<pṛ0 1> atha 
{gandharvatantram | 
śivaproktam} | 

[prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 

oṃ namaḥ paradevatāyai | 
yaṃ vadantyamalātmānaḥ puruṣaṃ prakṛteḥ param | 
cidrūpaṃ paramānandaṃ vande devaṃ vinā(taṃ vighnanā ka pāṭha |)yakam || 1 || 
bhartāraṃ guṇavṛddhiśūnyamacalaṃ gatvābhisārakramāṃd 
dīvyantī kulavartmanaiva guṇavatyānandamātanvatī | 
śete suptabhujaṅgapotakuṭilā yā merumūlaṃ gatā 
sūte(yantra?putra)śatāni tāni murajinmukhyāni pāyādasau || 2 || 
viśvāmitra iti khyāto nṛpaḥ paramadhārmikaḥ | 
siddhiṃ dṛṣṭvā vasiṣṭhasya tapastepe suduścaram || 3 || 
aprāpya tapasaḥ siddhimudīcīṃ diśamāviśat | 
gaṅgādvārasamāsīnaṃ muniṃ yogaparāyaṇam || 4 || 
dattātreyaṃ mahābhāgamabhivādya kṛtāñjaliḥ | 
uvācedaṃ vacastasmai vinayānatakandharaḥ || 5 || 

viśvāmitra uvāca 
nādrā(kṣyaṃ?kṣaṃ) samyagiṣṭvāpi kratubhirbahudakṣiṇaiḥ | 
satpātre sarvadānāni kṛtvāpi munisattama || 6 || 

<pṛ0 2> mahāvidyāṃ prajapyātha puraskriyāpuraḥsarām | 
bhavābdhestaraṇopāyaṃ tapastaptvā suduścaram || 7 || 
sarvāgamaikatattvajña brahmaniṣṭha tapodhana | 
kiṃ kariṣyāmyahaṃ deva kutra yāsyāmi tadvada || 8 || 

dattātreya uvāca 
mā viṣīda nṛpaśreṣṭha sarvathā tvaṃ sthiro bhava | 
yacchrutvā(di?dhi) gataṃ pūrvamasmābhirnandikeśvarāt | 9 || 
tadaśeṣaṃ pravakṣyāmi guhyād guhyataraṃ param | 
sāramuddhṛtya bhagavān yāmalādapi sarvataḥ || 10 || 
tantraṃ dvādaśasāhasryaṃ bhogamokṣaikasādhanam | 
pārvatyai kathayāmāsa tantraṃ gandharvasaṃjñakam || 11 || 
gīyate sarvatantrāṇāmakhilādyo yatastviha | 
tenāyaṃ nṛpaśārdūla tantro gandharva ucyate || 12 || 

nandikeśvara uvāca 
kailāsaśikharārūḍhaṃ devadevaṃ jagadgurum | 
pañcavaktraṃ mahākāyaṃ jaṭājūṭavibhūṣitam || 13 || 
cārucandrakalāyuktaṃ mūrdhni vyālaughabhūṣitam | 
bāhubhirdaśabhiryuktaṃ vyāghracarmadharaṃ śubham || 14 || 
kālakūṭadharaṃ kaṇṭhe nāgahāropaśobhitam | 
vibhūtibhūṣaṇaṃ devaṃ prativaktraṃ tribhistribhiḥ || 15 || 
netraistu pañcadaśabhiryuktaṃ sphaṭikasaṃnibham | 
śaktitriśūlakhaṭvāṅgavaradābhayakānapi | 16 || 

<pṛ0 3> akṣasūtraṃ bījapūraṃ bhujaṅgaṃ ḍamaruṃ dhanuḥ | 
dakṣiṇairdadhataṃ hastairvāmaiḥ (rvāmabhirhastairvṛta ka pāṭha |) koṭīrabhūṣaṇam || 17 || 
vṛṣabhoparisaṃsthaṃ tu gajakṛttiparicchadam | 
sarvātmanāviṣṭacittaṃ girijāmukhapaṅkaje || 18 || 
praṇamya parayā bhaktyā kṛtāñjalipuṭā satī | 
uvāca pārvatī devī īśvaraṃ parameśvaram || 19 || 

pārvatyuvāca 
devadeva jagannātha bhaktānāmārtināśana | 
prasanno yadi māṃ deva brahma kiṃ vā taducyate || 20 || 
yogaṃ kiṃvā śarīraṃ ca brūhi me parameśvara | 
smitapūrvaṃ mahādevaḥ pūrṇānandamayo vibhuḥ || 21 || 
vāmadevākhyavaktreṇa (mantreṇa kha pāṭhaḥ |) pratyuvāca priyāṃ vibhuḥ (prabhu ka pāṭha |) | 

īśvara uvāca 
yallābhānnāparo lābho yatsukhānnāparaṃ sukham || 22 || 
yajjñānānnāparaṃ jñānaṃ tad brahmetyavadhāraya | 
yad dṛśyānnāparaṃ dṛśyaṃ yad dṛṣṭvā na punarbhavaḥ || 23 || 
tiryagūrdhvamadhaḥ pūrṇaṃ saccidānandamavyayam | 
anantamekaṃ nityaṃ (nta nityameka ka pāṭha |) yat tad brahmetyavadhāraya || 24 || 

pārvatyuvāca 
karmapāśasamābaddho bhogī bhogaparāyaṇaḥ | 
kathaṃ mukto bhaveddevaṃ bhogenaiva maheśvara || 25 || 
tat sarvaṃ kathayeśāna yadyahaṃ tava vallabhā | 

<pṛ0 4> īśvara uvāca 
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yad guhyaṃ paramādbhutam || 26 || 
na vaktavyaṃ tvayā kiṃcijjaneṣu kathitaṃ mayā | 
apṛthaktvaśarīratvād vakṣyāmi tava suvrate || 27 || 
yaduktaṃ te mayā tantraṃ trividhaṃ triguṇātmakam | 
tāmasaṃ kutra saṃproktaṃ rājasaṃ cāpi kutracit || 28 || 
sāttvikaṃ tatra kutrāpi dhīmāṃstasmāt taduddharet | 
tāmasaṃ narakāyaiva svargāya rājasaṃ priye || 29 || 
sāttvikaṃ mokṣadaṃ prāhusturīyaṃ niṣphalaṃ śive | 
śāstrāṇi caiva girije tāmasāni nibodha me || 30 || 
tāmasāni purāṇāni tantrāṇi tāni ca priye | 
svargamokṣavihīnāni tāni yatnādvivarjayet || 31 || 
i(ya?ma) marthaṃ purā devi pṛṣṭavān devakīsutaḥ | 
māṃ prasādya tapastaptvā bhogena muktisādhanam || 32 || 
tasmai vāpi mayā proktaṃ saṃdehocchedakārakam |
tatastenāpi saṃproktaṃ brahmaṇe haṃsarūpiṇe || 33 || 
nandikeśvara etadvai mayoktaṃ punareva hi | 
so'pi cābhūtsvayaṃ kartā mama tulyo mahāmatiḥ || 34 ||  
puṣpadante tataḥ proktaṃ tantrametadvarānane | 
gandharvebhyo dadau tena rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam || 35 || 
brahmaṇā ca tathā prāptaṃ tasmāt te munayaḥ priye | 
purandareṇāṅgirasād bhārgavāddaityarāṭ prabhuḥ || 36 || 

<pṛ0 5> pulasterapi paulastyāḥ kramādevaṃ mahītale | 
namucyādyā mahādaityāḥ purā svāyaṃbhuvāntare || 37 || 
mahābalaparīvārā mahāvīryā mahaujasaḥ | 
sarvadharmaratāḥ śuddhāḥ sarvapāpavivarjitāḥ || 38 || 
trayīdharmaratāḥ sarve bhagnā indrapurogamāḥ | 
tadākarṇya maheśāni brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ || 39 || 
madantikaṃ samāsādya stutibhirmāṃ prasādya ca | 
uvācedaṃ vacaścāpi ślakṣṇaṃ madhurayā girā || 40 || 

brahmovāca 
sarvajña sarvalokeśa sarvaduḥkhanisūdana | 
bhogamokṣaprade tantre tvayā prakāśite prabho || 41 || 
tadavāpya mahādeva nararākṣasadānavāḥ | 
siddhipradā bhaveyuste prabhunāma kathaṃ caret || 42 || 
sarve brahmātmanā deva yadi yāsyanti vidyayā | 
kaiva sṛṣṭiḥ kimatrāpi (nnāsti ka pāṭha |) kāryyaṃ syād vada śaṃkara || 43 || 
iti vijñāpya māṃ brahmā yayau brahmasadaḥ (da ka pāṭha |) prati | 
tato'haṃ parameśāni gatvā mandaraparvatam || 44 || 
tān viprānatha saṃsmṛtya mantrayitvā ca taiḥ saha | 
nandikeśvaramāhūya dvāri saṃsthāpya satvaram || 45 || 
rakṣitavyastvayā bhadra vi(kṣa?ghna) śceha samāgataḥ | 
ityādiśya praviṣṭo'haṃ nirjanaṃ paramaṃ mahat || 46 || 
mohanārthaṃ paraṃ teṣāṃ daityādīnāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 

<pṛ0 6> śāstrāṇi vividhānyatra saṃproktāni dvijaiḥ saha || 47 || 
yeṣāṃ śravaṇamātreṇa pātityaṃ jñānināmapi | 
yaccintanānmahādevi gotamo munipuṃgavaḥ || 48 || 
akṣapāda iti khyātaḥ pramatto māṃ vigarhayan | 
anubhūya tadāsvādaṃ māmeva śaraṇaṃ yayau || 49 || 
tat kṛpālurahaṃ devi svayamādiṣṭavānidam | 
vaiṣṇavaṃ tantramācakṣva vi(ṣṇuya?ṣṇūyaṃ)stu sadā mune || 50 || 
prasannako yadā viṣṇustataḥ siddhimavāpsyasi | 
yaduktaṃ te mayā tantraṃ kṛṣṇasya paramātmanaḥ || 51 || 
adhītya nāradāt sarvaṃ siddhimāpa munistadā | 
prathamaṃ hi mayaivoktaṃ (mayā prokta kha pāṭha |) śaivaṃ pāśupatādikam || 52 || 
macchaktyāveśitai(vai śatai ka pāṭha |)rvipraiḥ saṃproktāni tataḥ param | 
kaṇādena ca saṃproktaṃ śāstraṃ vaiśeṣikaṃ mahat || 53 || 
gotamena tathā nyāyaṃ sāṃkhyaṃ tu kapilena tu | 
dhiṣa(dhīṣa ka pāṭha |)ṇena tathā proktaṃ cārvākamatigarhitam || 54 || 
daityānāṃ nāśanārthāya viṣṇunā buddharūpiṇā | 
bauddhaśāstra(stra tathā kha pāṭha |)masat proktaṃ nagnanīlapaṭādikam || 55 || 
āpā(āpatya kha pāṭha |)(tyaṃ?rthya) śrutivākyānāṃ darśayaṃllokagarhitam | 
karmasvarūpatyājya(tādātmya kha pāṭha |)tvamatra vai pratipādyate || 56 || 
sarvakarmaparibhraṣṭā(ṣṭa klmaṣa kha pāṭha |)d (vaikarma saṃ?vikarmāsat) taducyate | 

<pṛ0 7> gautamaproktaśāstrārthaniratāḥ sarva eva hi || 57 || 
sārgālīṃ yonimāpannāḥ saṃ(dhi?di)gdhāḥ sarvakarmasu | 
sarvasya jagato'pyatra mohanārthaṃ purā śive || 58 || 
vedārthavanmahāśāstraṃ māyāvādamavaidikam | 
mayaiva kathitaṃ devi jagatāṃ nāśakāraṇāt || 59 || 
dvijanmanā jaimininā pūrvaṃ (sarvaveda kha pāṭha |) vedamapārthataḥ | 
nirīśvareṇa vādena kṛtaṃ śāstraṃ mahattaram || 60 ||
tatraivāhaṃ mahāmantrān saṃdūṣya doṣavistaraiḥ | 
kṛta(vānta?vāṃsta)ntravistāraṃ sasaṃdehapadānvitam || 61 || 
atha devāśca devyaśca dūṣite mantravigrahe | 
abhavan dūṣitāḥ sarve hīnavīryyaparākramāḥ || 62 || 
nirbalāstvaṅgahīnāśca atha sarve divaukasaḥ | 
viṣṇulokaṃ samāsādya vyasanaṃ tannyavedayan || 63 || 
viditvā vyasanaṃ viṣṇustattat teṣāṃ divaukasām | 
vainateyaṃ samāruhya nandikeśvarasaṃnidhau || 64 || 
āgato vāritastena maddarśanasamutsukaḥ | 
tatra sthitvā maheśāni bhagavāñjagadīśvaraḥ || 65 || 
vardhayituṃ (varddha ka pāṭha |) śarīraṃ ca vainateyaṃ samādiśat | 
pravṛddhasya khagendrasya sthitvā tasyottamāṅgake || 66 || 
sa dṛṣṭvā samupāviṣṭamidamāha smitānanaḥ | 

śrībhagavānuvāca 
akālaṃ pralayaḥ (ya ka pāṭha |) kasmāt kriyate bhavatādhunā || 67 || 

<pṛ0 8> na yujyate mahādeva kartumevaṃ(va kha pāṭha |) na sāṃpratam | 

īśvara uvāca 
dūṣitā brahmaṇo mantrāḥ saurāścāgnisamudbhavāḥ || 68 || 
tathā vai dūṣitā yaunyāḥ śriyaścāpīha kecana | 
sarasvatyā mahāmantrā vaiṣṇavā api kecana || 69 || 
vaināyakā mahāmantrāḥ prāyeṇa dūṣitā mayā | 
śaktitantreṣu ye kecit sasaṃdehapadānvitāḥ || 70 || 

śrībhagavānuvāca 
jagadvandya kalādhīśa sarvabhūtopakāraka | 
nivarttasva mahādeva madvākyaśāsanādibhiḥ || 71 || 

īśvara uvāca 
virato'haṃ tadā tasya viṣṇoramitatejasaḥ | 
vacanāt parameśasya śaṃkhacakragadābhṛtaḥ || 72 || 
tānyadhītyaiva te sarve mohitā viṣṇumāyayā | 
bhaviṣyanti ca saṃdigdhā vāli(vālī kha pāṭha)śatvādanāsthayā || 73 || 
vivadiṣyanti saṃmūḍhā hetuvādaparāyaṇāḥ | 
he(ti?tu)sādhyetivākyācca bhaviṣyanti parāṅmukhāḥ || 74 || 

[iti śrīgandharvataṃtre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde tantraprastāvanānirūpaṇaṃ nāma prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 1 || 

<pṛ0 9> [dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
pārvatyuvāca 
śaktitantraṃ mahādeva saṃdeharahitaṃ kuru | 
tathā kathaya deveśa bhogena muktisādhanam || 1 || 

īśvara uvāca 
niḥsaṃdehaṃ mahātantraṃ śrūyatāṃ khalu sāṃpratam | 
gopitavyaṃ paśoragre pūrṇacandranibhānane || 2 || 
parātmajīvayoraikyaṃ mayātra pratipādyate | 
brahmaṇo'pi paraṃ rūpaṃ nirguṇaṃ vakṣyate mayā || 3 || 
śrūyatāṃ vimale bhadre ātmānamātmanā punaḥ | 
praṇamāmi mahādevīṃ turīyāṃ brahmarūpiṇīm || 4 || 
yasyā smaraṇamātreṇa bhavābdhau na nimajjate | 
asyā(tasyā ka pāṭha |)ścārādhanaṃ kṛtvā nānya(nānyadā kha pāṭha |)syārādhanaṃ caret || 5 || 
anyasya smaraṇād duḥkhaṃ (devi kha pāṭha |) yoginīśāpamālabhet | 
apamṛtyurbhavet tasya mṛte ca narakaṃ vrajet || 6 || 
enāmupāsya deveśi kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 
sakṛdenāmupāsyaiva na mātuḥ stanapo bhavet || 7 || 
tasmād devi śubhe bhadre turīyāṃ samupāśrayet | 
ādau kāmeśvarī jñeyā dvitīyā bhagamālinī || 8 || 

<pṛ0 10> vajreśvarī tṛtīyā ca turyā tripurasundarī | 
trayāṇā(eṣaṇā ka pāṭha |)mapi devānāṃ pracodikā (ditā kha pāṭha |) tripādikā || 9 || 
tripureti samākhyātā kāmadā sā (sāhi ka pāṭha |) kāmeśvarī | 
trīn yasmāt purato dadyād durgā sā parameśvarī || 10 || 
tripureti samākhyātā saundaryyātiśayāt tathā | 
mayāpi cintyate sā tu tatprasādādahaṃ prabhuḥ || 11 || 
jagatāmīśvaratvaṃ ca labdhaṃ tadanukampayā | 
brahmatvaṃ brahmaṇā prāptaṃ viṣṇutvaṃ viṣṇunā tathā || 12 || 
surāsuramunīndrāṇāṃ mahattvaṃ tatprasādataḥ | 
teneyaṃ mahatī vidyā durlabhā bhuvanatraye || 13 || 

devyuvāca 
bhagavan sarvamantrāśca bhavatā me prakāśitāḥ | 
mahātripurasundaryyā mantrā ye pūrvasūcitāḥ || 14 || 
tāṃstānevādhunā nātha saṃdeharahitān (tā ka pāṭha |) kuru | 

īśvara uvāca 
sarvakāryeṣu sarvatra tāntrike vaidike tathā || 15 || 
aviśvāso mahān doṣo yatnatastaṃ vivarjayet | 
saṃsiddheḥ kāraṇaṃ devi viśvāsaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ || 16 || 
viditvā rakṣaṇaṃ yattu saguṇaṃ vīryyavardhanam (varddha ka pāṭha |) | 
ratneṣu kīlakaṃ yadvad granthirmalayasaṃbhave || 17 ||
āstiko'tha śucirdānto (rdakṣo kha pāṭha |) dvaitahīno jitendriyaḥ | 

<pṛ0 11> brahmiṣṭho brahmavādī ca brahmī brahmaparāyaṇaḥ || 18 || 
sarvahiṃsāvinirmuktaḥ sarvaprāṇihite rataḥ (tā ka pāṭha |) | 
so'smiñ śāstre'dhikārī syāt tadanyo bhramasādhakaḥ (tadanyatra na sādhaka kha pāṭha |) || 19 || 
nāstikāya kuśīlāya dāmbhikāya kadācana | 
na vaktavyaṃ paśoragre kuṭile cumbake tathā || 20 || 
śṛṇu devi mahad guhyaṃ mantroddhāraṃ varānane | 
ādau pañcadaśī vidyā kathyate vīravandite || 21 || 
(kāma ka yoni e turyyasvara ī purandara la bhuvaneśī hrīṃ iti vāgbhavakūṭam |) kāmadevastato yonisturyya(stū ka pāṭha |)svarapurandarau |  
bhuvaneśī tataḥ paścāt pañca (rañja(vaktra kha pāṭha |)?varṇa) vibhūṣitaḥ || 22 || 
ayaṃ sa vāgbhavo devi vāgīśatvapradāyakaḥ | 
etajjaptvā mahābījaṃ kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale || 23 || 
bālakasya tu jihvāyāṃ tridinābhyantare nyaset | 
madhunā śvetadūrvābhiḥ suvarṇasya śalākayā || 24 || 
idaṃ vāgbhavakūṭaṃ tu likhedvai jananāntare | 
sa eva paṇḍito bhūyānna (bhūtvā kha pāṭhaḥ |) tu mūrkho bhaved dhruvam || 25 || 
eta(ida kha pāṭha |)dvāgbhavakūṭaṃ tu vāliśasyāpi mūrdhani | 
hastaṃ dattvā paṭhet siddhamaṣṭotaraśataṃ priye || 26 || 
so'pi ślokānmaheśāni karotyeva na saṃśayaḥ | 
satarkapadavākyārthaśabdālaṃkārasāravit || 27 || 
jihvāyāṃ nyasanād devi mūko'pi sukavirbhavet | 

<pṛ0 12> bahunātra kimuktena jalpitenāpi sundari || 28 || 
vāgīśaṃ spardhate(rddha ka pāṭha |) vākaiḥ sarvajño bhuvi jāyate | 
mūko bhavati vāgīśo vācaspatirivāparaḥ || 29 || 
(śiva ha candra sa kāma ka vyoma ha purandara la lajjā hrī iti kāmarājakūṭam |)  śivacandrau samudbhṛtya kāmavyomapurandarān | 
uddharet parameśāni lajjābījaṃ tataḥ priye || 30 || 
kāmarājamidaṃ bhadre ṣa(yadva ka pāṭha |)ḍvarṇa sarvaśobhitam | 
(candra sa kāma ka indra la mahāmāyā hrī iti śaktikūṭam |) candraḥ kāmastathendraśca mahāmāyā tataḥ param || 31 || 
śaktibījaṃ varārohe vedākṣarasamanvitam | 
trikūṭeyaṃ mahāvidyā mahātripurasundarī || 32 || 
sarvatīrthama(ye?yī) devī sarvadevasvarūpiṇī | 
sarvaśāstramayī śuddhā sarvadoṣavivarjitā || 33 || 
caturvedamayī sākṣāt sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī | 
kāmarājākhyavidyeyaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradā || 34 || 
anayā sadṛśī vidyā triṣu lokeṣu durlabhā | 
etasyā eva vidyāyāḥ śaktiṃ turyaṃ ca pārvati || 35 || 
(uktāyā eva vidyāyā vāgbhavādau śaktiturye eī vihāya śiva ha induḥ sa ityetat dvayamādau niyojya lopāmudropāsitā vidyā bhavati |) hitvā mukhe śivendubhyāṃ lopāmudrā prakāśitā | 
(māra ka yoni e kāma ka śakra la īśvaro hrī iti vāgbhavakūṭasthāne vinyasya pūrvavatkāmarājaśaktiyogāt śāṃbhavī vidyā |) mārabījaṃ tato yoniḥ kāmaḥ (śu?śa)kraṃ tatheśvarī || 36 || 

<pṛ0 13> pūrvavat kāmarājaṃ ca śaktikūṭaṃ tathaiva ca | 
savīryyā siddhidā vidyā trailokyavaśakāriṇī || 37 || 
tava snehānmaheśāni mayeyaṃ tu prakāśitā | 
etacchāṃbhavamuddiṣṭaṃ śṛṇu śāktamataḥ param (ra ka pāṭha |) || 38 || 
(śakti sa maheśa ha kāma k indra la mahāmāyā hrīṃ iti prāguktavidyāyā vāgbhave niyojya śāktī vidyā sapadyate |) śaktirmaheśaḥ kāmaśca indrabījamataḥ param | 
mahāmāyā tataḥ paścāt pūrvavadaparaṃ tataḥ || 39 || 
vidyātrayamidaṃ bhadre durlabhaṃ bhuvanatraye | 

devyuvāca 
ṣoḍaśārṇāṃ mahāvidyāṃ trailokyavaśadāyinīm || 40 || 
adhunā kathayeśāna yadyahaṃ tava vallabhā | 

īśvara uvāca 
śṛṇu devi mahāvidyāṃ ṣoḍaśākṣararūpiṇīm || 41 || 
etasyā eva vidyāyā yadādye bhuvaneśvarī | 
tadeyaṃ parameśāni ṣoḍaśākṣararūpiṇī || 42 || 
māyāsthāne (vā?ra) mābījaṃ dattvānyā (bhuvaneśvarī hrī tadādiyutā pūrvoktā vidyā ṣoḍaśārṇā | athavādau ramābījopetā tathā bhavati |) ṣoḍaśī bhavet | 
varadā siddhidā vidyā (dyāt ka pāṭha |) kuberāspadadāyinī || 43 || 
cintāmaṇiriyaṃ vidyā trailokye cāpi durlabhā | 
vedādimaṇḍitā cānyā vidyā mokṣapradāyinī || 44 || 
tathaiva hi mahā(māyā kha pāṭha |)bījaṃ ramābījaṃ tathaiva ca | 

<pṛ0 14> pañcadaśākṣarīvidyāṃ tathaiva ca samuddharet || 45 || 
seyaṃ (samanantaroktā pañcadaśākṣarī māyāramābhyā hrī śrīṃ ityābhyāsādyayojitā saptadaśākṣarī vidyā bhavati |) saptadaśī vidyā sākṣāt jāgratsvarūpiṇī | 

devyuvāca 
tataḥ kathaya deveśa rājarājeśvarīṃ parām || 46 || 
ṣoḍaśārṇāṃ mahāvidyāṃ trailokyavaśadāyinīm | 
jananīṃ sarvamantrāṇāṃ parabrahmasvarūpiṇīm || 47 || 

īśvara uvāca 
rājarājeśvarīṃ vidyāṃ tathāsyāḥ kavacaṃ priye | 
yo jānāti mahīpṛṣṭhe sa devo natu mānuṣaḥ || 48 || 
rājarājeśvarī vidyā kathyate śṛṇu pārvati | 
ramābījaṃ samuddhṛtya māyābījaṃ niyojayet || 49 || 
kāmabījaṃ samālikhya vāgbījaṃ tadanantaram | 
caturdaśasvaropetaṃ candraṃ binduyugānvitam || 50 || 
praṇavaṃ bhavuneśānīṃ ramāṃ caiva maheśvari | 
pañcadaśākṣarīṃ paścāduddharet parameśvari || 51 || 
vyutkramāt parameśāni pūrvoktabījapañcakam | 
ālikhya saṃpuṭīkuryyād vidyeyaṃ dvyaṣṭakūṭakā (ramā śrī māyā hrī kāmabīja klī vāgbīja ai caturdaśasvaropeta savisargaścandrasauḥ praṇava okāra bhuvaneśānī hrīṃ ramā śrī tata pañcadaśākṣarī vyutkramai bījapañcakaiśca sapuṭitā ṣoḍaśakūṭā turīyā vidyā bhavati |) || 52 || 
turīyeyaṃ mahāvidyā kevalātmasvarūpiṇī | 
ṣoḍaśārṇā mahāvidyā śrīvidyā kathitā parā || 53 || 

<pṛ0 15> vaktrakoṭisahasraistu jihvākoṭiśatairapi | 
varṇituṃ naiva śakyeyaṃ śrīvidyā ṣoḍaśākṣarī (śakye'ha śrīvidyā ṣoḍaśākṣarīm kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 54 || 
ṣoḍaśārṇā mahāvidyā sarvatantreṣu gopitā | 
tava snehānmaheśāni gandharve vai prakāśitā || 55 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde vidyābhedoddhāranirūpaṇaṃ nāma dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 2 || 

<pṛ0 16> [tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
devyuvāca 
devadeva jagannātha bhaktānāmārtināśana | 
pañcapañcākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ pañcamīṃ sarvakāmadām || 1 || 
adhunā kathayeśāna samagrāṃ pāpanāśinīm | 

īśvara uvāca 
durlabhā pañcamī vidyā pañcakūṭātmikā śubhā || 2 || 
bhuktimuktipradā śuddhā sukhadā duḥkhanāśinī | 
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yathā sā cintyate parā || 3 || 
gurubhaktena śuddhena sādhakena subuddhinā | 
devī pañcātmakaṃ sarvaṃ jagadetaccarācaram || 4 || 
pṛthivyāpastathā tejo vāyurākāśameva ca | 
pṛthivī brāhmaṇī śaktirjalaṃ nārāyaṇī tathā || 5 || 
tejo rudrasya rudrāṇī vāyurīśasya ceśvarī | 
māheśvarī tathākāśaṃ śaktirmaheśvarasya ca || 6 || 
pañcadevā(vyā kha pāṭha |)tmakaṃ pañca pañcamīpañcaśaktayaḥ | 
yā śaktiḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ jagaccaitanyarūpiṇī || 7 || 
sā (sadhyebhāva aiśa evamagrepi bodhyam |)) eva pañcamīvidyā jagadādhārarūpiṇī | 
sā eva hi jagatsarvaṃ sā eva paramā kalā || 8 || 

<pṛ0 17> nānyat parataraṃ devi vidyate tadbahiṣkṛte | 
pañcaviṃśatitattvena kūṭake pañca devatāḥ || 9 || 
ādau kāmeśvarī jñeyā tato vajreśvarī śubhā | 
tṛtīyā bhagamālā ca turyyā tripurasundarī || 10 || 
śrīmattripurasundaryyāścintanīyā parā kalā | 
sā eva pañcamī śaktiḥ parabrahmasvarūpiṇī || 11 || 
paramānandarūpaṃ yajjagatāṃ kāraṇaṃ mahat | 
tasyā devyāstu tadrūpamudayāstavivarjitam || 12 || 
sthūlatve sthūlarūpā sā sūkṣmatve sūkṣmarūpiṇī | 
sthūlasūkṣmaprabhedena jagatkāraṇarūpiṇī || 13 || 
yo'sau viśveśvaro devo viśvaṃ vyāpya sthitaśca yaḥ | 
saiva viśveśvarī devī vyāpakatvena saṃsthitā || 14 || 
nityā sā sukharūpā ca mahāsukhaśubhapradā | 
tatsvarūpānandamayī1 paramānandarūpiṇī || 15 || 
kiṃ punaḥ śaktirūpeṇa parabrahmasvarūpiṇī | 
tasyāḥ punaḥ punaḥ sṛṣṭirjāyate līyate sadā || 16 || 
tasmācchaktiḥ pradhānā ca śaktyā vyāptamidaṃ jagat | 
sarvadānandahṛdayaścādvaitānandapāragaḥ || 17 || 
samayācārasaṃpanno bhogī bhogaparāyaṇaḥ | 
sadā jñānaviśuddhātmā gurubhakto jitendriyaḥ || 18 || 
gandharvarūpavān bhūtvā pañcamīṃ samupāsayet | 
pṛthivyāṃ māna(vo?vaḥ) śreṣṭho yadi jānāti pañcamīm || 19 || 

<pṛ0 18> śāpabhraṣṭena gandharvo na naro daivayogataḥ | 
yo jānāti mahāvidyāṃ pañcakūṭātmikāṃ parām || 20 || 
sa bhavet khacaro devi ṣaṇmāsānnātra saṃśayaḥ | 
sadā jñānaviśuddhātmā mokṣabhāgī bhavennaraḥ || 21 || 
bhogena labhate muktiṃ yadi jānāti pañcamīm | 
pañcapañcākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ yo'sau jānāti sādhakaḥ || 22 || 
sa pūjyaḥ sarvalokeṣu sa devo natu mānuṣaḥ (mānava kha pāṭha |) | 
trikūṭameva (ka ka pāṭha |) kūṭeṣu kūṭamekaṃ tripañcakam || 23 || 
pañcapañcākṣarī vidyā trikūṭā pañcakūṭakaiḥ | 
pañcaviṃśatitattvena varṇarūpeṇa saṃsthitā || 24 || 
ekavarṇe trikūṭe ca trikūṭe pañca devatāḥ | 
ekavarṇe pañcadaśa devatāḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 25 || 
pañcaviṃśatitattvena trikūṭe pañcasaṃkhyayā | 
pañcasaptatipūrvāṇi tena tāsāṃ śatatrayam || 26 || 
pañcakūṭānvitā vidyā parā saubhāgyasundarī | 
varṇarūpeṇa sā devī jagadādhārarūpiṇī || 27 || 
akṣarāt sarvamutpannaṃ jagadetaccarācaram | 
nityamekākṣaraṃ brahma akṣaraṃ paramaṃ padam (sakṛjjaptvākṣara mantra brahmabhūyāya kalpate | ityadhika kha pāṭha |) || 28 || 
japyamekākṣaraṃ brahma ādikūṭāntamadhyagam | 
japtvā tatsādhayet sarvaṃ bahujaptena (jāpyena kha pāṭha |) kiṃ phalam || 29 || 
tadeva paramaṃ guhyaṃ mahāsaubhāgyadāyakam | 

<pṛ0 19> tadeva pañcakūṭaṃ tu pañcatattvena pañcamī || 30 || 
(kāma ka viṣṇuyuto'kāropeta, śakti e māyā ī śakro la mahāmāyā hrī ityetatpañcamīvidyāyā prathama vāgbhavakūṭam) kāmaṃ viṣṇuyutaṃ śaktirmāyā śakraśca pārvati | 
paścād devi mahāmāyābījaṃ cānte niyojayet || 31 || 
(madhyakūṭatraya kāmarājasya | tanna śiva ha śakti sa kāmaḥ ka bhṛ la vyomānaletyādinā hrīṃ, iti kāmarājasya prathama kūṭam |) śivabījaṃ samudhṛtya śaktibījaṃ tadantaram | 
tadadhaḥ kāmabījaṃ tu bhūrvyomānalasaṃyutam || 32 || 
caturthasvarasaṃyuktamarddhendubindubhūṣitam | 
prathamaṃ kāmarājasya kūṭaṃ trailokyapūjitam || 33 || 
madhyakūṭaṃ pravakṣyāmi kāmarājasya madhyagam | 
atiguhyataraṃ devi snehād vakṣyāmi kevalam || 34 || 
(viyat ha viṣṇuyutamakāropetam | mādana ka hasa ha indra la viṣṇo padamityādinā hrī, iti kāmarājasya madhyama kūṭam |) viyadviṣṇuyutaṃ devī mādanaṃ tadanantaram | 
tadadho haṃsabījaṃ tu indrabījaṃ samuddharet || 35 || 
viṣṇoḥ padaṃ vahniyutaṃ māyābījaṃ samuddharet | 
madhyakūṭamidaṃ proktaṃ mahāsaubhāgyadāyakam || 36 || 
turīyaṃ tu pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi sudurlabham | 
(kāma ka śiva ha vāyu ya indra la viyadityādinā hrī, iti kāmarājasya tṛtīya kūṭam |) kāmabījaṃ maheśāni śivabījaṃ tataḥ param || 37 || 
tadadho vāyubījaṃ tu indrabījaṃ niyojayet | 
viyad vahnisamāyuktaṃ caturthasvarabhūṣitam || 38 || 

<pṛ0 20> arddhendubindusaṃyuktaṃ caturthaṃ kūṭamuttamam | 
śaktikūṭaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi sudurlabham || 39 || 
yacchrutvā sādhakāḥ sarve labhante muktimuttamām | 
(prāṇo ha kāma ka indra la devī sa sāntamityādinā hrī iti śaktikūṭam |) prāṇabījaṃ samuddhṛtya kāmabījaṃ samuddharet || 40 || 
indrabījaṃ tathā de(vi?vī) krameṇa viniyojayet | 
sāntaṃ vahnisamāyuktaṃ caturthasvarasaṃyutam || 41 || 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ śaktikūṭaṃ samuddharet | 
phalaṃ cāsyā viśeṣeṇa sādhanaṃ ca varānane || 42 || 
kathitavyaṃ mayā (mahādevi ka pāṭha |) devi saṃkṣepāt kathyate'dhunā | 
eṣā vidyā mahāvidyā guhyād guhyatamā priye || 43 || 
bhogadā mokṣadā caiva sarvakāmārthasiddhidā | 
vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ kūṭaṃ śaktikūṭaṃ tu pañcamam || 44 || 
madhyakūṭatrayaṃ devi kāma(bī?rā)jaṃ manoharam | 
kāma(bī?rā)jaṃ pravakṣyāmi kūṭabhedena tacchṛṇu || 45 || 
jñātvā tatsādhayed devi asādhyamapi bhūtale | 
saubhāgyaṃ prathamaṃ kūṭaṃ mahāsaubhāgyadāyakam || 46 || 
trikūṭamekakūṭena kāma(bī?rā)jaṃ mahatparam (dam ka pāṭha |) | 
evaṃ kūṭatrayeṇaiva nityā saubhāgyasundarī || 47 || 
ekatra pañcakūṭena nityaṃ kūṭatrayānvitā | 
durlabhā sarvalokeṣu mahāsaubhāgyasundarī || 48 || 
etasyā eva vidyāyā madhyakūṭasya madhyamam | 

<pṛ0 21> japtvānandamayo bhūtvā sarvakāmamupālabhet || 49 || 
iyaṃ svapnāvatī nāmnā vidyā trailokyaviśrutā | 
ākarṣaṇakarī vidyā jagadāhlādakāriṇī || 50 || 
sādhanaṃ ca pravakṣyāmi yasmādākarṣaṇaṃ bhavet | 
svarge ma(rte?rtye) ca pātāle nārīṇāṃ puruṣasya ca || 51 || 
nāryo vaśyā viśeṣeṇa vaśaṃ (jā?yā)ti jagattrayam | 
bhogadā mokṣadā caiṣā vidyā gandharvasevitā || 52 || 
mahābhogavatī vidyā mahadaiśvaryadāyinī | 
tathā madhumatīsiddhirjāyate'syāḥ prasādataḥ || 53 || 
bṛhattvaṃ ca laghutvaṃ ca darśanādarśane tathā | 
praveśaṃ parakāyasya kāmarūpo bhaved dhruvam || 54 || 
puṃsāṃ rūpaṃ striyo rūpaṃ yaccānyadrūpamuttamam | 
sarvaṃ tat paramaṃ rūpaṃ tasyā eva na saṃśayaḥ || 55 || 
kāntistuṣṭistathā puṣṭiḥ śraddhā lajjā dayā ghṛṇā | 
dhṛtiḥ śāntistathā ṛddhiḥ siddhirbuddhirmatiḥ kṣamā || 56 || 
mahāmāyā mahābuddhirmahāvidyā mahodayā | 
mahāmahatkarī vidyā brahmavidyaiva kevalā || 57 || 
mahābhūtadine naktaṃ śmaśāne yadi sādhakaḥ | 
sahasraikapramāṇena kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale || 58 || 
yo japet pañcamīṃ vidyāṃ parāṃ trailokyamātṛkām | 
sa naro devadeveśo mahādeva ivāparaḥ || 59 || 
bhogātmā labhate bhuktiṃ nānābhogena kevalam | 

<pṛ0 22> bhunakti bahulān bhogān rasānnānāvidhānapi || 60 || 
yad bruvantyakṣaraṃ loke bhunakti bahulaṃ sukham | 
śūnyāgāre vihāre ca cinta(yenno?yanyo) japetparām || 61 || 
ākarṣaṇaṃ bhavettasya sarvakāmaṃ tato labhet | 
prathamānandahṛdayo dvitīya(ma?mu)pabhogavān || 62 || 
tṛtīyamupabhogena caturthamapi kāmayet | 
pañcamaṃ prathamaṃ puṇyaṃ mantrasiddhikaraṃ param || 63 || 
pañcamaṃ tu viśeṣeṇa bhogayet kāmayet sadā | 
pañcamābhyasanādvīraḥ pūjāyā labhate phalam || 64 || 
kuṇḍagolodbhavairdravyaiḥ svayaṃbhūkusumena ca | 
rocanākuṃkumābhyāṃ ca japamālāṃ pralepayet || 65 || 
karpūrāgurukastūrīrocanākuṃkumena ca | 
japamālāmupaskṛtya pratiṣṭhāṃ vidhivaccaret || 66 || 
taddravairakṣatāñchuddhān saṃ(śrā?srā)vya ca punaḥ punaḥ | 
vāriṇā śodhitaṃ kṛtvā sindūre nikṣipet tataḥ || 67 || 
paṭe citramaye śuddhe naktaṃ yaḥ pūjayennaraḥ | 
japtvā vidyāṃ ca mālāyāṃ sarvakāmamupālabhet || 68 || 
ānīya kanyakāṃ divyāṃ pramadāṃ yauvanonnatām | 
ukṣitāṃ mūlamantreṇa suśīlāṃ cāruhāsi(hnīṃ?nīm) || 69 || 
sarvadānandahṛdayāṃ ghṛṇālajjāvivarjitām | 
gurubhaktāṃ suveśāṃ ca devatāpūjane ratām || 70 || 
tasyā gātre nyasenmantrī pañcakāmāñ śarānapi | 

<pṛ0 23> pañcakūṭaṃ nyasenmantrī pañcāśanmātṛkāṃ nyaset || 71 || 
divyamālāṃ samādāya sādhako vijitendriyaḥ | 
sahasraikapramāṇena japet svapnāvatīṃ tataḥ || 72 || 
anenaiva vidhānena bhavedākarṣaṇaṃ mahat | 
tasyāstu madanāgāre pūjayet parameśvarīm || 73 || 
(tallakṣaṇaṃ- yathā madhyamāmadhyage kṛtvā kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭharodhite | tarjanyau daṇḍavat kṛtvā madhyamoparyanāmike | kṣobhābhidhānā mudreya sarvasaṃkṣobhakāriṇī || iti | ) sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīṃ mudrāṃ baddhvā yoniṃ pracālayet | 
kāmeśvarīsvarūpāṃ tāṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ || 74 || 
kāmeśvarasvarūpaṃ ca ātmānamapi bhāvayan | 
svayamakṣobhito bhūtvā sādhakaḥ pañcamaṃ caran || 75 || 
tasyāḥ puṣpaṃ svayaṃ yāvad (prāgvat kha pāṭha |) rakṣaṇīyaṃ prayatnataḥ | 
tāmbūlagandhapuṣpaiśca pratyahaṃ pūjayecca tām || 76 || 
nānārasānnapānena tṛptimācarya yatnataḥ | 
vastrālaṃkārabhūṣādyaistasyāḥ saṃtoṣamānayet || 77 || 
yathākāle tathā puṣpaṃ svayaṃ tadgopyarūpataḥ | 
gṛhītvā tu prayatnena svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ hi tat || 78 || 
svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ divyaṃ trailokyeṣvapi durlabham | 
prāpnoti sādhakaśreṣṭho durlabhaṃ sādhayedbhuvi || 79 || 
svayaṃbhūpuṣpayogena sākṣatena sadārcayet | 
vidyāṃ svapnāvatīṃ japtvā kṣipramākarṣaṇaṃ bhavet || 80 || 
devatāśca grahā nāgā dānavā rākṣasāśca ye | 

<pṛ0 24> rājānaśca striyaḥ sarvā nityaṃ vaśyā bhavanti hi || 81 || 
svayaṃbhūkusumaiḥ pūjāṃ pratyahaṃ yaḥ samācaret | 
japtvā vai divyamālāyāṃ sarvakāmamupālabhet || 82 || 

pārvatyuvāca 
purāpyekādaśī vidyā bhavatā kathitā mayi | 
nārādhitā mayā yasmāttasmānmṛtyuvaśaṃ gatā || 83 || 
sārātsāratarāṃ vidyāṃ śrotumicchāmi sāṃpratam | 

īśvara uvāca 
ekādaśākṣarī vidyā bhairavyāḥ kathitā purā || 84 || 
idānīṃ tava prītyarthaṃ kathayāmi tathā parām | 
(mādana ka gotrabhit la sāntetyādinā hrī, iti vāgbhavam | brahmā ka gagana ha śakra la nakulīśa ityādinā hrī, iti kāmarājam | śakti sa mādana ka śakra la hara ityādinā hrī, iti śaktikūṭam | iyamekādaśākṣarī bhairavī vidyā |) mādanaṃ gotrabhi(cchā?tsā)nto rephamāyārdhacandravān || 85 || 
nādabindusamāyukto vāgbhavaḥ parameśvari | 
brahmā ca gaganaṃ śakro nakulīśo'nalaḥ śaśī || 86 || 
māyā binduḥ sanādena kāma(bī?rā)jaṃ samuddharet | 
śaktirmādanaśakraśca haro vahnīndumāyayā || 87 || 
kalānādasamākrāntaḥ kathitaḥ kāmado manuḥ | 
yasmai kasmai na dātavyo bāndhavāya ca pārvati || 
manurvimṛ(ṣya?śya)dātavyo jyeṣṭhaputrāya dhīmate || 88 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde pañcamīvidyoddhāraprayogādinirūpaṇaṃ nāma tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 3 || 

<pṛ0 25> [caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
pārvatyuvāca 
devadeva mahādeva lokānāṃ hitakāraka | 
yatsūcitaṃ purā nātha kimarthaṃ na prakāśitam || 1 || 
rājarājeśvarīdevyāstripurāyāḥ śubhāvaham | 
kavacaṃ yadi me prītaḥ kathayasva vṛṣadhvaja || 2 || 

īśvara uvāca 
lakṣavārasahasrāṇi vāritāsi punaḥ punaḥ | 
strīsvabhāvānmahādevi punastvaṃ paripṛcchasi || 3 || 
atyantaṃ durlabhaṃ guhyaṃ kavacaṃ sarvakāmadam | 
tathāpi kathayāmyadya tava prītyā varānane || 4 || 
trailekyamohanaṃ nāma triṣu lokeṣu durlabham | 
sarvasaubhāgyajananaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 5 || 
yaddhṛtvā dānavān viṣṇurnijaghāna sudāruṇān | 
lokān vitanute brahmā saṃhartāhaṃ yataḥ priye || 6 || 
dhanādhipaḥ kubero'pi yataḥ sarve digīśvarāḥ (ra ka pāṭha |) | 
naitatparataraṃ guhyaṃ pratijāne hi (jānīhi ka pāṭha |) pārvati || 7 || 
vedaśāstrapurāṇeṣu sārametadvarānane | 
putradārādisahitaṃ śiro (vo ka pāṭha |) deyaṃ kathaṃcana || 8 || 
na deyaṃ kavacaṃ guhyaṃ prāṇaiḥ kaṇṭhagatairapi | 

<pṛ0 26> śṛṇu sarvāṅgasubhage divyaṃ kavacamuttamam || 9 || 
rājarājeśvarīdevyāḥ kavacasya ṛṣiḥ śivaḥ | 
chando virāḍ devatā ca mahātripurasundarī || 10 || 
haṃsaḥ śaktiḥ parā bījaṃ ramābījaṃ ca kīlakam | 
dharmārthakāmamokṣeṣu viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 11 || 
tripurā trividhā pātu mama sarvārthasiddhaye | 
aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ vadane bālā pātu sarvārthasiddhidā || 12 || 
hasraiṃ (haisra hesrau ka pāṭha |)(-)hasakalarī(-)hasrauḥ kaṇṭhe pātu mahādevī śrīmattripurabhairavī 
hṛdaye'vyānmaheśānī mahātripurasundarī || 13 || 
rājarājeśvarīvidyā ṣoḍaśī yā mahodayā | 
brahmarandhre sadā pātu kamalā parameśvarī || 14 || 
girirājasutā devī pātu nityaṃ ca śīrṣake | 
kāmabījaṃ lalāṭe'vyādvāgbījaṃ kaṇṭhadeśake || 15 || 
sauḥ pātu (tuta kha pāṭha |) me tathā pārśve praṇavo bāhumūlake | 
śaṃbhupriyā sadā pātu bāhvo(huda kha pāṭha |)rdakṣiṇasavyayoḥ || 16 || 
viṣṇupriyā sadā pātu maṇibandhadvaye tathā | 
pārvatīśaḥ kare pātu netre nakṣatravallabhaḥ || 17 || 
śrotre ratipriyaḥ pātu ghrāṇe śakraḥ sadāvatu |
pṛṣṭhadeśe sadā pātu pārvatī parameśvarī || 18 ||  
hsauḥ (heso ka pāṭha |) śvāse caiva niḥśvāse pātāṃ paramasiddhidau | 
kāmaḥ kāme sadā pātu pinākī liṅgagocare || 19 || 

<pṛ0 27> pṛthvī sarvāṃ(śa?sa)ke pātu hṛllekhā hṛdaye'vatu | 
stanau viṣṇupriyā pātu kukṣau ca sa purāntakaḥ || 20 || 
netre vajradharaḥ pātu māyā vai jaṭhare'vatu | 
padadvandve ca sauḥ pātu aiṃ jihvānilaye'vatu || 21 || 
klīṃkāraḥ sarvadā pātu dantoṣṭhayorvarānane | 
śīrṣādipādaparyantaṃ sarvāṅgaṃ bhuvaneśvarī || 22 || 
rakṣāhīnaṃ ca yat sthānaṃ varjitaṃ kavacena tu | 
tatsarvaṃ parameśāni pātu (ti kha pāṭhaḥ |) nityaṃ haripriyā || 23 || 
ādhāre vāgbhavaḥ pātu kāmarājo hṛdi priye | 
śaktikūṭaṃ tathā pātu bhruvormadhye ca pārvati || 24 || 
śīrṣe kūṭatrayaṃ pātu lalāṭe sarvamantrakaḥ | 
aṣṭāviṃśativarṇeyaṃ mukhavṛtte sadāvatu || 25 || 
ṣoḍaśīyaṃ mahāvidyā brahmavidyaiva kevalā | 
bhogamokṣapradā devī kevalātmasvarūpiṇī || 26 || 
kāmeśvarī lalāṭe'vyānmukhe tu bhagamālinī | 
dakṣanetre sadā pātu nityaṃ (dīptā?klinnā) mahodayā || 27 || 
bhīruṇḍā vāmanetre'vyāt karṇe vai vahnivāsinī | 
mahā(vidye?vajre)śvarī pātu vāmakarṇapradeśake || 28 || 
dakṣanāsāpuṭe pātu śivadūtī maheśvarī | 
vāmanāsāpūṭe pātu tvaritā sarvasiddhidā || 29 || 
dakṣagaṇḍe sadā pātu nityaṃ māṃ kulasundarī | 

<pṛ0 28> trailokyavimalā pātu vāmagaṇḍapradeśake || 30 || 
oṣṭhe nīlapatākāvyād adhare vijayāvatu | 
ūrdhvadante sadā pātu devī māṃ sarvamaṅgalā || 31 || 
adhodantapradeśe'vyānnityaṃ jvālāṃśumālinī | 
vicitrā sarvadā pātu nityaṃ mūrdhani pārvati || 32 || 
āsāṃ pradhānabhūtā yā mahātripurasundarī | 
ṣoḍaśī sā sadā pātu mukhe vai parameśvarī || 33 || 
pṛṣṭhadeśe sadā pāntu(1) guravastrividhāśca te | 
pādayoḥ sarvadā pātu tripurā parameśvarī || 34 || 
jānudeśe sadā pātu devī māṃ tripureśvarī | 
ūrudvaye sadā pātu devī tripurasundarī || 35 || 
tripuravāsinī devī kaṭideśe sadāvatu | 
tripurāśrīśca māṃ nityaṃ guhyadeśe sadāvatu || 36 || 
mūlādhāre sadā pātu devī tripuramālinī | 
nābhau tripurasiddhāvyāt tripurā(ca?mbā) sadā hṛdi || 37 || 
brahmarandhre sadā pātu(1) mahātripurasundarī | 
āsāṃ tu mantrabījāni proktasthāneṣu vinyaset || 38 || 
(2)pāṣāṇḍagaṇamadhye tu buddho māṃ parirakṣatu | 
brahmāvyād brahmasaṃghāte(3) śivo māṃ yogasiddhaye || 39 || 
jñāne māṃ bhāskaraḥ pātu mokṣe nārāyaṇaḥ prabhuḥ | 
yā śaktiḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ vidyāvidyeti gīyate || 40 || 
sā śaktiḥ sarvadā pātu strīputradhanasaṃpadi | 

<pṛ0 29> aṇimā paścime pātu laghimā cottare'vatu || 41 || 
pūrvataḥ pātu mahimā īśitā (tvā ka pāṭha |) dakṣiṇe'vatu | 
vaśitā (tvā ka pāṭha |) vāyunilaye īśe prākāmyasiddhidā || 42 || 
bhuktisiddhistathāgneye pātvicchāsiddhī rākṣase | 
adhaḥ pātu prāptisiddhirmokṣasiddhistathordhvake || 43 || 
brahmāṇī saṃdhyayoḥ pātu māheśvarī divāvatu | 
madhyāhne pātu kaumārī rātrau ca śakravallabhā || 44 || 
brāhme muhūrtake pātu vaiṣṇavī sarvasiddhidā | 
niśīthe pātu vārāhī cāmuṇḍā śa(kra?tru)vigrahe || 45 || 
mahotsāhe mahālakṣmīḥ pātu nityaṃ maheśvarī | 
śīrṣe saṃkṣobhiṇī pātu (tāri?drāvi)ṇī hṛdaye'vatu || 46 || 
ākarṣiṇī śikhāyāṃ tu kavace pātu vaśyadā | 
unmādinī tathā netre sarvagātre mahāṅkuśā || 47 || 
trikhaṇḍā bhujayoḥ pātu bīje bījasvarūpiṇī | 
khecarī pādayoḥ pātu yonimudrā ca sarvataḥ || 48 || 
(sa?kā)mākarṣaṇarūpāvyāt sadā(kāmā kha pāṭhaḥ |)karṣaṇakarmaṇi | 
buddhyākarṣaṇarūpāvyāt parabuddhivikarṣaṇe || 49 || 
ahaṃkāre sadā pātu ahaṃkāravikarṣaṇī | 
śabdākarṣaṇarūpāvyācchabdākarṣaṇakarmaṇi || 50 || 
sparśākarṣaṇarūpā māṃ pātu sparśanakarmaṇi | 
rūpākarṣaṇarūpāvyāt pararūpavikarṣaṇe || 51 || 

<pṛ0 30> rasākarṣaṇarūpāvyād rase vai parameśvarī | 
gandhākarṣaṇarūpā māṃ pātu gandhe ca sarvadā || 52 || 
cittākarṣaṇarūpā māṃ pāyādākṛṣṭikarmaṇi | 
dhairyākarṣaṇarūpā tu pātu dhairyavidhau sadā || 53 || 
smṛtyākarṣaṇarūpāvyājjñānākarṣaṇakarmaṇi | 
nāmākarṣaṇarūpāvyānnāmavyāharaṇe sadā || 54 || 
bījākarṣaṇarūpā māṃ sarvabījapraropaṇe | 
parajīvākarṣaṇe pātvātmākarṣaṇarūpiṇī || 55 || 
amṛtākarṣaṇī(1) pātu amṛtīkaraṇe(2) sadā | 
śarīrākarṣaṇī(3) pātu sadā śarīrarakṣaṇe || 56 || 
anaṅgakusumā pātu purataḥ sarvakarmaṇi | 
anaṅgamekhalā pātu pṛṣṭhataḥ parameśvarī || 57 || 
anaṅgamadanā pātu vāmato me maheśvarī | 
dakṣiṇe sarvadā pātu anaṅgamadanāturā || 58 || 
nityaṃ cānaṅgarekhāvyādūrdhvaṃ mama sadā priye | 
anaṅgaveginī pātu adho me parameśvarī || 59 || 
tathānaṅgāṃkuśā nityaṃ pātu māṃ dikṣu sarvadā | 
anaṅgamālinī pātu vidikṣu mama sarvadā || 60 || 
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī cordhve pātu māṃ jagadīśvarī | 
sarvavidrāviṇī cādho dikṣu sarvavikarṣaṇī || 61 || 
sarvāhlādakarī śaktirvidikṣu parirakṣatu | 

<pṛ0 31> sarvasaṃmohinī pātu samantāt parameśvarī || 62 || 
antarbahiśca māṃ pātu sarvastambhanakāriṇī (karmaṇi ka pāṭha |) | 
tathaiva pātu māṃ nityamākāśe sarvajṛmbhaṇī || 63 || 
pātāle caiva māṃ pātu sarvavaśyakarī tathā | 
devaloke sadā pātu sarvarañjanakāriṇī || 64 || 
sarvonmādanaśaktirmāṃ bhūtale parirakṣatu | 
sarvārthasādhanī śaktiḥ pāyādbhūtagaṇālaye || 65 || 
siddhānāmālaye pātu sarvasaṃpattipūraṇī | 
rākṣasānāṃ ca yakṣāṇāṃ sarvamantramayī gṛhe || 66 || 
asurāṇāṃ nivāse tu sarvadvandvakṣayaṃkarī | 
sarvasiddhipradā devī pātu rājagṛhe sadā || 67 || 
sarvasaṃpatpradā pātu svagṛhe sarvasaṃpadi | 
sarvapriyaṅkarī pātu sarvalokeṣu sarvadā || 68 || 
sarvamaṅgalakārye'vyāt sarvamaṅgalakāriṇī | 
sarvakāmapradā devī sarvakāryeṣu sarvadā || 69 || 
aiśvarye sarvadā pātu sarvaiśvaryapradāyinī (sarvaduḥkhavimocinī ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
sarvamṛtyupraśamanī pāyānnityaṃ mamālaye || 70 || 
sarvārambhe sadā pātu sarvavighnavināśinī | 
dehasaundaryakāle tu pātu sarvāṅgasundarī || 71 || 
sarvasaubhāgyakāle tu sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī | 
sarvajñā ca gṛhe pātu sarvaśaktimayī raṇe || 72 || 
sarvaiśvaryapradā mārge sarvajñānamayī jale | 

<pṛ0 32> sarvavyādhiṣu sarvatra sarvavyādhivināśinī || 73 || 
parvate pātu prabalā sarvādhārasvarūpiṇī | 
sarvapāpaharā pātu sarvakarmasu sarvadā || 74 || 
sarvānandakarī(1) devī nānāghakṛtagocare | 
sarvavairibhaye pātu sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇī || 75 || 
sarvasaṃkalpakāryeṣu sarvepsitaphalapradā | 
vaśinī vaśyakārye'vyāt kāmeśī stambhane'vatu || 76 || 
mohane modinī(2) pātu vimaloccāṭane'vatu | 
aruṇā pātuṃ māṃ vāde (3)jayinī jalpakarmaṇi || 77 || 
sarveśvarī kāmyakārye kaulinī bhedakarmaṇi | 
jṛmbhaṇe sarvadā pā(tu?ntu) śarāḥ pañca maheśvari || 78 || 
dhanurmohavidhau pātu pāśastu vaśyakarmaṇi | 
mahātejomayaḥ pātu stambhane māṃ tathāṅkuśaḥ || 79 || 
sarvajñā hṛdaye pātu nitya(kṛtā?tṛptiḥ) ca śīrṣake | 
anādibodhikā pātu nityaṃ śikhāpradeśake || 80 || 
kavace māṃ svatantrāvyāt netre nityamaluptikā | 
acintyaśakti(va?ra)streṣu pāyāt paramasiddhidā || 81 || 
kāmeśvarī ratau pātu yuddhe vajreśvarī tathā | 
nityaṃ pātu maheśānī(4) śrīkāme bhagamālinī || 82 || 
rase rūpe ca gandhe ca śabde5 sparśe ca pātu mām | 
sarvānandamayī devī mahātripurasundarī || 83 || 

<pṛ0 33> īśāne vaṭukaḥ pātu āgneyyāṃ yoginīgaṇāḥ | 
tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedo'sthimajjaśukrāṇi pāntu naḥ || 84 || 
kṣetreśo nairṛte pātu gaṇeśo vāyumandire | 
mātaṅgavanitā pātu śeṣikā kulasundarī || 85 || 
śaktirmāṃ sarvadā pātu mūlādhāranivāsinī | 
itīdaṃ kavacaṃ devi triṣu lokeṣu durlabham || 86 || 
yannoktaṃ ḍāmare tantre yannoktaṃ rudrayāmale | 
sarvatantreṣu yannoktaṃ gandharve prakaṭīkṛtam || 87 || 
tava prītyā mahādevi gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ | 
tava nāmni smṛte devi sarvayajñaphalaṃ labhet || 88 || 
sarvatraiva jayaprāptirvāñchā sarvatra sidhyati | 
nāmnaḥ śataguṇaṃ stotraṃ vyākhyānaṃ cāpi tacchatam || 89 || 
tasmācchataguṇaṃ dhyānaṃ dhyānācchataguṇo manuḥ | 
mantrācchataguṇaṃ devi kavacaṃ te mayoditam || 90 || 
yasmai kasmai na dātavyaṃ sugopyamatidurlabham | 
na deyaṃ paraśiṣyāya kṛpaṇāya sureśvari || 91 || 
śiṣyāya bhaktihīnāya cumbakāya tathaiva ca | 
gurubhaktivihīnāya parahiṃsāratāya ca || 92 || 
nindakāya kuśīlāya dāmbhikāya maheśvari | 
abhaktebhyo'bhi putrebhyo dattvā mṛtyumavāpnuyāt || 93 || 
yo dadāti niṣiddhebhyaḥ kavacaṃ manmukhāccyutam | 
tasya naśyanti deveśi vidyāyuḥkīrttisaṃcayāḥ || 94 || 

<pṛ0 34> taṃ hiṃsanti ca yoginyo madīyaśāsanāt priye | 
pare narakamāpnoti janmakoṭiśatāni ca || 95 || 
sarvalakṣaṇayuktāya yantramantraratāya ca | 
śiṣyāya śāntacittāya gurubhaktiratāya ca || 96 || 
udake lavaṇaṃ līnaṃ yathā bhavati pārvati | 
mano bhavati vai līnaṃ pādayoḥ śrīguroḥ priye || 97 || 
tadā deya mahadguhyaṃ kṛpayā cātidurlabham | 
guroḥ pādaprasādena śrīvidyā yadi labhyate || 98 || 
tathaiva kavacaṃ devi triṣu lokeṣu durlabham | 
sa ca devo haraḥ sākṣāt tatpatnī parameśvarī || 99 || 
pramādādapi deveśi śrīgurornāma nādadet | 
yasya bhaktirgurau nityaṃ vartate devavat (ta ka pāṭha |) priye || 100 || 
tasya mantrasya yantrasya siddhirbhavati nānyathā | 
kavacasya tathā siddhirguṭikāyāśca sundari || 101 || 
idaṃ kavacamajñātvā yo japet sundarīṃ parām | 
navalakṣaṃ prajaptvāpi (aiśa pāṭha |) tasya vidyā na sidhyati || 102 || 
śuciḥ samāhito bhūtvā bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ | 
sarvabhūtālaye supte niśāyāmardha(rddha ka pāṭha |)rātrake || 103 || 
hetuyukto maheśāni nirjane paśuvarjite | 
raktāsanopaviṣṭastu raktābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 104 || 
tāmbūlapūritamukho dhūpāmodasugandhitaḥ | 
saṃsthāpya vāmabhāge tu śaktiṃ svāmiparāyaṇām || 105 || 

<pṛ0 35> raktavastraparīdhānāṃ śivamantradharāṃ śubhām | 
yā śaktiḥ sā mahādevī hararūpastu sādhakaḥ || 106 || 
anyonyacintanād devi devatvamupajāyate | 
śaktiyukto yajed devīṃ śrīcakre lakṣaṇānvite || 107 || 
puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ devyai mūlamantreṇa dāpayet | 
bhogaiśca madhuparkādyaistāmbūlādyaiḥ suvāsitaiḥ || 108 || 
pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ pūjā(bhū ka pāṭha |)koṭiphalaṃ labhet | 
pūrvokta(syā?nyā)samevāsmin samaye ca pravinyaset || 109 || 
ātmānaṃ paramaṃ dhyāyed divyastrībhiralaṃkṛtam | 
divyaṃ mūrdhni mahacchatraṃ sahasradalanirmitam || 110 || 
sudhāvarṣimukhāmbhojaṃ sasmitaṃ divyavarcasam | 
paramānandasaṃdohamuditaṃ paramavyayam || 111 || 
divyālaṅkāravastrāḍhyaṃ divyamālyānulepitam | 
divyāsanasamāsīnaṃ divyabhogavibhoginam || 112 || 
sarvagaṃ sarvabhūteśaṃ sṛṣṭisthityantakāriṇam | 
nirlepaṃ nirmalaṃ śāntaṃ sarvavyāpinamīśvaram || 113 || 
tato devīṃ hṛda(dā ka pāṭha |)mbhoje dhyāyet tadgatamānasaḥ | 
ja(vā?pā)kusumasaṃkāśāṃ bālārkakiraṇāruṇām || 114 || 
raktapadmasamāsīnāṃ raktābharaṇabhūṣitām | 
raktavastraparīdhānāṃ pūrṇacandranibhānanām (na ka pāṭha |) || 115 || 
saivāhamityabhedena dvaitahīnaṃ vicintayet | 
advaitānandabhāvena sādhakaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 116 || 

<pṛ0 36> chāyayā śoṇayā vyāptaṃ jagadetaccarācaram | 
bhāvanāvaśasaṃpanno bhāvayed bhāvanā(ta ka pāṭha | )paraḥ || 117 || 
evaṃ cintāparasyāśu siddhayo'ṣṭau bhavanti hi | 
saṃprāpya vipulān bhogān rājyāspadaṃ ca bhūtale || 118 || 
aindraṃ padamavāpyātha viharan nandane vane | 
urvaśīpramukhābhiśca svecchayā divyabhoga(dā?vā)n || 119 || 
tadāpnoti paraṃ sthānaṃ durāpaṃ tridaśairapi | 
tataśca kavacaṃ divyaṃ paṭhedekamanāḥ priye || 120 || 
tasya sarvārthasiddhiḥ syānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā | 
idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ paraṃ svastyayanaṃ mahat || 121 || 
sarveṣāmeva hiṃsrāṇāṃ ḍākinīnāṃ maheśvari | 
niśācaragaṇānāṃ ca vāraṇaṃ nāśanaṃ tathā || 122 || 
āyurbalapradaṃ nityaṃ tuṣṭipuṣṭiśubhāvaham | 
nārīṇāṃ mṛtavatsānāṃ guṇavatsutadāyakam || 123 || 
sūtyā(ḥ) sūtigṛhasyāpi bālagrahanivāraṇam | 
viṣada(sya?syu)grahāṇāṃ ca sadā śāntivivarddhanam || 124 || 
viṣaśastrāgnirudrāṇāṃ vāraṇaṃ jayadaṃ yudhi | 
jale sthale tathākāśe sarvotpāteṣu sarvadā || 125 || 
trailokyavāsināmeva sarvamaṅgaladāyakam | 
sakṛdyastu paṭhed devi kavacaṃ devadurlabham || 126 || 
hayamedhaphalaṃ tasya bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ | 
nityaṃ yastu paṭhed devi śṛṇuyādvā samāhitaḥ || 127 || 

<pṛ0 37> sa sarvāṃllabhate kāmān pare devīpuraṃ vrajet | 
saṃgrāme ca jayecchatrūn mātaṅgāniva kesarī || 128 || 
dahet tṛṇaṃ yathā vahnistathā śatrūñjayet sadā | 
nāstrāṇi tasya śāstrāṇi śarīre prabhavanti ca || 129 || 
tadgātraṃ prāpya śastrāṇi brahmāstrāṇi ca yāni ca | 
mālyāni kusumānīva sukhadāni bhavanti hi || 130 || 
parāḥ parāṅmukhā yānti vi(vā?nā)yuddhena pārvati | 
vyādhistasya kadācittu duḥkhaṃ nāsti kadācana || 131 || 
gatistasyaiva sarvatra vāyostulyā sadā bhavet | 
dīrghāyuḥ kāmabhogī so (eśa pāṭhaḥ |) dhanadhānyasamṛddhimān || 132 || 
jitavyādhī rūpavān syād guṇavānabhijāyate | 
cāturvargyaṃ kare tasya bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 133 || 
anyasya vallabhaḥ so (aiśa pāṭhaḥ |) vai putradārakulānvitaḥ | 
iha loke sukhaṃ bhuktvā pare mukto bhaviṣyati || 134 || 
na tasya durgatirdevi kadācidapi jāyate | 
durgrahāḥ sugrahā yānti vaśaṃ gacchanti mānavāḥ || 135 || 
na tasya vighno bhavati na śoko bhuvi jāyate | 
vetālāśca piśācāśca rākṣasāśca bhayānakāḥ || 136 || 
te sarve vilayaṃ yānti kavacasyāsya kīrttanāt | 
tasyaiva śatravo devi cintāmātraprayogataḥ || 137 || 
vinaśyanti na saṃdeho yoginyo bhakṣayanti tān | 

<pṛ0 138> śāntikādīnī karmāṇi māraṇoccāṭanāni ca || 138 || 
vacomātreṇa deveśi tasya sidhyanti bhūtale | 
na pāpairlipyate devi mahograistu sudāruṇaiḥ || 139 || 
na kālasya vaśaṃ gacchenna jarā naca duḥkhitā | 
tatra deśe na durbhikṣaṃ naca mārī pravarttate || 140 || 
na rogāstatra jāyante notpātāḥ prabhavanti ca | 
vividhāścaiva yoginyastasya sādhaka (vibhaktilopa aiśa |) saṃnidhau || 141 || 
śāntiṃ caiva prayacchanti rakṣanti putravat sadā | 
sarvadā ca sukhaprāptiḥ sarvatīrthaphalaṃ labhet || 142 || 
nānena sadṛśaḥ kaścit sādhako bhuvi jāyate | 
surāsuramanuṣyāṇāṃ tattvarūpaḥ sukhāvahaḥ || 143 || 
yena vijñāta(na ka pāṭha |)mātreṇa smṛtenaiva ca sundari | 
akṣayāṃllabhate kāmān muktisthānaṃ ca gacchati || 144 || 
sarvalakṣaṇahīno'pi smaraṇāt kalu(kula ka pāṭha |)ṣāpahaḥ | 
aho kavacamāhātmyaṃ paṭhamānasya nityaśaḥ || 145 || 
vināpi yogacaryeṇa yogināṃ samatāṃ vrajet | 
bhūrjatvaci samālikhya cakraṃ tattvavinirmitam || 146 || 
madhyetrikoṇaṃ saṃlikhya sādhyasādhakayorlipim | 
tadūrdhve mūlamantraṃ ca mātṛkārṇena veṣṭayet || 147 || 
agurudravamiśreṇa candanena sugandhinā | 
etadyantraṃ mahādevi surāsurasudurlabham || 148 || 

<pṛ0 39> rocanākuṅkumenaiva tadbāhye kavacaṃ likhet | 
śvetasūtreṇa saṃveṣṭya lākṣayā pariveṣṭayet || 149 || 
pañcāmṛtaiḥ pañcagavyaiḥ sna(snā ka pāṭha |)payitvā śubhe'hani | 
saṃpūjya devīrūpāṃ tāṃ guṭikāṃ sarvakāmadām || 150 || 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāmantreṇa (mātre ka pāṭha |) prāṇāṃstatra niveśayet | 
cāruṇā śātakumbhena bhūṣitāṃ yonimudrayā || 151 || 
antaryoniṃ tato dhyātvā tatra saṃsthāpayed budhaḥ | 
eṣā tu guṭikā devi kaṇṭhalagnā dhanapradā || 152 || 
śīrṣe vaśyaka(re?rī) devi kaṭyāṃ stambhanakāriṇī | 
baddhā vāmabhuje caiṣā vairipakṣavināśinī || 153 || 
jaṭhare rogaśamanī putradā hṛdi saṃsthitā | 
vidyākarī lalāṭasthā śikhāyāṃ tu yaśaḥpra(daḥ?dā) || 154 || 
dakṣiṇe bāhumūle vai yadi tiṣṭhati sarvadā | 
tadā sarvārthasiddhiḥ syādyadyanmanasi varttate || 155 || 
satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ | 
na śaknomi prabhāvaṃ hi (ta ka pāṭha |) kathituṃ (aya ṇijlope aiśa pāṭha |) kavacasya vai || 156 || 
etattu kavacenaiva paṭhanaṃ sādhanaṃ priye | 
kathitaṃ me tava snehād gopanīyaṃ sadā priye || 157 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde mahātripurasundarītrailokyamohanākhyaṃ kavacaṃ nāma caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 4 || 

<pṛ0 40> [pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
pārvatyuvāca 
vinā yantreṇa cet pūjā devatā na prasīdati | 
tasmāt kathaya deveśa yantramasyā manoharam || 1 || 
yasya darśanamātreṇa dāridryaṃ naśyati dhruvam | 

īśvara uvāca 
saivamālocya sa(sva ka pāṭha |)rgādau saccidānandarūpiṇī || 2 || 
samastatattvasaṃyogāt smṛtyadhiṣṭhānarūpiṇī | 
vyaktīkaroti nityā(vaḥ?yā)prakṛtiḥ paramaḥ pumān || 3 || 
sā tattvasaṃjñā cinmātrā(trā jyo ka pāṭha |)jjyotiṣaḥ saṃnidhestathā | 
vicikīrṣuryonibhūtā kvacidabhyeti bindunā || 4 || 
ativyaktā parāśaktiravinābhāvalakṣaṇā | 
akhaṇḍaparacicchaktirvyāptā cidrūpiṇī vibhuḥ || 5 ||| 
samastatattvabhāvena vivarte(tsā?cchā)samanvitā | 
prayāti bindubhāvaṃ ca kriyāprādhānyalakṣaṇam || 6 || 
baindavaṃ mātṛcakrasya trirūpatvaṃ punarbhavet | 
binduḥ śivātmakastatra bījaṃ śaktyātmakaṃ smṛtam || 7 || 
tayoryoge bhavennādastebhyo yaccintayāmyaham | 
tasmāt tāni ca cakrāṇi tatprakāraḥ prakathyate || 8 || 
tataḥ prāṅmukha āsīnaścakroddhāraṃ samārabhet | 
hemarūpyāditāmrāṇāṃ paṭṭe cātimanohare || 9 || 

<pṛ0 41> caturasre same śuddhe madhyocchūnavibhūṣite | 
yugmāṅgamilitaṃ devi paṭṭasyeha samīritam || 10 || 
athavā parameśāni bhūmau cakraṃ samālikhet | 
hastamātramite śuddhe gomayenopale(li ka pāṭha |)pite || 11 || 
sindūrarajasā tatra kuṅkumenātha vā priye | 
ālikheccakrarājaṃ ca lekhanyā haimayā tathā || 12 || 
athavā kuśamūlena darbhapāṇiḥ samāhitaḥ | 
netraramyaṃ yathā cakraṃ tathā kuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ || 13 || 
pratīcyagraṃ likhedekaṃ trikoṇaṃ taduparyatha | 
pūrvatrikoṇamadhyāgraṃ trikoṇāntaramālikhet || 14 || 
atha saṃdhidvaya bhittvā prāgagraṃ vilikhet param | 
trikoṇamadhyagaṃ cakramaṣṭakoṇaṃ tathā bhavet || 15 || 
tato daśāracakrasya nirmāṇaṃ śṛṇu pārvati | 
dakṣiṇottaragā rekhāstisro yāstatra tāsvapi || 16 || 
madhyarekhāṃ parityajya rekhe dve parivardha(rddha ka pāṭha |)yet | 
tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā saṃdhibhede catuṣṭayam || 17 || 
kṛtvā rekhādvayaṃ kuryād daśakoṇaṃ yathā bhavet | 
tathānyadaśakoṇasya nirmāṇaṃ parikīrtyate || 18 || 
dakṣiṇottaragāsvevaṃ rekhāḥ pañca bhavanti yāḥ | 
tāsāṃ rekhā(dva?tra)yaṃ madhye hitvā pūrvāparaṃ tu tat || 19 || 
bāhyarekhādvayaṃ devi pūrvavat parivardhayet | 

<pṛ0 42> tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā saṃdhibhedacatuṣṭayam || 20 || 
kṛtvā rekhādvayaṃ kuryād daśakoṇaṃ yathā bhavet | 
caturdaśāracakrasya nirmāṇaṃ kathyate'dhunā || 21 || 
dakṣiṇottaragāsvevaṃ rekhāḥ sapta bhavanti yāḥ | 
tāsāṃ rekhā(dva?tra)yaṃ hitvā bāhye pūrvāparaṃ tataḥ || 22 || 
dīrghaṃ rekhādvayaṃ mantrī pūrvavat parivardha(rddha ka pāṭha |)yet | 
tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā saṃdhibhedacatuṣṭayam || 23 || 
daśārīkṛtya tenaiva saṃdhibhedacatuṣṭayāt | 
rekhādvayaṃ bahiḥ kuryādrekhāḥ syurnava caiva(mena ka pāṭha |) vai || 24 || 
kalpayedatha tasyāgrairanyakoṇacatuṣṭayam | 
evaṃ caturdaśāraṃ syādvilocanamanoharam || 25 || 
evaṃ niṣpādite cakre yadbhavati ca tacchṛṇu | 
madhye trikoṇameva syāt tanmadhye binduriṣyate || 26 || 
caturṇāmapi cakrāṇāṃ bahiragrāstrikoṇakāḥ | 
tricatvāriṃśacca guṇitā yonayo'ṣṭau ca śobhanāḥ || 27 || 
matsyā dvādaśa saṃpannāścatuṣkoṇopaśobhitāḥ | 
granthayo'ṣṭādaśāpi syuḥ ṣaṭpathā granthayo'pare || 28 || 
caturviṃśatisaṃkhyātāḥ śobhanāste catuṣpathāḥ | 
aṣṭakoṇagarbhaṃ tu catuṣkoṇatrayaṃ tathā || 29 || 
dakṣiṇottarapūrvāsu dikṣu saṃbhavati kramāt | 
dakṣiṇottaragāstatra nava rekhā bhavanti hi || 30 || 

<pṛ0 43> nava rekhāstathaivānyā vahnivāyudigāyatāḥ | 
na(ka etat padyārdha nāsti |)va rekhāstathaivānyā nairṛteśadigāyatāḥ || 31 || 
tatra ye pañca deveśi sādhakābhimukhāgrakāḥ | 
trikoṇāste śaktayaḥ syuḥ pañca (ne?ta)tra śubhodayāḥ || 32 || 
pūrvāgrā ye tu catvāro vahnayaste prakīrtitāḥ | 
evaṃ cakraṃ vinirmāya bāhye vṛttaṃ vilikhya ca || 33 || 
tenāṣṭadalapadmasya nirmāṇaṃ tadbahistathā | 
vṛttena ṣoḍaśadalaṃ likhet padmaṃ manoharam || 34 || 
vṛttatrayaṃ tu tadbāhye tadbāhye caturasrakam | 
trirekhaṃ bhūpuraṃ viddhi caturddhāropaśobhitam || 35 || 
evaṃ bhavanti cakrāṇi bindunaiva nava kramāt | 
vṛttatrayaṃ maheśāni na pūjāyāṃ nigadyate || 36 || 
evametasya cakrasya prabhāvo varṇi(taṃ?tuṃ) mayā | 
na śakyate maheśāni kalpakoṭiśatairapi || 37 || 
evametanmahācakraṃ mahāśrītripurāmayam | 
yantraṃ śarīramityāhurmantraṃ jñānamakhaṇḍitam || 38 || 
śarīraṃ trividhaṃ prāhurbhautikaṃ ca manomayam | 
paraṃ jñānamayaṃ nityaṃ yadanāśi nirantaram || 39 || 
mudrāṃ bhautikamityāhuryantraṃ viddhi manomayam (haram ka pāṭha |) | 
mantraṃ jñāna(kāma ka pāṭhaḥ |)mayaṃ viddhi evaṃ tridhā vapurbhavet || 40 || 
mudrāśarīraṃ me (brūhi?viddhi) aṅgabhūtaṃ tathā param | 

<pṛ0 44> yonibhūtā mahāmudrā śarīramiti kīrtitam || 41 || 
tasyā rasasamutpannāḥ kāmeśvaryādikāstathā | 
binducakraṃ varārohe sarvānandamayaṃ priye || 42 || 
saṃvidvedyaṃ mahācakraṃ jñeyaṃ brahmasvarūpakam | 
tataḥ paraṃ śivāṅkasthāṃ mahātripurasundarīm || 43 || 
samāvāhya yajeddevīṃ parayātha saparyayā | 
agnīśāsuravāyavyamadhye dikṣu ca pārvati || 44 || 
ṣaḍaṅgayuvatīḥ (sarvajñādiśaktī |) paścāt pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ | 
tanmayīścā(ṣva kha pāṭhaḥ |)tha nityāśca yajet saubhāgyakāmukaḥ || 45 || 
mahātryasraṃ smaret tatra pañcadaśaka(kā kha pāṭhaḥ |)lātmakam | 
vāmāvartakrameṇaiva kalāḥ pañcadaśa kramāt || 46 || 
akārādyā(dyā u kha pāṭha |)mukārāntāṃ(ntā kha pāṭha |) dakṣiṇasyāṃ vicintayet | 
tataśca pūrvarekhāyāṃ dīrghakarṇādi (ūkārādi |) pañcakam || 47 || 
vicintyottararekhāyāṃ śaktyā(sī?di) (ekārādi |) paricintayet | 
kāmeśvaryādikānityāstathaiva paripūjayet (nitya yathā 1 kāmeśvarī 2 bhagamālinī 3 nityaklinnā 4 bheruṇḍā 5 vahnivāsinī 6 vajreśvarī 6 śivādūtī 8 tvaritā 9 kulasundarī 10 nityā 11 nīlapatākā 12 vijayā 13 sarvamaṅgalā 14 jvālāmālinī 15 citrā || hrīṃ śrīṃ a kāmeśvarīnityāśrīpādukā pūjayāmi tarpayāmi nama ityeva vāmāvartena sapūjayet |) || 48 || 
pratipattithimārabhya paurṇamāsyantamadrije | 
ekaikāṃ pūjayennityāṃ tattattithikrameṇa tu || 49 || 
ādāvekaikavṛddhyā tu yajet sādhakasattamaḥ | 

<pṛ0 45> kṛṣṇapakṣe maheśāni pūjayettu(ttattu kha pāṭhaḥ |) trimaṇḍalam || 50 || 
vicitrādyā varārohe yāvat kāmeśvarī bhavet | 
pūjanīyā vilomena vānyā(ḥ) tathaiva pārvati || 51 || 
ubhayoḥ pakṣayorante yathoktadhyānayogataḥ | 
(sva?sa)rgasthāṃ ṣoḍaśīṃ nityāṃ mahātripurasundarīm (pūjayediti śeṣa |) || 52 || 
tattadvidyāstathā dhyānaṃ yantrāṇi pūjanāni tu | 
homānyanyāni sarvāṇi kāmyāni ca varānane || 53 || 
paṭalaiḥ pañcasaṃkhyaistu paścāt vakṣyāmyahaṃ śive | 
atrāṅgāvṛtibhūtānāṃ śṛṇu pūjāṃ varānane || 54 || 

īśvara uvāca 
tatra tatra maheśāni samāvāhya vidhānataḥ | 
pūjayet sādhako bhaktyā ya(do?tho)ktakramavartma(kā?nā) || 55 || 
mūlādyenaiva tatrādyāṃ haṃsena puṭitena tu | 
dvitīyena dvitīyāṃ ca tṛtīyena tṛtīyakam || 56 || 
caturthena caturthī ca pañcamenaiva pañcamīm | 
ṣaṣṭhena tu tathā ṣaṣṭhīṃ saptamena tu saptamīm || 57 || 
aṣṭamenāṣṭamīṃ caiva navamīṃ navamena tu | 
daśamīṃ daśa(mī?me)naiva ekādaśīṃ tathaiva hi || 58 || 
ekādaśākṣareṇaiva dvādaśīṃ dvādaśena tu | 
trayodaśīṃ ca tatraiva trayodaśākṣareṇa tu || 59 || 
caturdaśākṣareṇaiva yajet tatra caturdaśīm | 
pañcadaśākṣareṇaiva yajet pañcadaśīṃ tataḥ || 60 || 

<pṛ0 46> samastena tathā devi ṣoḍaśīṃ paripūjayet | 
ādā(ādyā ka pāṭha |)vante ca madhye ca saparyā khalu pārvati || 61 || 
mahādevyāḥ samākhyātā nityaiva vihitāgame | 
tāmeva pūjayedvāpi mahātripurasundarīm || 62 || 
yatastasyāḥ samutpannaṃ nityāmaṇḍalamīdṛśam | 
athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi kāmyaṃ kāmārthasiddhaye || 63 || 
yathoktāṃ kulajāṃ śastāṃ cārulakṣaṇalakṣitām | 
svecchāṛtumatīṃ pūrṇa(rṇā ka pāṭha |)yauvanācchanna(cchāditaśai ka pāṭha |)śaiśavām || 64 || 
tatrādyadivase devīṃ pūjayitvā yathāvidhi | 
yajet kāmeśvarīmādyāṃ dvitīyāṃ dvitīye tathā || 65 || 
tṛtīye'tha tṛtīyāṃ ca caturthe(rthī ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca caturthikām | 
pañcame pañcamīṃ caiva ṣaṣṭhīṃ ṣaṣṭhe tathāhani || 66 || 
saptame saptamīṃ caiva aṣṭamīmaṣṭame'hani | 
navame navamīṃ devīṃ daśame daśamīṃ tathā || 67 || 
ekādaśīṃ tathā rudre dvādaśīṃ dvādaśe'hani | 
trayodaśadine devīṃ trayodaśīṃ krameṇa tu || 68 || 
caturdaśīṃ tathā śakre pañcadaśīṃ tato yajet | 
ṣoḍaśīṃ ṣoḍaśe pūrṇe yajed (bu?vṛ)ddhikrameṇa tu || 69 || 
anyāścaiva yajet paścādaparaṃ yat prakīrtitam | 
ṣoḍaśarturniśāḥ strīṇāṃ tāsu kramotkramād yajet || 70 || 
yathāvidhi krameṇaiva na dinaṃ vyatilaṅghayet | 

<pṛ0 47> naiva visarjayet tāṃ tu yāvatsā(syā ka pāṭhaḥ |) syāt phalārthinī || 71 || 
phalārthinīṃ viditvaiva visṛjyānyāṃ samāśrayet | 
niśāḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ saṃyuktāḥ ṣoḍaśa śaktayastathā || 72 || 
ekasmin divase devi labhyante bhāgyayogataḥ | 
pūjayettāḥ prayatnena yathāvat pūrvasūcitāḥ || 73 || 
rātrau vṛddhyā dine hānyā rase madhye sthito balī | 
ṛtumekaṃ krameṇaiva sa bhavet surapādapaḥ || 74 || 
vimalājayinīmadhye guravaḥ (aṣṭāracakre gurukramasaparyā bodhyeti sūcyate |) kathitāstu te | 
trailokyamohane cakre buddhaṃ ca paripūjayet || 75 || 
brahmaviṣṇuśivākhyāstāstisro rekhāśca tannibhāḥ | 
tatrādau brahmarekhāyāmaṇimādyāḥ (aṇimā-laghimā-mahimā-īśitva-prākāmya-bhuktisiddhi-icchāsiddhi-rasasiddhi-mokṣasiddhaya ityetā brahmarekhāyā pūjyā |) sthitāḥ priye || 76 || 
varābhayakarā raktāḥ samīhitaphalapradāḥ | 
kaumārī pītavarṇā ca śaktitomaradhāriṇī || 77 || 
varadābhayahastā ca dhyātavyā parameśvarī | 
aṅkuśaṃ tomaraṃ vidyutkuliśau bibhratī karaiḥ || 78 || 
indrāṇī gauravarṇā ca dhyeyā sarvasamṛddhidā | 
vaiṣṇavī śyāmavarṇā ca śaṃkhacakravarābhayān || 79 || 
hastapadmaiśca bibhrāṇā divyabhūṣaṇabhūṣitā | 
vārāhī śyāmavarṇā ca potrivaktrasamanvitā || 80 || 
halaṃ ca musa(ṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |)laṃ khaḍgaṃ kheṭakaṃ dadhatī karaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 48> cāmuṇḍā kṛṣṇavarṇā ca śūlaṃ ḍamarukaṃ tathā || 81 || 
khaḍgaṃ vetālakaṃ caiva dadhanā dakṣiṇairbhujaiḥ | 
kheṭakaṃ caṣa(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)kaṃ caiva nāgaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ ca vāmakaiḥ || 82 || 
brahmāṇīpramukhāḥ (brahmāṇī-māheśvarī kaumārī-vaiṣṇavī-vārāhī-indrāṇī-cāmuṇḍā-mahālakṣmya ityetā madhyamāyā viṣṇurekhāyāṃ pūjyāḥ |) sarva(ā) viṣṇurekhā samāśritāḥ | 
brahmāṇī raktavarṇā ca caturbhiḥ śobhitā mukhaiḥ || 83 || 
varadābhayahastā ca kuṇḍi(ṇḍa ka pāṭha |)kākṣalasatkarā | 
māheśvarī śvetavarṇā trinetrā śūladhāriṇī || 84 || 
kṛpāṇame(naṃ?ṇaṃ) paraśuṃ dadhānā pāṇibhiḥ priye | 
bhedamasyāḥ paraṃ guhyaṃ saṃkṣepāt kathya(thitā kha pāṭha |)te'dhunā || 85 || 
mahālakṣmīstu pītābhā padme darpaṇameva ca | 
mātuluṅgaphalaṃ caiva dadhānā parameśvarī || 86 || 
śivarekhāṃ samāśritya saṃkṣobhaṇyādikāḥ (sakṣobhaṇyādayo mudrādevya prakaṭayoginyastrailokyamohane cakre caturasrarekhātmake śivarekhāyā sapūjyā |) sthitāḥ | 
raktāḥ saṃkṣobhaṇīmukhyāḥ svasvamudrākarānvitāḥ || 87 || 
etāḥ prakaṭayoginyo dhyeyāḥ sarvasamṛddhaye | 
aṇimāpurato devi tripurā cakranāyikā || 88 || 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśā muktāratnavibhūṣitā(tāḥ ka pāṭha |) |
pustakaṃ cākṣamālāṃ ca kamaladvayamuttamam || 89 ||
bibhratī siddhaye dhyeyā mahāpātakanāśinī | 
trivṛttaṃ (vṛttatrayaṃ maheśāni na pūjāyā nigadyate (5|36 ityuktyā pūjāyā nopayujyate tat |) candrasūryāgnisvarūpaṃ viddhi pārvati || 90 ||  

<pṛ0 49> sarvāśāpūrake cakre ravivedadalānvite | 
brahmāṇaṃ cintayettatra sravatpīyūṣavarṣiṇi(rpite kha pāṭha |) || 91 || 
kāmākarṣaṇikādyāstu ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃyutāḥ | 
sṛ(śṛ ka pāṭha |)ṇipāśadharāḥ sarvā rūpeṇāpīha tatsamāḥ || 92 || 
etāstu gupyayoginyo (tā yathā kāmabuddhyahakāraśabdasparśarūparasagandhacittadhairyasmṛtināmabījātmāmṛtaśarīrākarṣaṇyaḥ iti guptayoginya sarvāśāparipūraka ṣoḍaśadalacakre sapūjyāḥ |) dhyeyāḥ sarvasamṛddhidāḥ | 
kāmākarṣaṇikāgre tu tripureśī vyavasthitā || 93 || 
tripurāsadṛśī dhyeyā tripureśī varānane | 
aṣṭapatraṃ varārohe japākusumasaṃnibham || 94 || 
sarvasaṃkṣobha(naṃ?ṇaṃ) nāma sarvakāmaphalapradam | 
cintayitvā śivaṃ tatra vargāṣṭakasamanvitāḥ || 95 || 
anaṅgakusumādyāstu smṛtā guptatarāśca (yathā anaṅgakusumānaṅgamekhalānaṅgamadanānaṅgamadanāturānaṅgarekhānaṅgaveginyanaṅgāṅkuśānaṅgamālinīti etā guptatarayoginyaḥ sarvasakṣobhakārake'ṣṭadalacakre sapūjyāḥ |) tāḥ | 
sundarīsadṛśāḥ sarvāḥ sarvakāmaphalapradāḥ || 96 || 
anaṅgakusumāgre tu dhyeyā tripurasundarī | 
sarvālaṅkārasaṃpannā pustakaṃ cākṣamālikām || 97 || 
varābhayau ca dadhatī bandhūkakusumaprabhā | 
sarvasaubhāgyade cakre dāḍimīkusumaprabhe || 68 || 
caturdaśārake devi bhāskaraṃ paricintayet | 

<pṛ0 50> sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīmukhyāḥ (sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī-sarvavidrāviṇī-sarvākarṣiṇī-sarvāhlādinī-sarvamohinī-sarvastambhinī-sarvajṛmbhiṇī-sarvavaśaṅkarī-sarvarañjanī-sarvonmādinī-sarvārthasādhanī-sarvasaṃpatpūraṇī-sarvamantramayī-sarvadvandvakṣayakarītyetā saṃpradāyayoginya sarvasaubhāgyadāyake caturdaśāracakre pūjyāḥ |) saṃpradāyāḥ smṛtā imāḥ || 99 || 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīśakteḥ(kti ka pāṭha |) purastripuravāsinī | 
sundaryāḥ sadṛśī dhyeyā sarvakāmaphalapradā || 100 || 
sarvārthasādhake cakre sarvarakṣākare tathā | 
bāhyāradaśakoṇe ca japākusumasannibhe || 101 || 
nārāyaṇaṃ prapūjyātha bāhyāradaśake tataḥ | 
sarvasiddhipradāmukhyāḥ kulakaulā (sarvādaya siddhipradā-saṃpatpradā-priyakarī-maṅgalakāriṇī-kāmapradā-duḥkhavimocinī-mṛtyupraśamanī-vighnavināśinī-aṅgasundarī-saubhāgyadāyinī- ityetāḥ kulakaulayoginyaḥ sarvārthasādhake bahirdaśāracakre pūjyā |) imāḥ smṛtāḥ || 102 || 
sarvasiddhipradāgre tu tripurā(ra kha pāṭha |)śrīrvyavasthitā | 
udyadbhānusahasrābhā divyālaṃkārabhūṣitā || 103 || 
pustakaṃ japamālāṃ ca dadhatī varadābhaye | 
antardaśāracakre ca pūjyāḥ sarvasamṛddhidāḥ || 104 || 
tathā niga(rva?rbha)yoginyaḥ sarvajñā(jñā ka pāṭhaḥ |)pramukhāḥ (sarvajñā-sarvaśakti-sarvaiśvaryapradā-sarvajñānamayī-sarvavyādhivināśinī-sarvādhārasvarūpā-sarvapāpaharā-sarvānandamayī-sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇī-sarvepsitaphalapradā- ityetā nigarbhayoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākare'ntardaśāracakre pūjanīyā |) priye | 
sarvajñāpurato devi sthitā tripuramālinī || 105 || 
indragopaprabhā devī pāśāṅkuśakapālinī | 
mahābhīti(ha?ka)rā samyak sādhakānāṃ kṣaṇādiyam || 106 || 

<pṛ0 51> sarvarogahare cakre bālārka(laka ka pāṭha |)kiraṇāruṇe | 
vaśinīpramukhāstatra rahasyayoginīryajet || 107 || 
vaśinīpramukhā(vaśinī-kāmeśvarī-modinī-vimalā-aruṇā-jayinī-sarveśvarī-kaulinī-vāgdevatā ityetā rahasyayoginyaḥ sarvarogahare vasukoṇacakre sapūjyā |)raktā varābhayakarānvitāḥ | 
pustakaṃ japamālāṃ ca dadhānāḥ parameśvari || 108 || 
vaśinīpurato devi sarvasiddhipradāyinīm | 
tathā tripurasiddhāṃ ca dhyāyedviṣavināśinīm || 109 || 
trikoṇāgravibhāgasya dakṣiṇe vāmake priye | 
catuṣpathasamāyukte bāṇacāpau prapūjayet || 110 ||  
trikoṇasyordhvabhāgasya vāmadakṣiṇayostathā | 
ṣaḍadhvarūpayordevi pāśāṅkuśau vyavasthitau || 111 || 
sarvasiddhiprade cakre trikoṇe parameśvari | 
udyatsūryasahasrābhe bandhūkakusumaprabhe || 112 || 
atirahasyayoginyaḥ saṃsthitā vīravandite | 
agrakoṇe agnicakre kāmarūpe varānane || 113 || 
kāmeśvarī trinetrā ca taruṇāruṇavigrahā | 
caṣa(sa ka pāṭha |)kaṃ varadānaṃ ca pāśaṃ cāṅkuśameva ca || 114 || 
dadhatī parameśāniṃ dhyeyā rudrātmaśaktikā | 
vāmakoṇe trikoṇasya sūryacakre maheśvari || 115 || 
jālandhare mahāpīṭhe vajreśvarī samīritā | 
trinetrā pūrṇacandrāsyā bandhūkakusumaprabhā || 116 || 

<pṛ0 52> pāśāṅkuśau śarāṃścāpaṃ caṣa(sa ka pāṭha |)kaṃ mātuluṅgakam | 
dadhatī cārurūpā sā dhyeyā viṣṇvātmaśaktikā || 117 || 
dakṣakoṇe trikoṇasya (lo?so)macakre varānane | 
pūrṇagiryālaye devi kathitā bhagamālinī || 118 || 
trinetrā taruṇendumastā sindūrāruṇavigrahā | 
pustakaṃ japamālāṃ ca pāśāṅkuśakameva ca || 119 || 
dadhatī parameśānī dhyeyā brahmātmaśaktikā | 
kāmeśvarī purobhāge tripurā(mnā?mbā) vyavasthitā || 120 || 
mālinīsadṛśī dhyeyā sarvakāmaphalapradā | 
athavā raśmayaḥ sarvā devīrūpeṇa cintayet || 121 || 
navāvaraṇaśaktīnāṃ dhyānaṃ devyāḥ samaṃ yataḥ | 
niḥsaranti yathā nityaṃ sūryabimbānmarīcayaḥ || 122 || 
devyastathā samutpannā mahādevyāḥ śarīrataḥ | 
uḍyāṇapīṭhake devi brahmacakre varānane || 123 || 
parāpararahasyākhyā devī brahmasvarūpiṇī | 
cakreśīmapi tāmeva pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ || 124 || 
sthitikrameṇa pūjeyaṃ yantroddhārakrameṇa tu | 
sṛṣṭikramaṃ mahadguhyaṃ pūjanaṃ parameśvari || 125 || 

pārvatyuvāca 
cakramaṇḍalamākhyātaṃ na pūjā tatra maṇḍale | 
idānīṃ kathayeśāna pūjākramamanuttamam || 126 || 

<pṛ0 53> īśvara uvāca | 
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi pūjākramamanuttamam | 
yasya prabodhamātreṇa jīvanmuktaḥ pramodate || 127 || 
devyā nityoditā pūjā tribhirbhedairvyavasthitā | 
parā(aparā ca ka pāṭha |) caivāparā devi tṛtīyā ca parāparā || 128 || 
cakramadhye samāvāhya pū(ja?jya)te dravyavistaraiḥ | 
prathamā sā samākhyātā matā purandarādibhiḥ || 129 || 
mṛ(dā?dvā)sane samāsīnaḥ khagasaṃyamane rataḥ | 
samakāyaśirogrīvo nāsālokanatatparaḥ || 130 || 
vikalparūpasaṃjalpavimukho bhāvatatparaḥ | 
mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthāṃ paramānandarūpiṇīm || 131 || 
āpyāyitajagadrūpāṃ paramāmṛtavarṣiṇīm | 
tattajjñānamaye cakre paramātmasvarūpiṇīm || 132 || 
ardha(rddha ka pāṭha |)mātrā yonirūpāṃ bindutrivalayātmikām | 
paramānandapuṣpeṇa pūjayedātmarūpiṇīm || 133 || 
indriyaprīṇanairdravyairvihitaṃ svātmapūjanam | 
uttameyaṃ dvitīyā sā mayā niṣpādyate sadā || 134 || 
parāparā samākhyātā ubhayaṃ yatra vidyate | 
devakīsūnunā ceyaṃ niṣpādyate sadā priye || 135 || 

[iti śrīpārvatīśvarasaṃvāde gandharvatantre yantroddhārāvaraṇaśaktyarcanaṃ nāma pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 5 || 

<pṛ0 54> [ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
pārvatyuvāca | 
devyāḥ pūjā samākhyātā tṛtīyā yā maheśvara | 
kathaya (tā kathaya ka pāṭha |) tāṃ suraśreṣṭha vista(stā ka pāṭha |)reṇādhunā prabho || 1 || 
jñānena karmaṇā ceha dehaśuddhirdvidhā bhavet | 
jñānaśuddhistvayā proktā karmaśuddhirna darśitā || 2 || 
vi(nmu?ṇmū)trapicchalo dehaḥ kathaṃ devamayo bhavet | 
tanme vada mahādeva prasādasumukha prabho || 3 || 

īśvara uvāca 
jñānena karmaṇā vāpi siddhirbhavati nānyathā | 
jñānayogaśca vaktavyaḥ karmayogaṃ śṛṇu priye || 4 || 
brāhmye mūhūrte utthāya sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ | 
padmāsanasamāsīnaḥ prāṇāyāmapuraḥsaraḥ || 5 || 
brahmarandhra(ndhre kha pāṭhaḥ |)sthite padme sahasradalaśobhite | 
vimale pūrṇacandrasya maṇḍale cintayed gurum || 6 || 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ śvetābharaṇabhūṣitam | 
tādṛkprasūnamālyādivibhūṣitatanuṃ (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathā || 7 || 
padmāsanasamāsīnaṃ sarvayoginiṣevitam | 
varābhayakaraṃ śāntaṃ dvinetraṃ karuṇāmayam || 8 || 
vāmorūgatayā śaktyā raktayā vāmapāṇinā | 
dhārayantyotpalaṃ dakṣahastenāliṅgitaṃ vibhum || 9 || 

<pṛ0 55> paramānandasaṃdohasāndramānasamīśvaram | 
ānandasāndraraktākṣaṃ smaret smitamukhāmbujam || 10 || 
(bālādya ai bhuvaneśānī hrī ramā śrī khecarī hasakhaphre śivo ha candrā0 sa mātṛkānta kṣa kālo ma śakro la ambu vahniḥ ra vāyu0 ya vāmakarṇa0 ū | vakramiti tathā sahakhaphre sahakṣamalavarayīmiti | śivacandrāviti hsau0 candraśivau sahau0 |) bālādyaṃ bhuvaneśānī ramā caivātha khecarī | 
śivacandrau mātṛkāntaṃ kālaśakrā(dyu?mbu)vahnayaḥ || 11 || 
vāyuśca vāmakarṇena yojitā bindunādinaḥ | 
(ca?va)kraṃ kṛtvādimaṃ teṣu karṇe vāmākṣi yojayet || 12 || 
śivacandrau triśūlāḍhyau bindunā parimaṇḍitau | 
candraśivau triśūlāḍhyau (sva?sa)rgavantau maheśvari || 13 || 
tasmāt svagurunāmānte ānandanātha cālikhet | 
tathā śaktipadānte vai ambā(tatropa ka pāṭha |)padamato likhet || 14 || 
pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti vidhinā paripūjayet | 
laṃ pṛthivyātmanā brahmaṇā gandhaṃ kalpayāmi gandhatanmātrātmane 
ghrā(ṇa?ṇendriyāya) gandhaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā, 
athāṅguṣṭhakaniṣṭhābhyāṃ yojayedgandhamuttamam || 15 || 
haṃ ākāśātmanā sadāśivena puṣpaṃ kalpayāmi śabdatanmātrātmane 
śrotrendri(ya?yāya) śabdaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā,
aṅguṣṭhatarjanīyogaṃ puṣpadānaṃ tathaiva hi | 
yaṃ vāyvātmanā īśvareṇa dhūpaṃ kalpayāmi sparśatanmātrātmane
tvagindriyāya sparśaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā,
aṅguṣṭhamadhyamāyogaṃ dhūpadānaṃ tathaiva hi || 16 || 

<pṛ0 56> (vaṃ?raṃ) vahnyātmanā rudreṇa dīpaṃ kalpayāmi rūpatanmātrātmane 
cakṣurindriyāya rūpaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā,
aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ maheśāni dīpaṃ dadyāt samāhitaḥ | 
vaṃ amṛtātmanā viṣṇunā naivedyaṃ kalpayāmi rasatanmātrātmane 
jihvendriyāya rasaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā, 
aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogaṃ naivedyaṃ tatpratiṣṭhitam || 17 ||
evaṃ kulaguruṃ devi pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ | 
yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha praṇamet siddhihetave || 18 || 
namaste bhagavannātha śivāya gururūpiṇe | 
vidyāvatārasaṃsiddhyai svīkṛtānekavigraha || 19 || 
navāya navarūpāya paramātmaikarūpiṇe | 
sarvājñānatamobhedabhānave cidghanāya te || 20 || 
svatantrāya dayā(tṛ?kḷ)ptavigrahāya śivātmane | 
paratantrāya bhaktānāṃ bhavyānāṃ bhavyarūpiṇe || 21 || 
vivekināṃ vivekāya1 vima(rṣā?rśā)ya vima(rṣa?rśi)nām | 
prakāśināṃ prakāśāya jñānināṃ jñānarūpiṇe || 22 || 
purastāt pārśvayoḥ pṛṣṭhe namaskuryāmuparyadhaḥ | 
sadā saccittarūpeṇa vidhehi bhavadāsanam || 23 || 
ajñānatimirāndhasya jñānāñjanaśalākayā | 
cakṣurunmīlitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ || 24 || 
namo'stu gurave tubhyaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivātmane | 

<pṛ0 57> avidyāgrastasaṃsārasāgarottārahetave || 25 || 
gururbrahmā gururviṣṇurgurūrdevo maheśvaraḥ | 
gurureva paraṃ jñānaṃ gurureva paraṃ tapaḥ || 26 || 
ataḥ sarvatra deveśi gurupūjā garīyasī | 
anyadevasaparyā vā cānyadevasya kīrtanam || 27 || 
gurudevaṃ vinā devi tadagre kriyate yadi | 
tadā narakamāpnoti satyametadvadāmyaham || 28 || 
pūjite gurupāde vai sarva(devaḥ?daiva)sukhī bhavet | 
sarveṣāṃ mantratantrāṇāṃ pitāsau yaḥ sadāśivaḥ || 29 || 
yasya bhaktirgurau nityaṃ vartate devavat priye | 
tasya sarvārthasiddhiḥ syānnānyathā khalu pārvati || 30 || 
gurupādarajo mūrdhni dhyātvā karma samārabhet | 
brahmarandhre sahasrāre karpūradhavalo guruḥ || 31 || 
varābhayakaro nityo brahmarūpī sadānaghaḥ | 
jāgarti parameśāni nijasthānaprakāśakaḥ || 32 || 
kulanāthaṃ parityajya ye śāktāḥ pa(ri?ra)sevinaḥ | 
teṣāṃ dīkṣā ca yāgaśca hyabhicārāya kalpate (lpya ka pāṭha |) || 33 || 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena kulīnaṃ gurumāśrayet | 
kulīnaḥ sarvavidyānāmadhikārīti gīyate || 34 || 
dīkṣāprabhuḥ sa evātra sarvatantreṣu nāparaḥ | 
gurumaṇḍalapūjāṃ tu kuryāt saptasu parvasu || 35 || 

<pṛ0 58> devyuvāca 
vinā yogaṃ na sidhyeta(ddhye ka pāṭha |) kuṇḍalīcaṅkramaḥ prabho | 
mūlapadme kuṇḍalinī yāvannidrāyitā prabho || 36 || 
tāvanna kiṃcit sidhyeta (ddhye ka pāṭha |) mantrayantrārcanādikam | 
jāgarti yadi sā devī bahubhiḥ puṇyasaṃcayaiḥ || 37 || 
tadā prasādamāyānti mantrayantrārcanādayaḥ | 
śivavadviharelloke aṣṭaiśvaryasamanvitaḥ || 38 || 
yogayogād bhavenmuktirmantrasiddhirakhaṇḍitā | 
siddhe manau parāvāptiriti śāstrārthanirṇayaḥ || 39 || 
yuktātmā yena viharet svarge martye rasātale | 
jīvanmuktaśca dehānte paraṃ nirvāṇamāpnuyāt || 40 || 
tat kārtsnyena paraṃ yogaṃ yogaṃ kathayasva mayī(he kha pāṭhaḥ |)śvara | 

īśvara uvāca 
kathayāmi tava snehād yogayogyāsi pārvati || 41 || 
saṃsārottāraṇaṃ muktiryogaśabdena kathyate | 
yogo hi lalitā devī niścitaṃ viddhi pārvati || 42 || 
na yogo nabhasaḥ pṛṣṭhe na bhūmau na rasātale | 
aikyaṃ jīvātmanoścā(naścā ka pāṭha |)huryogaṃ yogaviśāradāḥ || 43 || 
kāmakrodhalobhamohamadamātsaryasaṃjñakāḥ (ka ka pāṭha |) | 
tatsamūhāḥ ṣaḍākhyātā yogavighnakarā ime || 44 || 
yo(gajñai?gāṅgai)rebhirjitvo tānyogino yogamāpnuyuḥ | 

<pṛ0 59> yamaṃ niyamamāsanaprāṇāyāmau tataḥ param || 45 || 
pratyāhāraṃ dhāraṇākhyaṃ dhyānaṃ sārdhaṃ(rddha ka pāṭha |) samādhinā | 
aṣṭāṅgānyāhuretāni yogino yogasādhane || 46 || 
ahiṃsā satyamasteyaṃ brahmacaryaṃ dayārjavam | 
kṣamā dhṛ(dhṛtimitāhāraśauca ka pāṭha |)tirmitāhāraḥ śaucaṃ ceti yamā daśa || 47 || 
tapaḥ saṃtoṣamāstikyaṃ dānaṃ devasya pūjanam | 
siddhāntaśravaṇaṃ caiva hrīrmatiśca japo hutam || 48 || 
daśaite niyamāḥ proktā yogaśāstraviśāradaiḥ | 
padmāsanaṃ svastikākhyaṃ bhadraṃ vajrāsanaṃ tathā || 49 || 
vīrāsanamiti proktaṃ kramādāsanapañcakam | 
ūrvorupari vinyasya samyak pādatale ubhe || 50 || 
aṅguṣṭhau ca nibadhnīyād hastābhyāṃ vyutkramāt tataḥ | 
padmāsanamiti proktaṃ yogināṃ hṛdayaṅgamam || 51 || 
jānū(nu pāṭha |)rvorantare samyak kṛtvā pādatale ubhe | 
ṛjukāyo vasedyogī svastikaṃ tatpracakṣate || 52 || 
sīva(sema ka pāṭhaḥ |)nyāḥ pārśvayornyasyed gulphayugmaṃ suniścalam | 
vṛṣaṇādhaḥ pādapārṣṇiṃ pāṇibhyāṃ paribandhayet || 53 ||
bhadrāsanaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ yogibhiḥ parikīrtitam | 
ūrvoḥ(u kha pāṭha |) pādau kramānnyasya jānvoḥ pratyaṅmukhāṅgulī(līḥ kha pāṭha |) || 54 || 
karau nida(va ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhyādākhyātaṃ vajrāsanamanuttamam | 
ekaṃ pādamadhaḥ kṛtvā vinyasyorāvathetaram || 55 || 

<pṛ0 60> ṛjukāyo vasedyogī vīrāsanamitīritam | 
iḍayā karṣayedvāyuṃ bāhyaṃ ṣoḍaśamātrayā || 56 || 
dhārayet pūritaṃ yogī catuḥṣaṣṭyā ca mātrayā (mātrālakṣaṇa yathāha nārada-kālena yāvatātmīyo hasta sva jānumaṇḍalam | paryeti mātrā tulyā syāt svayā śvāsaṃkamātrayeti || tathā phetkāriṇātantre-jānu pradakṣiṇīkṛtya na vṛta na vilambitam | kriyate cāgulīsphoṭa sā mātrā parikīrtiteti ||) | 
suṣumnāmadhyagaṃ samyag dvātriṃśanmātrayā śanaiḥ || 57 || 
nāḍyā piṅgalayā caivaṃ recayedyogavittamaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmamimaṃ prāhuryogaśāstraviśāradāḥ || 58 || 
bhūyobhūyaḥ kramāttasya vyatyāsena samācaret | 
mātrāvṛddhikrameṇaiva samyag dvādaśa ṣoḍaśa || 59 || 
japadhyānādibhiryuktaṃ sagarbhaṃ tadvidurbudhāḥ | 
ta(du?da)petaṃ vigarbhaṃ ca prāṇāyāmaṃ paraṃ viduḥ || 60 || 
kramādabhyasataḥ puṃso dehe svedodgamo'dhamaḥ | 
madhyamaḥ ka(lpa?mpa)saṃyukto bhūmityāgaḥ paro mataḥ || 61 || 
uttamasya guṇāvāptiryacchīlanakamiṣyate | 
indriyāṇāṃ vicaratāṃ viṣayeṣu nirākulam || 62 || 
balādāharaṇaṃ tebhyaḥ pratyāhāro'yamīritaḥ | 
aṅguṣṭhagulphajānuṣu sī(ma?va)nīliṅganābhiṣu || 63 || 
hṛdgrīvākaṇṭhadeśeṣu lambikāyāṃ tato nasi | 
bhrūmadhye stanake mūrdhni dvādaśānte yathāvidhi || 64 || 
dhāraṇaṃ prāṇamarutordhāraṇeti nigadyate | 
samāhitena manasā caitanyāntaravartinā || 65 || 
