<pṛ0 61> ātmanyabhīṣṭadevānāṃ dhyānaṃ dhyānamihocyate | 
samatvabhāvanā nityaṃ jīvātmaparamātmanoḥ || 66 || 
samādhimāhurmunayaḥ proktamaṣṭāṅgalakṣaṇam | 
iti te kathitaṃ devi kāmādiṣaṭkanāśanam || 67 || 
durlabhaṃ viṣayāsaktaiḥ sulabhaṃ saṃyamātmanām | 
samādhiḥ saṃvidutpattiḥ parajīvaikatāṃ prati || 68 || 
yadi jīvaḥ parādbhinnaḥ kāryyatāmeti suvrate | 
(sva?a)cittvaṃ ca prasajyeta(jyaiva kha pāṭhaḥ |) ghaṭavat parameśvari || 69 || 
vināśitvaṃ bhayaṃ caiva dvi(ta?tī)yā(vi?di)ti te śrutiḥ | 
nityaḥ sarvagato hyātmā kūṭastho doṣavarjitaḥ || 70 || 
ekaḥ san bhidyate bhrāntyā māyayā na svarūpataḥ | 
tasmād dvaitaṃ na me cāsti na prapañco na saṃ(smṛ?sṛ)tiḥ || 71 || 
yathākāśo ghaṭākāśo mahākāśa itīritaḥ | 
tathā bhrāntirdvidhā proktā hyātma(tma ka pāṭhaḥ) jīveśvarātmanā || 72 || 
nāhaṃ deho naca prāṇo nendriyāṇi tathaiva ca | 
na mano naiva buddhiśca naiva cittamahaṃkṛtiḥ || 73 || 
nāhaṃ pṛthvī na salilaṃ naca vahnistathānilaḥ | 
nacākāśo na śabdaśca naca sparśastathā rasaḥ || 74 || 
nahi gandho na rūpaṃ ca na māyāhaṃ na saṃsṛtiḥ | 
sadā sākṣisvarūpatvād(pādvā ka kha pāṭhaḥ |) brahma caivāsmi kevalaḥ || 75 || 
so'haṃ brahma na saṃsārī na matto'nyat kadācana | 

<pṛ0 62> iti vidyāt svamātmānaṃ samādhiḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 76 || 
samādhau svasvarūpo'sau turīyasvara eva hi | 
turīyāṃśaḥ parāśaktirbindvātmā brahma kevalam || 77 || 
prajñātmānaṃ vadantyeke eke'pi brahma kevalam | 
jīvamīśvarabhāvena vidyāt so'hamiti dhruvam || 78 || 
yathā phenataraṅgādi samudrādutthitaṃ punaḥ (priye kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
samudre līyate tadvajjagadātmani līyate || 79 || 
yasyaivaṃ paramātmā(sa?svā)pṛthagbhūtaḥ prakāśitaḥ | 
sa yāti paramaṃ bhāvaṃ svayaṃ sākṣāt parāmṛtam || 80 || 
yadā manasi caitanyaṃ bhāti sarvātmakaṃ sadā | 
yogino'vyavadhānena tadā saṃpadyate svayam || 81 || 
yadā bhūtāni sarvāṇi svātmanyevābhipaśyati | 
sarvabhūteṣu cātmānaṃ brahma saṃpadyate (sa?ta)dā || 82 || 
yadā sarvāṇi bhūtāni samādhistho na paśyati | 
ekībhūtaḥ pareṇāsau tadā bhavati kevalaḥ || 83 || 
yadā(tadā ka pāṭhaḥ |) janmajarāduḥkhavyādhīnāmeva bheṣajam | 
kevalaṃ brahmavijñānaṃ jāyate'sau tadā śivaḥ || 84 || 
tasmādvijñānato muktirnānyathā bhavakoṭibhiḥ | 
mantrauṣadhibalairyadvajjīryate bhakṣitaṃ viṣam || 85 || 
tadvat sarvāṇi karmāṇi jīryanti jñāninaḥ kṣaṇāt | 
dehābhimāne galite vidite paramātmani || 86 || 

<pṛ0 63> yatra yatra mano yāti tatra tatra samādhayaḥ | 
ahaṃ brahma (devi kha pāṭhaḥ |) nacānyo'smi mukto'hamiti bhāvayet || 87 || 
saccidānandarūpo'haṃ nityaṃ muktasvabhāvavān | 
evaṃ samādhiyukto yaḥ samādhaye sa kalpa(lpya ka pāṭhaḥ |)te || 88 || 
sadāśivo'hamityuktvā sve(sva ka pāṭhaḥ |)cchayā viharedyatiḥ | 
lipyate na sa pāpena badhyate naca karmaṇā || 89 || 
yathāgnividrutaṃ svarṇaṃ mālinyaṃ dahati kṣaṇāt | 
tathā brahmārpitātmāsau sarvakarmāṇi dahyati || 90 || 
ātmasthāṃ devatāṃ tyaktvā bahirdevānvici(nva?nu)te | 
karasthaṃ kaustubhaṃ tyaktvā bhramate kācatṛṣṇayā || 91 || 
na yogena na yantreṇa na mantreṇa vinā hi saḥ (?) | 
dvayorabhyāsayogena brahma saṃsiddhikāraṇam || 92 || 
tamaḥparivṛte gehe ghaṭo dīpena dṛśyate | 
evaṃ māyāvṛto hyātmā manunā gocarīkṛtaḥ || 93 || 
etatte kathitaṃ devi brahmajñānamidaṃ mahat | 
vijñāya guruto japtvā saṃsārasāgaraṃ taret || 94 || 
yatra yatra mṛtaścāyaṃ gaṅgāyāṃ śvapacālaye | 
brahmavid brahmabhūyāya kalpa(lpya ka pāṭhaḥ |)te nānyathā priye || 95 || 
viśvaṃ śarīramityuktaṃ pañcabhūtātmakaṃ priye | 
caṃdrasūryāgnitejobhirjīvabrahmaikarūpakam || 96 || 
tisraḥ koṭyastadardhe(rddhe ka pāṭhaḥ |)na śarīre nāḍayo matāḥ (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 

<pṛ0 64> tāsu mukhyā daśa proktāstāsu tisro vyavasthitāḥ || 97 || 
pradhānā merudaṇḍe'tra candrasūryāgnirūpiṇī | 
śaktirūpā tu sā nāḍī sākṣādamṛtavigrahā || 98 || 
iḍā vāme sthitā nāḍī śuklā tu candrarūpiṇī | 
piṅgalākhyā ca yā dakṣe puṃrūpā sūryavigrahā || 99 || 
dāḍimīkusumaprakhyā viṣākhyā cāparā matā | 
merumadhyasthitā yā tu mūlādābrahmarandhragā || 100 || 
sarvatejomayī sā tu suṣumnā(mṇā ka pāṭhaḥ |) vahnirūpiṇī | 
tasyā madhye vicitrākhyā amṛtasrāviṇī śubhā || 101 || 
sarvadevamayī sā tu yogināṃ hṛdayaṅgamā | 
visargādbinduparyantaṃ vyāpya tiṣṭhati tattvataḥ || 102 || 
mūlādhāre tripurākhye icchājñānakriyātmake | 
madhye svayaṃbhūliṅgaṃ tu koṭisūryasamaprabham || 103 || 
tadūrdhve(rddhe ka pāṭhaḥ |) tatturīyaṃ tu dhyāyedbandhūkasaṃnibham | 
tadūrdhve(rddhe ka pāṭhaḥ |) tacchikhākārā kuṇḍalī raktavigrahā || 104 || 
sā eva hi parā sūkṣmā mahātripurasundarī | 
caitanyaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ śabdabrahma yaducyate || 105 || 
tatprāpya kuṇḍalīrūpaṃ prāṇināṃ dehamadhyagam | 
sarvatejomayaṃ tattu saccidānandamavyayam || 106 || 
tadbāhye hemavarṇābhaṃ (ra?va)savarṇaṃ (vādisāntavarṇopetamityarthaḥ |) caturdalam | 
drutahemasamaprakhyaṃ padmaṃ tatra vibhāvayet || 107 || 

<pṛ0 65> tadūrdhve'gnisamaprakhyaṃ ṣaḍdalaṃ hīrakaprabham | 
bādilāntaṣaḍa(ḍva kha pāṭhaḥ |)rṇena yuk (kta ka pāṭhaḥ |) svādhiṣṭhānasaṃjñakam || 108 || 
mūlamādhāraṣaṭkānāṃ mūlādhāraṃ tato viduḥ | 
svaśabdena paraṃ liṅgaṃ svādhiṣṭhānaṃ tato viduḥ || 109 || 
tadūrdhve nābhideśe tu maṇipūraṃ mahat puram | 
hemābhaṃ vaidyutābhaṃ ca bahutejomayaṃ tathā || 110 || 
maṇivadbhinnaṃ tatpūraṃ(tatpura maṇivadbhinna kha pāṭhaḥ |) maṇipūraṃ tato viduḥ | 
daśabhiśca dalairyuktaṃ ḍādiphāntākṣarānvitam || 111 || 
viṣṇunādhiṣṭhitaṃ padmaṃ viśvālokanakāraṇam | 
tadūrdhve'nāhataṃ padmamudyadādityasaṃnibham || 112 || 
kādiṭhāntākṣa(ntadalai ka pāṭhaḥ |)rairarkapatraiśca samalaṃkṛtam | 
tanmadhye bāṇaliṅgaṃ tu sūryāyutasamaprabham || 113 || 
śabda(bdo ka pāṭhaḥ |)brahmamayaḥ śabdo'nāhatastatra dṛśyate | 
anāhatākhyaṃ tatpadmaṃ yogibhiḥ parikīrtyate || 114 || 
ānandasadanaṃ tattu puruṣādhiṣṭhitaṃ param | 
tadūrdhve tu viśuddhākhyaṃ dalaiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiryutam || 115 || 
svaraiḥ ṣoḍaśakairyuktaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ mahatprabham | 
viśuddhiṃ tanute yasmājjīvasya haṃsalokanāt || 116 || 
viśuddhaṃ padmamākhyātamākāśākhyaṃ mahādbhutam | 
ājñācakraṃ tadūrdhve tu ātmanādhiṣṭhitaṃ param || 117 || 

<pṛ0 66> hakṣādidvidalaṃ padmaṃ candreṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ tu tat | 
ājñāsaṃkramaṇaṃ tatra gurorājñeti kīrtitam || 118 || 
kailāsākhyaṃ tadūrdhve tu bodhinī tu tadūrdhvataḥ | 
sahasrārāmbujaṃ devi bindusthānaṃ tadūrdhvataḥ || 119 || 
ādau pūrakayogena svādhāre yojayenmanaḥ |
guda(de ka pāṭhaḥ |)meḍhrāntare śaktiṃ tāmākuñcya prabodhayet || 120 || 
liṅgabhedakrameṇaiva bindusthānaṃ samānayet | 
śaṃbhunā tāṃ parāṃ śaktimekī(bhāva?bhūtāṃ)vicintayet || 121 || 
tadudbhavāmṛtaṃ vaktradrutaṃ lākṣārasopamam | 
pāyayitvā ca tāṃ śaktiṃ parokṣāṃ yogasiddhidām || 122 || 
ṣaṭcakradevatāstatra saṃtarpyāmṛtadhārayā | 
ānayettena mārgeṇa mūlādhāraṃ punaḥ sudhīḥ || 123 || 
yātāyātakrameṇaiva tatra kuryānmanolayam | 
evamabhyasyamānaṃ tu ahanyahani pārvati || 124 || 
jarāmaraṇaduḥkhādyairmucyate bhavabandhanaiḥ | 
ityuktaṃ paramaṃ yogaṃ yonimudrāprabandhanam || 125 || 
athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi samādhiṃ bhavanāśanam | 
athavā parameśāni yathoktadhyānayogataḥ || 126 || 
hṛtpadmakarṇi(li kha pāṭhaḥ |)kāmadhye dhyāyeddevīmananyadhīḥ | 
tripurātmakamātmānaṃ bhāvayennyastavigrahaḥ || 127 || 
aikyaṃ saṃbhāvayennityaṃ svagurudevatātmanām | 

<pṛ0 67> ahaṃ devo nacānyo'smi brahmaivāhaṃ na śokabhāk || 128 || 
saccidānandarūpo'haṃ śuddhabuddha(dvi ka pāṭhaḥ |)svabhāvavān | 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya taditi paratastataḥ || 129 || 
saditi tu samālocya(bhāṣya kha pāṭhaḥ |) karma kuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ | 
smaraṇāt karmaṇāmādye brahmabhūyāya kalpate || 130 || 
sarvamaṅgalasaṃpanno bahirnirgatya sādhakaḥ | 
tya(kta?ktvā)mūtrapurīṣe ca karapādau viśodhayet || 131 || 
mukhaṃ prakṣālya deveśi nāsārandhradvayaṃ tataḥ | 
netrāñjanaṃ vidhāyaiva śuddhasthānaṃ samāśrayet || 132 || 
netrāñjanamakṛtvaiva yaḥ paśyet sauramaṇḍalam | 
janmārjitaphalaṃ naśyet kā kathā tasya durmateḥ || 133 || 
tritattvena tri(dhā?rā)camya dantadhāvanamācaret | 
dantakāṣṭhama(thā?khā)ditvā pūjayedyastu devatām || 134 || 
tatpūjā viphalā devi mṛte ca narakaṃ vrajet | 
klīmātmakaṃ kāmadevaṃ sarvānte janamā(rvajanamathā kha pāṭhaḥ |)likhet || 135 || 
priyāya hṛdayānto'yaṃ manurdanta(rdeha kha pāṭhaḥ |)viśuddhaye | 
caturdaśasvarairvaktraṃ kṣālayecchu(tsi kha pāṭhaḥ |)ddhihetave || 136 || 

[iti gandharvatantre śrīpārvatīśvarasaṃvāde karmayogādikramanirūpaṇaṃ nāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 6 || 

<pṛ0 68> [saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śaṃkara uvāca 
prātaḥ snānaṃ tataḥ kuryāt traipuraṃ yojayan kramam | 
sugandhisalilaiḥ śuddhaiḥ kulatīrthe'thavā punaḥ || 1 || 
nadyādau vidhivat snāyāt kuladarbhavidhā(ya?ra)kaḥ | 
raupyaṃ dakṣiṇatarjanyāmanāmā hemasaṃyutā || 2 || 
vāmakaniṣṭhikā hemaiḥ kuladarbho'yamīritaḥ | 
eṣa eva bhaveddarbho na darbho vanasaṃbhavaḥ || 3 || 
aśūnyaṃ tu karaṃ kuryādvahnīndvarkapratiṣṭhayā | 
sarvabhūtavaśī sa syānmudrayā cātiśobhayā || 4 || 
tritattvena tri(dhā?rā)camya saṃkalpya pāpanuttaye | 
kulapātre saratnaṃ ca satilaṃ sajalaṃ tataḥ || 5 || 
gṛhītvā kuladevasya prītaye snānamācaret | 
asnātasya phalaṃ nāsti tathātarpayataḥ pitṝn || 6 || 
idaṃ viṣṇubhairavaṃ tu vicakrama itīritam | 
mṛdālambhanakṛtye ca nityamevamudīrayet || 7 || 
kulacakraṃ jale nyasya kula(mbha kha pāṭhaḥ |)mudrāṃ vidhāya ca | 
ehi gaṅge namastubhyaṃ sarvatīrthasamanvite || 8 || 
āvāhayāmi devi tvāṃ snānārthamiha sundari | 
āvāhyāmbhasi saṃyojya somasūryāgnimaṇḍalam || 9 || 

<pṛ0 69> saṃcintya mantrī tanmadhye dhyāyet tripurasundarīm | 
gāyatryā ca (tryāśca ka pāṭhaḥ |) mahādevyāḥ sundarīmāhvayecchivām || 10 || 
trivāramaja(janau?jjane)vāri mūlamantreṇa mantrayet | 
abhiṣiñcet tato mūrdhni (ddhni ka pāṭhaḥ |) mūlamantraṃ hṛdi smaran || 11 || 
tribhistu tripurābījaistridhā majjanamācaret | 
tasmādutthāya deveśi nirmuktāśeṣavigrahaḥ || 12 || 
tryakṣarīṃ ca samuccārya dukūle paridhāpayet | 
sakeśaṃ mūṣikākrāntamadhautaṃ bhagnamambaram || 13 || 
malinaṃ parakīyaṃ ca paryuṣitaṃ ca varjayet | 
tilakaṃ kularūpaṃ ca kṛtvācamya vidhānataḥ || 14 || 
tataḥ saṃdhyāmupāsīta pāpahānāya sādhakaḥ (hā yena sādhanā ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
snānaṃ ca trividhaṃ proktaṃ saṃdhyā ca trividhā smṛtā || 15 || 
āntaraṃ ca bhaveddevi bāhyaṃ mānasameva ca | 
mānasaṃ vai bhavet snānaṃ yaḥ sadā śuddhamānasaḥ || 16 || 
sparśate pāduke devi (sparśalepādike vāpi kha pāṭhaḥ |) nirvikalpaḥ sadaiva hi | 
bāhyaṃ mantraiśca (hyamannaiva kha pāṭhaḥ |) saṃproktamāntaraṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam || 17 || 
prāguktakramayogena prāṇāyāmaparo budhaḥ | 
śaktiṃ paraśivenaiva saṃgamayya (mārdha ka pāṭhaḥ |) vidhānataḥ || 18 || 
tadudbhavāmṛte śaśvannimajya punareva hi | 
snāyācca vimale tīrthe puṣkare hṛdayāśrite || 19 || 

<pṛ0 70> bindutīrthe'thavā snātvā punarjanma na vidyate | 
ātmānaṃ sarvadā samyag dhyāyeddhyānaparāyaṇaḥ || 20 || 
devatābhedataḥ saṃdhyā mānasīyaṃ parā priye | 
śivaśaktyoḥ samāyogo yasmin kāle prajāyate || 21 || 
sā saṃdhyā kulaniṣṭhānāṃ samādhisthaiḥ pratīyate | 
aparāṃ kathayāmyatra sarvapāpavināśinīm || 22 || 
upaviśya śucau deśe tritattvena trirā(dhā ka pāṭhaḥ |)camet | 
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā tribhi(dhā kha pāṭhaḥ |)rbījaistridhāvi(dha?dhi)m || 23 || 
vāmahaste jalaṃ gṛhya galitodakabindubhiḥ | 
saptathā prokṣaṇaṃ kuryānmūrdhni(ddhni ka pāṭhaḥ |) mantramanusmaran || 24 || 
avaśiṣṭodakaṃ dakṣahaste saṃgṛhya sādhakaḥ | 
nāsāmāśliṣya toyena tatastenāghamarṣaṇam || 25 || 
iḍayākṛṣya dehāntaḥ kṣālitaiḥ pāpasaṃcayaiḥ | 
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tadudakaṃ dakṣa(vāma ka pāṭhaḥ |)nāḍyā virecitam || 26 || 
dakṣahaste tu tanmantrī pāparūpaṃ vicintya ca (ntayet kha pāṭhaḥ |) |
purato vajrapāṣāṇe pra(ni kha pāṭhaḥ |)kṣipedastramantrataḥ || 27 || 
ityaghamarṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā punarācamanaṃ tathā | 
abhiṣiñcet tato mūrdhni vidhinā sādhakottamaḥ || 28 || 
oṃ āpo devī raso'mṛtaṃ pūtaṃ brahma punīmahe | 
jalāñjalitrayaṃ bhūmau mārtaṇḍabhairavāya ca || 29 || 
ūrdhvabāhustato mantrī mārtaṇḍaṃ samupāśrayet || 

<pṛ0 71> oṃ udutyaṃ jātavedasaṃ devaṃ vahanti ketavaḥ || 30 || 
dṛśe viśvāya mārtaṇḍaśeṣe bhairavamīrayet (sūrya mārtaṇḍaśeṣe deveśi bhairavaṃ padamīrayet kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
sūryamaṇḍalamadhye tu kulacakraṃ vicintayet || 31 || 
bālyocitaṃ spṛhantīṃ vai bālikāṃ(kā kha pāṭhaḥ |) cakramadhyataḥ | 
bālārkamaṇḍalābhāsaṃ bhānuvahnīndulocanām || 32 || 
pāśāṅkuśau śarāṃścāpaṃ dhārayantīṃ śivāṃ smaret | 
madhyāhne cintayed devīṃ navayauvanaśobhitām || 33 || 
sāyāhne cintayed devīṃ trailokyaikaprabhāmayīm | 
sarvayauvanasaṃpannāmujjvalāṃ paramāṃ kalām || 34 || 
tāmeva cintayedrātrau bhogī bhogaparāyaṇām | 
aṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyā gāyatrīṃ ca japet sudhīḥ || 35 || 
ravimaṇḍalagāṃ devīṃ praṇipatya samāpayet | 
evaṃ saṃdhyāṃ samāpyātha hṛdi vidyāṃ parāmṛ(ṣe?śe)t || 36 || 
athavā parameśāni sadaināṃ paricintayet | 

devyuvāca 
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi kathamatrādhikāritā || 37 || 
vedavratavihīnānāṃ vratyādīnāṃ kṛtāgasām | 
tathaivānupanītānāṃ strīśūdrāṇāṃ bhavecchiva || 38 || 
kathamete mahādeva muktiṃ gacchantyanuttamām | 
na vinā brāhmaṇaṃ mucyeddehaba(ndhyā?ndhā)diti śrutiḥ || 39 || 

īśvara uvāca

<pṛ0 72> devadāruvane pūrvaṃ brāhmaṇānatidurdhi(kti ka pāṭha |)yaḥ | 
vilokya bhagavān viṣṇurmāmabhyetyābhivādya ca || 40 || 
upaviṣṭastadā devaḥ kāruṇyadrutacetasā | 
pṛṣṭavān māṃ mahādevi teṣāṃ mukte(kti ka pāṭhaḥ |)rhi kāraṇam || 41 || 

bhagavānuvāca 
ime durmatayaḥ sarve vedācārabahiṣkṛtāḥ | 
anyāyamaithune (śa?sa)ktāḥ surāpānaparāyaṇāḥ || 42 || 
ātmajñānavihīnānāṃ yogābhyāsāvahelinām | 
kathameṣāṃ bhavenmuktistadupāyaṃ vada prabho || 43 || 
śūdrādīnāṃ kathaṃ deva dīkṣāyāmadhikāritā | 

īśvara uvāca 
api kṛtvā durācārān patito vedavarjitaḥ || 44 || 
nārī śūdro'thavā vrātyo yāṃ jñātvā brāhmaṇo bhavet | 
yayā vijñāyate brahma saccidānandamavyayam || 45 || 
tāmeva kathayāmyadya tavaiva hṛdi saṃsthitām | 
caturviṃśatitattvena nirmitāṃ(tā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tatsvarūpiṇīm(ṇī ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 46 || 
trikāraṃ campakāpītaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakam | 
śatapatrāsanārūḍhaṃ dhyāyet padmāsanasthitam || 47 || 
pukāraṃ cintayedevamatasīpuṣpasaṃnibham | 
padmamadhyasthitaṃ saumyamupapātakanāśanam || 48 || 
rakāraṃ kapilaṃ nityaṃ kamalāsanasaṃsthitam | 
dhyayecchāntaṃ suraśreṣṭha mahāpātakanāśanam || 49 || 

<pṛ0 73> sukāraṃ cintayedevamindranīlasamaprabham | 
nirdahet sarvaduḥkhāni graharogodbhavāni ca || 50 || 
ndakāraṃ vahnidīptābhaṃ cinta(nā?ye)t puruṣarṣabha | 
bhrūṇahatyākṛtaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇādeva naśyati || 51 || 
(ri?ryai)kāraṃ vimalaṃ dhyāyed brahmahatyāvināśanam | 
(ri?vi)kāraṃ cintayedvidvān śuddhasphaṭikasaṃnibham || 52 || 
pāpaṃ naśyati tatkṣipramagamyāgamanodbhavam | 
(su?dma)kāraṃ cintayedyogī śuddhasphaṭikasaṃnibham || 53 || 
abhakṣyabhakṣaṇaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇādeva naśyati | 
hekāraṃ tārakāvarṇamindu(śeṣa?śīrṣa)vibhūṣitam || 54 || 
yogināṃ varadaṃ dhyāyed brahmahatyāvināśanam | 
kākāraṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ ca nīlameghasamaprabham || 55 || 
dhyātvā puruṣaśārdūla pāpaṃ nāśayati dhruvam | 
mekāraṃ raktavarṇaṃ ca kamalāsanasaṃsthitam || 56 || 
gohatyādikṛtaṃ pāpaṃ nāśayatyeva tatkṣaṇāt | 
śva(ya ka pāṭhaḥ |)kāraṃ paramaṃ dhyāyet taptakāñcanasaṃnibham || 57 || 
kamalāsanamāsīnaṃ mantrī hatyāvimocanam | 
(ri?ryai)kāraṃ śuklavarṇaṃ tu jātīpuṣpasamaprabham || 58 || 
guruhatyākṛtaṃ pāpaṃ dhyātvā dahati tatkṣaṇāt | 
dhīkāraṃ cintayecchuklaṃ kundapuṣpasamaprabham || 59 || 
pitṛmātṛvadhāt pāpānmucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ | 

<pṛ0 74> makāraṃ padmarāgābhaṃ cintayed dīptatejasam || 60 || 
pūrvajanmārjitaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇādeva naśyati | 
hikāraṃ śaṅkhavarṇaṃ tu pūrṇacandrasamaprabham || 61 || 
aśeṣapāpadahanaṃ dhyāyennityamihācyuta(?) | 
tatkāraṃ pāṇḍuraṃ dhyāyet padmasyopari saṃsthitam || 62 || 
pratigrahakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ smaraṇādeva naśyati | 
naḥkāraṃ raktavarṇaṃ tu indragopasamaprabham || 63 || 
dhyātvā prāṇivadhaṃ pāpaṃ nirdahejjagadīśvara | 
klinkāraṃ raktavarṇaṃ tu smaredvajrasamaprabham || 64 || 
nirdahet sarvapāpāni nānyaiḥ pāpaiḥ pralipyate | 
nekāraṃ tu mukhaṃ pūrvamudyadarkasamaprabham || 65 || 
sakṛddhyātvā suraśreṣṭha sa gacched brahmaṇaḥ padam | 
nīlotpaladalaśyāmaṃ prakāraṃ dakṣiṇānanam || 66 || 
sakṛd dhyātvā suraśreṣṭha sa gacchedvaiṣṇavaṃ padam | 
saumyaṃ gorocanāpītaṃ cokāraṃ cottarānanam || 67 || 
sakṛd dhyātvā suraśreṣṭha sa gacchedrudratāṃ punaḥ | 
śaraccandranibhaṃ śāntaṃ dakāraṃ paścimānanam || 68 || 
sakṛd dhyātvā suraśreṣṭha sa gacchedaiśvaraṃ padam |
yātkāraṃ ca śiraḥ proktamūrdhvā(rddhā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nanamitīritam || 69 || 
sakṛd dhyātvā suraśreṣṭha sadāśivapuraṃ vrajet | 
akṣarāṇāṃ tu sarveṣāṃ vakṣyante devatāḥ kramāt || 70 || 

<pṛ0 75> agnivāyusūryavidyudyamā varuṇa eva ca | 
bṛhaspatistu(ti tu ka pāṭhaḥ |) parjanya indro gandharva eva ca || 71 || 
pūṣā śivaśca tuṣṭā ca va(vā kha pāṭhaḥ |)savaśca maruttathā | 
somo'ṅgirā viśvedevā aśvinau ca prajāpatiḥ || 72 || 
sarvadevaśca rudraśca brahmā viṣṇuśca devatāḥ | 
japakāle cintayitvā tāsāṃ sāyujyamāpnuyāt || 73 || 
lalitāyāstribhirbījaistripadīyaṃ(strīpade kha pāṭhaḥ |) trayīmayī | 
etajjñātvā tu medhāvī japahomaṃ karoti yaḥ || 74 || 
ṣaḍaṅgamavidhāyādau dhyāyaṃ(tāṃ?stāṃ)paradevatām | 
na bhavet sūtakaṃ tasya mṛtakaṃ ca na vidyate || 75 || 
yaścaivaṃ tu na jānāti gāyatrīṃ ca yathāvidhi | 
kathitaṃ sūtakaṃ tasya mṛtakaṃ ca mayānagha || 76 || 
naiva dānaphalaṃ tasya naca yajñaphalaṃ labhet | 
naca tīrthaphalaṃ proktaṃ tasyaivaṃ sūtake sati || 77 || 
gāyatryeṣā samākhyātā traipurī sarvasiddhidā | 
gāyantaṃ trāyate yasmād gāyatrī tena cocyate || 78 || 
mahāpātakayuktoṃ'pi prajaped daśadhā yadi | 
satyaṃ satyaṃ mahādevi mukto bhavati tatkṣaṇāt || 79 || 
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vai japedenāmananyadhīḥ (śatāvṛttyā gāyatrī japate yadi kha pāṭha |) | 
sarvapāpavinirmukto bhavet pūjādhikāravān || 80 || 
jīvanmukto jāmadagnyaḥ śiṣyo me ghorapātakaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 76> vimukto mātṛhatyādyairmīnanāthastathā paraḥ || 81 || 
jegīṣavyaśca candraśca vāsavaśca vimocitaḥ | 
gurutalpagamanādyaistathāgastyaḥ pramocitaḥ || 82 || 
abhakṣyabhakṣaṇāt pāpādanayaiva vimocitaḥ | 
cāṇḍālagamanādyaiśca vaśiṣṭhaścāpi mocitaḥ || 83 || 
dattātreyaḥ surāpānājjvalanaḥ sarvabhakṣaṇāt | 
ta eva brahmaṇāḥ sarve viṣṇunā prabhaviṣṇunā || 84 || 
anayaiva mahādevi sarva eva pramocitāḥ | 

devyuvāca 
dhanyā cānugṛhītāsmi tvayā nāthena śaṃkara || 85 || 
niḥsaṃśayāsmi deveśa bhramo dvaitaśca me hataḥ | 
katidhā sā bhaved deva tadidānīṃ vada prabho || 86 || 

īśvara uvāca 
ekaiva sā mahādevi bahudhā bhinnatāṃ gatā | 
saurī ca vaiṣṇavī caiva śāktī brāhmyatha śāṃbhavī || 87 || 
tattantre tāḥ prayoktavyāstraipurīyaṃ prakāśitā | 
tarpaṇaṃ ca tridhā proktaṃ sāṃprataṃ tacchṛṇu(sva?ṣva)me || 88 || 
somārkānalasaṃghaṭṭāt skhalitaṃ yat parāmṛtam | 
tenāmṛtena divyena tarpayet paradevatām || 89 || 
āntaraṃ tarpaṇaṃ hyetanmānasaṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam | 
ātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ smṛtvā sadā saṃtarpitātmavān || 90 || 
sarvadā sarvakāryeṣu saṃtuṣṭaḥ sthiramānasaḥ | 
upaviśya śucau deśe tatastarpaṇamārabhet || 91 || 

<pṛ0 77> tarpayitvā gurūnādau mūladevīṃ ca tarpayet | 
bījadvayaṃ tato vidyā hutabhugdayitānvitā || 92 || 
tato devyāḥ svanāmānte tarpayāmi namaḥpadam | 
devān pitṝn ṛṣīṃścaiva tarpayet kulavāriṇā || 93 || 
tarpaṇādau prayuñjīta tṛpyatāṃ vṛddhabhairavaḥ | 
tathaiva parameśāni viṣṇuṃ rudraṃ prajāpatim || 94 || 
evaṃ ṛṣīn pratarpyātha pitṝnapi ca bhairavān | 
tṛpyatāṃ sundarī mātā pitā bhairavastṛpyatām || 95 || 
ādau tripurapūrvaṃ ca tarpaṇe viniyojayet | 
śrāddhe vivāhe dāne ca snāne cānaṅgapūjane || 96 || 
sarvadā sarvakāryeṣu tāntrike vaidike tathā | 
tripurabhairavaṃ caiva smaret tripurasundarīm || 97 || 
svavidyāṃ saṃsmaran kuryyāt kriyāṃ sarvatra coditām | 
dvijātīnāṃ ca saṃskāro vedoktaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ || 98 || 
teṣāṃ tu tatra tatrāpi vidyayā vidhimācaret | 
anyeṣāmapi varṇānāṃ vidyayaiva samāpayet || 99 || 
vidyayāṃ saṃskṛto yastu sa eva brāhmaṇo mataḥ | 
nidha(no?ne)vidyayā dāho vidyayānyat samācaret || 100 || 
tenaiva tanmayī(yāt ka pāṭhaḥ |) siddhiḥ sarvatra bhavati dhruvam | 
yāvanna dīyate devi sūryāyārghyaṃ vidhānataḥ || 101 || 
vidhinā vihitā pūjā tāvat kena pragṛhyate | 
mārtaṇḍabhairavāyārghyaṃ dūrvābhiḥ si(śi ka pāṭhaḥ |)tataṇḍulaiḥ || 102 || 

<pṛ0 78> raktapuṣpaiścandanaiśca sagaṇāya nivedayet | 
(śivetyādinā hrībījoddhāra kṛta |) śivabījaṃ vahnisaṃsthaṃ vāmanetravibhūṣitam || 103 || 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ haṃsaḥpadamatho likhet | 
mārtaṇḍabhairavāyeti prakāśaśakti cālikhet || 104 || 
sahitāyeti coktvā vai idamarghyamataḥ param | 
vahnijāyānvitaṃ kṛtvā sūryāyārghyaṃ nivedayet || 105 || 
na dadyādbhāskarāyārghyaṃ śaṃkhatoyairmaheśvari | 
sarvadevamayaṃ sūryaṃ sarvadevanamaskṛtam || 106 || 
pūjayitvā vidhānena pradakṣiṇamanuvrajan | 
praṇamya bhagavantaṃ vai sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate || 107 || 
yaḥ sadā pūjayed devaṃ dṛṣṭvā vā praṇamet prabhum | 
pūjitaṃ daivatatvena brahmāṇḍāntaragocaram || 108 || 
tisraḥ koṭyo'rddhakoṭī ca tīrthānāṃ yadudāhṛtam | 
sakṛt pradakṣiṇaṃ devi dadyāt tatphalamañjasā || 109 || 
tīrthānāṃ darśane yadyat tattadbhāskaradarśanāt | 
sarvatīrthāmṛtaiḥ snāto sa (ya kha pāṭhaḥ |) sadā sūryaraśmibhiḥ || 110 || 
atha tripuragāyatryā devyai cārghyaṃ nivedayet | (guptadīkṣāviṣaye idha bodhyam |)
sūryamaṇḍalasaṃsthāyai pūrvoktadhyānayogataḥ || 111 || 
cakrarājaṃ hṛdi dhyātvā tatra devīṃ samānayet | 
aṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyā japan vidyāmananyadhīḥ || 122 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde snānasaṃdhyopāsanādividhirnāma saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 7 || 

<pṛ0 79> [aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
tato mauni viśuddhātmā hṛdi vidyāṃ parāmṛ(ṣe?śe)t | 
abahirmānaso yogī yāgabhūmimathāviśet || 1 || 
keśakīṭādisaṃyuktā na snigdhā nātipicchalā | 
na rū(ru ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṣā nātinīcā vai nātyuccā(ṣṇā kha pāṭhaḥ |) na vanānvitā || 2 || 
na ca vāyubhirācchannā nānyaprāṇisamākulā | 
dhūlikardamasaṃyuktā paśubhirna vilokitā || 3 || 
vṛkṣādibhiranākīrṇā dravavā(dvā kha pāṭhaḥ |)risamākulā | 
anāvṛtā caturdikṣu manasastu(sotu ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭikāriṇī || 4 || 
ūṣare kṛṣisaṃyukte(kta ka pāṭhaḥ |) sthāne puṇye'pi nārcayet | 
yāgabhūmirniṣiddhaiṣā vihitā kathyate'dhunā || 5 || 
vāpīkūpasamīpasthā sumanodyānamadhyagā (sadhiraiśaḥ |) | 
vicitramaṇḍapairyuktā śuddhavedipari(skṛ?ṣkṛ)tā || 6 || 
patākādhvajasaṃkīrṇā lākṣāruṇaparicchadā | 
puṣpaprakarasaṃkīrṇā ghaṇḍācāmarabhūṣitā || 7 ||  
dīpadarpaṇasaṃyuktā(tā ka pāṭhaḥ |) vitānopapariṣkṛ(skṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)tā | 
peyairbhakṣyaiḥ samāyuktā karpūrāgurudhūpitā || 8 || 
bālārkasadṛśī ramyā manaḥsaṃtoṣakāriṇī | 
tattadāyudhapūrṇāntarvibhūṣitaprapūjitā || 9 || 

<pṛ0 80> evameṣā mahādevi yāgabhūmiḥ samīritā | 
pūjāvedyā bahiḥ sthitvā caturhastāntare dhiyā || 10 || 
gṛhe ced dvāradeśastha ācamya manasā gurūn | 
praṇamediṣṭadevīṃ ca dikpālānapi cetasā || 11 || 
indramagniṃ yamaṃ vande nirṛtiṃ varuṇaṃ tathā | 
pavanaṃ dhanadaṃ ceśaṃ prajāpatimanantakam || 12 || 
gaṇeśaṃ caiva kṣetreśaṃ vande dvāraśriyaṃ tathā | 
gaṇanāthaṃ ca vaṭukaṃ durgāṃ kṣetraṃ ratiṃ smaram || 13 || 
prītiṃ vasantakaṃ caiva śaṅkhapadmanidhī(dhi ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathā | 
sarasvatīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ māyāṃ durgāṃ namāmyaham || 14 || 
bhadrakālīṃ ca svastiṃ ca svāhāṃ śubhaṃkarī tathā | 
gaurīṃ ca lokadhātrīṃ ca vāgīśvarīṃ namāmyaham || 15 || 
brahmāṇaṃ vāstupuruṣaṃ praṇamāmi yathākramam | 
puṣpāñjalimathaitebhyo bhaktyā paramayā diśet || 16 || 
maṇḍalaṃ vāmataḥ kṛtvā caturasraṃ maheśvari (jalena caturasrakam kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
ādhāraṃ pūjayet tatra pātraṃ cānnodakānvitam || 17 || 
saṃskṛtya parameśāni sarvabhūtabaliṃ haret | 
tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśānīṃ sarvavighnapadaṃ tataḥ || 18 || 
(hṛ?kṛ)dante sarvabhūtebhyo huṃkāraṃ vahnivallabhām | 
samuccaran baliṃ dadyānmudrayā tattvasaṃjñayā || 19 || 
aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogaṃ tattvamudreyamīritā | 

<pṛ0 81> bālānte cāstramālikhya ṅentaṃ phaṭkārasaṃyutam || 20 || 
astramantraḥ samākhyātaḥ sarvavighnaughanāśakaḥ | 
anenaivākṣatān samyak saṃmantrya saptadhā tataḥ || 21 || 
apasarpantu te bhūtā bhūmau ye cāntari(rī ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṣagāḥ | 
divyalokagatā ye ca te naśyantu(nti kha pāṭhaḥ |) śivājñayā || 22 || 
anenaivākṣatāṃstatra vikiredyajñamaṇḍape | 
aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ iti mantreṇa pūjā(devyā?vedyāṃ) maheśvari || 23 || 
aṅgaṃ saṃkocayan vāmaṃ praviśedda(da ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṣiṇāṅghriṇā | 
yāgamandiragāṃstatra vighnānutsārayet tataḥ || 24 || 
pārṣṇighātakarasphoṭasamudañcitavaktrakaiḥ(ka ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tālatrayamidaṃ kṛtvā vighnānsarvānapāharet || 25 || 
tataḥ punarhuṃphaḍiti pārśvamūrdhva(rddha ka pāṭhaḥ |)madhastathā | 
ātmanaḥ krodhadṛṣṭyātha nirīkṣya sumanā bhavet || 26 || 
vīkṣaṇaṃ (sarva?varma)bījena yajñabhūmeḥ samīritam | 
ta(tū?ttu)ryo bindusaṃyuktaḥ kalānādasamanvitaḥ || 27 || 
ba(dha kha pāṭhaḥ |)rmabījamidaṃ proktaṃ dharmakāmārthasādhanam | 
prokṣaṇaṃ cāstramantreṇa yāgabhūmeḥ samācaret || 28 || 
aśuddhapakṣisaṃyogapakṣiviṣṭāvasecanam | 
mūṣikāmaṇḍūkasparśakṛmikīṭādisaṃgamaḥ || 29 || 
ajñātadūṣaṇaṃ(tadūṣita kha pāṭhaḥ |) sthānaṃ mārjanādau ca yadbhavet | 
evamādīni naśyanti lokanāt sparśanāt priye || 30 || 

<pṛ0 82> madhukaiṭabhayormedasaṃghātairdṛḍhatāṃ gatā | 
medinī sarvadāśuddhā surapūjāsu sarvataḥ || 31 || 
tasya doṣasya mokṣārthaṃ(ṣā ka pāṭhaḥ |) kāmabījaṃ likhet kṣitau | 
naivedyādi svayaṃ dhṛtvā va(ma ka pāṭhaḥ |)hninā ca malaṃ dahet | 
śrīvatsamudrayā dṛṣṭyā tat sarvamavalokayet || 33 || 
yadātmanā na vijñātaṃ samyak puṣpādidūṣaṇam | 
asparśanādikaṃ vāpi yadanyāyārjitaṃ bhavet || 34 || 
tathā nirmālyasaṃsṛṣṭiḥ kīṭādyārohaṇaṃ ca yat (caret ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tat sarvaṃ nāśamāyāti naivedyādyavalokanāt || 35 || 
naivedyakādikaṃ yattu puṣpagandhādikaṃ ca yat | 
sarvamācchādikaṃ kāryaṃ yāvadāvāhayet parām || 36 || 
āvāhya sthāpayitvā tu nirācchādaṃ prakāśayet | 
rākṣasāḥ pratigṛhṇanti nirācchādaṃ yataḥ priye || 37 || 
āsanaṃ ca tataḥ kuryānnātinīcaṃ nacocchritam | 
āsanaṃ cārghyapātraṃ ca bhagnamāsādayenna tu || 38 || 
kṛṣṇājine mokṣasiddhiḥ śrīmokṣau vyāghracarmmaṇi | 
kāmyārthaṃ kambale caivamabhīṣṭaṃ raktakambale || 39 || 
kuśāsane sarvasiddhirmāraṇe kṛṣṇakambalam | 
tripurāpūjane śastaṃ raktakambalamāsanam || 40 || 
naitad dvihastato dīrghaṃ sārdhahastā(nu?nna)vistṛtam | 
na tryaṅgulāt samucchrāyaṃ pūjākarmmaṇi saṃgrahet || 41 || 

<pṛ0 83> yatheṣṭaṃ cārmmaṇaṃ kuryāt pūrvoktaṃ siddhidāyakam | 
na dīkṣito viśejjātu kṛṣṇasārājine gṛhī || 42 || 
dharaṇyāṃ duḥkhasaṃbhūtirdaurbhā(tido ka pāṭhaḥ |)gyaṃ dārujāsane | 
āmranimbakadambānāmāsanaṃ vaṃśa(sarva ka pāṭhaḥ |)nāśanam || 43 || 
bakule kiṃśuke caiva panaseṣu hataśriyaḥ | 
vaṃśeṣṭakāśmadharaṇītṛṇapallava(bilvaja kha pāṭhaḥ |)nirmmitam || 44 || 
varjayedāsanaṃ mantrī dāridryavyādhiduḥkhadam | 
nārācairvāribhinnaṃ syādviśīrṇaṃ bhagnameva ca || 45 || 
paryuṣitaṃ pareṣāṃ tadadhautaṃ ca vivarjayet | 
gāntā(mbhā kha pāṭhaḥ |)rīnirmmitaṃ śastaṃ nānā(nyaddā kha pāṭhaḥ |)dārumayaṃ śubham || 46 || 
na yatheṣṭāsano bhūyāt pūjākarmmaṇi sādhakaḥ | 
kāṣṭhādikāsanaṃ kuryānmitameva sadā priye || 47 || 
caturviṃśatyaṅgulena(la hi kha pāṭhaḥ |) dīrghaṃ kāṣṭhāsanaṃ śive | 
ṣoḍaśāṅgulavistīrṇamucchrāyāccaturaṅgulam (kambala cārmaṇa śaila mahāmāyāprapūjane | praśastamāsana devi kathita varavarṇini || ityādhika kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 48 || 
tadardhāṅgulaṃ vā kuryānnocchritaṃ cāta ācaret | 
dharaṇyā vastrasaṃyogād dāruje kambalasya ca || 49 || 
kauśeyājinasaṃyogo hanti puṇyaṃ purātanam | 
yathāśaktyekato mantrī śastāsanamupāviśet || 50 || 
pāṇibhyāmāsanaṃ dhṛtvā vihitaṃ vistared bhuvi | 

<pṛ0 84> parābījaṃ (pareti hrībījamatra jñeyam |) samuccārya tataścādhārapūrvakam || 51 || 
śaktipadaṃ samālikhya kamalāsanamālikhet | 
ṅentaṃ namaḥpadaṃ kuryādanenaivāsanaṃ yajet || 52 || 
mūlaprakṛtiṃ tatraiva kūrmaṃ ca paricintayet | 
anantaṃ cāpi saṃpūjya pṛthivyarghyaṃ nivedayet || 53 || 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya pṛthivyai nama ityapi | 
pāṇibhyāmāsanaṃ dhṛtvā smaredevaṃ vidhānataḥ || 54 || 
merupṛṣṭha ṛṣiḥ proktaḥ sutalaṃ chanda īritam | 
kūrmo vai devatā cātra āsanasyopaveśane || 55 || 
viniyogastathā prokta upaviśet samantrakam | 
pṛthvi tvayā dhṛtā lokā devi tvaṃ viṣṇunā dhṛtā || 56 || 
tvaṃ ca dhāraya māṃ nityaṃ pavitramāsanaṃ kuru | 
duḥśilpiracitatvādi yadanyāsanadūṣaṇam || 57 || 
ajñātarūpakaṃ yāti vilayaṃ vidhinā priye | 
padadvayaṃ samaṃ samyagūrudvayoparisthitam || 58 || 
savyaṃ pādamupādāya dakṣiṇopari vinyaset | 
viṣṭabhya kaṭyoḥ pārṣṇī tu nāsāgra(gra?nya)stalocanaḥ || 59 || 
padmāsanaṃ bhavedetat praśastaṃ tripurārcane | 
svastikaṃ gomukhaṃ caivamūrdhvasvastikameva vā || 60 || 
paryaṅkamāsanaṃ śastamevaṃ baddhāsanaḥ priye | 
paśyannabhīṣṭadevaṃ ca pādadoṣaṃ na paśyati || 61 || 

<pṛ0 85> na yuktamanyathā pādadarśanaṃ surapūjane | 
digvibhāgeṣu kauverī dik śivāprītidāyinī || 62 || 
tasmāt tanmukha āsīnaḥ pūjayet tripurāṃ sadā | 
uttarābhimukho bhūtvā yadā devīṃ prapūjayet || 63 || 
uttarāśā tadā devi pūrvāśaiva na saṃśayaḥ | 
īśānamagnikoṇaṃ syādvāyukoṇaṃ tatheśakam || 64 || 
dakṣiṇāśā tadā jñeyā paścimāśā maheśvari | 
rākṣasaṃ vāyukoṇaṃ syādā(dagniśca kha pāṭhaḥ |)gneyaṃ rākṣasaṃ bhavet || 65 || 
prākpratyaṅmukhapūjāyāṃ laukikaṃ paścimaṃ smṛtam | 
dakṣiṇottarapūjāyāṃ saṃmukhaṃ paścimaṃ smṛtam || 66 || 
yoginīcakrapūjāyāṃ digiyaṃ nānyathā bhavet |
kuṅkumāruṇadehastu raktābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 67 || 
raktāsanopaviṣṭastu lākṣāruṇagṛhe sthita(m?ḥ) | 
tāmbūlarāgavadano dhūpāmodasugandhitaḥ || 68 || 
karpūrakṣodadigdhāṅgo raktacandanabhūṣitaḥ | 
sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyastripurīkṛtavigrahaḥ || 69 || 
manaḥsaṃkalparakto vā sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ | 
kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā mandasmitamukhāmbujaḥ || 70 || 
vāmakarṇordhva(rddha ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhāge tu guruṃ ca praṇamet tataḥ | 
dakṣakarṇordhva(rddha ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhāge tu gaṇeśaṃ praṇamed budhaḥ || 71 || 
durgāṃ namet purobhāge pṛṣṭhataḥ kṣetranāyakam | 

<pṛ0 86> svadakṣe vāmato devyā dīpaṃ saṃsthāpayettataḥ || 72 || 
tato ramiti mantreṇa śikhāṃ dīpasya saṃspṛśet | 
devatīrthena deveśi saṃspṛśya ca vidhānataḥ || 73 || 
suprakāśo mahādīpaḥ sarvatasmimirāpahā | 
sabāhyābhyantaraṃ jyotirdīpo'stu śubhadāyakaḥ || 74 || 
sa tasya śubhado dīpo bhavet sparśanamātrataḥ | 
pataṅgakīṭakeśādidāhakravyādasaṅga(saha ka pāṭhaḥ |)taḥ || 75 || 
vasāmajjāsthisaṃbhūtiryadādyanupayogi(na?tā) | 
ajñātarūpakaṃ sarvaṃ doṣaṃ sparśādvināśayet || 76 || 
rocanākuṅkumābhyāṃ ca kastūrīcandanendubhiḥ | 
rañjitaṃ cakrarājaṃ ca svayaṃbhūkusumairyutam || 77 || 
sindūrarajasākrāntaṃ purataḥ siṃhaviṣṭare | 
saṃsthāpya sahasā devi yoginībhiḥ samaṃ tataḥ || 78 || 
devīrūpaṃ vicintyātha cakre puṣpāñjaliṃ diśet | 
aśūnyaṃ(nyaku ka pāṭhaḥ |) kusumaiḥ kuryācchūnye vighnādya(nya kha pāṭhaḥ |)nekaśaḥ || 79 || 
gandhapuṣpākṣatādīni dakṣabhāge nidhāpayet | 
prakṣālanāya karayoḥ pātraṃ paścānnidhāpayet || 80 || 
arghyādikaṃ purobhāge savye kumbhaṃ nidhāpayet | 
maṇḍalaṃ vāmataḥ kṛtvā jalena caturasrakam || 81 || 
vaha(t?n)karābhyāṃ deveśi tatrādhāraṃ manoharam | 
suvarṇaraupyatāmrādivihitaṃ sthāpayet tataḥ || 82 || 

<pṛ0 87> vahnimaṇḍalarūpaṃ taṃ kalābhiḥ saha pūjayet | 
kalaśaṃ hemajaṃ dhanyaṃ (dhā ka pāṭhaḥ |) niśchidraṃ cāpi sundaram || 83 || 
vastrapūtairjalaiḥ pūrṇaṃ sagandhairdoṣavarjitaiḥ | 
pānīyaṃ ghaṭamadhyasthaṃ vī(kṣan?kṣya) guhyaṃ ca sādhakaḥ || 84 || 
vāmena pāṇinā devi tatrādhāre niveśayet | 
pūjayet sūryarūpaṃ taṃ kalābhiḥ parameśvari || 85 || 
(kalpaṃ taṃ ca?kalaśaṃ taṃ) samabhyarcya viśeṣeṇa varānane | 
tatrasthamamṛtaṃ sākṣāccandrarūpaṃ vicintayet || 86 || 
candramaṇḍalamabhyarcya kalābhiḥ suravandite | 
ānandabhairavaṃ tatra yajedānandabhairavīm || 87 || 
yadyanyaddūṣaṇaṃ pātre toye vā(rā ka pāṭhaḥ |)jñānato bhavet | 
tatsarvaṃ nāśamāyāti pūjārhaḥ kalaśo bhavet || 88 || 
pātramastrāmbubhiḥ prokṣya dakṣato vahnimaṇḍale (dakṣiṇe sthāpayettataḥ kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
sādhāraṃ sthāpayeddevi pūjayet taṃ yathāvidhi || 89 || 
śuddhodakena saṃpūrṇaṃ (sapūjya kha pāṭhaḥ |) mūla(mantra kha pāṭhaḥ |)vidyā tato japet | 
prokṣayettena kalaśaṃ prokṣiṇīsthena vāriṇā || 90 ||
vāmatastu tathā śaṅkhaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya vidhānataḥ | 
taduttarata evāsmin pādyamācamanīyakam || 91 || 
cakropari śivāṃ natvā bhūtaśuddhimathācaret | 
svabhāvataḥ sadāśuddhaṃ pañcabhūtātmakaṃ vapuḥ || 92 ||  
(manaḥ?sadā)pūtisamāyuktaṃ śleṣmaviṇmūtrapicchilam | 

<pṛ0 88> tasyaiva hi viśuddhyarthaṃ vāyvagnisalilākṣaraiḥ || 93 || 
śoṣadāhau tathā bhasmaprotsādo'mṛtavarṣaṇam | 
āplāvanaṃ ca kartavyaṃ pūrakumbhakarecakaiḥ || 94 || 
pañcaśuddhivihīnena kṛtaṃ yadabhicāravat | 
viparītaphalaṃ dadyādabhaktyābhyarcanaṃ tathā || 95 || 
śarīrākārabhūtānāṃ bhūtānāṃ yadviśodhanam | 
avyayabrahmasaṃsparśād bhūtaśuddhiriyaṃ priye || 96 || 
antaḥkaraṇamadhye tu jyotirā(ṣā kha pāṭhaḥ |)tmā pravartate | 
liṅga(ḍga kha pāṭhaḥ |)dehaṃ tu taṃ(tat kha pāṭhaḥ |) prāhuryoginastattvavedinaḥ || 97 || 
tasya vai śodhanaṃ caiva sarvaśuddhiḥ prajāyate | 
tadeva viśvajananakāraṇaṃ janmakāraṇam || 98 || 
tatpratītau bhavenmuktirnānyato janmakoṭibhiḥ | 
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā yonimudrāṃ (tallakṣaṇa yathā- mitha kaniṣṭhake baddhvā - tarjanībhyāmanāmike | anāmikordhva saśliṣṭadīrghamadhyamayoradha | aṅguṣṭhāgradvaya nyasedyonimudrayamīritā || iti |) tathā smaret || 99 || 
vidyākūṭatrayaṃ devi vahnyarkendumayaṃ dhiyā | 
puratraye'tha saṃcintya teṣāmaikyaṃ tataḥ smaret || 100 || 
tasmiṃstejomaye (viśve?bimbe) saccidānandadhāmani | 
kevalānubhavānande para(ram kha pāṭhaḥ |)brahmaṇi śāśvate || 101 || 
nimajya binduge dhāmni kṣaṇaṃ sthitvā tu cintayet | 
bālārkakiraṇāraktaṃ tattattejomayaṃ smaret || 102 || 

<pṛ0 89> śuddhalākṣāmṛtāmbhodhimadhye cātimanohare(ram ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
navaratnamaye dvīpe taccintāmaṇimaṇḍape || 103 || 
ratnasiṃhāsanāmbhoje vahnyarkendusvarūpiṇīm | 
bālārkakoṭisaṃkāśāṃ turīyāṃ paramāṃ kalām || 104 || 
dakṣiṇādhaḥkare bāṇān vāmādho dhanureva ca | 
dakṣiṇordhve(śṛ?sṛ)ṇiṃ vāme pāśaṃ cāpi kare (rairdhṛtām kha pāṭhaḥ |) dhṛtam || 105 || 
aruṇāmaruṇākalpavasanākṣitrayānvitām | 
ātmābhedena saṃcintya śuddhajñānasvabhāvinam(nīm kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 106 || 
kevalānubhavānandamātmānaṃ paricintayet | 
oṃ hrīṃ haṃsastataḥ sohaṃ svāheti manunā śive || 107 || 
bālābījatrayasyānte mahātripurasundari | 
ātmānaṃ rakṣarakṣeti kuryādrakṣāṃ hṛdi (dra ka pāṭhaḥ |) spṛśan || 
digbandhaḥ svastriyā(?)caivaṃ choṭikābhiḥ samantataḥ || 108 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde yāgadhāmārcanabhūtaśuddhyādivarṇanaṃ nāma aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 8 || 

<pṛ0 90> [navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
deva eva yajeddevaṃ nādevo devamarcayet | 
nyāsaṃ vinā japaṃ prāhurāsuraṃ viphalaṃ śive || 1 || 
nyāsāttadātmako bhūtvā devo bhūtvā tu taṃ yajet | 
prāṇāyāmaistathā dhyānairnyāsairdevaśarīratā || 2 || 
nyāsavidhiṃ śṛṇu prājñe karaśuddhipuraḥsaram | 
mātṛkādyaṃ samuddhṛtya dvitīyaṃ ca sabindukam || 3 || 
śāntāntaṃ kā(ntaka ka pāṭhaḥ |)disaṃyuktamekārāntāntayojitam | 
evameṣā mahāvidyā karaśuddhikarī (sabindu mātṛkādya a dvitīya ca ā śāntetyādinā sau ityeṣā karaśuddhikarīvidyā |) matā || 4 || 
gṛhītvā raktapuṣpaṃ ca sagandhaṃ sādhakastataḥ(kottama kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
anenaiva tu mantreṇa puṣpaṃ hastatalasthitam || 5 || 
saṃmārjya savyahastena vāmena pāṇinā tataḥ | 
nirmañchya kāmabījena jighrapedvāgbhavena tu || 6 || 
aiśānyāṃ niḥkṣipedetaccheṣa(śava kha pāṭhaḥ |)bījena pārvati | 
aṅgulyagrāṇi śuddhāni puṣpasya grahaṇādbhavet || 7 || 
mardanāt karayoḥ śuddhirnirmañchanāttu pṛṣṭhayoḥ | 
ghrāṇāddevāśca tuṣyanti tīrthānāṃ ca samāgamaḥ || 8 || 
prakṣepāt sarvavighnānāṃ dūrasaṃsthānameva ca | 

<pṛ0 91> durgandhocchi(tsṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭasaṃsparśadūṣaṇaṃ karayostu yat || 9 || 
ajñātarūpaṃ tatsarvaṃ nāśayedvidhināmunā | 
karaśuddhiṃ vidhāyādāvṛṣinyāsādikaṃ tataḥ || 10 || 
ṛṣicchandodaivatānāṃ vinyāsena vinā yadā | 
japyate sādhite'pyeṣa na tatra tatphalaṃ labhet || 11 || 
ṛṣirasyā maheśāni dakṣiṇāmūrtiravyayaḥ | 
paṃkti(ccha ka pāṭhaḥ |)śchandastathā proktaṃ vidyāyāḥ śṛṇu pārvati || 12 || 
devatā parameśānī mahātripurasundarī | 
viniyogaḥ samākhyāto bhuktimuktiprasādhane || 13 || 
śirasi mukhavṛtte ca hṛdaye ca pravinyaset | 
mātṛkāṃ śṛṇu deveśi sarvapāpavināśinīm || 14 || 
yā brāhmīpramukhā devyo mātaraḥ parikīrtitāḥ | 
tāsāṃ mantrāṇi sarvāṇi vyañjanāni sva(su ka pāṭhaḥ |)rāstathā || 15 || 
candrabindusamāyuktāḥ sarvakāmaphalapradāḥ | 
ṛṣiḥ saṃmohanaḥ proktaścha(ccha ka pāṭhaḥ |)ndo gāyatramucyate || 16 || 
devateyaṃ samuddiṣṭā samastajananī parā | 
śaktayastu (su?sva)rā devi bījaṃ vyañjanasaṃcayaḥ || 17 || 
viniyogaḥ samuddiṣṭaḥ samastajanamohane | 
svareṇa dīrghayuktena ṣaḍaṅgāni samācaret || 18 || 
hṛdayaṃ ca śiro devi śikhā ca kavacaṃ tataḥ | 
netrama(ntraṃ?straṃ)nyaset svīyamudrājātiyutaṃ namaḥ || 19 || 

<pṛ0 92> svāhā vaṣaḍ huṃ ca vauṣaṭ (svāhāvaṣaḍvoṣaḍastra phaḍa ka pāṭhaḥ |) phaḍantaṃ yojayet priye | 
ṣaḍaṅgo'yaṃ mātṛkāyāḥ sarvapadottaraḥ śive || 20 || 
bālārkakoṭirucirāṃ sphaṭikākṣamālāṃ 
kodaṇḍamikṣujanitaṃ (sva?sma)rapañcabāṇān | 
vidyāṃ ca hastakamalairdadhatīṃ trinetrāṃ 
dhyāyet samastajananī navacandracūḍām || 21 || 
dvyaṣṭapatrāmbuje kaṇṭhe svarān ṣoḍaśa cintayet | 
hṛtpadme dvādaśacchade kādīn dvādaśa vinyaset || 22 || 
daśapatrāmbuje nābhau ḍakārādīn nyaseddaśa | 
ṣaṭpatre liṅgamadhyasthe bakārādīn nyasecca ṣaṭ || 23 || 
ādhāre caturo varṇān vādīn nyaseccaturdale | 
hakṣau bhrūmadhyage padme dvidale paricintayet || 24 || 
ityantarmātṛkāḥ smṛtvā bahirnyāsaṃ tataścaret (śive ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
(bahirmātṛkānyāsamāha akāretyādinā | klīanamo lalāṭe ityeva jñeyam |) akārādikṣakārāntā mātṛkāḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 25 || 
pratyekaṃ kāmabījādyāḥ sarvakāmaphalapradāḥ | 
candrabindusamāyuktā namontāśca pravinyaset || 26 || 
lalāṭe mukhavṛtte ca netrakarṇeṣu pārvati | 
nāsāgaṇḍauṣṭhadanteṣu samūrdhāsyeṣu śāṃkari || 27 || 
pāṇipādayugasyāntaḥsaṃdhyagreṣu kramācchive | 
pārśvadvaye pṛṣṭhanābhijaṭhareṣu kramān nyaset || 28 || 

<pṛ0 93> yādīn sadhātukān devi krameṇaiva tato nyaset | 
tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedo'sthimajjā(jja ka pāṭha |)śukrāṇi dhātavaḥ || 29 || 
prāṇātmā ca jīvātmā ca paramātmā tathaiva ca | 
hṛdaye bāhumūle ca tathā kaṇṭhapradeśake || 30 || 
skandha(kakṣa)yorhṛdayaprānte pāṇipādayuge tathā | 
jaṭharānanayordevi sarvāṅgeṣu kramānnyaset || 31 || 
(mātṛkānyāsamudrā nirdiśati lalāṭe'nāmikāmityādinā |) lalāṭe'nāmikāṃ madhyāṃ vinyasenmukhapaṅkaje | 
tarjanīmadhyamānāmāvṛddhā eva tu netrayoḥ || 32 || 
aṅguṣṭhaṃ karṇayordevi kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhakau nasoḥ | 
madhyāstisro gaṇḍayośca madhyamāmoṣṭhayoḥ priye || 33 || 
anāmāṃ dantayordevi madhyamāmuttamāṅgake | 
mukhe'nāmāṃ madhyamāṃ ca hastapāde'tha pārśvayoḥ || 34 || 
kaniṣṭhānāmikāmadhyāstāstu pṛṣṭhe'tha pārvati | 
tāstu sāṅguṣṭhakā nābhau sarvāḥ kukṣau pravinyaset || 35 || 
hṛdaye ca talaṃ sarvaṃ bāhvoḥ kaṇṭhapradeśake | 
skandhayorhṛdayaprānte hastapādayuge tathā || 36 || 
jaṭharāsyayuge devi talameva prakīrtitam | 
etāstu mātṛkāmudrāḥ krameṇa parikīrtitāḥ || 37 || 
ajñātvā vinyasedyastu nyāsaḥ syāttasya niṣphalaḥ | 
anāmayā vā puṣpairvā manasā vā nyaseduta || 38 || 

<pṛ0 94> evaṃ tu mātṛkānyāsaṃ yaḥ kuryāt parameśvari | 
sarvayajñeṣu pūjāsu pūto yogyaśca jāyate || 39 || 
nātaḥ parataro mantro(ra mantra ka pāṭhaḥ |) vidyate kvacideva hi | 
ye ye mantrā devatānāmṛṣīṇāmatha rakṣasām || 40 || 
te sarve mātṛkāmantre nityameva pratiṣṭhitāḥ | 
sarvamantramayaścāyaṃ sarvadevamayastathā || 41 || 
caturvargapradaścāyaṃ tuṣṭipuṣṭipradāyakaḥ | 
sarvapīṭhamayaścāpi mātṛkānyāsa ucyate || 42 || 
yaḥ (ya ka pāṭhaḥ |) kuryānmātṛkānyāsaṃ vinaiva surapūjanāt | 
tasmādbibheti satataṃ bhūtagrāmaścaturvidhaḥ || 43 || 
taṃ draṣṭumapi devāśca spa(rśa?rdha)yanti mahaujasam | 
sa tu sarvaṃ (rva ka pāṭhaḥ |) vaśaṃ kuryānna ca yāti parābhavam || 44 || 
puṭitāṃ sarvabījena samastajananīṃ parām | 
pañcāśanmātṛkāṃ vidyāṃ japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 45 || 
vāgdevatāṃ hṛdi dhyātvā mūrdhni sarvākṣarāṇi tu | 
dvidhā ca mātṛkāmantraiḥ sakramairvyutkramairapi || 46 || 
mantrayitvā maheśāni prabhāte yaḥ pibejjalam | 
sa vāgmī paṇḍito dhīmāñjāyate pravaraḥ kaviḥ || 47 || 
candrabindusamāyuktān svarān pūrvaṃ paṭhedbudhaḥ | 
vyañjanāni tu sarvāṇi kevalāni paṭhet priye || 48 || 
jalaṃ hastatale gṛhya paṭhitvākṣarasaṃhatim | 

<pṛ0 95> abhimantrya ca tattoyaṃ prathamaṃ pū(rva?ra)kaiḥ pibet || 49 || 
kumbhakena dvitīyaṃ tu tṛtīyaṃ recakena tu | 
evaṃ sakṛt trivāraṃ tu pītvā toyaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ || 50 || 
dṛḍhāṅgaḥ paṇḍito bhūyāt putrapautrasamanvitaḥ | 
trisaṃdhyamatha pītvaivaṃ mātṛkāmantramantritam || 51 || 
toyaṃ kavitvamāpnoti sarvān kāmāṃstathaiva ca | 
satataṃ kurute yastu mātṛkāmantramantritam || 52 || 
toyadā(pā)naṃ mahādevi pūrakumbhakarecakaiḥ | 
sa sarvakāmān saṃprāpya putrapautrasamṛddhimān || 53 || 
bhūtvā mahākavirloke balavān satyavikramaḥ | 
sarvatra durlabho bhūtvā cānte mokṣamavāpnuyāt || 54 || 
rājānamathavā rājaputraṃ bhāryāṃ ca vā priye | 
vaśīkaroti na cirānmātṛkāmantrapālakaḥ || 55 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde karaśuddhyantarbahirmātṛkānyāsavarṇanaṃ nāma navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 9 || 

<pṛ0 96> [daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śrīdevyuvāca 
ṣoḍhākhyāṃ mātṛkāṃ deva kathayasva vṛṣadhvaja | 

īśvara uvāca 
gaṇeśaiḥ prathamo nyāso dvitīyastu grahairmataḥ || 1 || 
nakṣatraiśca tṛtīyaḥ syādyoginībhiścaturthakaḥ | 
rāśibhiḥ pañcamo nyāsaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ pīṭhairnigadyate || 2 || 
ṣoḍhā nyāsastvayaṃ proktaḥ sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ | 

śrīdevyuvāca 
phalaṃ cāsya prayogaṃ ca viśadīkuru tattvataḥ || 3 || 

īśvara uvāca 
nārāyaṇo'sya(ṛṣi ka pāṭhaḥ |)rṣi proktaśchandastriṣṭubudāhṛtam | 
śivaśaktyātmavarṇa(ṛṣī?rāśi)rdevatā ca sadāśivaḥ || 4 || 
haṃsaḥ śaktiḥ parā bījaṃ śrībījaṃ caiva kīlakam | 
puruṣārthaprasādhye ca viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 5 || 
mūrdhni saṃcintayeddevi śrīguruṃ śivarūpiṇam | 
(1) ramābījaṃ paraṃ paścāddhaṃsāt svarādyamīritam || 6 || 
vighneśvarāya vai procya śriyai namastataḥ param (avighneśvarāya śriyai namo lalāṭe ityādirūpo nyāso bodhya |) | 
vighnarājādikānevaṃ śaktiyuktāṃstathaiva ca || 7 || 
vinyasenmātṛkāsthāne mātṛkaikānvitaṃ śive | 
vighnarājāya deveśi(kri?hri)yai namastataḥ param || 8 || 

<pṛ0 97> vināyakāya ca tuṣṭyai śāṃtyai śivottamāya ca | 
vighnakartre(ha ka pāṭhaḥ kṛte kha pāṭhaḥ |) tathā puṣṭyai nama iti pravinyaset || 9 || 
vighnahartre sarasvatyai nama iti pravinyaset | 
vināyakāya medhāyai pūrvavadatha vinyaset || 10 || 
ekadantāya kāntyai ca dvidantāya ca yā(kā kha pāṭhaḥ |)minīm | 
gajavaktrāya mohinyai nirañjanajaṭe (nirañjanāya jaṭāyai nama iti prayogo bodhyaḥ |) tathā || 11 ||
kapardine ca tīvrāyai jvālinī dīrghavaktrakaḥ | 
śaṅkukarṇāya nandāyai svarasā ca vṛṣadhvajaḥ || 12 || 
gaṇanāthaśca kāminyā gajendraśca śubhā tathā | 
jayinī śūrpakarṇaśca satyayā ca trilocanaḥ || 13 || 
lambodarāya vighneśyai mahānandaḥ(ndasva ka pāṭhaḥ |) svarūpiṇī | 
kāmadayā caturmūrtiḥ sadāśivastataḥ param || 14 || 
madavihvalayā yukta āmodo vikaṭāyutaḥ | 
durmukhāya ca ghūrṇāyai sumukho bhūtisaṃyutaḥ || 15 || 
pramadāya tathā bhūmyai ekapādo matistathā | 
dvijihvo ramayā yuktaḥ surasenaśca mānuṣī || 16 || 
makaradhvajayā yukto vīraśca parameśvari | 
ṣaṇmukhāya vikarṇāyai varado bhṛṅga(?bhruku)ṭīyutaḥ || 17 || 
vāmadevāya lajjāyai dīrghaghoṇāyutastataḥ | 
vajratuṇḍo dviraṇḍaśca dhanurdharāyutaḥ priye || 18 || 

<pṛ0 98> senānye caiva yāminyai grāmaṇī rātrisaṃyutaḥ | 
mattaścandrikayā yukto vimattāya(lāya kha pāṭhaḥ |) śaśiprabhā || 19 || 
tathaiva parameśāni lolayā mattavāhanaḥ | 
jaṭi(le?ne)capalākṣyai (kṣiṇyai ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca muṇḍī ṛddhiyutastathā || 20 || 
khaḍgī durbhagayā yukto vareṇyaḥ (śu?su)bhagāyutaḥ | 
nyastavyaḥ parameśāni śivayā vṛṣaketanaḥ || 21 || 
bhakta(kṣya kha pāṭhaḥ |)priyāya durgāyai meghanādāya kā(likā kha pāṭhaḥ |)minī | 
kālakubjā(jihvā kha pāṭhaḥ |)samāyukto gaṇeśvaraḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 22 || 
gaṇeśo vighnahāriṇyā nyastavyaḥ sādhakottamaiḥ | 
(2) sūryamukhān mahādevi nyaset kāmadughānatha || 23 || 
svarān pūrvaṃ samuddhṛtya candrabindusamanvitān | 
sūryāya nama uccārya hṛdaye ca pravinyaset || 24 || 
bhruvormadhye tathā somaṃ (ṣa?ya)vargeṇa pravinyaset | 
bhūputraṃ locanadvandve kavargeṇa tathaiva ca || 25 || 
budhaṃ ca hṛdaye devi cavargeṇa pravinyaset | 
bṛhaspatiṃ tathā kaṇṭhe ṭavargeṇa pravinyaset || 26 || 
bhārgavaṃ tu gale deśe tavargeṇa tathā priye | 
pavargeṇa śaniṃ nābhau rāhuṃ gude śavargakaiḥ || 27 || 
ḻakṣābhyāṃ pādayoḥ ketuṃ nyasedevaṃ vidhānataḥ | 
(3) svarādyaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ ca aśvinyai nama ityapi || 28 || 
lalāṭe ca pravinyasya tathānyānapi vinyaset |  

<pṛ0 99> iṃyutāṃ bharaṇīṃ devi dakṣanetre pravinyaset || 29 || 
īṃ uṃ ūṃ kṛttikāṃ caiva vinyasedvāmanetrake | 
ṛṃ ṛṃ ḷṃ ḹṃ yutāṃ devi rohiṇīṃ dakṣakarṇake || 30 || 
eṃyutāṃ mṛgaśīrṣāṃ ca vāmakarṇe pravinyaset | 
aiṃkāreṇa tathādrāṃ ca dakṣanāsāpuṭe nyaset || 31 || 
oṃ auṃ punarvasuṃ caiva vāmanāsāpuṭe nyaset | 
kaṃ yutaṃ(tāṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca nyaset puṣyaṃ(ṣyāṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) kaṇṭha(ṇṭhe ka pāṭhaḥ |)deśe ca pārvati || 32 || 
khagābhyāṃ ca tathāśleṣāṃ dakṣaskandhe pravinyaset | 
ghaṅābhyāṃ ca maghāṃ devi vāmaskandhe pravinyaset || 33 || 
caṃpūrvaphalgunīṃ caiva dakṣakurparake nyaset | 
vāmakurparake devi chaṃ jaṃ uttaraphalgu(ṇī?nī)m || 34 || 
dakṣiṇe maṇibandhe tu jhaṃñaṃ hastaṃ(stāṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca vinyaset | 
maṇibandhe tathā vāme ṭaṃṭhaṃ citrāṃ pravinyaset || 35 || 
ḍaṃkāreṇa tathā svātīṃ (tī ka pāṭhaḥ |) dakṣahastatale nyaset | 
ḍhaṇābhyāṃ ca viśākhāṃ vai vāmahastatale tathā || 36 || 
tathābhyāmanurādhāṃ ca nyasennābhau samāhitaḥ | 
daṃdhaṃ jyeṣṭhāṃ kaṭau dakṣe tribhirmūlāṃ ca vāmataḥ || 37 || 
pūrvāṣāḍhāṃ vakāreṇa dakṣorau vinyaset tataḥ | 
bhakāreṇottarāṣāḍhāṃ vāmorau tadanantaram || 38 || 
dakṣajānupradeśe ca maṃ śravaṇaṃ (ṇā ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca vinyaset | 

<pṛ0 100> yaṃraṃyutāṃ dhaniṣṭhāṃ ca vāme jānuni vinyaset || 39 || 
śatabhiṣāṃ lakāreṇa dakṣajaṅghāpradeśake | 
vaṃśaṃvarṇasthitāṃ vāme pūrvabhādrapadāṃ nyaset || 40 || 
tathaivottarabhādrāṃ(dra ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca ṣasahairdakṣapādataḥ | 
ḻakṣābhyāṃ bindu(maddvā?mūrdha)bhyāṃ revatīṃ vinyasettataḥ || 41 || 
(4) raktākṣīṃ ca śvetavarṇāṃ paśubhītika(ha ka pāṭhaḥ |)rāṃ śubhām | 
khaḍgaṃ ca caṣakaṃ caiva śūlaṃ khaṭvāṅgameva ca || 42 || 
anugrāmugradaṃṣṭrāṃ ca ekāsyāṃ ripunāśinīm | 
pāyasānnaprasa(śa ka pāṭhaḥ |)ktāṃ ca svaraiḥ kalpitavigrahām || 43 || 
ḍākinīṃ bhāvayeddīvīṃ sarvakāmaprapūraṇīm | 
(aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ṛṃ ḷṃ ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ aṃ aṃ ḍāṃ ḍīṃ ḍamalavarayūṃ ḍākinyai namaḥ ḍākini tvagdhātugate catuṣṣaṣṭilakṣakoṭiyoginī svāmini sarvasattvavaśaṃkari ājñā me dehi mama vicce | iti spaṣṭam |) svarān pūrvaṃ samuddhṛtya candrabindusamanvitān || 44 || 
ṭhāntadvayaṃ tataḥ paścāt pāśaturīyabheditam | 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ bījadvayamudīritam || 45 || 
ṭhāntaṃ bhāntaṃ mahībījaṃ vāruṇaṃ vahnivāyavau | 
vāmakarṇastato devi nādabindukalāyutaḥ || 46 || 
ḍākinyai nama ityante saṃbodhya ḍākinīṃ tataḥ | 
(dugdhānna?tvagdhātu)gata ityuktvā catuḥṣaṣṭipadaṃ tataḥ || 47 || 
lakṣakoṭipadasyānte yoginīsvāminīti ca | 
sarvasattvavaśaṃ brūyāt ka(vi?ri)śabda(mayaṃ?padaṃ)tataḥ || 48 || 

<pṛ0 101> ājñāṃ me dehi tatpaścānmama vi(kri?cce)padadvayam | 
viśuddhau vinyaseddevi rākinīṃ cintayet tataḥ || 49 || 
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhyasthāṃ daṃṣṭrābhīmamukhīṃ tathā | 
navīnanīradaśyāmāṃ pīnonnatapayodharām || 50 || 
śūlaṃ ḍamarukaṃ caiva dadhatīṃ vajrapadmake (vajrapadme ca dhāriṇīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
śuklā(mvāśa?nnāsa)ktacitāṃ ca kaṭhavarṇātmavigrahām || 51 || 
kaṭhavarṇāṃstato rephe pūrvavat svarabhedite | 
(cā?ṭhā)ntaṃ hitvāgnibījaṃ ca pūrvavat tadanantaram || 52 || 
rākinyai nama ābhāṣya saṃbodhya ca tathā bhavet | 
asṛgdhātugate paścād dvātriṃśallakṣakoṭi ca || 53 || 
yoginīsvāmini prānte pūrvavat tadanantaram | 
raktavarṇāṃ trinetrāṃ ca devadeveśasaṃyutām || 54 || 
daṃ(ṣṭrīṃ?ṣṭriṇī)mugrarūpābhāṃ vajraṃ (rudraṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) śaktiṃ varābhayau | 
dadhatīṃ cintayet devīṃ guḍabhaktotsukāṃ parām || 55 || 
evaṃ dhyātvā maheśānīṃ ḍaphavarṇātmavigrahām | 
ḍaphavarṇāṃstato devi bhūbījadvitayaṃ tathā || 56 || 
vahniṃ hitvā ma(hā?hī)bījaṃ pūrvavadaparaṃ tathā | 
(sā?lā)kinyai nama uccārya saṃbodhya ca tathā vrajet (bhavet kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 57 || 
māṃsadhātugate paścāt ṣoḍaśalakṣakoṭitaḥ | 
pūrvavadaparaṃ sarvaṃ nābhipadme pravinyaset || 58 || 
svādhiṣṭhānākhyapadme ca kākinīṃ paricintayet | 

<pṛ0 102> pītavarṇāṃ mahāmattāṃ gajakumbhopamastanīm || 59 || 
dadhyannā(śa?sa)ktacittāṃ ca surapravaravanditām | 
śūlaṃ ḍamarukaṃ caiva pāśaṃ cābhayameva ca || 60 || 
vahantīṃ parameśānīṃ bādilāntātmavigrahām | 
bādilāntā(nta ka pāṭhaḥ |)stathā kāṃkīṃkamalavarayūṃ tataḥ || 61 || 
kākinyai nama ityante saṃbodhya caiva kākinīm | 
medodhātugate paścāt tathāṣṭa(jala?lakṣa)koṭi ca || 62 || 
yoginī(ni ka pāṭhaḥ |)svāminī procya pūrvavadaparaṃ tathā | 
pañcavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ ca vahnibhānusvarūpiṇīm || 63 || 
cāpaṃ bāṇaṃ tathā pāśaṃ sṛ(śṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṇi ca pustakaṃ tathā | 
jñānamudrāṃ ca hastābjairdadhatīṃ parameśvarīm || 64 || 
mudgānnaprītisaṃyuktāṃ mūlādhāre vicintayet | 
vādi(dha?sā)ntā(ntāsta ka pāṭhaḥ |)stathā sāṃsīṃsa(śāśī śa ka pāṭha |)malavarayūṃ tathā || 65 || 
(śā?sā)kinyai nama ityante saṃbodhya sā(śā ka pāṭhaḥ |)kinīṃ tataḥ | 
asthidhātugate caiva caturlakṣeti koṭi ca || 66 || 
yogi(ni?nī) svāmini prānte varavaradapadaṃ tathā | 
bindusthāṃ śuklavarṇāṃ ca hakṣavarṇasvarūpiṇīm || 67 || 
ḍamaruṃ cākṣasūtraṃ ca kapālaṃ khaḍgameva ca | 
pustakaṃ jñānamudrāṃ ca dadhatīṃ bāhubhiḥ sadā || 68 || 
locanatrayasaṃyuktāṃ ṣaḍvaktrāṃ sarvamohinīm | 

<pṛ0 103> haridrānnaprasaktā ca madhumadamudānvitām || 69 || 
devendravanditāṃ devīṃ bhāvayeddhākinīṃ parām | 
haṃkṣaṃhāṃhīṃ ca deveśi hamalavarayūṃ tathā || 70 || 
hākinyai nama uccārya saṃbodhya caiva hākinīm | 
majjādhātugate paścād dvilakṣakoṭiśabdataḥ || 71 || 
śeṣaṃ(ṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |) pūrvavaduddhṛtya bhruvormadhye pravinyaset | 
akārādikṣakārāntāṃ mātṛkāṃ sarvamuccaret || 72 || 
yāṃyīṃ(yāṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) tu parameśāni yamalavarayūṃ tathā | 
yākinyai nama ityante saṃbodhyaiva tu yākinīm || 73 || 
śukradhātugate paścāddaśakoṭipadaṃ tataḥ | 
pūrvavacca pravinyasya (5) rāśinyāsamataḥ param || 74 || 
(aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ meṣāya namo dakṣagulphe ityādi jñeyam | vedārṇaiścatubhirakṣarairityarthaḥ |) vedārṇairdakṣagulphe'tha meṣaṃ vinyasya pārvati | 
dakṣajānau vṛṣaṃ tryarṇairvṛṣaṇe mithunaṃ tribhiḥ || 75 || 
dvābhyāṃ karkaṭakaṃ kukṣau dvābhyāṃ skandhe'tha siṃhakam | 
anusvāravisargābhyāṃ śavargeṇa ca kanyakām || 76 || 
dakṣiṇe ca śirobhāge vinyasedvīravandite | 
tathā vāmaśirobhāge kavargeṇa tulāṃ nyaset || 77 || 
cavargeṇa tathā skandhe vṛścikaṃ vinyaset tataḥ | 
ṭavargeṇa tathā kukṣau dhanvinaṃ vinyaset tataḥ || 78 || 
makaraṃ tu tavargeṇa vṛṣaṇe (dakṣiṇe?vāmake) nyaset | 

<pṛ0 104> pavargeṇa tathā kumbhaṃ vāmajānuni vinyaset || 79 || 
yavargeṇa kṣakāreṇa mīnaṃ gulphe tu vāmake | 
caturthīnatisaṃyuktaṃ sthāneṣvevaṃ kramānnyaset || 80 || 
(6) atha (pi?pī)ṭhāni vi(va ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhinā yathāsthāne pravinyaset | 
parāpūrvaṃ ca sarveṣāṃ mātṛkāṃ ca pṛthak pṛthak || 81 || 
caturthīnatiyuktāni mātṛkāvannyaset kramāt | 
kāmarūpaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ vārāṇasīṃ tataḥ param || 82 || 
nepālaṃ (medāna ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca mahāpīṭhaṃ pauṃṇḍravardhanameva ca (paugaṇḍavarddhana tathā kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
purasthiraṃ mahādevi carasthiramataḥ param || 83 || 
pūrṇaśailaṃ mahāpīṭhamarbudaṃ ca tataḥ param | 
kāśmīraṃ ca tathā pīṭhaṃ kānyakubjamatho bhavet || 84 || 
āmrātakeśvaraṃ(dārukeśa mahā kha pāṭhaḥ |) pīṭhamekāmraṃ(gra kha pāṭhaḥ |) ca tataḥ śive | 
trisrotaḥ pīṭhamuddiṣṭaṃ kāmakoṭṭa(ṭi kha pāṭhaḥ |)mataḥ param || 85 || 
kailāsaṃ bhūtanagaraṃ kedāraṃ pīṭhamuttamam | 
śrīpīṭhaṃ ca tathauṃkāraṃ jālandharamataḥ param || 86 || 
mālavaṃ(nava ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca kulāntaṃ ca devamātṛkameva ca | 
gokarṇaṃ ca tato devi māruteśvarameva ca || 87 || 
aṭṭahāsaṃ ca virajaṃ rājagṛhamataḥ param | 
pīṭhaṃ kollagiriṃ caiva elāpuramataḥ priye || 88 || 
kāleśvaramahāpīṭhaṃ praṇavaṃ ca jayantikā | 

<pṛ0 105> pīṭhamujjayinīṃ caiva kṣīrikāpīṭhameva ca || 89 || 
hastināpurakaṃ pīṭhaṃ pīṭhamuḍḍīśameva ca | 
prayāgaṃ caiva ṣaṣṭhīśaṃ māyāpurajaleśvarau || 90 ||| 
malayaṃ ca mahāpīṭhaṃ śrīśailamathavāpi ca (ca tathā priye kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
meruṃ giriṃ mahendraṃ ca vāmanaṃ cāpi vinyaset || 91 || 
hiraṇyapurakaṃ pīṭhaṃ mahālakṣmīpuraṃ ca vai | 
uḍḍīyānaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ chāyāpura(pīṭha kha pāṭhaḥ |)mataḥ param || 92 || 
ṣoḍhānyāsastvayaṃ proktaḥ sarvapāpaharaḥ sadā | 
ṣoḍhānyāsavihīno yaḥ praṇameddevi sundarīm || 93 || 
so'cirānmṛtyumāpnoti narakaṃ ca prapadyate | 
evaṃ nyastaśarīrastu bhaved gaṅgādharaḥ svayam || 94 || 
mantrī nacātra saṃdeho nigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ | 
na tasya pūjyo loke'smin pitṛmātṛmukho naraḥ || 95 || 
svayaṃ ca sādhakaśreṣṭho yaṃ kaṃcana na (vindati?vandate) | 
sa ma(rtho?rtyo)mṛtyumāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā || 96 || 
namaskāraṃ na kurvīta jyeṣṭhasyāpi kadācana | 
gurorapi na padyeta (vandeta ka pāṭhaḥ |) mriyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 97 ||
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena namaskāraṃ vivarjayet | 
kāmaṃ krodhaṃ tathā lobhaṃ māyāhaṃkārameva ca || 98 || 
saṃkalpaṃ bhojanālāpaṃ na kuryāt kenacitsaha | 
bhoktavyaṃ yoṣitā sārdhaṃ yatkiṃcit tatta(nma ka pāṭhaḥ |)yaiva hi || 99 || 

<pṛ0 106> vinyaseddevi yuktātmā trikālaṃ ca divā niśi | 
yathā sābhyāsayogena sāmarthyaṃ tadvadāmyaham || 100 || 
yatrāyaṃ nivaseddevi ṣoḍhānyāsī ca sādhakaḥ | 
divyaṃ kṣetraṃ bhavettatra samantācchatayojanam || 101 || 
devāḥ sarve namasyanti taṃ namāmi na saṃśayaḥ | 
kṛtvā nyāsamimaṃ devi yatra gacchati sādhakaḥ || 102 || 
tatra yadviṣaye caiva yanmā(ṣaṇmā ka pāṭhaḥ |)naṃ puruṣaiḥ saha | 
dyāvāntarikṣabhūśailajalāraṇyanivāsinaḥ || 103 || 
bhūtapretapiśācāśca yakṣakūṣmāṇḍarākṣasāḥ | 
paśyanti pāvakārūḍhaṃ ye cānye hiṃsakā janāḥ || 104 || 
śatrusaṃhatisaṃkīrṇe(rṇo ka pāṭhaḥ |) saṃgrāme'thāpadeṣu ca | 
na bhayaṃ vidyate tasya paratra śivatāṃ vrajet || 105 || 
ye kecit pāpasaṃghātāḥ saptajanmāntarodbhavāḥ | 
naśyanti nyāsamātreṇa bhāskareṇa tamo yathā || 106 || 
satatābhyāsayogena ṣaṇmāsena ca mānave(vaḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
dahyate sarvapāpāni brahmahatyādikāni ca | 
kiṃcātibahunoktena mama tulyo bhaved dhruvam || 107 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde ṣoḍhānyāsakramanirūpaṇaṃ daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 10 || 

<pṛ0 107> [ekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
karaśuddhirṛṣinyāsa(bhūta kha pāṭhaḥ |) āsanaṃ ca tataḥ param (pīṭhanyāsa tathaiva ca kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
karāṅgayoḥ ṣaḍaṅgāni vaśinyādyamataḥ param (mātṛkānyāsameva ca kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 1 || 
na(ra?va)yonicaturvyūhatattvanyāsādikaṃ tathā | 
mūlavarṇādivinyāsaḥ saṃmohanākhya eva ca || 2 || 
etadeva hi nityaṃ syāt kāmyaṃ cānyat prakīrtitam | 
karaśuddhikarīpūrvaṃ (a ā sau iti karaśuddhikarīvidyā |) tripureti padaṃ tataḥ || 3 || 
amṛtārṇavaśabdoparyāsanāya namo manuḥ | 
pādayorvinyaset paścādbālānte tripureśvarī || 4 || 
potāmbujāsanāyānte namo jānuni vinyaset | 
hrīṃklīṃ(drī ka pāṭhaḥ |)saustripuretyuktvā sundarīti padaṃ tataḥ || 5 || 
ṅentamātmāsanāyānte nama(uccārya?ūrvo pra)vinyaset | 
ādyaṃ(di ka pāṭhaḥ |) madhyaṃ tathāntaṃ ca(śa?ku)māryāḥ śivasaṃyutam (bālāyā bījatraye śiveti hakāreṇa sayutam |) || 6 || 
tripuravāsinītyuktvā cakrāsanāya hṛttataḥ | 
kaṭi(deśe ka pāṭhaḥ |)dvaye pravinyasya śivaṃ somayutaṃ kuru || 7 || 
etasyā eva vidyāyā (samanantaroktavidyāyā eva bījatraye śivo hakāra sakāreṇa yuta |) stripura(ra ka pāṭhaḥ |)śrīpadaṃ tataḥ | 
sarvamantrāsanāyānte namo guhye pravinyaset || 8 || 

<pṛ0 108> (parā hrīṃ kāmabījaṃ klī | vāruṇa va indraḥ la yoni e sabindu tena ble |) parā ca kāmabījaṃ ca vāruṇaṃ tvindrasaṃyutam | 
yoniyuktaṃ sabinduṃ ca tripuramālinī tataḥ || 9 || 
sādhyāsanāya mūle ca nama iti pravinyaset | 
(māyā hrī ramā śrī bālāyāstṛtīya sau |) māyābījaṃ ramābījaṃ kumāryāśca tṛtīyakam || 10 || 
tathā tripurasiddhānte sā(tripura ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhyasiddhāsanaṃ tataḥ | 
nābhideśe pravinyasya hṛdaye ca pravinyaset || 11 || 
(śivacandrau hakārasakārau vahnīti rakārāruḍhau vāgbhavaṃ aiṃ tena hasarai | kāmarājaśaktibījayorapi uktavarṇasayojanayā bījāntare bodhye kevalamantyakūṭe visargasthāne bindu sthāpya | tena hasakalarī | hasarau iti) śivacandrau vahnisaṃsthau vāgbhavaṃ tadanantaram | 
kāmarājaṃ kumāryāstu śivacandrānvitaṃ kuru || 12 || 
pṛthvībījāttato vahniṃ śaktibīje tataḥ param | 
śivavahnī niyojyaiva hitvā sargaṃ tu baindavam || 13 || 
saṃyojya parameśāni tripurāmbāpadaṃ tataḥ | 
pa(rvaṇa?ryaṅka)śaktipīṭhāya namo hṛdi pravinyaset || 14 || 
(vadanyeti saṃpatpradābhairavīvidyā sā yathā hasraiṃ hasakalarīṃ hasrauḥ iti |) vadanyāśeṣabījānte mahātripurabhaira(va?vī) | 
sadāśivamahāpretapadmāsanāya cālikhet || 15 || 
nama ityaja(baṃddhe?randhre)tu vinyaset sādhakottamaḥ | 
(vahni ra varuṇo va śakraṃ la ṣaṣṭhasvaraḥ nādādiyuktaḥ ū tena khalū iti vaśinīvāgdevatāvidyā iti|) vahnirvaruṇasakraṃ ca ṣaṣṭhasvaravibhūṣitam || 16 || 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ vaśinīti padaṃ tataḥ | 

<pṛ0 109> vāgdevatā caturthyantā namaḥ svaraiḥ pravinyaset || 17|| 
(mādana ka śakreti lakārārūḍha mahāmāyā hrī iti kāmeśvarī |) mādanaṃ śakramārūḍhaṃ mahāmāyā tataḥ param | 
iyaṃ kāmeśvarī jñeyā kavargeṇa lalāṭake || 18 || 
(dhāntaṃ na varuṇa va indra la caturthasvara ī teta navalī |) dhāntaṃ varuṇamindraṃ ca caturthasvarabindukam | 
eṣaiva modinī devī bhruvormadhye cavargake || 19 || 
(vāyuḥ ya purandara la tena blūṃ |) vāyuṃ purandaraṃ devi ṣaṣṭhasvaravibhūṣitam | 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ vimaleyaṃ samīritā || 20 || 
nyastavyā kaṇṭhadeśe tu ṭavargeṇaiva pārvati | 
(chāntaṃ ja bhānta sa jvalana ra turīyeti caturthasvara ī tena jmrīṃ |) chāntaṃ bhāntaṃ ca jvalanaṃ turīyasvarabindukam || 21 || 
aruṇeyaṃ tu vāgdevī tavargeṇa hṛdi smṛtā | 
jayinī ca tato devi (nakuli ha somaśakreti sakāralakārau |) nakuliḥ somaśakrakam || 22 || 
(vāruṇa va vāyu ya tathā ṣaṣṭhasvara tena hasalavayūṃ iti|) vāruṇaṃ vāyubījaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhasvaravibhūṣitam | 
nābhideśe samākhyātā pavargeṇa varānane || 23 || 
(jānta jha bhānta ma repha ra vāyu ya tathā ṣaṣṭhaḥ svaraḥ teta jhamarayū iti |) jāntaṃ bhāntaṃ tato rephaṃ vāyubījasamanvitam | 
ṣaṣṭhasvarasamāyuktaṃ nādabindukalāyutam || 24 || 
sarveśvarī(ṣa?ya)vargeṇa svādhiṣṭhānākhyapaṅkaje | 
(saṃvartaka kṣa kālo ma vahni ra māyā ī tena kṣamrī iti |) saṃvartakaṃ maheśāni kālabījoparisthitam || 25 || 
vahnibījaṃ tato māyā nādabindukalānvitā | 

<pṛ0 110> mūlādhāre śavargeṇa kaulinī parikīrtitā || 26 || 
etā vāgdevatā devi vaśinīvat pravinyaset | 
mūlavidyādvirāvṛttyā sarvāṅgulitaleṣu ca || 27 || 
ṅenteṣu parameśāni nyasedaṅgāni ṣaṭ kramāt | 
namaḥ svāhā vaṣaḍ vauṣaḍ huṃ phaḍiti ṣaḍaṅgakam || 28 || 
karayoratha vinyasya ṣaḍaṅgeṣu tathā nyaset | 
namo'ntaṃ hṛdayaṃ(ye ka pāṭhaḥ |) ṅentaṃ svāhāntaṃ ca tathā śiraḥ || 29 || 
śi(khare?khā va)ṣaṭ caturthyantā huṃ ṅentaṃ kavacaṃ tataḥ | 
netratrayaṃ ca vauṣaṭ ca astraṃ phaḍantamīśvari || 30 || 
(hṛdayamityādinā ṣaḍaṅganyāsamudrā nirdiśati |) hṛdayaṃ madhyamānāmātarjanībhiḥ smṛtaṃ śiraḥ (ta śiva ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
madhyamātarjanībhyāṃ syādaṅguṣṭhena śikhā priye || 31 || 
daśabhiḥ kavacaṃ proktaṃ tisṛbhirnetramīritam | 
tathaivoktāṅgulībhyāṃ ca saśabdamastramīritam || 32 || 
pūjā tapo'rcanaṃ homaḥ siddhamantrakṛtā api | 
aṅgavinyāsavidhurā na dāsyanti phalānyamī || 33 || 
vaśinīpramukhān devi vinyasettadanantaram | 
mūlakūṭatrayeṇaivaṃ sthāneṣveṣu kramānnyaset || 34 || 
(navayoninyāsamāha karṇayoriti | mūlabījatrayeṇaivāya kārya |) karṇayościbuke caiva śaṅkhayorvadane punaḥ | 
netrayornasi vinyasya aṃśa(aśa ka pāṭhaḥ |)yorjaṭhare tataḥ || 35 || 
punaḥ kurparayoḥ kukṣau jānunorliṅgamūrdhani | 

<pṛ0 111> pādayorguhyadeśe ca pārśvayorhṛdayāmbuje || 36 || 
stanayoḥ kaṇṭhadeśe ca nyasedevaṃ vidhānataḥ | 
caturvyūhaṃ tato devi nyaset pīṭhasamanvitam || 37 || 
(spaṣṭa yathā ai agnicakre kāmagiryālaye mitreśanāthātmake kāmeśvarīrudrātmaśaktiśrīpādukāyai nama ādhāre | evamagre'pi bodhyam |) mūlavāgbhavamuccārya agnicakrepadaṃ tataḥ | 
kāmagiryālaye paścānmitre(trī ka pāṭhaḥ |)śapadamuddharet || 38 || 
nāthātmakepadaṃ paścāt kāme(mī ka pāṭhaḥ |)śvarī padaṃ tataḥ | 
rudrātmaśaktiśabdācchrīpādukāyai namo nyaset || 39 || 
ādhāre parameśāni hṛdaye ca tataḥ param | 
mūladvi(ta?tī)yamuccārya sūryacakrepadaṃ tataḥ || 40 || 
jālandharapadāt pīṭhe śaṣṭhīśanāthaśabdataḥ | 
ātmakepadamābhāṣya vajreśvarīpadaṃ tataḥ || 41 || 
viṣṇvātmaśaktiśabdānte pūrvavacca tadīritam | 
śaktikūṭaṃ samuccārya somacakrepadaṃ tataḥ || 42 || 
pūrṇagiripadānte ca pīṭhepadamataḥ param | 
uḍḍīśaparato devi nāthātmakepadaṃ tataḥ || 43 || 
tadante yojayeddevi bhagapūrvā ca mālinī | 
brahmātmaśaktiśabdānte pūrvavad dvidale nyaset || 44 || 
turyabījamathoccārya brahmacakrepadāt tataḥ | 
tathaivoḍyānapīṭhe tu (va?ca)ryānāthātmakepadam || 45 || 
tadante parameśāni mahātripurasundarī | 

<pṛ0 112> para(ra ka pāṭhaḥ |)brahmātmaśaktyante pūrvavad brahmarandhrake || 46 || 
vinyasyaivaṃ maheśāni tattvanyāsaṃ samācaret | 
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ mūlāntaṃ punareva hi || 47 || 
mūlavāgbhavamuccārya ātmatattvapadaṃ tataḥ | 
(svā?vyā)pikāyai caturthyantā mahātripurasundarī || 48 || 
nama iti pravinyasya kāmarājamataḥ param | 
vidyātattvapadāt pūrvaṃ pūrvavad hṛdayāvadhi || 49 || 
nyase(ttvātmī?ttārtī)yabījānte śivatattvasvarūpiṇīm | 
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ tadādibhrūlatāvadhi || 50 || 
tato nyasenmahādevi vidyākūṭatrayaṃ pṛthak | 
karayormūlamadhyāgramūlahṛddhṛdyugāntare || 51 || 
mūlavidyātrayāvṛttyā sthāneṣveṣu kramānnyaset | 
brahmarandhre turīyaṃ ca tenaiva vyāpakaṃ nyaset || 52 || 
brahmarandhre tathādhāre hṛdi netratraye tathā | 
karṇayormukhavṛtte ca bhujayoḥ pṛṣṭhadeśake || 53 || 
jānudvaye tathā nābhau mūlavarṇān pravinyaset | 
svayaṃ mantratanurbhūtvā devīṃ mantramayīṃ yajet || 54 || 
trailokyamaruṇaṃ dhyāyañ śrīvidyāṃ manasi smaret | 
yonimudrāṃ maheśāni brahmarandhre pravinyaset || 55 || 
lalāṭe ca pravinyasya bhruvormadhye ca vinya(pra ka pāṭhaḥ |)set | 
mukhe kaṇṭhapradeśe tu hṛdaye tāmanukramāt || 56 || 

<pṛ0 113> nyāsaḥ saṃmohanākhyo'yaṃ trailokyamohanakṣamaḥ | 

śrīdevyuvāca 
antaryāgavidhiṃ brūhi bahiryāgavidhiṃ tathā || 57 || 

īśvara uvāca 
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yajanaṃ cāntaraṃ mahat | 
manojīvātma(naḥ?noḥ)śuddhiḥ prāṇāyāmena jāyate || 58 || 
antargataṃ yacca malaṃ tacca śuddhaṃ prajāyate | 
prāṇāyāmairvinā devi kṛtaṃ karma nirarthakam || 59 || 
prāṇāyāmātparaṃ tattvaṃ prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ tapaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ jñānaṃ prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ padam || 60 || 
prāṇāyāmātparaṃ yogaṃ prāṇāyāmātparaṃ dhanam | 
nāsti nāsti punarnāsti kathitaṃ tava suvrate || 61 || 
vatsarābhyāsayogena brahma sākṣādbhaved dhruvam | 
caitanyāvaraṇaṃ yadvat kṣīyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 62 || 
prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā muktimārge nāsti mayoditam | 
prāṇāyāmena munayaḥ siddhimā(hu ka pāṭhaḥ |)purnacānyathā || 63 || 
prāṇāyāmaparo yogī na yogī śiva eva saḥ | 
gamanāgamanaṃ vāyoḥ prāṇasya dhāraṇaṃ tathā || 64 || 
prāṇāyāma iti prokto yogaśāstraviśāradaiḥ | 
prāṇo vāyuriti khyāta āyāmastannirodhanam || 65 || 
prāṇāyāma iti prokto yogināṃ yogasādhanam | 
bāhyādāpūraṇaṃ vāyorudare pūrako bhavet || 66 || 

<pṛ0 114> saṃpūrṇakumbhavadvāyordhāraṇaṃ kumbhako(ka ka pāṭhaḥ |) bhavet | 
bahiryadrecanaṃ vāyorudarādrecako bhavet || 67 || 
pūrakaṃ ca yathāśaktyā kumbhakaṃ taccaturguṇam | 
kumbhakārdhaṃ bhavedrecaḥ prāṇāyāmo'yamīritaḥ || 68 || 
(prāṇāyāmamudrā nirdiśati kaniṣṭheyādinā |) kaniṣṭhānāmikāṅguṣṭhairyannāsāpuṭadhāraṇam | 
prāṇāyāmaḥ(ma ka pāṭhaḥ |) sa vijñeyastarjanīmadhyame vinā || 69 || 
vāmayā pūrayedvāyuṃ śanaiḥ śanaistu madhyayā | 
dhārayeddakṣayā(vāmayā ka pāṭhaḥ |) muñcedaparaṃ tat kramotkramāt || 70 || 
yāvacchakyaṃ niyamyāsūn manasaiva smaran parām | 
mantrasya mukhabījaṃ vā samastaṃ vā japan priye || 71 || 
mūlādhāre trikoṇākhye koṭisūryasamaprabhe | 
dhyāyet kuṇḍalinīṃ nityaṃ kālānala(kāmānanda ka pāṭhaḥ |)śikhopamām || 72 || 
raktāṃ sūkṣmāṃ ca viśvasya sṛṣṭisthitilayātmikām | 
viśvātītāṃ jñānarūpāṃ cintayedūrdhvavāhinīm || 73 || 
hūṃkāroccāraṇenaiva samutthā(ya?pya)parāṃ śive | 
ṣaṭcakraṃ ca vinirbhidya prāpayitvā paraṃ śivam || 74 || 
parā(ramā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nandena saṃyojya paramānandarūpiṇīm | 
tadabhedasamāpannāmanākulamanāḥ smaret || 75 || 
(śrā?srā)vayitvā su(rā?dhā)dhārāṃ prāpayecchaktimaṇḍalam | 
tenaiva cakrabhedena mūlādhāraṃ samānayet || 76 || 

<pṛ0 115> mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ bisatantusvarūpiṇīm | 
udyatsūryasahasrābhāṃ dhyāyenmantrātmadevatām || 77 || 
kuṇḍalīṃ trividhāṃ tatra tathā bījatrayaṃ tridhā | 
turīyāṃ kuṇḍalīṃ mūrdhni mahātripurasundarīm || 78 || 
vāgbhavaṃ mūladeśe ca dravatsvarṇanibhaṃ smaret | 
mūlādihṛdayaṃ yāvad vahnikuṇḍalinīṃ tathā || 79 || 
hṛdaye kāmarājaṃ ca sūryakoṭisamaprabham | 
sūryakuṇḍalinīṃ tatra sūryakoṭisamaprabhām || 80 || 
hṛdayādgalaparyantaṃ dhyāyedanākulaḥ śive | 
bhrūmadhye śaktibījaṃ tu candrakoṭisamaprabham || 81 || 
bhrūmadhyād brahmarandhrāntaṃ candrakuṇḍalinīṃ śive | 
candrakoṭisamaprakhyāṃ(śra?sra)vadamṛtavigrahām || 82 || 
bījatrayamayīṃ bindau turyāṃ(rīyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) bindutrayātmikām | 
deśakālānavacchinnāṃ sarvatejomayīṃ smaret || 83 || 
turyakuṇḍalinīṃ tadvatkevalaṃ jñānavigrahām | 
evaṃ dhyātvā punarvidyāṃ saṃpūrṇāṃ manasā smaret || 84 || 
cidānandamayīṃ svacchāmekātmakatayā priye | 
sudhāvṛṣṭyābhipatantyā tarpayet paradevatām || 85 || 
dhyātvā dhyātvā punardhyātvā sahajānandavigrahām | 
bindu(śru?sru)tasudhābhistu(dbhistu kha pāṭhaḥ |) tarpayecca punaḥ punaḥ || 86 || 
antaryāga iti prokto jīvato muktidāyakaḥ | 

<pṛ0 116> munīnāṃ ca mumukṣūṇāmadhikāro'tra kevalam || 87 || 
prātaḥ sāyaṃ carennityaṃ ṣoḍaśa prāṇasaṃyamān (mam ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
nāśayet sarvapāpāni tṛṇarāṇimivānalaḥ || 88 || 
sarveṣāmeva pāpānāṃ prāyaścittamidaṃ smṛtam | 
svadehasthaṃ yathā sarpaścarmotsṛjya nirāmayaḥ || 89 || 
prāṇāyāmāttathā muñjedavidyākāmakarmakam | 
paropapāpajaṃ pāpaṃ paradravyāpahārajam || 90 || 
parastrīmaithunotpannaṃ prāṇāyāmaśataṃ dahet | 
mahāpātakajātāni brahmahatyādikāni ca || 91 || 
sarvāṇyetāni dahyante prāṇāyāmacatuḥśataiḥ | 
(namaḥ?manaḥ)śaktiḥ samākhyātā pañcāsyāḥ(syā pañca ge ka pāṭhaḥ |) pañca dehagāḥ || 92 || 
ekarūpaṃ śivaṃ kṛtvā tadaṅke tāṃ niveśayet | 
śūnyarūpe pare sthāpya tāvubhau samamāsthitau || 93 || 
cintayet sādhako natvā nādarūpaṃ tayoḥ kramāt | 
tadantarmanasātmānaṃ jyotīrūpaṃ sanātanam || 
samādhinā samāgatya tyajet saṃsārabandhanam || 94 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde nityanyāsāntaryāgavidhinirūpaṇamekādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 11 || 

<pṛ0 117> [dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
athavā parameśānīṃ līlākalitavigrahām | 
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhyasthāṃ nigṛhyendriyamāna(saḥ?sam) || 1 || 
tanmanāḥ sādhakavaro manasā pūjayecchivām | 
vāmakarasya tarjanyāṃ dakṣiṇasya kaniṣṭhayā || 2 || 
tathā dakṣiṇatarjanyāṃ(nyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) vāmāṅguṣṭhena yojayet | 
unnataṃ dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhaṃ vāmasya madhyamādikāḥ || 3 || 
aṅgulīryojayet pṛṣṭhe dakṣiṇasya karasya ca | 
vāmasya(syā ka pāṭhaḥ |) pitṛtīrthena madhyamānāmike tathā || 4 || 
adhomukhe tu te kuryāddakṣiṇasya karasya ca | 
raktapuṣpaṃ gṛhītvaivaṃ vidhāya pāṇikacchapam || 5 || 
kuryāttad hṛdayāsannaṃ nimīlya(li ka pāṭhaḥ |) nayanadvayam | 
samakāyaśirogrīvaṃ kṛtāsanaparigrahaḥ || 6 || 
paśyanniva tato devīmekāgramanasā tataḥ | 
pratyakṣīkṛ(ta?tya) hṛdaye mānasairupacārakaiḥ || 7 || 
ṣoḍaśānāṃ prakāraistu hṛdisthāṃ pūjayecchivām | 
āsanaṃ prathamaṃ dadyādratnasiṃhāsanaṃ śubham || 8 || 
pādyaṃ caraṇayordadyācchirasyarghyaṃ nivedayet | 
paramāmṛtapānīyaṃ bhāvapuṣpaiḥ suvāsitam || 9 || 

<pṛ0 118> svarṇapātre jalaṃ kṛtvā tadyādācamanaṃ mukhe | 
madhuparkaṃ tato dadyāt punarācamanaṃ tataḥ || 10 || 
svavāme maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā paryaṅkaṃ paribhāvayet | 
śrīratnapāduke dattvā nītvā tāṃ snānamandire || 11 || 
bhadrāsanopaviṣṭāyā udvartanaṃ samācaret | 
ghṛtenodvartanaṃ kṛtvā manasā paribhāvayet || 12 ||  
karpūrāgurukastūryā(staryā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathā mṛgamadena ca | 
rocanākuṅkumairmiśrairnānāgandhasamanvitaiḥ || 13 || 
sugandhidivyatailaiśca snāpayet parameśvarīm | 
devakanyāsahasraistu svarṇakumbhasahasrakaiḥ || 14 || 
nadībhirnadarājaiśca apsarogaṇapannagaiḥ | 
siñcatā vāriṇā snātāṃ cintayet paradevatām || 15 || 
dukūlairmārjitaṃ gātraṃ dukule pari(dhetathā?dhāpya ca) | 
kaṃkatīkeśasaṃskāro vidhivadbandhanaṃ tathā || 16 || 
sūtrāvalīṃ(lī0 ka pāṭhaḥ |) keśapāśe sindūraṃ keśamadhyame | 
lalāṭe tilakaṃ dadyādalaktaṃ radanacchade || 17 || 
netreṣu hyañjanaṃ(rañjana ka pāṭhaḥ |) kṛtvā gandhairgātrānulepanam | 
kāñcanāñcitakañcūlīśobhanaṃ hṛdayopari || 18 || 
vibhūṣaṇaṃ tato dadyāt suvarṇarajatādinā | 
śiraḥkarṇagrīvādoṣasūjjva(dīti ujjva ka pāṭhaḥ |)lābharaṇāni ca || 19 || 
nūpurau ca tato dadyānmuktahāraṃ (nūpurau tato dadyādānandahāra ka pāṭhaḥ |) samujjvalam | 

<pṛ0 119> anyadābharaṇaṃ caiva yatra yena virājate || 20 || 
śrī(puna śrīra ka pāṭhaḥ |)ratnapāduke dattvā cakramadhye samānayet | 
gandhaṃ puṣpaṃ ca dhūpaṃ ca dīpaṃ naivedyameva ca || 21 || 
hemapātragataṃ divyaṃ paramānnaṃ susaṃskṛtam | 
kapilāghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ nānāvyañjanasaṃyutam || 22 || 
bhakṣyaṃ(kṣya ka pāṭhaḥ |) bhojyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ coṣyaṃ tathaiva ca | 
kṣīrapānīyasaṃyuktaṃ dadhimadhusamanvitam || 23 || 
sakarpūraṃ ca tāmbūlaṃ mānasaṃ parikalpayet | 
manasāpi mahādevyai naivedyaṃ dīyate yadi || 24 || 
yo naro bhaktisaṃyuktaḥ sa dīrghāyuḥ sukhī bhavet | 
mālyaṃ padmasahasrasya manasā yaḥ prayacchati || 25 || 
kalpakoṭisahasrāṇi kalpakoṭiśatāni ca | 
sthitvā tava pure śrīmān sārvabhaumo bhavet kṣitau || 26 || 
manasā tu mahādevyai yaḥ kuryācca pradakṣiṇam | 
sa dakṣiṇaṃ yamagṛhaṃ narakānnaiva(ni na ka pāṭhaḥ |) paśyati || 27 || 
namanaṃ mānasaṃ devyā yo bhaktyā kurute naraḥ | 
so'pi lokānvijityaiva naraloke mahīyate || 28 || 
mahāmāyāṃ mahādevīṃ samarcayāmi śaktitaḥ | 
nānāvidhaistu naivedyairiti cintākulastu yaḥ || 29 || 
naivedyaṃ dehi nitarāmiti yo bhāṣate muhuḥ | 
so'pi lokān vibhidyaiva devīloke mahīyate || 30 || 

<pṛ0 120> bahirvaccakrapūjāṃ ca manasaiva samācaret | 
navāvaraṇaśaktīnāṃ pūjanaṃ manasaiva hi || 31 || 
itthamantaḥ samārādhya manasaiva japenmanum | 
tadā bhavati siddhīśo devavadviharet kṣitau || 32 || 
evameva maheśāni pūjayāmi maheśvarīm | 
yogino munayaścaiva pūjayanti sadā priye || 33 || 
kevalaṃ mānasenaiva naiva siddho bhavedgṛhī | 
sabāhyena tu tenaiva gṛhastho munipuṅgavaḥ || 34 || 

pārvatyuvāca 
dhyānayogaṃ mahādeva śrotumicchāmi he prabho | 
saṃpūrṇaṃ kathayeśāna yena siddho bhavet paraḥ(nara ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 35 || 

īśvara uvāca 
vinā nyāsairvinā pūjāṃ vinā japya(yye ka pāṭhaḥ |)puraskriyām | 
dhyānayogādbhavet siddho nānyathā khalu pārvati || 36 || 
dhyānayogādahaṃ siddho viṣṇuścāpi pitāmahaḥ | 
dhyānayogāt paraṃ siddhā(ddho ka pāṭhaḥ |) mānavā api pāpinaḥ || 37 || 
sarvatantreṣu yadguhyaṃ sarvasiddhipradāyakam | 
vinā yena na sidhyanti varṣakoṭiśatairapi || 38 || 
dhyānayogaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvatattvapradāyakam | 
ekānte vijane ramye kṛtāsanaparigrahaḥ || 39 || 
nivṛttākhilacidvṛttirmudrāmudritavigrahaḥ | 
kāraṇānandasaṃdohairbahirantaḥprapūritaḥ || 40 || 

<pṛ0 121> gurūn natvā vidhānena so'hamityu(tipa ka pāṭhaḥ |)parodhataḥ | 
aikyaṃ saṃbhāvayeddhīmāñjīvasya brahmaṇo'pi ca || 41 || 
kāraṇe sarvabhūtānāṃ tattvānyapi ca cintayet | 
bījabhāvena līnāni vyutkramāt paramātmani || 42 || 
evaṃ vicintya deveśi pārthivāṃśaṃ jale gatam | 
jalaṃ tejasi līnaṃ ca tejo vāyau vicintayet (jala ca tejaso rūpa tejorūpa vicintayet | nirvāṇavāyunā vahni vāyunātra vicintayet || iti ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 43 || 
ākāśe saṃhṛtaṃ vāyu khaṃ ca manasi līyate | 
mano'haṃkāravaśagaṃ tathāhaṃ (tathā vai manasi ka pāṭhaḥ |) mahati sthitam || 44 || 
mahāntaṃ prakṛtau līnaṃ cintayet parameśvari | 
mumukṣuścintayellīnāṃ prakṛtiṃ paramātmani || 45 || 
nāho na rātrirna saṃdhyā na sūryo naiva candramāḥ | 
idaṃ tamomayaṃ sarvamāsīdbhuvanavarjitam || 46 || 
aprajñātamalakṣyaṃ ca prasuptamiva sarvataḥ | 
cintayitvā maheśāni na kiṃcidapi bhāvayet || 47 || 
ekamāsīt paraṃ brahma nityaṃ sūkṣmamatīndriyam | 
nityānandamayaṃ dhāma tejorūpaṃ sanātanam || 48 || 
tadeva prakṛtiḥ sā tu tejorūpā sanātanī | 
nityānandavapurdevī tadrūpā tatprakāśinī || 49 || 
tayoryogādabhūdvṛṣṭiḥ paramāmṛtarūpiṇī | 
paripūrṇamidaṃ devi samastaṃ plāvayet tathā || 50 || 

<pṛ0 122> tatrāmbhasi svamātmānaṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ | 
budbudaṃ cintayettatra prakṛtiṃ cintayet parām || 21 || 
prakṛtirhi mahāntaṃ vai ahaṃ ca mahatastathā | 
ahaṅkārānmanaścaiva manasaḥ khaṃ samutthitam || 52 || 
ākāśādvāyumu(mākṛ kha pāṭhaḥ |)tkṛṣya vāyostejaḥ samutthitam | 
tejaso jalamāsādya jalācca pṛthivīṃ smaret || 53 || 
bahiṣkṛtya yathāsthānaṃ niveśya vidhinā tataḥ | 
haimaṃ brahmāṇḍamebhiḥ syād bhūbījena dṛḍhaṃ smaret || 54 || 
praṇavena dvidhā kṛtvā jalaughaiḥ paripūrayet | 
brahmāṇḍābhyantare toyaṃ tadadho bhekamavyayam || 55 || 
tasya pṛṣṭhe mahādevi kālāgnirudrarūpakam | 
ādhāraśaktiṃ tatraiva mūlaprakṛtirūpiṇīm || 56 || 
brahmaśilāsamārūḍhāṃ kūrmākārāṃ śaśiprabhām | 
padmadvayadharāṃ devīṃ mūrdhani kūrmadhāriṇīm (karma ca mūrdhni dhāriṇīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 57 || 
nīlābhaṃ cintayet kūrmamanantaṃ kundasaṃnibham | 
tasya mūrdhni sthitaṃ devi śvetaṃ vārāharūpakam || 58 || 
tamālaśyāmalāṃ dante dhārayantaṃ vasundharām | 
tāṃ ca saṃcintayettatra nīlendīvaradhāriṇīm || 59 || 
cintayet salilaiḥ pūrṇāṃ catuḥsāgaramekhalām | 
tanmadhye cintayeddevi sudhāsāgaramadbhutam || 60 || 
raktābhamamṛtaṃ tatra śuddhalākṣārasopamam | 

<pṛ0 123> tanmadhye cintayeddevi dvīpaṃ vidrumasaṃnibham || 61 || 
girirājaśatākīrṇaṃ paritekṣuvanaṃ (aiśa pāṭha |) mahat | 
girau svarṇagiriṃ caiva kalpodyānaṃ girestaṭe || 62 || 
campakāśokapunnāgapāṭalaiḥ kuṭajaistathā | 
lavaṅgamādhavībilva(-)devadārunamerubhiḥ || 63 || 
mandārapārijātādyaiḥ kalpavṛkṣaiḥ supuṣpitaiḥ | 
sarvato'laṃkṛtaṃ divyairnityapuṣpaphaladrumaiḥ || 64 || 
candanaiḥ karṇikāraiśca mātuluṅgaiḥ karañjakaiḥ | 
drākṣekṣurambhājambūbhirmadhukairāmrakairapi || 65 || 
dāḍimīcūtapanasaiḥ pūgaiḥ karpūrakairapi | 
kadalīkundakharjūranārikelairalaṃkṛtam || 66 || 
kadambaiḥ karavīraiśca tagarairnāgakesaraiḥ | 
yā(pā kha pāṭhaḥ |)vantīsvarṇayūthī(thi ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhirvajrairdamanakairapi || 67 || 
mālatīmallikājātīketakīśatapatrakaiḥ | 
anyaiḥ sugandhipuṣpādyaiḥ śobhitaṃ yūthikādibhiḥ || 68 || 
anyonyāsaktavallībhirvṛkṣaṣaṇḍaiśca maṇḍitam | 
sarvartukusumopetairnamadbhirupaśobhitam || 69 || 
mandamārutasaṃbhinnakusumāmodadiṅmukham | 
utphullakusumāmodaprahṛṣyadbhṛṅgasaṃkulam || 70 || 
kūjatkokilasaṃghena(hena ka pāṭhaḥ |) vācālitadigantaram | 
kālameghasamālokanṛtyadbarhikadambakam || 71 || 

<pṛ0 124> śārikāśukabahulaiḥ kūjatkalaravairyutam | 
dvandvabhāvaṃ prakurvadbhirmṛgairnānāvidhairapi || 72 || 
saritsarobhira(rā ka pāṭhaḥ |)cchodaiḥ śobhitaṃ kumudotpalaiḥ | 
teṣu saraḥsu vipulaṃ mahārasarasāmṛtam || 73 || 
sarvato'laṃkṛtaṃ divyaṃ lasatkāñcanapaṅkajam | 
mattaṣaṭpadani(ryya?rju)ṣṭaṃ śakuntaiśca kalasvanaiḥ || 74 || 
haṃsakāraṇḍavākīrṇaṃ cakrāhvaiḥ sārasairapi | 
tanmahāsaraḥpuline ratnasopānamaṇḍite || 75 || 
mahārasarasāndolavīcivikṣepaśītale | 
sarvakāmadughaṃ divyaṃ sarvaratnasamanvitam || 76 || 
mauktikaiḥ kusumaiḥ sragbhirdukūlaiḥ svarṇatoraṇaiḥ | 
smaret kalpataruṃ tatra tadadho ratnabhūmikām || 77 || 
vistīrṇaṃ sumanovyāptāṃ (mahadvyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tanmadhye ratnamaṇḍapam | 
paritaḥ pārijātāḍhyaṃ bhāsvaraṃ śaśiśītalam || 78 || 
udyadādityasaṃkāśaṃ ratnasopānamaṇḍitam | 
śatayojanavistīrṇaṃ caturdvārasamanvitam || 79 ||  
dvārṣu vidrumadehalyābhātaṃ vajrakavāṭakam | 
ratnasaṃkḷptasaṃśobhikavāṭāṣṭakasaṃyutam || 80 || 
nānāratnaviśobhāḍhya(ḍya ka pāṭhaḥ |)ratnaprākāramaṇḍitam | 
navaratnasamākḷptatuṅgaprākāratoraṇam || 81 ||
tatra tatra viniḥkṣiptanānāratnopaśobhitam | 

<pṛ0 125> mahāmarakatasthalyā juṣṭaṃ (yuṣṭa ka pāṭhaḥ |) vidrumavedibhiḥ || 82 || 
śikhareṣvindranīleṣu hemakumbhairalaṃkṛtam | 
cakṣuṣmatpadmarāgāgrairvajrabhittiṣu nirgataiḥ || 83 || 
juṣṭaṃ (yu ka pāṭhaḥ |) vicitravaitānairmahā(rghyai?rghai)rhematoraṇaiḥ | 
sarvarddhyupacayairarkamaṇistambhairvirājitam || 84 || 
hemadaṇḍaśikhālambidhvajāvalipariṣkṛtam (skṛtam ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
svasvasthāna(sthi?kṛ)tāvasthairlokapālairadhiṣṭhitam || 85 || 
siddhacāraṇagandharvairvidyādharamahoragaiḥ | 
kinnarairapsarobhiśca krīḍadbhi(rdu?rju)ṣṭadiṅmukham || 86 || 
nṛtyasaṃgītaniratairamarastrīgaṇairyutam | 
navaratnasamābaddhastambharājivirājitam || 87 || 
taptahāṭakasaṃkḷptavātāyanamanoharam | 
nānāratnāṃśukodbaddhasuvarṇaśatakoṭibhiḥ || 88 || 
kiṃki(nī?ṇī)maṇisaṃnaddhapatākābhiralaṃkṛtam | 
mahāmāṇikyavaidūryaratnacāmarabhūṣitam || 89 || 
jātarūpamayai ratnaiścitritairativistṛtaiḥ | 
māṇikyaratnavaidūryasvarṇamālāvalīyutaiḥ || 90 || 
antarāntarasaṃbaddharatnairdṛṣṭimanoharaiḥ | 
vicitritaiścitravarṇairvitānairupaśobhitam || 91 || 
sthūlamuktāphaloddāmalambamānairalaṃkṛtam | 
uparyupari vinyastanilayeṣu pṛthak pṛthak || 92 || 

<pṛ0 126> kḷptaiḥ kaśi(mbu?pu)bhiḥ kāntaṃ paryaṅkavyajanāsanaiḥ | 
divyopakaraṇopetaṃ sarvakālasukhāvaham || 93 || 
dukūlakṣaumakau(ṣe?śe)yairnānāvarṇairvirājitam | 
sragbhirvicitrapuṣpābhirmañjuśiñja(jjaṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |)tṣaḍaṅghribhiḥ || 94 || 
candanāgurukarpūramṛganābhivilepitam | 
candanāgurukarpūradhūpitaṃ (pradhūpitam ka pāṭhaḥ |) sumanoharam || 95 || 
nānākusumasaurabhyavāhigandhavahānvitam | 
nandanodyānamadhyasthamadhaḥ kalpatarorapi || 96 || 
evaṃ saṃcintya manasā maṇḍapaṃ sumanoharam | 
tanmadhye sphuritaṃ dhyāyenmahāmāṇikyamaṇḍapam || 97 || 
śaraccandranibhacchatraṃ muktāmāṇikyamaṇḍitam | 
hemadaṇḍaśikhālambi śvetacāmarabhūṣitām || 98 || 
tadadhaḥsthāṃ smaredraktāṃ mahāmāṇikyavedikām | 
udyadarkendukiraṇāṃ caturasropaśobhitam || 99 || 
vedikā vedikāsthāne siṃhāsanaṃ tatopari (aiśa pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tasyāgneyādikoṇeṣu dharmādikāṃstu saṃsmaret || 100 || 
dikṣvadharmādikāṃstatra cintayedgātrarūpiṇaḥ | 
raktaśyāmaharidrendranīlābhān pādarūpiṇaḥ || 101 || 
vṛṣake(śavibhṛ?saribhū)tebharūpān dharmādikān smaret | 
prasūnatūlikāṃ tatra siṃhāsanasya madhyame || 102 || 
tanmadhye paramaṃ dhyāyet sarvatattvātmakāmbujam | 

<pṛ0 127> ānandakandamevātra saṃvinnālaṃ tathaiva ca || 103 || 
prakṛtivikārarūpadvātriṃśatpatrakesaram | 
pañcāśadvarṇabījāḍhyakarṇikāparimaṇḍitam || 104 || 
karṇikāyāṃ smaret sūryaṃ tanmadhye somamaṇḍalam | 
(somamaṇḍalamadhye tu saṃsmaredvahnimaṇḍalam) || 105 || 
vahnimaṇḍalamadhyasthe tu sattvaṃ ca paricintayet | 
rajaśca tatra saṃcintya tamo'pi ca tanmadhyataḥ || 106 || 
jñānatattvātmanaścaiva māyātattvātmanastathā | 
vidyātattvātmano devi kalātattvātmano yajet || 107 || 
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ | 
ete pañca mahāpretāścaturdiṅmadhyasaṃsthitāḥ || 108 || 
sadāśivoparigataṃ triśṛṅgajyotiravyayam | 
tasya madhye mahāpadmaṃ pīyūṣaparipūritam || 109 || 
sudhārṇavāsane tatra tripurāṃ prakaṭeśvarīm | 
potāmbujāsane tadvaccintayet tripureśvarīm || 110 || 
cintayet sādhako bhaktyā guptayoginyadhīśvarīm | 
ātmāsanagatāṃ tatra smaret tripurasundarīm || 111 || 
guptatareśvarīṃ devīṃ cakrāsane vicintayet | 
tripuravāsinīṃ devīṃ saṃpradāyagaṇeśvarīm || 112 || 
sarvamaṃtrāsane devi cintayet tripura(rāśri kha pāṭhaḥ |)śriyam | 
kulakauleśvarīṃ devīṃ sādhyāsanagatāṃ tataḥ || 113 || 

<pṛ0 128> tripuramālinīṃ prājñe nigarbhayoginīśvarīm | 
siddhāsane tataḥ paścāt siddhāṃ tripurapūrvikām || 114 || 
paryaṅkaśaktipīṭhe tu tripurāmbāṃ vicintayet | 
kāmeśvarāṅkaparyaṅkasamāsīnāṃ parāṃ kalām || 115 || 
raktapadmanibhāṃ devīṃ bālārkakiraṇāruṇām | 
japākusumasaṃkāśāṃ dāḍimīkusumaprabhām (mopamām ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 116 || 
padmarāgapratīkāśāṃ kuṅkumodakasaṃnibhām | 
sphuranmukuṭamāṇikyakiṅkiṇījālamaṇḍitām || 117 || 
kālālikulasaṃkāśakuṭilālakapallavām | 
pratyagrāruṇasaṃkāśavadanāmbhojamaṇḍalām || 118 || 
kiṃcidardhendukuṭilalalāṭamṛdupaṭṭikām | 
pinākadhanurākārasubhruvaṃ (bhrūlatā ka pāṭhaḥ |) parameśvarīm || 119 || 
ānandamuditollolalīlāndolita(lalita kha pāṭhaḥ |)locanām | 
sphuranmayūkhasaṃghātavilasaddhemakuṇḍalām || 120 || 
(lalita ka pāṭhaḥ |)sugaṇḍamaṇḍalābhogajitendvamṛtamaṇḍalām (ndusutalocanām ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
viśvakarmavini(dini ka pāṭhaḥ |)rmāṇasūtrasu(vi kha pāṭhaḥ |)spaṣṭanāsikām || 121 || 
tāmra(rakta kha pāṭhaḥ |)vidrumabimbābharaktoṣṭhī(ntarbimboṣṭhī ka pāṭhaḥ |)mamṛtopamām | 
dāḍimībījavajrābhadantapaṅktivirājitām (suśobhitām ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 122 || 
ratnadvīpasamudbhāsijihvāṃ madhurabhāṣiṇīm (sphuradbhāṣajihvāmūlavirājitām kha pāṭhaḥ | ida padyārdha ka pāṭhe nāsti |) | 

<pṛ0 129> smitamādhuryavijitamādhuryarasasāgarām || 123 || 
anaupamyaguṇopetacibukoddeśaśobhitām | 
kambugrīvāṃ mahādevīṃ mṛṇālalalitairbhujaiḥ || 124 || 
maṇikaṅkaṇakeyūrabhārakhinnaiḥ praśobhitām (bhūṣaṇai pariśobhitām ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
raktotpaladalākārasukumārakarāmbujām || 125 || 
karāmbujanakhajyotsnā(tirvi kha pāṭhaḥ |)virājitanabhaḥsthalām (līm ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
muktāhāralatopetapīnonnata(samunna ka pāṭhaḥ |)payodharām (pīnavṛttonnatakucā tanumadhyena śobhitāmityadhikaḥ pāṭhaḥ kha |) | 
trivalīvalanāyuktamadhyadeśasuśobhitām || 126 || 
lāvaṇyasaridāvarttākāranābhivibhūṣitām (suśobhitām ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
anargha(rghya ka pāṭhaḥ |)ratnaghaṭitakāñcīyuktanitambinīm || 127 || 
nitambabimbadviradaromarājīvarāṅkuśām | 
kadalīlalitastambhasukumārorumīśvarīm || 128 || 
lāvaṇyakandalī(kadalī kha pāṭhaḥ |)tulyajaṅghāyugalamaṇḍitām | 
gūḍhagulphapadadvandvaprapadājitakacchapām || 129 || 
nūpurairvilasatpādapaṅkajātimanoharām | 
brahmaviṣṇuśiroratnanirghṛṣṭacaraṇāmbujām || 130 || 
tanudīrghāṅgulībhāsvannakhacandravirājitām | 
śītāṃśuśatasaṃkāśakāntisaṃtānahāsinīm || 131 || 
lauhityajitasindūrajapādāḍimarāgiṇīm | 
raktavastraparīdhānāṃ raktābharaṇabhūṣitām || 132 || 

<pṛ0 130> icchāśaktimayaṃ pāśamaṅkuśaṃ jñānarūpiṇam | 
kriyāśaktimaye bāṇadhanuṣī dadhatīṃ parām || 133 || 
karpūraśakalonmiśratāmbūlapūritānanām | 
mahāmṛgamadoddāmakuṅkumāruṇavigrahām || 134 || 
sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyāṃ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitām | 
jagadāhlādajananīṃ jagadrañjanakāriṇīm || 135 || 
jagadākarṣaṇakarīṃ jagatkāraṇa(sthāpana kha pāṭhaḥ |)rūpiṇīm | 
sarvadeva(mantra ka pāṭhaḥ |)mayīṃ devīṃ sarvamantramayīṃ parām (saubhāgyasundarīm kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 136 || 
sarvalakṣmīmayīṃ sākṣā(nityā kha pāṭhaḥ |)tparamānandarūpiṇīm (sundarīm kha pāṭhaḥ |) |
nirlepaṃ nirguṇaṃ śuddhamātmānaṃ tripurāmayam || 137 || 
ātmābhedena saṃcintya yāti tanmayatāṃ naraḥ | 
(so kha pāṭhaḥ |)sāhamityasya satataṃ cintanāttanmayo bhavet || 138 || 
tāmeva cintayeddevi nānyat kiṃcittayā vinā | 
tattejobhiridaṃ sarvaṃ paripūrṇaṃ vibhāvayet || 139 || 
evaṃ bhāvanayāviṣṭo(dṛṣṭo kha pāṭhaḥ |) devavadviharet kṣitau | 
dhyānayogaparasyāsya pūjyo nāstīha kaścana || 140 || 
sa eva sukṛtī loke sa pūjyo natu pūjakaḥ | 
yogātmā yogavijjñānī sa devo natu mānuṣaḥ || 141 || 
saṃnyāsī sa ca vinyāsī yuktātmā sa munirmataḥ | 
nāsādhyaṃ vartate tasya sa siddho yogipuṅgavaḥ || 142 || 
indriyaprīṇanairdravyaistoṣayed bhūṣayet sadā | 

<pṛ0 131> ātmānameva satataṃ pūjayed devatādhiyā || 143 || 
devavadviharennityaṃ kāla(dhyāna ka pāṭhaḥ |)yogaparāyaṇaḥ | 
yat paśyati yacchṛṇoti gītanṛtyādikaṃ ca yat || 144 || 
paridadhāti yatkiṃcit svayaṃ yadanulimpati | 
hastyaśvarathakhaṭvādi yadārohati sādhakaḥ || 145 || 
yat karoti yadaśnāti tat sarvaṃ devatādhiyā | 
viṣayān viṣayī bhuṅkte yāneva svamanorathān || 146 || 
tattat samagramāsādya tatsarvaṃ devatādhiyā | 
jāgradādi suṣuptyantaṃ sarvaṃ taddevatādhiyā || 147 || 
divya eva bhavettatra na caivānyaḥ kadācana | 
tasmād divyaparo yastu devīmānandarūpiṇīm || 148 || 
pūjayet satataṃ bhaktyā mahātripurasundarīm | 
mokṣārthī labhate mokṣaṃ dhyānayogaparāyaṇaḥ || 149 || 
tāṃ tu yaścintayedrātrau bhogī dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ | 
kāmeśvarāṅkaparyaṅkasamāsīnāṃ parāṃ kalām || 150 || 
sarvāṅgasundarīṃ hṛdyāṃ prasādasumukhekṣaṇām | 
sakāraṇā(karuṇā kha pāṭhaḥ |)mabhidhyāyet sarvāṅgeṣu mano dadhat || 151 || 
caturvargaṃ kare tasya jīvanmuktaḥ sa eva hi | 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde dhyānayoganirūpaṇaṃ dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 12 || 

<pṛ0 132> [trayodaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śrīpārvatyuvāca 
bahiryāgavidhiṃ brūhi sāṅgena parameśvara | 
viśeṣārghasya(rghyasya ka pāṭhaḥ |) saṃsthānaṃ nityā(ja?ya)janameva ca || 1 || 

īśvara uvāca 
tādṛśīmambikāṃ dhyatvā tridhātmānaṃ ca tanmayam | 
tenaiva mūlamantreṇa śirodeśe tadeva hi || 2 || 
svakīye kusumaṃ dadyādaṅganyāsaṃ punastathā | 
caitanyaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ yad brahmaṃ(hmā ka pāṭhaḥ |) so'hamīśvaraḥ || 3 || 
so'hamityasya satataṃ cintanād devarūpatā | 
ātmano jāyate samyagbhāvanānnātra saṃśayaḥ || 4 || 
pūjopakaraṇasyāpi devatvamiha jāyate | 
sarveṣāṃ devatādṛṣṭyā jāyate śuddhatāpi ca || 5 || 
ahaṃ devo'tha naivedyaṃ puṣpagandhādikaṃ ca yat | 
devādhāro hyahaṃ devo na devo matparaḥ kvacit || 6 || 
devameva yaje cāhaṃ devadevo'hameva ca | 
yadi bāhyārcana(nā ka pāṭhaḥ |)dravyasaṃpattirapi vidyate || 7 || 
viśeṣārghyādikaṃ devi tadā kuryādatandritaḥ | 
pūjārghyapātraṃ naivaidyādyādhārapānapātrakam || 8 || 
sarvaṃ tāmramayaṃ kuryādyatkiṃcidiha pūjane | 
tāmre devāḥ pramodante tāmre devāḥ sthitāḥ sadā || 9 || 

<pṛ0 133> devīprītikaraṃ tāmraṃ tasmāt tāmraṃ prayojayet | 
śaṅkhaśuktirajata(jatsva ka pāṭhaḥ |)svarṇairdivyānāṃ pātramiṣyate || 10 || 
mahāśaṅkhaistu vīrāṇāṃ phalajaṃ vanavāsinām | 
aṣṭāṅgulasya na nyūnaṃ nādhikaṃ sārdhapāṇitaḥ || 11 || 
sarveṣāmeva pātrāṇāṃ mānamevaṃ vidhīyate | 
pañcaratnairmahādevyāḥ pañca pātrāṇi kārayet || 12 || 
sāmānyaṃ ca viśeṣaṃ ca pādyamācamanīyakam | 
kumbhaṃ cāpi prayatnena ratnaiḥ kuryādvibhūtaye || 13 || 
ratnaṃ gaganasaṃjñaṃ ca svargaratnaṃ tathaiva ca | 
martyapātālaratne ca nāgaratnaṃ tathaiva ca || 14 || 
gāruḍaṃ caiva māṇikyaṃ vajraṃ vaidūryameva ca | 
nīlaṃ ca kramato vidyāt pañca ratnāni yojayet || 15 || 
bījapañcakameteṣāṃ kramādvakṣye sudurlabham | 
gasau ca (sa?pa)manāḥ paścādindrasthāḥ (indrasthā iti lakārasthā tena glūṃ slūṃ plūṃ mlūṃ nlūṃ iti |) kramataḥ priye || 16 || 
nādabindukalāyuktā vāmakarṇavibhūṣitāḥ | 
tarpaṇārthaṃ viśeṣeṇa cakrapūjānivedane || 17 || 
śrīpātraṃ sādhayeddhīmān vidhinā sādhakottamaḥ | 
yonimudrāṃ vidhāyādau kuryādarghyasya sādhanam || 18 || 
ātmaśrīcakrayormadhye caturasraṃ tu kārayet | 
tanmadhye caiva ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tanmadhye vṛttamuttamam || 19 || 
trikoṇaṃ tatra saṃlikhya candanena varānane | 

<pṛ0 134> maṇḍalaṃ taṃ samabhyarcya sādhayedāsanaṃ tataḥ || 20 || 
bālābījatrayaṃ devi tatastripurasundarī | 
arghyapātrāsanaṃ caiva sādhayāmīti sādhayet || 21 || 
tathaivāstreṇa tu tathā (yutayā iti ka pāṭhaḥ |) sāmānyārghyodakena tu | 
prakṣālya parameśāni maṇḍale sthāpayettataḥ || 22 || 
vahnimaṇḍalarūpaṃ taṃ kalābhiḥ saha pūjayet | 
pūrvavat parameśāni pātraṃ prakṣālya sādhakaḥ || 23 || 
viśeṣārghyapadāt pātraṃ pratiśabdādanantaram | 
sthāpayāmīti manunā saṃsthāpya tadanantaram || 24 || 
sūryamaṇḍalarūpaṃ taṃ kalābhiḥ saha pūjayet | 
pūjayettaṃ vidhānena bindu(śru?sru)tasudhāmayaiḥ || 25 || 
mātṛkāṃ pra(kāprati ka pāṭhaḥ |)tilomena mūlābhimantritāmṛtaiḥ | 
ādimaiḥ pūrayedvāpi tathā puṣpāsavairapi || 26 || 
kapilāyāstathā kṣīrairnārikelāmṛtairapi | 
ikṣurasaiḥ sugandhaiśca madhuratritayena vā || 27 || 
pūrayet tanmahāpātraṃ nānādravyaiḥ kadācana | 
adhikāriprabhedena dravyabhedā bhavanti hi || 28 || 
svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ tatra karpūrāgurucandanaiḥ | 
rocanākuṅkumairmiśraṃ kastūrīparibhāvitam || 29 || 
nikṣipet parameśāni śarkarāṃ madhusaṃyutām | 
pūrvoktamaṇḍalaṃ tatra saṃcintya sādhakottamaḥ || 30 || 

<pṛ0 135> aṅkuśamudrayā paścāt tīrthaṃ vai prārthayet tataḥ | 
ṛjumadhyāmadhyaparvākrāntā tarjanyadhomukhī || 31 || 
vijñeyāṅkuśamudreyaṃ kuñcitā madhyaparvataḥ | 
sauramaṇḍalataḥ paścāt tīrthamāvāhayet tathā || 32 || 
gaṅgāvatāramantreṇa sarvaistīrthagaṇaiḥ saha | 
gaṅgāpi yamunāyāti pūjāpātrajalaṃ prati || 33 || 
mīnamudrāṃ vidhāyātha hastābhyāṃ pātramuttamam | 
ācchādya parameśāni cinmayaṃ tīrthamāgatam || 34 || 
adhomukhāvubhau hastau svasvopari ca saṃsthitau | 
pārśvadvayagatāṅguṣṭhau mīnamudreyamīritā || 35 || 
māṇikyaṃ mauktikaṃ devi vidrumaṃ gāruḍaṃ tathā | 
puṣparāgaṃ tathā vajraṃ nīlaṃ gomedakaṃ śubham || 36 || 
vaidūryaṃ navaratnāni tatrāmbhasi niyojayet | 
ratneśīṃ pūjayettatra sarvapāpapraṇāśinīm || 37 || 
śrībījaṃ ca parābījaṃ tathaiva bījapañcakam | 
pūrvabīje vilomena (tu kha pāṭhaḥ |) tatpaścādviniyojayet || 38 || 
dravyadoṣaharā devī ratneśīyaṃ navākṣarī | 
ṣaḍaṅgāni ca ṣaṭkoṇe pūrvoktāni prapūjayet || 39 || 
tanmadhye ca pareśāni (parameśāni kha pāṭhaḥ |) vṛttaṃ pūrṇendusaṃnibham | 
candramaṇḍalarūpaṃ tamamṛtaṃ paricintayet || 40 || 
kalābhistaṃ prapūjyātha cintayenmadhyamaṇḍalam | 

<pṛ0 136> akathāditrirekhāḍhyaṃ ha(ijñā ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṣābhyantaramadhyagam || 41 || 
tadagre kāmarūpaṃ ca jālandharaṃ ca vāmataḥ | 
dakṣe pūrṇagiriṃ caiva madhye caivoḍḍiyānakam || 42 || 
tatra tatra yajed devīṃ caturvyūhasvarūpiṇīm | 
sūryakoṭipratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭyayutaprabham || 43 || 
tathā daśabhujaṃ devaṃ pañcavaktraṃ trilocanam | 
khaḍgakhaṭvāṅga(kheṭaka ka pāṭhaḥ |)paṭṭīśamudgaraṃ śūlakuntakam (dantakam ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 44 || 
bibhrataṃ kheṭakaṃ śaktiṃ varadābhayapāṇi(na?ka)m | 
tasyotsaṅge (svadhāṃ?surāṃ)devīṃ candrakoṭyayutaprabhām || 45 || 
himakundendudhavalāṃ pūrvāyudhakarodyatām | 
prahasantīṃ viśālākṣīṃ devadevasya saṃmukhīm(khe ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 46 || 
evaṃ dhyātvā samāvāhya kulākulamayīṃ vibhuḥ | 
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ kuryānmudrayā dhenusaṃjñayā || 47 || 
avaguṇṭhya tato mantrī nīrajāyatalocane | 
sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt ṣaḍaṅgena ca pūrvavat || 48 || 
paramīkaraṇaṃ kuryānmahāmudrikayā tataḥ | 
mu(ṣa?sa)lamudrikāṃ yoniṃ gālinīṃ ca pradarśayet || 49 || 
vāmamuṣṭyantare'ṅguṣṭhe dakṣiṇe sa(vaśā?ralā)ṅgulīḥ | 
vāmāṅguṣṭhaṃ spṛśedagre yojitā dakṣiṇādadhaḥ (?) || 50 || 
muṣṭī kṛtvā tu hastābhyāṃ vāmasyopari dakṣiṇam | 
kuryānmu(ṣa?sa)lamudreyaṃ sarvavighnavināśinī || 51 || 

<pṛ0 137> kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhakau bhugnau (śaktau ka pāṭhaḥ |) karayoritaretaram | 
tarjanīmadhyamānāmāḥ saṃhatā bhugnavarjitāḥ || 52 || 
mudreyaṃ gālinī proktā paramāmṛtadāyinī | 
(śivacandrau hasau mātṛkānta kṣa kālo ma śakro la ambu va vahni ra vāyu ya vāmakarṇa ū tena hasakṣamalavarayū ānandabhairavāya vauṣaṭ | iti) śivacandrau mātṛkāntaṃ kālaśakrā(dyu?mbu)vahnayaḥ || 53 || 
vāyuśca vāmakarṇena yojitā bindunādinaḥ | 
bījametat samuccārya tathā cānandabhairavam || 54|| 
ṅentaṃ śikhāmantrayutaṃ punarbījāni saṃlikhet | 
(uktamantrasyādau sakāra hitvā vāmakarṇasthāne vāmākṣi īmiti yojyam | tena sahakṣamalavarayī surādevyai vauṣaṭ iti | vastutastu hitveti sthāne kṛtveti spaṣṭa0 pāṭho gurusaṃpradāyādanumantavya0 tena sakāramādita kṛtveti jñeya tata sahakṣametyādimantra0 |) candraṃ hitvā(dina kha pāṭhaḥ |)di (na?taḥ)kuryātkarṇe vāmākṣi yojayet || 55 || 
(svadhā?surā)devyai tato vauṣaṭ iyamānandabhairavī | 
anena tau tu saṃyojya paramānandananditau || 56 || 
tadāmṛte tayoryogādamṛtaṃ kṣarate'ciram | 
tayoḥ pañcopacāreṣu ṛcaḥ pañca niyojayet || 57 || 
prathama(ma ka pāṭhaḥ |)prakṛterhaṃsaḥ pra tadviṣṇuranantaram | 
traiyambakastṛtīyaḥ syāccaturthastatpadādikaḥ || 58 || 
viṣṇuryoniṃ-padādistu pañcamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 
daśadhā prajapedvidyāṃ saṃspṛśyāmṛtamadrije || 59 || 
vāgbhavaṃ kāmabījaṃ ca sargavān manuyug bhṛguḥ | 
tathāmṛtepadaṃ brūyāt paścādamṛtodbhave tathā || 60 || 

<pṛ0 138> amṛteśvari tathetyuktvā paścādamṛtavarṣiṇi | 
amṛtaṃ(śrā?srā)vayayugaṃ vahnijāyāvadhirmanuḥ (spaṣṭa yathā ai klī sau amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛteśvari amṛtavarṣiṇi amṛta sravaya 2 svāhā |) || 61 || 
vāgbhavaṃ vadayugmaṃ ca vāgvādini ca (tu kha pāṭhaḥ |) vāgbhavam | 
kāmabījaṃ klinne (klīnnetyu ka pāṭhaḥ |) coktvā kledini kledayeti ca || 62 || 
mahākṣobhaṃ kuruyugaṃ kāmabījamataḥ param | 
tārtīyaṃ mokṣamityuktvā kuruyugmaṃ vadettataḥ || 63 || 
śaktibījaṃ punaścānte saṃdīpanamanuḥ (ai vadavada vāgvādini aiṃ klī klenne kledini kledaya mahākṣobha kuru 2 klī sau0 mokṣa kuru 2 sau iti saṃdīpinīvidyā |) priye | 
saṃdīpanādikaṃ kṛtvā bodhinyā bodhayet tataḥ || 64 || 
kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā smarenmantraṃ (pūrvalikhita brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍasaṃbhūtamityādi mayi citsphuraṇā kuru ityantam iti paryāyarūpeṇādhika pāṭho dṛśyate |) varānane | 
evaṃ pātracatuṣkaṃ ca vaṭukādeḥ punarbhavet || 65 || 
gurūṇāṃ ca trayaṃ caikamekamevātmano bhavet | 
evaṃ bhavanti pātrāṇi navaiva hyuttamāni ca || 66 || 
pañcapātraṃ bhavenmadhye madhyamaṃ tvekapātrakam | 
gurave guru(pā?pu)trāya tatpatnyai tat samarpayet || 67 || 
(va?vī)raśaktyai (varaṃ?vīra)pātraṃ nivedyātmani yojayet | 
evamevārcanād devi bhavedamṛtamuttamam || 68 || 
kuśāgreṇa samādāya amṛtaṃ sarvapāvanam | 

<pṛ0 139> gurutrayaṃ ca saṃtarpya vaṭukādīn pratarpya ca || 69 || 
pralayānalasaṃkāśe cidagnau juhuyāt tataḥ (ayamatra mantra- ārdra jvalati jyotirevāhaṃ brahmāhamasmi sāhamasmi ahamevāha mā juhomi svāhā ||) | 
ātmanaḥ kuṇḍalinyāśca hutvā vai brahmarandhrake || 70 || 
bījatrayeṇa triḥ prāśya mudrayā tattvasaṃjñayā | 
viśuddhāntarmanāḥ pūto yogyaḥ syādyāgakarmaṇi || 71 || 
amṛtatvaṃ kavitvaṃ ca prāśyāmṛtaṃ labhennaraḥ | 
bhraṃśanādasya pātrasya bhūmau bindunipātanāt || 72 || 
aśubhaṃ syāt tadā tasya homācchāntirnacānyataḥ | 
prokṣayet tena cātmānaṃ mūlena vāruṇena vā || 73 || 
pūjopakaraṇaṃ cāpi trirabhyukṣya tathaiva hi | 
amṛtaiḥ prokṣitaṃ yattu sarvaṃ brahmamayaṃ bhavet || 74 || 
yadanyad dīyate dravyamalaṃkārādikaṃ ca yat | 
varuṇasyaiva bījena teṣāṃ prokṣaṇamācaret || 75 || 
sarveṣāṃ devamuccārya mūlamuccārya pūrvataḥ | 
arghyapātrasthatoyena pratināmnā nivedayet || 76 || 
anyatoyaistu saṃsṛṣṭamarghyapātrasthitetaraiḥ | 
tanna gṛhṇātīṣṭadevī dattaṃ vidhiśatairapi || 77 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde bahiryāgavidhau viśeṣārghyapātrādisādhanakramanirūpaṇaṃ trayodaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 13 || 

<pṛ0 140> [caturdaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
ādhāraśaktimārabhya kāmeśvarāntamadrije | 
pūjayet sādhako bhaktyā pīṭhaṃ mantramayaṃ puraḥ || 1 || 
oṃkārabindumadhyasthaṃ nāmadheyādyamakṣaram | 
devatānāṃ svabījaṃ tatpūjāyāmṛddhisiddhidam || 2 || 
kāmapīṭhaṃ tato dhyātvā pūjayet sādhakastathā | 
devaṃ kāmeśvaraṃ tatra hyekavaktraṃ caturbhujam || 3 || 
bhasmā(śru?ñci)taṃ madhyahṛdi raktāraktaṃ ca kuṅkumaiḥ | 
triśūlaṃ ca pinākaṃ ca vāmahastadvaye dhṛtam || 4 || 
utpalaṃ bījapūraṃ ca dakṣiṇadvitaye tathā | 
śvetapadmoparisthaṃ ca dhyātvā madhye prapūjayet || 5 || 
śaktyā yukto yadā devi sādhakaḥ paricintayet | 
āyudhā(nāma?nāṃ sva)rūpaṃ ca mūladevyāṃ (vyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) samaṃ niśi || 6 || 
śāṃbhavena (vākhyena ka pāṭhaḥ |) yajed devaṃ pūrvoktena ca sādhakaḥ | 
saptamyā mūlamuccārya mahātripurasundarī || 7 || 
amṛtapadamuccārya caitanyamūrtimāditaḥ | 
kalpayāmīti manunā mūrti saṃcintayet tathā || 8 || 
devīṃ kāmeśvarāṅkasthāṃ paramānandananditām | 
sādhakāya prayacchantīṃ puruṣārthacatuṣṭayam || 9 || 
ānandālasayā dṛṣṭyā vīkṣantīṃ karuṇārdrayā | 

<pṛ0 141> nārācamudrayā paścādrakṣāṃ mantreṇa kārayet || 100 || 
avaguṇṭhya tato mantrī kuryād digbandhanaṃ tataḥ | 
prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā gṛhṇīyāt kusumāñjalim || 11 || 
puṣpāñjaliṃ vinā devīṃ nāvāhayet kadācana | 
tato dhyāyenmahādevīṃ yathoktāṃ parameśvarīm || 12 || 
pratyakṣīkṛtya hṛdaye jitaprāṇo'tha sādhakaḥ | 
aikyaṃ saṃcintayed devyā bāhyāntarmūrtiyugmayoḥ || 13 || 
tatastu vāyubījena vahannāsāpuṭena tu | 
taccaitanyaṃ viniḥsārya puṣpāñjalau niveśayet || 14 || 
nāsikāvāyuniḥsārāt puṣpasthā devatā bhavet | 
yāvat saṃsthāpayed devīṃ svahastaṃ na viyojayet || 15 || 
kṛte viyoge hastasya puṣpāt tasmānmaheśvari | 
gandharvaiḥ pūjyate devī pūjakairnāpyate phalam || 16 || 
trikhaṇḍāmudrayā tasmāt tāmāvāhanavidyayā | 
nirgamayyātidīptābhāṃ śrīpīṭhāntarnidhārayet || 17 || 
pāṇidvayaṃ samaṃ samyak parivartanayogataḥ | 
yojayitvā tarjanībhyāmanāme dhārayet tataḥ || 18 || 
madhyame yojayenmadhye kaniṣṭhe tadadhastataḥ | 
aṅguṣṭhāvapi saṃyojyau tridhā yugmakrameṇa tu || 19 || 
trikhaṇḍeyaṃ mahāmudrā tripurāhvānakarmaṇi | 
hasa(hasa ka pāṭhaḥ |)bījasamārūḍhā bālā cāgnyāsanasthitā || 20 || 

<pṛ0 142> anayā(hasraiṃ hasakalarī hassrau iti trikhaṇḍāvidyā |)mūlamuccārya mudrayā ca trikhaṇḍayā | 
mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthe kāraṇānandavigrahe || 21 || 
sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvari | 
deveśi bhaktisulabhe parivārasamanvite || 22 || 
asyāṃ(mūrtau)samāgaccha sthitiṃ matkṛpayā kuru | 
ehi devi prabhāvāt te śubhade bhayanāśini || 23 || 
yāvat tvāṃ pūjayiṣyāmi tāvat tvaṃ susthirā bhava | 
kāmeśi tvamihāgaccha sarvaiḥ parikaraiḥ saha || 24 || 
pūjākarmaṇi sāṃnidhyamiha kalpaya kāminī | 
kāmeśvari samāgaccha kāmeśāṅkaniṣeduṣi || 25 || 
avyucchinnāṃ matiṃ śuddhāṃ vācaṃ kaṇṭhasya dehi me | 
evaṃ kṛte mahādevi sthitistasyāḥ prajāyate || 26 || 
samyak saṃpūritaḥ puṣpaiḥ karābhyāṃ kalpito'ñjaliḥ | 
āvāhanī samākhyātā mudrā sarvārthasādhikā || 27 || 
adhomukhīkṛtā saiva tadā vai sthāpanī bhavet | 
militaṃ muṣṭiyugalaṃ saṃnidhāpanarūpiṇī || 28 || 
antaraṅguṣṭhamuṣṭyā tu saṃnirodhanarūpiṇī | 
etasyā eva mudrāyāstarjanyau (savane?prasṛte) yadā || 29 || 
avaguṇṭhanamudreyaṃ sarvarakṣākarī matā | 
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt sādhako dhenumudrayā || 30 || 
parivartya karau paścāt tarjanīmadhyame yuge | 

<pṛ0 143> kaniṣṭhānāmikāyugmaṃ parasparayutaṃ kuru || 31 || 
dhenumudreyamākhyātā amṛtīkaraṇe priye | 
aṅgamantrān nyaset devi devyaṅge sādhakottamaḥ || 32 || 
sakalīkaraṇaṃ nāma mudreyaṃ vyāptirūpiṇī | 
anyonyagrathitāṅguṣṭhā prasāritaparāṅguliḥ || 33 || 
mahāmudreyamākhyātā paramīkaraṇe śive | 
tato'vaguṇṭhayed devīmavaguṇṭhanamudrayā || 34 || 
āvāhanaṃ bhaved devi dūrādāhvānameva ca | 
saṃsthāpanaṃ bhaved devi niścalatvopapādakam || 35 || 
naikaṭyāvasthititvaṃ ca saṃnidhānamitīritam | 
ananyacittatvayā(cchā?cñā)saṃnirodhanamucyate || 36 || 
saṃpūrṇāvasthiteryā(ccha?cñā)sakalīkaraṇaṃ priye | 
ayogyadṛṣṭyaviṣaya(yatā pā ka pāṭhaḥ |)pā(do?da)namavaguṇṭhanam || 37 || 
ānandapūrṇāva(sthiti?stha)tvamamṛtīkaraṇaṃ śive | 
sarvāparādhajātānāṃ sahiṣṇutvaprakāśakam || 38 || 
paramīkaraṇaṃ nāma saṃprārthanamihocyate | 
saṃmukhamudrayā devīṃ saṃmukhaṃ prārthayet tataḥ || 39 || 
muṣṭidvayasthitāṅguṣṭhau saṃmukhau ca parasparam | 
saṃśliṣṭāvucchritau kuryā(cchreya?tseyaṃ)saṃmukhamudrikā || 40 || 
mūlavidyāṃ samuccārya mahātripurasundarī | 
śrīpādukāṃ tataḥ paścāt pūjayāmīti bhaktitaḥ || 41 || 

<pṛ0 144> devīpādāmbujadvandve puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ diśet | 
tathaiva tarpayāmyante mudrayā tarpayet tridhā || 42 || 
prārthanamudrayā paścādabhyarthayedanena tu | 
prasādasaṃmukhe devi prasannā bhava sundari || 43 || 
pūjābhāgaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ māmakaṃ bhaktavatsale | 
ahaṃ yadyapi deveśi durbalo'pyalpasādhanaḥ || 44 || 
bhaktyā karomi pūjāṃ te kṛpayānugṛhāṇa mām | 
prasṛtāṅgulikau hastau mithaḥśliṣṭau ca saṃmukhau || 45 || 
kāryau ca hṛdaye seyaṃ mudrā prārthanasaṃjñikā | 
saṃdarśayet svasvabījapūrvaṃ mu(drāṃ ta?drāsta)to nava || 46 || 
saṃkṣobhadrāvaṇākarṣavaśyonmādamahāṅkuśāḥ | 
khecarībījayonyākhyā nava mudrāstataḥ kramāt || 47 || 
etā mudrā maheśāni ba(ndha?ndhū)kakuṅkumaprabhāḥ | 
svasvamudrā(drā ka pāṭhaḥ |)karāḥ sarvāḥ śrīvidyāsaṃmukhī(ḥ)smaret || 48 || 
athaivaṃ parameśānyā upacārān nivedayet | 
bhaktyaivaite kṛtā devi sādhakaṃ devasaṃnidhim || 49 || 
cārayanti yatastasmāducyante copacārakāḥ | 
samīpe cāraṇādvāpi(kalā?bāli)kānte tathoditāḥ || 50 || 
namontamāsanaṃ dadyāt svāgataṃ darśanaṃ bhavet | 
namontaṃ pādayoḥ pādyamarghya (śivo?namo)ntameva ca || 51 || 
svadhetyācamanaṃ (prājñi?proktaṃ) madhuparkastathaiva ca | 

<pṛ0 145> tenaiva manunācāmaṃ namontaṃ snānameva ca || 52 || 
namonte vāsasī prokte tathāṅgābharaṇāni ca | 
namontamarpayet(kundaṃ?gandhaṃ)puṣpaṃ ca (ca nāsti ka pāṭhaḥ |) vauṣaḍantakam || 53 || 
puṣpaṃ samarpayed devyai mudrayā jñānasaṃjñayā | 
aṅguṣṭhatarjanīyogāj jñānamudreyamīritā || 54 || 
namontaṃ ca tathā dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ (pamā ka pāṭhaḥ |) mālāṃ tathaiva ca | 
naivedyaṃ ca tato dadyādyathoktaṃ vai caturvidham || 55 || 
pānārthaṃ madhuraṃ vāri dadyādācamanaṃ punaḥ | 
karpūrasahitaṃ devyai tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet || 56 || 
tarpaṇāni punardadyāt tripurātattvamudrayā | 
aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogāt (ga ka pāṭhaḥ |) tattvamudreyamīritā || 57 || 
aṅguṣṭhaṃ śivamityāhuranāmā śaktirucyate | 
tarpaṇaṃ tu tayoryogādamṛtairvāmapāṇinā || 58 || 
yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha mudrāḥ saṃdarśayet kramāt | 
stutvā praṇamya vidhivajjapedvidyāmananyadhīḥ || 59 || 
japānte juhuyādagniṃ homānte balimutsṛjet | 
balidānāvasāne tu nivedyāni nivedayet || 60 || 
daśāṅgādyaistato dhūpaiḥ punardevīṃ pradhūpayet | 
dīpamālāḥ pradarśyātha pādāllalāṭakāvadhi || 61 || 
vīreśvarāya vauṣaṭ ca (ṣaḍiti ka pāṭhaḥ |) sindūraṃ dāpayedatha | 
aṅgarāgeṣu sindūraṃ pāneṣu madirāṃ tathā || 62 || 

<pṛ0 146> vastreṣu raktakauśeyaṃ(ṣeya ka pāṭhaḥ |) tripurāprītidāyakam | 
netrāñjanaṃ nivedyātha darśayed darpaṇaṃ tathā || 63 || 
mūrdhni cchatraṃ nidhāyātha bījayedraktacāmaraiḥ | 
sitairvā parameśānīṃ natu kṛṣṇaiḥ kadācana || 64 || 
vādaye(yañcha ka pāṭhaḥ |)cchaṅkhaghaṇṭe ca punaḥ punaḥ pradhūpayet | 
tataḥ saṃtoṣayed devīṃ gītavāditraniḥsvanaiḥ || 65 || 
vādyairnānāvidhairdevi krīḍākautukamaṅgalaiḥ | 
naṭanartakasaṃghai(hai ka pāṭhaḥ |)śca veśyābhirapi pārvati | 
ātmanā sarvabhāvena nivedya tanmayo bhavet || 66 || 

