<pṛ0 147> [pañcadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śrīdevyuvāca 
upacārān kathaṃ deva phalaṃ teṣāṃ ca kīdṛśam | 
yacca priyatamaṃ devyāstat sarvaṃ vada śaṃkara || 1 || 

īśvara uvāca 
upacārān pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu ṣoḍaśa pārvati | 
yaiḥ sākṣāt (syāt kha pāṭhaḥ |) tuṣyate devī vidhānairvihite(riḍite ka pāṭhaḥ |)rvi(duḥ bhuḥ) || 2 || 
sauvarṇa rājataṃ vāstraṃ tathā ratnavinirmitam | 
āsanaṃ prathamaṃ dadyāt pauṣpaṃ dāravameva vā || 3 || 
na patramāsanaṃ dadyāt kadācidiha pūjane | 
yathoktavidhinā devyai raktakambalameva vā || 4 || 
(sva ka pāṭhaḥ |)sumerupādapīṭhānte padmakalpita āsane (tamāsanam kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
bhogamokṣaprade mātastiṣṭhasva parameśvari || 5 || 
anenaivāsanaṃ devyai yo dadyādvihitaṃ śive | 
bhuktimuktī kare tasya sarvatra sthānavān bhavet || 6 || 
pā(dyā?dā)rthamudakaṃ pādyaṃ candanāgurusaṃyutam | 
suśītalaṃ(niveditamitiśeṣa |) mayā devi sukhāya tava pādayoḥ || 7 || 
tattaijasena pātreṇa śaṅkhenātha pradāpayet | 
dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ saṃsthānaṃ pādya(da ka pāṭhaḥ |)miṣyate || 8 || 

<pṛ0 148> pādyamantro mayā prokta(ma?stva)nenaiva nivedayet | 
arghyeṇa labhate kāmānarghyeṇa labhate dhanam || 9 || 
putrāyuḥ sukhamokṣā(ṇi?di) dānāda(rgha?rghya)sya vai labhet | 
pūrvasaṃsthāpitenaiva śaṅkhena vidhinā svayam || 10 || 
śvetasarṣapamudgābhyāṃ tilakṣīraistathā yavaiḥ | 
raktacandanapu(ṣpe ca? ṣpaiśca) tripurāyai maheśvari || 11 || 
nidhāya purato dadyādarghyamantreṇa sādhakaḥ | 
arghyamarghyamidaṃ devi mayā bhaktyā niveditam || 12 || 
sajalaṃ śaṅkhapātrastha gṛhītvā mūrdhni yojaya | 
udakaṃ dīyate ya(stu?ttu)sagandhaṃ phenavarjitam || 13 || 
ācamanā(dya?rthaṃ)devāya tadācamanamucyate | 
karpūravāsitairvāpi kālāgurupradhūpitaiḥ || 14 || 
yathā tathā sagandhairvā prasannaiḥ (ka?phe)navarjitaiḥ | 
dadyādācamanīyaṃ tu sagandhasalilaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 15 || 
taijasena tu pātreṇa śaṅkhenāpyathavā priye | 
āyurbalayaśovṛddhiṃ pradāyācamanīyakam || 16 || 
labhate sādhako nityaṃ(sa?kā)māṃścaiva yathepsitān (tam ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
sagandhācamanaṃ devi mayā bhaktyā niveditam || 17 || 
āyurbalayaśovṛddhyai tadidaṃ pratigṛhyatām | 
dadhi sarpirjalaṃ kṣaudraṃ sitābhiścāpi(pakṣabhiḥ?sekṣubhiḥ) || 18 || 
procyate madhuparkastu (rka tu ka pāṭhaḥ |) devīprītipradāyaka | 

<pṛ0 149> jalaṃ ca nārikelotthaṃ sitā dadhi ghṛtaṃ samam || 19 || 
sarveṣāmadhikaṃ kṣaudraṃ madhuparke prayojayet | 
taddadyāt kāṃsyapātreṇa ropyapātreṇa vā punaḥ || 20 || 
jyotiṣṭhomāśvamedhādau yat puṇyaṃ labhate naraḥ | 
sarvaṃ tat parameśāni madhuparke pratiṣṭhitam || 21 || 
ājyaṃ dadhi madhūnmiśraṃ jalaṃ cāpi saśarkaram | 
madhuparkaṃ ropyapātre (rauṣma ka pāṭhaḥ |) gṛhītvā bhuṅkṣva sundari || 22 || 
madhuparkaṃ vinā pūjā sādhakakṣayakāriṇī | 
madhuparkamadṛṣṭvaiva sādhakaṃ bhakṣayet parā || 23 || 
karpūrāgurukastūrīrocanākuṅkumaṃ tathā | 
nārikelajalaṃ kṣaudraṃ tathekṣurasamuttamam || 24 || 
sitā (tā kā pāṭhaḥ |) ca pañcagavyaṃ ca sarvauṣadhigaṇaṃ tathā | 
prānte toyamiti proktaṃ snānīyaṃ tripurāpriyam || 25 || 
bhṛṅgāreṇāthavā śaṅkhaistripurāyai nivedayet | 
sādhakaḥ snānadānāttu hayamedhaphalaṃ labhet || 26 || 
dīrghāyuḥ kāmabhogī ca mahāpātakahā bhavet | 
pratyekaṃ sarvavastūnāṃ sahasrapalamānataḥ || 27 || 
mahāsnānaṃ bhaveddevi madhyaṃ palaśatena tu | 
kaniṣṭhaṃ vai bhavet snānaṃ pa(lānāṃ?laiḥ) daśabhirīritam || 28 || 
miśrīkṛtaistu sarveṣāṃ snāmānaṃ na vidyate | 
sna(snā ka pāṭhaḥ |)payet prathamaṃ devīṃ tripāditi ṛcā punaḥ || 29 || 

<pṛ0 150> mūlenāpi tataḥ paścādamunā ca nivedayet | 
tvamāpaḥ pṛthivī (vī ka pāṭhaḥ |) caiva jyoti(staṃ?stvaṃ)vāyureva ca || 30 || 
kevalaṃ bhaktibhāvena devi tvāṃ snapayāmyaham | 
sna(snā ka pāṭhaḥ |)payitvā mahādevīṃ vastra yadi na dāpayet || 31 || 
sa nirlajjaḥ paraḥ pāpaḥ prapate(da?dvṛ)jinārṇave | 
vastrābhāve tato dadyādraktapadmaṃ tathā ja(vāḥ?pāḥ) || 32 || 
snapayitvā mahādevīṃ vastrayugmaṃ pradāpayet | 
vastreṇa hriyate lajjā vastreṇa hriyate tvagham || 33 || 
sarvabhūṣaṇavargeṣu vastramuttamamucyate | 
devīprītikaraṃ vastraṃ caturvargapradaṃ śubham || 34 || 
nirdaśaṃ malinaṃ jīrṇaṃ chinnaṃ gātrāvaliṅgitam | 
parakīyaṃ hyā(thu?khu)daṣṭaṃ sūcīviddhaṃ tathoṣitam || 35 || 
satpatākā(ri?vi)tānādau sūcividdhaṃ prayojayet | 
keśānvitamadhautaṃ ca śleṣmamūtrādidūṣitam || 36 || 
vahnidagdhaṃ kucailaṃ ca mahādevyai na dāpayet | 
citravastraṃ dukūlaṃ ca devīprītikaraṃ param || 37 || 
sarvasiddhipradaṃ vastraṃ vahniṣṭomaphalapradam | 
vidyātantusamāyukte mantravarṇasamanvite || 38 || 
vidyāvidye ja(vā?pā)śoṇavāsasī tava sundari | 
udyadādityasaṃkāśaṃ vāsoyugmaṃ sunirmalam || 39 || 
nūtanaṃ gātrasukhadaṃ paridhatsva sureśvari | 

<pṛ0 151> kirīṭaṃ ca śiroratnaṃ kuṇḍalaṃ ca lalāṭikā || 40 || 
tālapatraṃ ca hāraśca (ra ka pāṭhaḥ |) graiveyakamathormikā | 
sūtrāvalī keśapāśe tā(ḍa?ṭa)ṅkavalayā(ndadau?ṅgadāḥ) || 41 || 
pādāṅgu(rī?lī)yakaṃ sūtraṃ nūpuraṃ kṣudraghaṇṭikāḥ | 
alaṃkārāḥ samākhyātā alaṃkāreṣu ṣoḍaśa || 42 || 
caturvargapradaṃ nityaṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ sarvasaukhyadam | 
tuṣṭipuṣṭikaraṃ devyai (nitya ka pāṭhaḥ |) yathāśaktyā nivedayet || 43 || 
navaratnasamāyuktā drutahāṭakakalpitāḥ | 
gātrāṇi śobhayantvete alaṃkārāstu sundari || 44 || 
kāmeśi kāmarūpe tvaṃ sarvakāmaphalaprade | 
bhūṣaṇaṃ gṛhṇa cārvaṅgi mayā bhaktyā niveditam || 45 || 
cūrṇīkṛto vā ghṛṣṭo vā dāhākarṣita eva vā | 
rasaḥ saṃmardajo (samardaja ka pāṭhaḥ |) vāpi prāṇyaṅgodbhava eva vā || 46 || 
gandhaḥ pañcavidhaḥ prokto devīprītipradāyakaḥ | 
praśastagandhayu(ktā?ktyā)tu gandhacūrṇāni yāni ca || 47 || 
tāni gandhāhvayāni syuḥ sa gandhaḥ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
ghṛṣṭo malayajo gandhaḥ (sa?śa)balaśca nameruṇā || 48 || 
agurupra(bhū?bhṛ)tiścāpi yasya paṅkaḥ pradīyate | 
agurude(rurde ka pāṭhaḥ |)vadārvādi yo dagdhvā gṛhyate rasaḥ || 49 || 
sa dāhākarṣito gandhastṛtīyaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 
sagandhagandhinībilvatilakaṃ śatapatrikām || 50 || 

<pṛ0 152> niṣpīḍya gṛhyate yo'sau saṃmardajaḥ sa ucyate | 
mṛganābhisamudbhūtastatkośodbhava (ṣodbhava ka pāṭhaḥ |) eva vā || 51 || 
gandhaḥ prāṇyaṅgajaḥ proktaḥ pañcamastu sa ucyate | 
gandhasya vistaro bhedo diṅmātraṃ samudāhṛtam || 52 || 
sarveṣu gandhajāteṣu praśasto malayodbhavaḥ | 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena dadyānmalayajaṃ sadā || 53 || 
kuṅkumāgurukastūrīkarpūramalayodbhavaiḥ | 
samīkṛtaistu yo gandhastripurāprītidāyakaḥ || 54 || 
kucandanaṃ (śi?si)taṃ caiva kālīyakasamanvitam | 
anulepanamukhyaṃ tu devyāḥ prītikaraṃ param | 55 || 
alaktaṃ nakharāgeṣu devīprītikaraṃ tathā | 
gandhena labhate kāmān gandho dharmapradaḥ sadā || 56 || 
a(mvā?ṅgā)nāṃ sādhako gandho mokṣe cāpi pratiṣṭhitaḥ | 
śarīraṃ te na jānāmi ceṣṭāṃ(cai?ścai)va maheśvari || 57 || 
mayā niveditān gandhān pratigṛhya vilipyatām | 
gandhaiḥ sutoṣitā devī caturvargapradā bhavet || 58 || 
anenaiva maheśāni gandhān devyai nivedayet | 
ghṛtatailādiyogena svarṇādau dīpavahninā || 59 || 
yadañjanaṃ prajāyeta kṛtvā karpūramiśritam | 
dharmārthakāmamokṣāya tripurāyai nivedayet || 60 || 
vidhavā nā(ccha?ñja)naṃ kuryānmahāmāyārthamadrije | 

<pṛ0 153> na mṛtpātre gataṃ kuryāt sādhako netrarañjanam || 61 || 
na pūjāphalamāpnoti mṛtpātre vihitāñja(laiḥ?naiḥ) | 
parakīyāṃstathā ghrātān steyaṃ kṛ(tyā?tvā)bhimarditān || 62 || 
puṣpaṃ dhūpaṃ ca gandhaṃ ca nopaca(rān?ret) tathāparān | 
ghrātān nivedya deveśi naro namakamāpnuyāt || 63 || 
naiva paryuṣitaiḥ puṣpaiḥ patraiścāpi maheśvarīm | 
pūjayet parameśāni mahātripurasundarīm || 64 || 
sarvaṃ paryuṣitaṃ varjyaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ tathā | 
padmāni sitaraktāni kumudānyutpalāni ca || 65 || 
eṣāṃ paryuṣitāśaṅkā kāryā pañcadinordhvataḥ (rddhvataḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
anyeṣāṃ kusumānāṃ ca yāvadgandhaviparyayaḥ || 66 || 
bilvapatre maheśāni nāsti paryuṣitātmatā | 
bakulaṃ kesaraṃ vajraṃ mālyaṃ (lā kha pāṭhaḥ |) kundaṃ ca śālmalam || 67 || 
karavīraṃ cārkapuṣpaṃ bandhūkakamale tathā | 
mālatī mallikā jātī yūthikā mādhavī tathā || 68 || 
tagaraḥ karṇikāraśca droṇaścotpalacampakau | 
aśokaḥ kumudaścaiva śephālikākadambhakau || 69 || 
ketakī vanamālā ca kusumbhakiṃśukau tathā | 
kahlārabakule caiva lavaṅganāgakesarau || 70 || 
sarveṣu puṣpajāteṣu tripurāyāḥ sadaiva hi | 
etānyeva priyāṇi syurna patrairarcayecchivām || 71 || 
patreṣu bilvapatraṃ ca tathā madanapallavam | 

<pṛ0 154> dūrvāṅkuraṃ tathā pro(ktā?ktaṃ) nānyat patraṃ prayojayet || 72 || 
mallikā mālatī kundo droṇaścātha sitāmbujam | 
śuklapakṣe mahādevi tripurāyai nivedayet || 73 || 
sarveṣāṃ puṣpajātīnāṃ raktapadmaṃ tathā ja(vā?pā) | 
devīprītikaraṃ prājñe sarvakāmaphalapradam || 74 || 
ratnapuṣpaṃ ca deveśi tathā svarṇādinirmitam |
raktapadmena vajreṇa tulāṃ nāyāti karhicit || 75 || 
eteṣāṃ puṣpajātānāṃ yena kena vinirmitām | 
mālāṃ kṛtvā mahādevyai yat phalaṃ labhate naraḥ || 76 || 
api vaktrasahasraistadvaktuṃ(stu kha pāṭhaḥ |) nālaṃ tataḥ prabhuḥ | 
puṣpamūle vased brahmā puṣpamadhye tu keśavaḥ || 77 || 
puṣpāgre'haṃ sthito nityaṃ sarve devāḥ sthitā dale | 
carācarāśca sakalāḥ sadā puṣpavasāḥ smṛtāḥ || 78 || 
paraṃ jyotiḥ puṣpagataṃ puṣpeṇaiva prasīdati | 
bhogamokṣapradaṃ puṣpaṃ tuṣṭiśrīpuṣṭimodadam || 79 || 
puṣpairdevī prasannā syād dharmakāmārthadāyinī | 
tasmāt puṣpairyajed devīṃ nityaṃ bhaktiyuto naraḥ || 80 || 
brahmaviṣṇuśivādīnāṃ puṣpameva sadā priyam | 
tatte mātaḥ prayacchāmi pavitraṃ pratigṛhyatām || 81 || 
ugragandhamagandhaṃ ca kṛmikeśādidūṣitam | 
aśuddhapātrapāṇisthaṃ vāsobhiḥ kutsitātmabhiḥ || 82 || 
ānītaṃ nārpayed devyai pramādādapi doṣakṛt | 

<pṛ0 155> snā(tvā?tā)nītaiḥ paryuṣitairyācitaiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥ || 83 || 
svayaṃ vikā(śi?si)tairmuktaiḥ svayaṃ ca pātitairbhuvi | 
nārcayet kalikābhiśca vinā campakapaṅkajaiḥ || 84 || 
puṣpaṃ vā yadivā patraṃ phalaṃ neṣṭamadhomukham | 
duḥkhadaṃ tat samākhyātaṃ yathotpannatathārpaṇam || 85 || 
citrapūjāsu sarvāsu na viruddhaṃ na dūṣaṇam | 
adhomukhāparṇaṃ neṣṭaṃ puṣpāñjalividhiṃ vinā || 86 || 
kiṃcātibahunoktena sāmānyenedamucyate | 
uktā(nmu?nu)ktaistathā puṣpairjalajaiḥ sthalajairapi || 87 || 
patraiḥ sarvairyathālābhaṃ bhaktimān satataṃ yajet | 
puṣpābhāve yajet patraiḥ patrālābhe ca tatphalaiḥ || 88 || 
akṣatairvā jalairvāpi na pūjāṃ vyatilaṅghayet | 
eteṣāmapyalābhe tu mānasīṃ bhaktimāśrayet || 89 || 
dahyamānasya kāṣṭhādernistāpo yasya jāyate | 
nāsādirandhrasukhadaḥ sagandho'timanoharaḥ || 90 || 
sa dhūpa iti vijñeyo devīprītipradāyakaḥ | 
patraṃ (putra ka pāṭhaḥ |) mustaṃ nakhaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ jaṭā māṃsī ca śailajam || 91 || 
saralaṃ devakāṣṭhaṃ ca jatu sarjasacandanam | 
kapilāghṛta-karpūra-śarkarāgarumiśritam || 92 || 
ṣoḍaśāṅgo mahādhūpaḥ ṣoḍaśīprītidāyakaḥ | 
na bhūmau vitared dhūpaṃ nāsane kalaśe natu || 93 || 
yathā tathādhāragataṃ kṛtvā taṃ tu nivedayet | 

<pṛ0 156> vanaspatirasotpanno gandhāḍhyo gandha uttamaḥ || 94 || 
āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatām | 
atha dīpaṃ pravakṣyāmi jyotiṣṭomaphalapradam || 95 || 
ghṛtadīpastu(ṣu ka pāṭhaḥ |) prathamastilatailodbhavastataḥ | 
sārṣapaścādhamaḥ proktastadanyo ninditaḥ smṛtaḥ || 96 || 
padmasūtrabhavā cādyā kārpāsasaṃbhavā parā | 
darbhagarbhabhavā cāpi vartikā parikīrtitā || 97 || 
ko(ṣa?śa)jaṃ romajaṃ vāstraṃ tūlaṃ (malina ka pāṭhaḥ |) paryuṣitaṃ tathā | 
vartikārthaṃ na cādadyāt sādhako bhūtimicchukaḥ || 98 || 
taijasaṃ pārthivaṃ lauhaṃ dīpapātraṃ praśasyate | 
dīpavṛkṣāśca kartavyāstaijasādyāḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 99 || 
vṛkṣe dīpaḥ pradātavyo natu bhūmau kadācana | 
kurvantaṃ pṛthivītāpaṃ yo dīpamutsṛjennaraḥ || 100 || 
tāmisraṃ narakaṃ ghoramāpnotyeva na saṃśayaḥ | 
netrāhlādakaraḥ svarcirdūratāpavivarjitaḥ || 101 || 
saśikhaḥ śabdarahito nirdhūmo nātihrasvakaḥ | 
dīpavṛkṣasthite pātre śuddhasnehaprapūrite || 102 || 
dakṣiṇāvartavartyā vai cārudīptaḥ pradīpakaḥ | 
uttamaḥ procyate so'tra tripurāprītidāyakaḥ || 103 || 
vṛkṣeṇa varjito dīpo madhyamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 
vihīnaḥ pātratailābhyāma(dhya?dha)maḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 104 || 
dīpamālā prakartavyā naikadīpaḥ kadācana | 

<pṛ0 157> trayo dīpāḥ pradātavyāḥ pañca vā parameśvari || 105 || 
ito nyūnaṃ na dātavyaṃ tripurāyai kadācana | 
naiva dīpaḥ pradātavyo vidhūtaḥ śrīvivṛddhaye || 106 || 
na miśrīkṛtya dadyāt tu dīpasnehān ghṛtādikān | 
kṛtvā miśrīkṛtasnehaṃ rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 107 || 
naiva nirvāpayed dīpaṃ devārthamapi kalpitam | 
dīpahartā bhave(dga?da)ndhaḥ kā(no?ṇo)nirvāpako bhavet || 108 || 
na tena vyavahāro'pi kartavyaḥ sādhakottamaiḥ | 
sūryācandramasorjyotirvidyu(da?to')gnestathaiva ca || 109 || 
tvameva jyotiṣāṃ jyotirdīpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatām | 
dīpaṃ dakṣiṇato devyāḥ purato natu vāmataḥ || 110 || 
vāmatastu tathā dhūpamagre vā natu dakṣiṇe | 
nivedayet purobhāge gandhaṃ puṣpaṃ ca bhūṣaṇam || 111 || 
naivedyaṃ dakṣiṇe vāme purato vā na pṛṣṭhataḥ | 
gātre dātuṃ ca yadyogyaṃ yantreṣveva nivedayet || 112 || 
dadyādayogyaṃ purato naivedyaṃ bhojanādikam | 
madirāṃ pṛṣṭhato dadyādanyapānaṃ tu vāmataḥ || 113 || 
yā vidyā ceha deveśi śrīvidyāyāmanāsavā(yī ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
phalahīnā samākhyātā sābhicārāya kalpate || 114 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde pūjopacāratatphalavarṇanaṃ pañcadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] saṃpūrṇaḥ || 15 || 

<pṛ0 158> [ṣoḍaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
ikṣurasaṃ samādāya paryuṣitaṃ susaṃskṛtam | 
sahakārarasaṃ tatra nikṣipenmadhunā saha || 1 || 
bādaraṃ jāmbavaṃ caiva rasaṃ khārjūrameva ca | 
nārikelodbhavaṃ tatra drākṣārasamanuttamam || 2 || 
mohinīphalajaṃ cūrṇaṃ jātīkoṣarajastathā | 
kanakabījacūrṇaṃ ca jātīphalasamudbhavam || 3 || 
trijātaṃ trisugandhiṃ ca trikaṭuṃ triphalānvitam | 
tathānyeṣāṃ ca dravyāṇāṃ sugandhīnāṃ rajaḥ śive || 4 || 
kiṃcit kiṃcicca nikṣipya karpūrairadhi(ścā kha pāṭhaḥ |)vāsayet | 
svarṇe vā rājate pātre kā(ṭa?ca)puṭe'thavā priye || 5 || 
sthāpayitvā sitāṃ tatra nikṣipet parameśvari | 
nikṣipya lohitairdevi vastrairācchādya yatnataḥ || 6 || 
saptarātroṣitaṃ tattu jāyate hyamṛtopamam | 
candanāgurukarpūrairdhūpayitvā nivedayet || 7 || 
eṣā sarvottamā proktā devīpriyatamā sadā | 
madireti samākhyātā paramānandadāyinī || 8 || 
enāṃ nivedya sundaryai sarvasiddhimupālabhet | 
devīloke ciraṃ sthitvā tato rājā kṣitau bhavet || 9 || 

<pṛ0 159> tatrāpi cānayārādhya(dhyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) kaivalyaṃ muktimāpnuyāt | 
savikalpasya deveśi vihitaiṣā na cānyathā || 10 || 
nirvikalpasya deveśi surai(ra?va)vihitāgame | 
amṛtaṃ ca tadeva syānma(dā?dyaṃ)cāpi tadeva hi || 11 || 
nāpadyapi dvijo madyaṃ dadyād devyai kadācana | 
mohādyadi dadenmadyaṃ brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate || 12 || 
brahmaghātī sa eva syāttasmānmadyaṃ vivarjayet | 
madyameva purāsevyamāsīt kamalalocane || 13 || 
pītvā madyaṃ purā śukra ātmānaṃ cāpi(vismṛtaḥ?vyasmarat) | 
pītvā matto niśānāthaḥ patnīṃ tāṃ jagṛhe guroḥ || 14 || 
atastenāpi muninā śāpo dattaḥ sudāruṇaḥ | 
brahmā ca munibhiḥ sārdhamidameva purā jagau || 15 || 
mahādevyai dvijo madyaṃ yo dadyājjñānavihvalaḥ | 
paśubhāve sthito yaśca sa mahāpātakī bhavet || 16 || 
śeṣayorvihitaṃ madyaṃ nirvikalpakayoḥ punaḥ | 
nādyasya vihitaṃ tena brahmaghātī bhavecca saḥ || 17 || 
tenedaṃ pṛthivīkṣetre varjyamāsīt sulocane | 
jñānināṃ siddhidā ceyamamṛtatvapradāyinī || 18 || 
jñānena saṃskṛtā ceyaṃ mahāpātakanāśinī | 
brahmahatyā-surāpāna-svarṇasteyādipātakān || 19 || 
nāśayet pūjanā(ddheri?ddevi)nirvikalpo bhavedyadi | 

<pṛ0 160> nirvikalpo yadā madyaṃ mahādevyai nivedayet || 20 || 
aśvamedhasahasrasya agni(vahniṣṭo ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭomaśatasya ca | 
rājasūyaśatasyāpi phalamāpnotyasaṃśayam || 21 || 
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhīnāṃ nāyako jāyate'cirāt | 
savikalpo yadā devi pāpabhāṅ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 22 || 
sure cānaghadhāmāsi svā(dhā?hā)tvaṃ ca divaukasām | 
svadhā tvaṃ pitṛmukhyānāṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ ca siddhidā || 23 || 
kṣīrā(bdhi)matha(khane ka pāṭhaḥ |)ne pūrvamuddhṛtā devasaṃsadi | 
ānandabhairavī sārdhamānandabhairaveṇa tu || 24 || 
tvayi pra(sanna?sādaṃ)yātāyaṃ siddhireva na saṃśayaḥ | 
vimukhī cettadā tasya kulajñānavināśinī || 25 || 
prasannā khalu devānāṃ gandharvāṇāṃ tathaiva ca | 
vimukhī tvaṃ ca daityānāmasakṛt sarvanāśinī || 26 || 
tvāṃ(ma?da)dyāṃ va(da?ra)de devyai mayi citsphuraṇaṃ kuru | 
evaṃ stutvā surāṃ(rādavyai ka pāṭhaḥ |) devyai pūrvoktena ca saṃskṛtām || 27 || 
tripurāyai nivedyaiva nigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ | 
carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ ceti caturvidham || 28 || 
sarvayajñamayaṃ nityaṃ naivedyaṃ sarvatuṣṭidam | 
jñānadaṃ kāmadaṃ puṇyaṃ balārogyamayaṃ tathā || 29 || 
naivedyena labhet svargaṃ naivedyenāmṛtaṃ bhavet | 
dharmārthakāmamokṣāśca(kṣaśca ka pāṭhaḥ |) naivedyeṣu pratiṣṭhitāḥ(ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 30 || 

<pṛ0 161> tasmāt sarvaprayatnena naivedyaṃ khalu dāpayet | 
manasāpi mahādevyai naivedyaṃ dīyate yadi || 31 || 
yo naro bhaktisaṃyukto dīrghāyuḥ sa sukhī bhavet | 
haviḥ susaṃskṛtaṃ divyamājyayuktaṃ saśarkaram || 32 || 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ candrabimbasamaprabham | 
lasatta(ntu?ṇḍu)lajaṃ devi cārugandhasahaṃ mṛdu || 33 || 
sugandhiśā(dvi?li)jaṃ cā(tvaṃ?ru) madhumāṃsasamanvitam | 
apūpapāyasaṃ kṣīramannaṃ devyāḥ praśasyate || 34 || 
balidāneṣu vihitā ya eva mṛgapakṣiṇaḥ | 
teṣāṃ māṃsāni matsyāni deyāni vividhāni ca || 35 || 
sarvaṃ surabhigandhāḍhyaṃ vyañjanaṃ sumanoharam | 
yathā yathā bhavedbhakṣyaṃ yatnaṃ(yatnāt ka pāṭhaḥ |)(dravyaṃ?deyaṃ) tathā tathā || 36 || 
saṃskṛtya veśavārādyairmahādevyai nivedayet | 
yatpūtigandhasaṃyuktaṃ dagdhaṃ(dugdha ka pāṭhaḥ |) bhogabahiṣkṛtam || 37 || 
taduktamapi(yo?na)dadyāt tripurāyai kadācana | 
kālaśākaṃ kalāyaṃ ca pālakaṃ cāpi potikām || 38 || 
sārṣapaṃ mūlakaṃ cāpi vāstūkaṃ ca kalambikām | 
śākānetān mahādevyai yo dadyādbhaktisaṃyutaḥ || 39 || 
so'tulāṃ śriyamāpnoti devīloke mahīyate | 
māṣamu(gda?dga)masūrādyairvyañjanaṃ lavaṇānvitam || 40 || 
hiṅgujīramarīcādyairārdrakaiścāpi saṃskṛtam | 

<pṛ0 162> tintiḍīkhaṇḍasaṃyuktaṃ bhaktiyukto nivedya ca || 41 || 
jyotiṣṭomaphalaṃ labdhvā devīlokamavāpnuyāt | 
nānāvidhāni peyāni vyañjanāni bahūnyapi || 42 || 
kṣīrādīnyatha gavyāni māhiṣāṇi ca sarvaśaḥ |
āmikṣāṃ parameśānyai dadhi cāpi saśarkaram || 43 || 
pāyasaṃ śarkarāpūpaṃ kapilāghṛtasaṃyutam | 
pakvānnamatimiṣṭaṃ ca sitākarpūrasādhitam || 44 || 
śarkarālolitān kṛtvā vaṭakān kuṅkumāruṇān | 
saśarkaraṃ pakvadugdhaṃ kadalyādiphalānvitam || 45 || 
sitopadaṃśaṃ madyaṃ ca svarṇapātre nivedayet | 
athavā raupyapātre ca tāmrapātre'thavā punaḥ || 46 || 
abhāvāt padmapatre vā anyathā narakaṃ vrajet | 
āmamannaṃ mahādevyai naiva dadyāt kadācana || 47 || 
mantrakālāviśuddhāni naivedyāni kadācana | 
devebhyo nopayuñjīta(gurorvāme?puro vā sva)hiterataḥ || 48 || 
sitāsaṃmiśritāṃ dattvā surāṃ madhusamanvitām | 
devīloke ciraṃ sthitvā kaivalyaṃ muktimāpnuyāt || 49 || 
āmikṣayā samaṃ dattvā salilaṃ nārikelajam | 
kṣīrā(dya?jya)madhukarpūrasitādadhisamanvitam || 50 || 
trijātatrikaṭūnāṃ ca lavaṅgena dvayorapi | 
tathānyeṣāṃ ca vastūnāṃ cūrṇairgandhavatīṃ śive || 51 || 
sādhayitvā prakāreṇa vāsi(ta?tāṃ) gandhareṇubhiḥ | 

<pṛ0 163> yastaijasena pātreṇa peyaṃ devyai nivedayet || 52 || 
bhaktipravaṇa(ṇava ka pāṭhaḥ |)cittena tasya puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu | 
kalpakoṭisahasrāṇi kalpakoṭiśatāni ca || 53 || 
sthitvā devīpure śrīmān sārvabhaumo bhavet kṣitau | 
tataḥ paraṃ tu kaivalyamāpnoti ca yathecchayā || 54 || 
kevalaṃ nārikelāmbu dattvā devyai maheśvari | 
a(vahni ka pāṭhaḥ |)gniṣṭhomaphalaṃ labdhvā naraloke mahīyate || 55 || 
grāmyāraṇyaiḥ phalairdevīṃ sakalaiḥ paripūjayet | 
balipriyaṃ ca naivedyaṃ kaśerukaviṣādikam || 56 || 
ṛte śleṣmātakaṃ bilvaṃ śaunakaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ | 
phalānyayatnapakvāni nisargamadhurāṇi ca || 57 || 
supakvāni sugandhīni manoharāṇi yāni ca | 
evametāni śastāni nānyāni śubhadāni ca || 58 || 
sauvarṇe rājate vāpi tāmre vā prastare'pi ca | 
padmapatre'thavā dadyānnaivedyaṃ tripurāpriyam || 59 || 
nirācchādaṃ samālokya bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ | 
vāyubījena saṃśoṣya saṃdahedvahninā tathā || 60 || 
vāruṇena (sva?su)dhāvṛ(tyā?ṣṭyā)plāvayeddhenumudrayā | 
astramantreṇa saṃrakṣya mūlenaivābhiṣicya tu || 61 || 
mūladevyāḥ svanāmānte naivedyamiti coccaret | 
gṛhāṇa vahnijāyānto naivedyamanurīritaḥ || 62 || 

<pṛ0 164> annaṃ caturvidhaṃ devi rasaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samanvitam | 
mayā niveditaṃ bhaktyā tadidaṃ pratigṛhyatām || 63 || 
lehyacoṣyānupānādibhakṣya(tohyā?bhojyā)ni yāni ca | 
mayāhṛtāni yatnena (rū?kṛ)payā devi bhujyatām || 64 || 
jātīlavaṅgakakkolavāsitaṃ svardhunījalam | 
mukhavāsakaraṃ puṇyaṃ gṛhītvācāma sundari || 65 || 
mūlamantreṇa deveśi hunet pañcāhutīḥ kramāt | 
prāṇāpānau tathā vyānamudānaṃ ca samānakam || 66 || 
etatsvarūpaṃ jānīyādāhutīnāṃ ca pañcakam | 
pañcāṅgulībhireva syāt kramāt pañcāhutīḥ priye || 67 || 
punarācamanaṃ dattvā mukhavāsaṃ nivedayet | 
tāmbūlaṃ gandhasaṃyuktaṃ karpūrādisuvāsitam || 68 || 
saṃskṛtya vividhairdravyairgandhavadbhirnivedayet | 
stuvan nānāvidhaiḥ stotrairbhaktibhāvasamanvitaḥ || 69 || 
praṇamet parameśānīṃ (ni ka pāṭhaḥ |) vidhinā sādhakottamaḥ | 
devamānuṣagandharvā yakṣarākṣasapannagāḥ || 70 || 
namaskāreṇa tuṣyanti mahātmānaḥ samantataḥ |
namaskāreṇa labhate caturvargaṃ mahodayam || 71 || 
sarvatra sarvasiddhyarthaṃ natireva (tirekā pravartate kha pāṭhaḥ |) praśasyate | 
natvā vijayate lokān natvā dharmaḥ pravartate || 72 || 
namaskāreṇa dīrghāyuracchinnā labhate prajāḥ | 

<pṛ0 165> caturvargaṃ labhedbhakto na cirādeva sādhakaḥ || 73 || 
namaskāro mahāyajñaḥ prītidaḥ sarvataḥ sadā | 
namaskuru mahādevīṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ ca bhaktitaḥ || 74 || 
manasāpi mahādevyā yo bhaktyā kurute natim | 
so'pi lokān vinirjitya devīloke mahīyate || 75 || 
kāyiko vāgbhavaścaiva mānasastrividhaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
namaskārāśca vijñeyā uttamādhamamadhyamāḥ || 76 || 
kāyikaistu namaskārairdevāstuṣyanti sarvataḥ (sarvadā kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
namaskāreṣu sarveṣu kāyikaḥ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 77 || 
jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā saṃspṛśya śirasā kṣi(ta?ti)m | 
kriyate yo namaskāraḥ sa eva kāyikaḥ smṛtaḥ (procyate kāyikastu sa kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 78 || 
puṭīkṛtya karau śīrṣe namaskāraḥ pradīyate | 
aspṛṣṭvā jānuśīrṣābhyāṃ kṣitiṃ so'dhama ucyate || 79 || 
jānubhyāṃ kṣitimaspṛṣṭvā śirasāspṛśya medinīm | 
kriyate yo namaskāro madhyamaḥ kāyikastu saḥ || 80 || 
paurāṇikaistāntrikairvā mūlamantreṇa vā punaḥ | 
pradakṣiṇaṃ praṇāmaṃ ca kuryāddharmārthasādhanam || 81 || 
prasārya dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ svayaṃ namraśirāḥ punaḥ | 
dakṣiṇaṃ darśayan pārśvaṃ bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ || 82 || 
sakṛt pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā vartulākṛti sādhakaḥ | 
sa ca pradakṣiṇo jñeyaḥ sarvadevaugha(ka kha pāṭhaḥ |)tuṣṭidaḥ || 83 || 

<pṛ0 166> aṣṭottaraśataṃ yastu devyāḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇam | 
sa sarvakāmā(mamā kha pāṭhaḥ |)nāsādya paścānmokṣamavāpnuyāt || 84 || 
trikoṇamatha ṣaṭkoṇamardhacandraṃ pradakṣiṇam | 
daṇḍamaṣṭāṅgamugraṃ ca saptadhā natilakṣaṇam || 85 || 
dakṣiṇādvāyavīṃ gatvā diśaṃ tasmācca śāṃbhavīm | 
tato'pi dakṣiṇāṃ (da?ga)tvā namaskārastrikoṇavat || 86 || 
trikoṇākhyo namaskārastripurāprītidāyakaḥ | 
dakṣiṇādvāyavīṃ gatvā vāyavyāḥ śāṃbhavīṃ tathā || 87 || 
tato'pi dakṣiṇāṃ gatvā tāṃ tyaktvāgnau praviśya ca | 
agnito rākṣasīṃ gatvā kauberīṃ ca tato viśet || 88 || 
āgneyīṃ ca tato gatvā namaskāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ | 
ṣaṭkoṇākhyo namaskāro durgāyāḥ prītidāyakaḥ || 89 || 
dakṣiṇādvāyavīṃ gatvā tasmādvyāvṛtya dakṣiṇam | 
gatvā yo'sau namaskāraḥ so'rdhacandro mama priyaḥ || 90 || 
namaskāreṣu jānīyādāsāṃ prākṛtamadrije | 
tyaktvā svamāsanasthānaṃ paścādgatvā namaskṛtaḥ || 91 || 
nipatya daṇḍavad bhūmau nipatya hṛdayena ca | 
tathaiva daṇḍavad bhūmau daṇḍa ityucyate budhaiḥ || 92 || 
cibukena mukhenātha nāsayā hanukena ca | 
cakṣuṣā vātha karṇābhyāṃ brahmarandhreṇa caiva hi || 93 || 
tadaṣṭāṅmiti proktaṃ yadbhūmiṃ spṛśate kramāt | 

<pṛ0 167> brahmarandhreṇa saṃsparśaḥ kṣiteryasyā namaskṛteḥ || 94 || 
sa ugra iti vijñeyo viṣṇostuṣṭipradāyakaḥ | 
yat (yāsva kha pāṭhaḥ |) svayaṃ gadyapadyābhyāṃ (ga?gha)ṭitābhyāṃ namaskṛtiḥ || 95 || 
kriyate bhaktiyuktena vācikastūttamaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
paurāṇikairvaidikairvā tāntrikaiḥ kriyate natiḥ || 96 || 
sa madhyamo namaskāro bhavedvācanikaḥ (dācārata kha pāṭhaḥ |) sadā | 
pareṣāṃ gadyapadyābhyāṃ namaskāro yadā bhavet || 97 || 
sa vāciko'dhamo jñeyo namaskāreṣu sarvataḥ | 
iṣṭa(dhāmā?madhyā)niṣṭagatairmanobhistrividhaṃ bhavet || 98 || 
namanaṃ mānasaṃ proktamuttamādhamamadhyamam | 
trividhe ca namaskāre kāyikaścottamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 99 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde upacāraphalavidhinirūpaṇaṃ ṣoḍaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 16 || 

<pṛ0 168> [saptadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śrīdevyuvāca 
prakaṭādyāḥ kathaṃ deva pūjyante parameśvara | 
tat sarvaṃ kathayeśāna mudrāviracanaṃ tathā || 1 || 

īśvara uvāca 
tāstu prapūjayedbhaktyā sṛṣṭisthitilayakramaiḥ | 
mohanaṃ kṣobhaṇaṃ cakraṃ dakṣāvartakramādyajet || 2 || 
vāmāvartakrameṇaiva śeṣacakrāṇi pūjayet | 
ārabhya paścimād devi vāyavyantaṃ samāpayet || 3 || 
raśmivṛndāni te devi pūjayāmi vidhānataḥ | 
ājñāpaya jaganmātaryata(sta?stva)meva tāni(va?ca) || 4 || 
kṛtāñjalirmaheśāni devyājñāṃ sādhakottamaḥ | 
gṛhītvā pūjayet tuṣṭaḥ (ṣṭo ka pāṭhaḥ |) prāguktakramayogataḥ || 5 || 
pūjāvaraṇaśaktīnāṃ gandhapuṣpādbhirakṣataiḥ | 
jñānamudrānvitairdevi tarpaṇaṃ tattvamudrayā || 6 || 
(1) mahāyogīśvaraṃ devaṃ yoginaṃ karuṇāmayam | 
vāruṇaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya dakṣakarṇendubhūṣitam || 7 || 
buddhāya nama ityuktvā pūjayejjagadīśvaram | 
paścimādicaturdikṣu pūjayeda(ni?ṇi)mādikā || 8 || 
vāyavyādiṣu koṇeṣu vaśitvapramukhā(n?khāḥ)yajet |
prāptisiddhimadhobhāge sarvakāmāṃ (mā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathorddhvake || 9 || 

<pṛ0 169> māyālakṣmīsamāyogaṃ kṛtvā pūrvaṃ maheśvari | 
tathaiva siddhiśabdānte śrīpādukāṃ tato vadet || 10 || 
pūjayāmīti manunā pūjayeduktamārgataḥ | 
tathā dvitīyarekhāyāṃ brahmāṇyādyāḥ prapūjayet || 11 || 
asitāṅgaṃ ruruṃ caiva caṇḍaṃ krodhaṃ tathaiva ca | 
unmattaṃ ca tathā devi bhairavaṃ ca kapālinam || 12 || 
bhīṣaṇaṃ caiva saṃhāraṃ tābhiḥ saha prapūjayet | 
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīmukhyāstathā tṛtīyarekhagāḥ || 13 || 
karaśuddhikarīṃ pūrve (rīpūrvā ka pāṭhaḥ |) pūjayeccakranāyikām | 
dakṣiṇe pūjayed devyā mudrā saṃkṣobhakāriṇīm || 14 || 
a(ni?ṇi)māṃ pūjayedvāme buddhaṃ tasyāḥ puraḥ punaḥ | 
madhyame madhyataḥ kṛtvā kaniṣṭhe'ṅguṣṭha(bo?ro)dhite || 15 || 
tarjanyau daṇḍavat kṛtvā madhyamoparyanāmike | 
eṣā tu prathamā mudrā sarvasaṃkṣobhakāriṇī || 16 || 
(khā?thā)ntaṃ (thāntamityādinā drāṃ iti bījoddhāraḥ kṛta |) vahnisamārūḍhaṃ dvitīyasvarabhūṣitam | 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ bījaṃ tasyāḥ prakīrtitam || 17 || 
ādāya dakṣahastena viśeṣārghyodakaṃ tataḥ | 
bījadvayaṃ samābhāṣya tathaitāḥ prakaṭāstataḥ || 18 || 
yoginyaśca samudrāśca sasiddhayaśca sāyudhāḥ | 
tathā saparivārāśca sarvopacārakaistathā || 19 || 
trailokyamohane cakre tripurādhiṣṭhite tathā | 

<pṛ0 170> pūjitāstarpitāḥ santu devyā haste nivedayet || 20 || 
evamakhilacakrasthayoginīnāṃ mahaujasām | 
yathāva(daha?dukta)vākyena cakrapūjāṃ nivedayet || 21 || 
(1) māyālakṣmīkalābhistā nityāḥ kalāḥ prapūjayet | 
brahmā kamaṇḍaludharaścaturvakraścaturbhujaḥ || 22 || 
rājahaṃsasamāsīnaḥ prāṃśustuṅgāṃsa (śa ka pāṭhaḥ |) unnataḥ | 
sāvitrī vāmapārśvasthā dakṣiṇe ca sarasvatī || 23 || 
sarve devāḥ sthitāstvagre vedāḥ sarve'grataḥ sthitāḥ | 
varṇena raktagaurāṅgo japamā(na?lā)lasatkaraḥ || 24 || 
varābhayaprado devaḥ sarvalokapitāmahaḥ | 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya brahmaṇe nama ālikhet || 25 || 
anena manunā devi brahmāṇaṃ paripūjayet | 
bālayā yojitāṃ kṛtvā pūjayeccakranāyikām || 26 || 
darśayed(bhā?drā)viṇīṃ mudrāṃ tattadbījapuraskṛtām | 
(khā?thā)ntaṃ (thāntamityādinā drī iti drāviṇīmudrāyā bījoddhāraḥ |) vahnisamārūḍhaṃ turyasvaravibhūṣitam || 27 || 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ drāviṇībījamuttamam | 
sarvasaṃkṣobhamudrāyā madhyame sa(va?ra)le yadā || 28 || 
kriyete parameśāni sarvavidrāviṇī tadā | 
(3) śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ pañcavaktraṃ trilocanam || 29 || 
vyāghracarmasthite padme padmāsanagataṃ sadā | 
saṃśliṣyantamumāṃ devīṃ cāmarotpaladhāriṇīm || 30 || 

<pṛ0 171> dvibhujāṃ svarṇagaurāṅgīṃ saumyātisaumyarūpiṇīm | 
līlārabindaṃ(rā?vā)me(ṇa?na)pāṇinā bibhratīṃ sadā || 31 || 
śuklaṃ tu cāmaraṃ (da?dhṛ)tvā śivasyāṅge'tha dakṣiṇe | 
vinyasya dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ tiṣṭhantīṃ (ntī ka pāṭhaḥ |) paricintayet || 32 || 
trailokyajananīṃ devīṃ trailokyajanakaṃ śivam | 
umāmaheśvaraṃ dhyātvā mohayejjagatīmimām || 33 || 
kāmaṃ śakraṃ tathākāśaṃ (śatu ka pāṭhaḥ |) turīyamanubhūṣitam | 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ dvayaṃ bījaṃ tayoḥ kramāt || 34 || 
umā ṅentā (ntota ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathā ṅento maheśvaro hṛda(mvi?nvi)taḥ | 
mantrarājaḥ samākhyātaścaturvargaphalapradaḥ || 35 || 
anena tau samabhyarcya sarvasaṃkṣobhake tataḥ | 
anaṅgakusumāṃ pūrve kavargeṇaiva pūjayet || 36 || 
cavargeṇa ca deveśi dakṣiṇe'naṅgamekhalām | 
anaṅgamadanāṃ devi ṭavargeṇa ca paścime || 37 || 
tavargeṇottare bhāge pūjayenmadanāturām | 
tathaivānaṅgare(khāsu?khāṃ tu) pavargeṇa hutāśane || 38 || 
yavargeṇa ca deveśi nairṛte'naṅgaveginī(m) | 
śavargeṇa ca vāyavye'naṅgāṅkuśāṃ ca pūjayet || 39 || 
ḻakṣābhyāṃ parameśāni īśe cānaṅgamālinīm | 
proktasthāne samāvāhya pūjayeccakranāyikām || 40 || 
kāmabījaṃ puraskṛtya mudrāṃ saṃdarśayet tataḥ | 

<pṛ0 172> madhyamānāmikābhyāṃ tu kaniṣṭhānāmike same || 41 || 
aṅkuśākārarūpābhyāṃ madhyame parameśvari | 
iyamākarṣiṇī mudrā trailokyākarṣakāriṇī || 42 || 
(4) sarvasaubhāgyade cakre bhāskaraṃ paricintayet | 
padmarāgapratīkāśaṃ kirīṭāṅgadabhūṣaṇam || 43 || 
padmāsanasamāsīnaṃ svaśaktyāliṅgitaṃ vibhum | 
dadhānaṃ bāhubhirdevaṃ raktapadme (dmava ka pāṭhaḥ |) varābhayau || 44 || 
prāguktena tu mantreṇa bhāskaraṃ paripūjayet | 
saṃpradāyāḥ prapūjyaiva pūjayeccakranāyikām || 45 || 
vāruṇaṃ (vāra kha pāṭhaḥ |) (vaśyamudrāyā bījamuddharati vāruṇamiti vrūṃ** iti |) cendrabījasthaṃ (dakṣa?vāma)karṇavibhūṣitam | 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ bījaṃ vaśyakaraṃ mahat || 46 || 
puṭākārau karau kṛtvā tarjanyaṅkuśarūpiṇī | 
parivartakrameṇaiva madhyame tadadhogate || 47 || 
krameṇa devi tenaiva kaniṣṭhānāmike api | 
saṃyojya niviḍāḥ kāryāḥ sarvā aṅguṣṭhadeśataḥ || 48 || 
mudraiṣā parameśāni sarvavaśyakarī matā | 
(5) sarvārthasādhake cakre bāhye daśārake tataḥ || 49 || 
maṇimayama(had?hā)ratnapaṅkaje'timanohare | 
pīṭhe tasminniviṣṭasya pradyotanaśatadyuteḥ || 50 || 
taptakāñcanavarṇā(bhāvanato?bhavainate)yasya pārvati | 
āsīnamunnatāṃse ca viṣṇuṃ vidrumasaṃnibham || 51 || 

<pṛ0 173> svavāmorugatāṃ padmāṃ śliṣyantamaruṇekṣaṇam | 
pītavastraparīdhānaṃ (ca?sa)smitaṃ cārubhūṣaṇam || 52 || 
śaṅkhacakragadāpadmaṃ dadhānaṃ bāhubhiḥ sadā | 
cintayitvā maheśāni pūjayejjagadīśvaram (rīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 53 || 
mantrama(syāḥ?sya) pravakṣyāmi caturvargapradāyakam | 
kāmabījaṃ samuddhṛtya hṛṣīkeśamataḥ param || 54 || 
ṅentaṃ ca natisaṃyuktamanena taṃ prapūjayet | 
kulakaulāḥ prapūjyaiva pūjayeccakranāyikām || 55 || 
sarvonmādakarīṃ mudrāṃ darśayedbījapūrvikām | 
sasargo (bhṛgu sa sasargo visargasahita | iti sarvotmādinībījoddhāraḥ |) bhṛguretasyā bījametadudāhṛtam || 56 || 
saṃmukhau tu karau kṛtvā madhyamāmadhyage'ntyaje (me madhyame yajet ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
anāmike tu sarale tadbahistarjanīdvayam || 57 || 
daṇḍākārau tato'ṅguṣṭhau madhyamānakhadeśagau | 
mudraiṣonmādinī nāmnā kledinī sarvayoṣitām || 58 || 
(6) sarvarakṣākare cakre tathāntardaśakoṇake | 
trailokyamohanaṃ viṣṇuṃ dhyāyedbandhūkasaṃnibham || 59 || 
ja(vā?pā)kusumasaṃkāśaṃ dāḍimīkusumaprabham |
udyadādityasaṃkāśaṃ ratnasiṃhāsane'mbuje || 60 || 
padmāsanasamāsīnaṃ bhujaiścaturbhirāyataiḥ | 
pāśāṅkuśau ca dadhataṃ puṣpabāṇekṣukārmukam || 61 || 

<pṛ0 174> aruṇāyatalolākṣiyugalaṃ madaghūrṇitam | 
sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyaṃ kirīṭāṅgadabhūṣitam || 62 || 
raktamālāmbaradharaṃ raktagandhānulepinam | 
svavāmorugatāṃ śaktiṃ śliṣyantīṃ dakṣapāṇinā || 63 || 
vāmena pāṇinā padmaṃ dhārayantīṃ śucismitām | 
rucirāṅgadabhūṣāḍhyāṃ śuddhakṣomavirājitām || 64 || 
madanottaptahṛdayāṃ klidyadyoniṃ pareśvarīm | 
kalākalitama(ā)dhu(rāṃ?ryāṃ)taruṇīṃ yauvanānvitām || 65 || 
sakārmukabhujenaiva śliṣyantaṃ sṛdṛḍhaṃ tathā | 
ta(rja?jja)nitaparānandananditaṃ parameśvaram || 66 || 
nāgagandharvadevānāmaṅga(lā?nā)bhiḥ samāvṛtam | 
madanollalitāṅgābhirbhūṣitābhirvibhūṣaṇaiḥ || 67 || 
ātma(ā)bhedena yo dhyāyed devadevaṃ jagadgurum | 
trailokyamohanaṃ viṣṇuṃ trailokyamohano bhavet || 68 || 
bījamasya pravakṣyāmi lakṣmīnārāyaṇātmakam | 
(brahmā ka purandaro la māyāsvara ī nādādyupeta tena klīṃ iti |) brahmā purandaraḥ paścānmāyāsvaramataḥ param || 69 || 
nādabindukalāyuktaṃ bījaṃ trailokyapūjitam | 
śrutiṣu mathitasāraṃ devatākaṇṭa(hārakaṃ?kāriṃ) 
tribhuvana(śaṃkarī?śakāraṃ)śrīdhanādyarthakā(rakaṃ?ram) 
śamanabhayavināśaṃ sarvaśaṅkāpraṇāśaṃ 
bhavajaladhiviśoṣaṃ mānasā(ndha?ndhya)prakāśam (ida padya prakṣiptamiti pratibhāti |) 

<pṛ0 175> anena taṃ samabhyarcya niga(rva?rbha)yogi(nīṃ?nīḥ)yajet || 70 || 
nāyikāṃ tatra saṃpūjya mudrāṃ saṃdarśayet tathā | 
ta(asyā ka pāṭhaḥ |)(smāda?syāstva)nāmikāyugmamadhaḥ kṛtvāṅkuśākṛti || 71 || 
tarjanyāvapi tenaiva kramena viniyojayet | 
iyaṃ mahāṅkuśā mudrā sarvakāryārthasādhikā || 72 || 
(rephārūḍa kāmadeva kra | yodaśa svara tena kro iti |) kāmadevo'gnimārūḍho bindunādakalānvitaḥ | 
trayodaśasvaropeto mudrābījamitīritam || 73 || 
(7) aṣṭakoṇe maheśāni rahasyayoginīryajet | 
vaśinīpramukhāḥ sarvāḥ pūrvavadbījasaṃyutāḥ || 74 || 
pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti nyāsādeva viśeṣataḥ | 
cakreśvarīṃ (jñānātmikā ka pāṭhaḥ |) yajecchaktiṃ (bha?bhu)ktisiddhiṃ ca vāmataḥ || 75 || 
ta(daṅke?ddakṣe)khecarīmudrāṃ tāṃ ca saṃdarśayet tataḥ | 
savyaṃ dakṣiṇadeśe tu dakṣiṇaṃ vāmadeśataḥ || 76 || 
bāhuṃ kṛtvā maheśāni hastau saṃparivartya ca | 
kaniṣṭhānāmike devi yu(ktā?ktvā)tena krameṇa tu || 77 || 
tarjanībhyāṃ samākrānte sarvordhvamapi madhyame | 
aṅguṣṭhau ca maheśāni kārayet saralāviha || 78 || 
iyaṃ sā khecarī mudrā nāmnā sarvottamā priye | 
raciteyaṃ mahāmudrā sarvatejopahāriṇī || 79 || 
(śiva ha candra sa kānta kha pānta pha vahni repha ekādaśa svara e rthāt nādakalādiyuta tena hasakhaphre iti khecarīvidyā |) śivaṃ candraṃ tathā kāntaṃ pāntaṃ vahnisamanvitam | 

<pṛ0 176> ekādaśasvaropetaṃ bījaṃ tasyāḥ prakīrtitam (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 80 || 
(8) madhyatrikoṇacakre ca agradakṣottare śive | 
tā eva pūjayeddevi vinyāsoktavidhānataḥ || 81 || 
pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti viśeṣo'tra prakāśitaḥ | 
tripurā(pāṃ?mbāṃ)tu cakreśīmicchāsiddhiṃ ca vāmataḥ || 82 || 
parivartya karau spaṣṭāvardhacandrākṛtī priye | 
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayugalaṃ yugapat kārayet tataḥ || 83 || 
adhaḥ kaniṣṭhāvaṣṭabdhe madhyame viniyojayet | 
tathaiva kuṭile yojye sarvādhastādanāmike || 84 || 
bījamudreyamākhyātā parā trailokyamātṛkā | 
sadāśivasya bījāḍhyā (hsauṃ iti sadāśivabījam |) darśayitvā vidhānataḥ || 85 || 
(9) sarvānandamaye cakre brahmaviṣṇvīśarūpiṇīm | 
pūjayitvā vidhānena cakreśīmapi bhairavīm || 86 || 
jñānecchādikriyārūpāṃ mokṣasiddhiṃ ca vāmataḥ | 
siṃhaṃ ca purato devyā jagadādhāramarcitam || 87 || 
pūjayet satataṃ bhaktyā paśyantamambikāmukham | 
vāgbījaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya yonimudrāṃ pradarśayet || 88 || 
anāmikāyugaṃ devi parivartanayogataḥ | 
aṅkuśākārarūpābhyāṃ tarjanībhyāṃ tu dhārayet || 89 || 
madhyame kuru tanmadhye kaniṣṭhike tathāvidhe | 
daṇḍākārau tato'ṅguṣṭhau kaniṣṭhoparisaṃsthitau || 90 || 

<pṛ0 177> yonimudreyamākhyātā parā trailokyamātṛkā | 
atrapadaṃ samābhāṣya sarvānandamayāt tataḥ || 91 || 
cakrarājapadasyānte brahmasvarūpamālikhet | 
saṃvi(detya?nmaya)padaṃ brūyādbinducakre tataḥ param || 92 || 
eṣā parāparaśabdādrahasyayoginī tataḥ | 
brahmasvarūpiṇī paścānmahātripurasundarī || 93 || 
samudrā sāyudhā caiva savāhanā tathaiva ca | 
tathā saparivārānte sarvopacārakaistathā || 94 || 
pūjitāstu tathā devī tarpitāstviti (tamīti kha pāṭhaḥ |) pūrvavat | 
puṣpāñjalibhirabhyarcya tarpayedvidhinā tataḥ || 95 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde prakaṭāprakaṭādidevīpūjanakramanirūpaṇaṃ saptadaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 17 || 

<pṛ0 178> [aṣṭādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
prasādasumukhīṃ devīṃ bhāvayan prajapenmanum | 
sarvayajñeṣu sarvatra japayajñaḥ praśasyate || 1 || 
japāttuṣyanti devāśca japāt sidhyanti sādhakāḥ (kaḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena japaniṣṭhāparo bhavet || 2 || 
japaḥ syādakṣarāvṛttiradrutaṃ na vilambitam | 
pūjā dhyānaṃ japo homa iti dharmacatuṣṭayam || 3 || 
pratyahaṃ sādhakaḥ kuryāt svayaṃ cet siddhimicchati | 
japasyānte śivaṃ dhyāyed dhyānasyānte punarjapet || 4 || 
japadhyānasamāyuktaḥ śīghraṃ sidhyati mantravit | 
japarūpā śivā śaktirdhyānarūpaḥ sadāśivaḥ || 5 || 
tayoryogādbhavet siddhirnānyathā khalu pārvati | 
saṃyuktaṃ saṃyutaṃ kṛtvā yadayuktaṃ na yojayet || 6 || 
yathā siddhistathā mālā mālāṅgaṃ japakarmaṇi | 
mālayā japato nityaṃ siddhireva na saṃśayaḥ || 7 || 
āśusiddhikarī (ddhi ka pāṭhaḥ |) mālā varṇamayī samīritā |  
anulomavilomārṇairmātṛkāyāḥ sabindukaiḥ || 8 || 
(su?sa)merukaiḥ sadā kāryā mālā sarvasamṛddhi(jāḥ?dā) | 
aṣṭādhi(ke?kā)ṣṭavargaistu punareva samāpayet || 9 || 

<pṛ0 179> varṇenāntaritamastraṃ kṛtvā ja(pyeta?pettu)sādhakaḥ | 
mālābhāve tataḥ svāsu aṅgulīṣu japedbudhaḥ || 10 || 
nityaṃ japaṃ kare kuryānnatu kāmyaṃ kadācana | 
ārabhyānāmikāmadhyāt prādakṣi(ṇe?ṇye)na vai kramāt || 11 || 
tarjanīmūlaparyantaṃ japennavasu parvasu | 
tarjanyagre tathā madhye yo japet (tantra?mati)mānnaraḥ || 12 || 
catvāri tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo balam | 
anāmāmadhyaparvaṃ tu meruṃ (ru kha pāṭhaḥ |) kṛtvā na laṅghayet || 13 || 
meruṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kurvannanāmāmūlaparvataḥ | 
aṅgulīparvabhirmantraṃ japan rekhāṃ na saṃspṛśet || 14 || 
aṅgulīrnāpayuñjīta kiṃcidākuñcitā(ḥ) tale | 
aṅgulīnāṃ viyoge tu cchidreṇa (śra?sra)vate japaḥ || 15 || 
sphaṭikādibhirapyatra mālā japasamṛddhidā | 
nidhāya purato mālāṃ savyahastagatāṃ ca vā || 16 || 
japādau pūjayenmālāṃ toyairabhyukṣya yatnataḥ | 
iṣṭamantreṇa mālāyāḥ prokṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam || 17 || 
aiṃ māṃ māle mahāmāle sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi | 
caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava || 18 || 
candracandanakastūrī-rocanāgurukuṅkumaiḥ | 
pūjayitvā tato mālāṃ gṛhṇīyād dakṣapāṇinā || 19 || 
bījaṃ gaṇapateḥ pūrvamuccārya tadanantaram | 

<pṛ0 180> avighnaṃ kuru māle tvaṃ gṛhṇīyādityanena tu || 20 || 
yathā hastānna cyavate japataḥ (śra?sra)k tathācaret | 
hastāccyu(stacyu kha pāṭhaḥ |)tāyāṃ vighnaṃ syācchinnāyāṃ maraṇaṃ bhavet || 21 || 
yatnāt saṃgopayedenāṃ bhramayenna vi(dhā?dhū)nayet | 
guruṃ prakāśayennaiva yantraṃ mantraṃ kadācana || 22 || 
akṣamālāṃ ca mudrāṃ ca gurave'pi na darśayet | 
bhūtarākṣasavetālāḥ siddhagandharvacāraṇāḥ || 23 || 
haranti prakaṭaṃ yasmāt tasmādguptaṃ japet sadā | 
mālāṃ svahṛdayāsannāṃ dakṣiṇasya karasya ca || 24 || 
madhyamāyā madhyabhāge varjayitvā tu tarjanīm | 
anāmikākaniṣṭhābhyāṃ yutāyā namrabhāgataḥ || 25 || 
sthāpayitvā tatra mālāmaṅguṣṭhāgreṇa tadgatam | 
pratyekaṃ bījamādāya kuryādvāmena na spṛśet || 26 || 
prativāraṃ paṭhenmantraṃ śanairoṣṭhaṃ na cālayet | 
tarjanyā na spṛśenmālāṃ muktito gaṇanākramaḥ || 27 || 
aṅguṣṭhaparvamadhyasthāparivarttaṃ samācaret | 
aṅguṣṭhena vinā karma kṛtaṃ bhavati niṣphalam || 28 || 
aṅguṣṭhaṃ mokṣadaṃ devi tarjanī śatrunāśinī | 
madhyamā dhanasiddhau syācchāntikarmaṇyanāmikā || 29 || 
kaniṣṭhākarṣaṇe jñeyā japakarmaṇi siddhidā | 
mālābījaṃ tu japtavyaṃ spṛśennahi parasparam || 30 || 

<pṛ0 181> pūrvabījaṃ japan yastu parabījaṃ tu saṃspṛśet | 
aṅguṣṭhena bhavetta(sya?tra)niṣphalastasya tajjapaḥ || 31 || 
kiṭiśabdānvitā mālā cchinnabhinnāpivā bhavet | 
vāmorau dakṣapādaṃ ca vinyasya parameśvari || 32 || 
baddhavīrāsano mantrī diśaścānavalokayan | 
gurudaivatamantrāṇā(mekaṃ?maikyaṃ) saṃbhāvayan dhiyā || 33 || 
athavā cintayenmūrdhni guruṃ varṇādibhedataḥ | 
mantraṃ ca kaṇṭhato dhyātvā cintayan hṛdi devatām || 34 || 
nigadenopāṃśunā vā (vāpi ka pāṭhaḥ |) mānasenāthavā priye | 
japārambhaṃ sudhīḥ kuryād devatābhāvatatparaḥ || 35 || 
niḥśaṅkaḥ parameśāni spaṣṭavācā nigadyate | 
avyaktaḥ prasphuradvakra upāṃśuḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 36 || 
dhiyā yadakṣaraśreṇīṃ varṇasvarapadātmikām | 
uccaredanusaṃsmṛtya sa(bha?pro)kto mānaso japaḥ || 37 || 
sauṣumnādhvanyuccaritaṃ dhvanimātraṃ vibhāvayet | 
mantrākṣarāṇi cicchaktau protāni ca vibhāvayan || 38 || 
tāmeva parame vyomni paramāmṛtabṛṃhitaḥ | 
darśayatyātmasadbhāvaṃ pūjāhomādibhirvinā || 39 || 
manaḥ saṃhṛtya viṣayānma(dra?ntrā)rthagatamānasaḥ | 
na drutaṃ na vilambaṃ ca japenmauktikapaṅktivat || 40 || 
nigadena tu yajjaptaṃ lakṣamātraṃ varānane | 

<pṛ0 182> upāṃśūccāraṇaikena tulyaṃ bhavati śailaje || 41 || 
upāṃśulakṣamātraṃ tu yajjaptaṃ kamalekṣaṇe | 
mānasoccāraṇāttulyamekena varavarṇini || 42 || 
viśeṣāt tripurātantre praśasto mānaso japaḥ | 
manasā ca smaret stotraṃ vacasā vā japenmanum || 43 || 
ubhayaṃ niṣphalaṃ tasya bhinnabhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā | 
uttamo daśasāhasraḥ sahasro madhyamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 44 || 
adhamastu vijānīyādaṣṭottaraśataṃ śive | 
ito nyūnaṃ maheśāni na śastaṃ japakarmaṇi || 45 || 
yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāt saṃkhyayaiva prayatnataḥ | 
asaṃkhyātaṃ ca(sa?ya)jjaptaṃ tatsarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 46 || 
gṛhṇanti rākṣasā (ye?te)na gaṇayet sarvathā budhaḥ | 
naikavāsā japenmantraṃ bahuvastrākulo'pi vā || 47 || 
aprāvṛtakaro vāpi śirasā prāvṛto'pivā | 
cintāvyākulacitto vā kruddho vāpi tvarānvitaḥ || 48 || 
nirbodho'prītacitto na na rugno na kṣudhānvitaḥ | 
tathā cānyamanā bhūtvā pralapanna japenmanum || 49 || 
anāsīnaḥ śayāno vā gacchan bhuñjāna eva ca | 
yathāvidhi japaṃ kṛtvā mantreṇārghyodakena ca || 50 || 
japaṃ taṃ ca mahādevyā vāmahaste samarpayet | 
tejorūpaṃ japaphalaṃ śivayā svīkṛtaṃ smaret || 51 || 
śrībījenaiva pāṇibhyāmavatā(rārṇa?rya sva)śīrṣataḥ | 

<pṛ0 183> sārasvatena bījena hastābhyāṃ sthāpayet tataḥ || 52 || 
japakarmaṇi mālāyāḥ pratipattiriyaṃ priye | 
evaṃ yaḥ kurute mālāṃ jāpyaṃ ca sādhakaḥ priye || 53 || 
sa prāpnotīpsitaṃ devi hīnasyāyurviparyayaḥ | 
niḥsetuṃ ca yathā toyaṃ kṣaṇānnimnaṃ prasarpati || 54 || 
mantrastathaiva niḥsetuḥ kṣaṇāt kṣarati (naṃ?ma)ntriṇām | 
tasmāt sarveṣu mantreṣu sarve varṇā dvijādayaḥ || 55 || 
pārśvayoḥ setumāda(dhyāt?dhyuḥ)japakarmaṇi sādhakāḥ (ka ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
akāraṃ cāpyukāraṃ ca makāraṃ ca prajāpatiḥ || 56 || 
vedatrayāt samuddhṛtya praṇavaṃ nirmame purā | 
japādau japakarmānte praṇavaṃ seturūpakam || 57 || 
niyojayenmaheśāni sarvakāryārthasiddhaye | 
japānte juhuyādagniṃ daśāṃśaṃ japamānataḥ || 58 || 
tattu devyāḥ purobhāge sādhakaḥ parameśvarīm | 
homayet saṃskṛte vahnau tatra devīṃ dhiyā smaran || 59 || 
idaṃ tasyai samābhāṣya mūlamantreṇa sundari | 
svāhāntena ca hotavyaṃ pāyasairmadhurāplutaiḥ || 60 || 
vyastāvyastaṃ tato hutvā saṃbhave cānyadevatāḥ | 
ṣaḍāhutīḥ ṣaḍaṅgena nityahomo'yamīritaḥ || 61 || 
ekataḥ sarvakarmāṇi caikato japaho(nadhe?makam) | 
sarvādhikaṃ homakarma homāt kiṃvā na sādhyate || 62 || 

<pṛ0 184> anayā dīkṣito mantro yadi homavivarjitaḥ | 
trividhaṃ duḥkhamāpnoti nityahomaparo bhavet || 63 || 
akurvatāmagnihotramagnirbhūtvā maheśvarī (rīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
dhanāni śīghraṃ grasati gṛhakṣetrapaśūnapi || 64 || 
bahuduḥkhenārjitāni saṃcitānyacireṇa tu | 
ātmaprāṇādhikānyāśu bhū(tāgniṃ?tvāgniḥ)grasatīśvarī || 65 || 
agnihotraṃ sadā kuryāt (ta?ya)smādagnimayīśvarī | 
agnihotravidhānena saṃpadāṃ bhājanaṃ bhavet || 66 || 
agnihotraparasyeha vahnirbhavati śītalaḥ | 
gṛhakṣetrādivitteṣu vardhate jāṭharaḥ paraḥ || 67 || 
agnireva mukhaṃ devyāstasmādagnau hunet sadā | 
pakṣato māsato vāpi varṣato vā yathāvidhi || 68 || 
homāśaktau japedvidyāṃ homadviguṇasaṃkhyayā | 
stuvannānāvidhaiḥ stotraiḥ praṇamet sapradakṣiṇam || 69 || 
evaṃ nānāvidhairdevīṃ saṃtoṣya sādhakottamaḥ | 
bhaktipravaṇa(praṇava ka pāṭhaḥ |)cittena nivedyāni nivedayet || 70 || 
anulepaṃ ca sindūraṃ netrāñjanamanuttamam |
dhūpāmodaṃ pradīpāṃśca darpaṇaṃ vyajanaṃ tathā || 71 || 
chatraṃ ca cāmaraṃ caiva ghaṇṭānādamanuttamam | 
vādyaṃ gītaṃ tathā nṛtyaṃ krīḍākautukamaṅgale || 72 || 
nirmañchanaṃ ca siddhyarthai(ddhārthai ka pāṭhaḥ |)rdīpāvalibhireva ca | 

<pṛ0 185> dūrvārpaṇaṃ śirodeśe sākṣataṃ ca śanaiḥ śanaiḥ || 73 || 
bhaktipravaṇacittaṃ(ttena kha pāṭhaḥ |) ca dāsya(syāmyā ka pāṭhaḥ |)mātmanivedanam | 
evaṃ nivedayed devyai nivedyāni tathā budhaḥ || 74 || 
sa dhanyaḥ sarvalokānāṃ nānyaḥ pūjyaśca bhūtale | 
devatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ ca daityānāmatha rakṣasām || 75 || 
gandharvāṇāmaśeṣāṇāṃ nāgādīnāṃ mahātmanām | 
asmākaṃ cāpi sarveṣāṃ mānanīyaḥ surāsuraiḥ || 76 || 
sārvabhaumapadaṃ labdhvā kaivalyaṃ labhate tataḥ | 
anulipya mahādevīṃ vāsayejjagatīmimām || 77 || 
sindūraistilakaṃ devyai vaśyāḥ sarvāśca yoṣitaḥ | 
divyajñānaṃ bhavettasya(dehā?dattvā)ñjanamanuttamam || 78 || 
mālyādīnāṃ pradānena mahālakṣmīḥ sthirā gṛhe | 
tāmbūlasya pradānena pānīyasyāpi śobhane || 79 || 
sadānandamayo bhūyātsa(ma?dā) duḥkhavivarjitaḥ | 
dhūpaiḥ pradhūpitā devī dīpaiścāpi nirājitā || 80 || 
dadāti vittaṃ putrāṃśca dharāṃ bhūtimarogitām | 
dhānyaṃ (dhanyaścā kha pāṭhaḥ |)cāpyakhilān kāmānmatiṃ dharme tathā śubhām || 81 || 
darpaṇaṃ darśayitvaiva sārūpyaṃ labhate vibhoḥ | 
vyajanaiścāmarairvāpi vyajayitvā maheśvarīm || 82 || 
taṃ vyajayenmahālakṣmīścāmaradvayadhāriṇī | 
nimeṣārdhaṃ mahādevyāśchatraṃ copari dhārayet || 83 || 

<pṛ0 186> tasyopari mahacchatraṃ paripūrṇendusodaram | 
lokapālaiḥ sahāgatya dhārayet tridaśeśvaraḥ (sarvajit tridaśāpati ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 84 || 
ghaṇṭāśaṅkhanidānena toṣayedyo maheśvarīm | 
bherīdundubhivādyaiśca marutvāṃstamanuvrajet || 85 || 
(apā?yo'pi)no vādayed ghaṇṭāṃ śaṅkhaṃ vā svayameva hi | 
sa nirlajjaḥ kathaṃ brūte pūjayāmi maheśvarīm || 86 || 
brahmā viṣṇurharaścānye sarve śaṅkhādivādinaḥ | 
śaṅkhaghaṇṭādi(ṇṭāmayasta ka pāṭhaḥ |)kāṃstasmād vādayeddevasaṃnidhau || 87 || 
vādyaṃ yaḥ kārayeddevyai gītaṃ nṛtyaṃ tathaiva ca | 
tumbarurnāradaścaiva hāhā hūhūstathaiva ca || 88 || 
prasādayanti taṃ nityaṃ vidyādha(rā?ryo)'psarādayaḥ | 
suvāsinyo madaproḍhā veśayitvā yathāvidhi || 89 || 
veśyāstvalaṃkṛtāḥ sarvāḥ krīḍayeyuralaṃ yadi | 
devīmuddiśya puratastasya puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu || 90 | 
urvaśīpramukhāstaṃ (khā veśyāsta ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca krīḍayeyuralaṃ mudā | 
kautukaṃ kārayeddevyai hāsyānandāya yadbhavet || 91 || 
tena pramudito nityaṃ devīloke mahīyate | 
maṅgalāni mahādevyai kārayitvā yathāvidhi || 92 || 
vimānavaramāruhya brahmaviṣṇupuraḥsaram | 
sarvakāmasukhaṃ divyaṃ sarvaratnasamanvitam (tā ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 93 || 
anuvra(jaṃ?ji)tamindrādyaiḥ sapatnīkaiḥ savāhanaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 187> devīloke samāyāntaṃ samāgatya surāṅganāḥ || 94 || 
arundhatyatha sāvitrī tamahalyā śacī tathā | 
anusūyāditiścaiva mātaraśca (māraścaiva ka pāṭhaḥ |) sahānugāḥ || 95 || 
nirmañchya mauktikairdivyai ratnadīpairnivedya ca | 
akṣayaṃ maṅgalaṃ śīrṣe tarpayanti mudānvitāḥ || 96 || 
gośṛṅgopari yatkālaṃ tiṣṭhetsarṣapamarpitam | 
tāvaccitte mahādevyai bhaktiṃ kṛtvā naraḥ priye || 97 || 
(punāti?pūyate)sarvapāpebhyaḥ pāpātmā pāpakṛdyadi | 
pitṛmātṛkulaiḥ sārdhaṃ svargaloke mahīyate || 98 || 
tataḥ punarihāgatya cireṇa bhaktimān prabhuḥ | 
sārvabhaumapadaṃ labdhvā kaivalyamāpnuyāt tataḥ || 99 || 
prācuryādatha bhaktestu jaganmā(taḥ?tuḥ) padaṃ prati | 
anumeyamanenaiva bahunā vacasā ca kim || 100 || 
bhaktiḥ (kti ka pāṭhaḥ |) punarmaheśāni yadihānanyacittatā | 
bhajanaṃ sarvabhāvena sevya(vyā ka pāṭhaḥ |)sevakavartmanā || 101 || 
jaganmāturmahādevyā dāso'hamiti bhāṣate | 
sakṛdya(dyasya ta ka pāṭhaḥ |)stasya bhṛtyāste purandarasukhāḥ surāḥ || 102 || 
pitṛmātṛmukhān viprān gāśca bhṛtyānanekaśaḥ | 
hatvā nivedayedyastu ātmānaṃ tatpadāmbuje || 103 || 
śuddhā guṇamayaṃ dehaṃ paraṃ brahmādhigacchati | 
ahaṃ punaridaṃ viśvaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ brahmaṇā saha || 104 || 

<pṛ0 188> bhittvā cchittvā tathā lokān saṃtoṣya parameśvarīm | 
tasyai nivedya cātmānaṃ yāsyāmi brahma śāśvatam || 105 || 
tasmādyat kriyate karma mameti ca yadā bhavet | 
ātmānaṃ tatpadāmbhoje mahāmantreṇa cārpayet || 106 || 
tarpaṇāni punardattvā navamudrāḥ pradarśayet | 
mudaṃ rānti ca tā yasmāt tena mudrāḥ prakīrttitāḥ || 107 || 
kāmaṃ mokṣaṃ tathā dharmamarthaṃ mudrānvitā svayam | 
dadāti sādhakāyāśu devī gantuṃ samutsukā || 108 || 
saṃkṣobhadrāviṇyā(ṇīka kha pāṭhaḥ |)karṣavaśyonmādamahāṅkuśāḥ | 
khecarībījayonyākhyā nava mudrā smṛtāḥ kramāt || 109 || 
darśitāsvāsu mudrāsu bhavet pūjāsamāpanam | 
svasvabījena mudrāyā bandhanaṃ parikīrttitam || 110 || 
darśanaṃ mūlamantreṇa tyāgaḥ krodhodbhavena ca | 
mudrānuṣṭhānamajñātvā yo mudrāṃ dhārayedbudhaḥ || 111 || 
viphalaṃ tasya tatsarvaṃ jīvahīnaṃ vapuryathā | 
pūjādau darśitāsvāsu devyāstu saṃnidhirbhavet || 112 || 
bhakteḥ prācuryamatraiva śraddhayābhyarcanaṃ tathā | 
nirjanaścātmaśuddhiśca doṣarāhityatā tathā || 113 || 
pūjopakaraṇasyeha bāhulyaṃ ca pavitratā | 
saurabheṇātisaurabhyāccamatkārakṛtistathā || 114 || 
saṃsthānaṃ (napau ka pāṭhaḥ |) pauruṣeṇaiva manohāritvamātmanaḥ | 

<pṛ0 189> sau(makasya?mukhyaṃ ca)suveśaśca(śa ca ka pāṭhaḥ |) yaṣṭuḥ kākūktireva ca || 115 || 
pūjāvidhiṣu (mudākṣya kha pāṭhaḥ |) dākṣyaṃ ca tathaivānanyacittatā | 
stutirnatirjapaścaiva baliḥ peyaṃ tathaiva ca || 116 || 
heturatra samākhyāto devīsāṃnidhyakārakaḥ | 
madyaṃ (śrā?srā)vyaṃ tu sindūre (ra kha pāṭhaḥ |) svāṃgarāgeṣu kuṃkumam || 117 || 
iti yo yatra saṃprokto viśeṣastripurārcane | 
ebhirviśeṣaiḥ sahitaṃ tripurātantragocaram || 118 || 

[iti pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śrīgandharvatantre japādividhinirūpaṇaṃ aṣṭādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 18 || 

<pṛ0 190> [ekonaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
atha vakṣye maheśāni vaṭukādividhiṃ śṛṇu | 
yenānuṣṭhitamātreṇa sādhakaḥ siddhimāpnuyāt || 1 || 
balibhistarpitā hyete pūjitā yasya suvrate | 
siddhayaḥ sakalāstasya karasthā nātra saṃśayaḥ || 2 || 
anyathā ruṣitaistairhi sa vighnaiḥ paribhūyate | 
tasmāt tebhyaḥ prayatnena baliṃ kurvīta hetunā || 3 || 
māṃsena sādhitaṃ bhaktaṃ khaṇḍaṃ dadhi sapiṣṭakam | 
māṃsāni vividhānyatra sudugdhaṃ mīnameva ca || 4 || 
śrīcakramabhito devi maṇḍalānāṃ catuṣṭayam | 
īśāna(-)vahni(-)nairṛtyavāyukoṇeṣu pārvati || 5 || 
dhyeyo devyāstadā viṣṇuḥ putro'yaṃ vaṭurūpadhṛk | 
vaṭukaḥ kamalākṣastu svarṇagauraścaturbhujaḥ || 6 || 
gadāṃ śaṅkhaṃ ca padmaṃ ca cakraṃ cāpi dadhatkaraiḥ (karerdhṛtam ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
vidrutaḥ (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) purato devyāḥ(gaje?khage)ndrāsanasaṃsthitaḥ || 7 || 
(vāruṇaṃ va śakra la caturdaśa svara au candrabindusahita tena klau vaṭukāya namaḥ iti |) vāruṇaṃ śakrayuktaṃ ca caturdaśasvarānvitam | 
sahitaṃ candrabindubhyāṃ vaṭukāya namo'ntataḥ || 8 || 
anena manunā devi gandhādyaiḥ pūjayettataḥ | 

<pṛ0 191> tadagre parameśāni pātraṃ cānnodakānvitam || 9 || 
kṛtvā ca vidhivattatra baliṃ mantreṇa dāpayet | 
(ehyehi devīputravaṭukanāthakapilajaṭābhārabhāsvaratrinetrajvālāmukha sarvavighnān nāśaya nāśaya sarvopacārasahita bali gṛhṇa 2 svāheti balimantra |) ehyehi devī(vi ka pāṭhaḥ |)putrāntānte vaṭukānte'tha nātha ca || 10 || 
kapilānte jaṭābhārabhāsvarānte trinetra ca | 
jvālāmu(khyaṃ?kha) ca sarvānte vighnānnāśaya nāśaya || 11 || 
sarvopacārasahitaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇadvidhāpadam | 
vahnijāyānvito mantro vaṭukasya udāhṛtaḥ || 12 || 
vāmāṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ baliṃ tasmai nivedayet | 
asyaivārādhanaṃ kṛtvā mandabhāgyo'pi suvrate || 13 || 
sarvabādhāvinirmuktaḥ saṃpadāṃ bhājanaṃ bhavet | 
yajanaṃ cāsya devasya sāṃgena kathitaṃ purā || 14 || 
balipradānamātraṃ tu prasaṃgātkathitaṃ śive | 
ḍākinīpramukhāḥ paścādbalinā tarpayet tataḥ || 15 || 
tathaiva vāmato devyā maṇḍale yoginīḥ smaret | 
athavā cintayedetā yoginyaḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ || 16 || 
yoginyaḥ kāmarūpāśca taptakāñcanabhāsvarāḥ | 
mattāḥ kaṃkālamālāḍhyāḥ kaṭītaṭabharānatā || 17 || 
galadrudhiragandhāḍhyā raktavastrottarīyakāḥ | 
liṃgaṃ pāśaṃ kapālaṃ ca bibhratyaśca(śṛ?sṛ)ṇiṃ (śṛṇi cāpi dhṛtā ka pāṭhaḥ |) karaiḥ || 18 || 
svabhaktānāmabhimataṃ saṃdadānā (dīyamānā ka pāṭhaḥ |) mudānvitāḥ | 

<pṛ0 192> gandhādibhiḥ samabhyarcya baliṃ mantreṇa dāpayet || 19 || 
yāmātmakaṃ samuccārya yoginībhyastataḥ param | 
bhyasantaṃ (svāhānte ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarvavarṇānte yoginīpadamālikhet || 20 || 
kavacaṃ cāstramālikhya vahnijāyāṃ punarlikhet | 
anena manunā vāpi yoginīnāṃ baliṃ haret || 21 || 
aṅguṣṭhamadhyamānāmā yonyākāreṇa(kara kha pāṭhaḥ |) yojayet | 
kṛtāñjalistato devi saṃprārthayedanena tu || 22 || 
ūrdhvaṃ brahmāṇḍato vā divi gaganale bhūtale nistale vā 
pātāle(vānale)vā salilapavanayoryatrakutra sthitā vā | 
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapadā dhūpadīpādikena 
prītā devyaḥ sadā naḥ śubhabalividhinā pāntu vīrendravandyāḥ (devendravatya ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 23 || 
kṣetrapālaṃ mahādevyā vāmataḥ paricintayet | 
aparājitavallībhirveṣṭitasya mahātmanaḥ || 24 || 
āraktavarṇaiḥ(varṇa kha pāṭhaḥ |) satataṃ kusumairupaśobhite | 
tintiḍīkalpavṛkṣasya sacchāye ratnabhūṣite || 25 || 
nīlāñja(la?na)cayaprakhyaṃ(kṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |) dadhānaṃ karapaṅkajaiḥ | 
kṛpāṇaṃ ca kapālaṃ ca śūlaṃ ḍamarumeva ca || 26 || 
dhyāyecca samamatyarthaṃ daṃṣṭrābhinnādharaṃ param | 
pūjayitvā vidhānena baliṃ mantreṇa dāpayet || 27 || (yā yoginibhya sarvavarṇayoginībhyo haphaṭsvāheti balimantraḥ |) 

<pṛ0 193> ṣaḍdīrghasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ kṣakāraṃ vilikhet priye | 
tataḥ kṣetrapadaṃ pāla dhūpadīpādi vā likhet || 28 || 
sahitaṃ balimālikhya gṛhṇa gṛhṇa tato vadet | 
vahnijāyānvito mantraḥ (kṣāṃ kṣīṃ kṣūṃ kṣaiṃ kṣauṃ kṣaḥ kṣetrapāla dhūpadīpādisahitaṃ bali gṛhṇa 2 svāhā iti niṣkarṣa |) kṣetrapālasya pārvati || 29 || 
vāmamuṣṭiṃ vidhāyādau tarjanīṃ saralāṃ kuru | 
anayā mudrayā devi baliṃ tasmai nivedayet || 30 || 
caturthamaṇḍale devyāḥ purato dakṣabhāgataḥ | 
navīnanīradaśyāmaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 31 || 
tundinaṃ gajavaktraṃ ca caturbāhuṃ digambaram | 
vāmadakṣordhvapāṇibhyāṃ pāśāṅkuśa(va?dha)raṃ vibhum || 32 || 
dakṣiṇādhaḥkareṇaiva madhupūrṇakapālakam | 
sindūrasadṛśākārāmuddāmamadavihvalām || 33 || 
dhṛtaraktotpalāmanyapāṇinā taddhvajaspṛśa(śā ka pāṭhaḥ |)m | 
āliṅgya vāmahastena tasyā madanamandiram || 34 || 
spṛśantaṃ parameśānaṃ dhyātvā taṃ paripūjayet | 
gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ trayamālikhya ṅentaṃ gaṇapatiṃ tataḥ || 35 || 
varānte varadānte ca sarvānte janamālikhet | 
me vaśaṃ cānaya procya baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhāpadam || 36 || 
vahnijāyānvito mantro gaṇapasya (gā gī gū gaṇapataye varavarada sarvajana me vaśamānaya bali gṛhṇa 2 svāheti balimantra |) udāhṛtaḥ | 
muṣṭimadhyasthitāṃ devi aṅgulīṃ daṇḍavat kuru || 37 || 

<pṛ0 194> gajatuṇḍā mahāmudrā gaṇapasya sadā priyā | 
etadante maheśāni sarvabhūtabaliṃ haret || 38 || 
surā narāśca pitaro yakṣarakṣaḥpiśācakāḥ | 
ete bhūtāḥ samuddiṣṭā balibhistān pratarpayet || 39 || 
balibhistarpitāstvete yānti yajñe sahāyatām | 
atarpitā yadā tasmiṃste vai vighnasvarūpiṇaḥ || 40 || 
ātmānaṃ ca kriyāḥ sarvā mahāmantreṇa pārvati | 
tato brahmasvarūpiṇyai viśeṣeṇa samarpayet || 41 || 
vāratrayamitaḥ pūrvaṃ prāṇabuddhi tataḥ param | 
dehadharmādhikārānte jāgratsvapnasuṣuptiṣu || 42 || 
manasā ca tato vācā karmaṇā ca tataḥ param | 
hastābhyāṃ ca tataḥ padbhyāmudareṇa tataḥ param || 43 || 
śiśnā ca yat smṛtaṃ paścādyaduktaṃ yatkṛtaṃ bhavet | 
māṃ madīyaṃ tato devi sakalaṃ ca tataḥ param || 44 || 
tathaiva tvayi-śabdānte brahmaṇyarpitamastviti | 
svāhānto manurityukto mantraḥ (ita pūrva prāṇabuddhidahadharmādhikārajāgratsvapnasuṣuptiṣu manasā vācā karmaṇā hastābhyāṃ padbhyāmudareṇa śiśnā ca yatsmṛta yadukta yatkṛta mā madīya sakala tvayi brahmaṇyarpitamastu svāhati svātmasamarpaṇamantraḥ | māmiti asminmanau vibhaktipratirūpakamavyaya bodhyam |) svātmasamarpaṇe || 45 || 
etadante mahāmantrā(na?ni)yataḥ samudīrayet | 
āvāhanaṃ na jānāmi na jānāmi visarjanam || 46 || 
pūjābhāgaṃ na jānāmi tvaṃ gatiḥ parameśvari | 
satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyamutkṣipya bhujamucyate || 47 || 

<pṛ0 195> kāyena manasā vācā tvatto nānyā gatirmama | 
antaścāreṇa bhūtānāmantastvameva saṃsthitā || 48 || 
yaddataṃ bhaktimātreṇa patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ jalam | 
āveditaṃ ca naivedyaṃ tadgṛhāṇānukampayā || 49 || 
vidhihīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ bhaktihīnaṃ yadarcitam | 
yadakṣara(ra ka pāṭhaḥ |)paribhraṣṭaṃ mātrāhīnaṃ ca yadbhavet || 50 || 
anaṅgavyavadhānādi aparādhaśatāti ca | 
kṣantumarhasi me devi tvameva śaraṇaṃ yataḥ || 51 || 
tvayi me hṛdayaṃ cāstu tvayi cittaṃ manastvayi | 
tvatpūjāyāṃ mahāmāye saṃvardhantāṃ prayojitāḥ || 52 || 
ye punarvighnakartāraste naśyantu tvadājñayā | 
mantreṣu paṭhiteṣveṣu sva(raṃ?yaṃ)devī prasīdati || 53 || 
dātuṃ(datte kha pāṭhaḥ |) devī caturvargamityetannātra saṃśayaḥ | 
evaṃ saṃprārthya deveśi stutvā nutvāti(bhi kha pāṭhaḥ |)bhaktitaḥ || 54 || 
pradhānadevatāmūrtau parivārān samarpayet | 
tasyā eva maheśānyāḥ śarīre sarvadevatāḥ || 55 || 
vilīnāḥ santu mūlena de(vā?vya)ṅge mīlitāḥ smaret | 
atha kāmakalārūpamātmānaṃ paricintayet || 56 || 
tatastāṃ parameśānīṃ visṛjed hṛdayāmbuje | 
jñānato'jñānato vāpi yanmayā kriyate śive || 57 || 
tava kṛtyamidaṃ sarvamiti mātaḥ kṣamasva me | 
udvāsya parameśānīṃ khecaryātmani yojayet || 58 || 

<pṛ0 196> anenaiva tu mantreṇa dhyāyaṃstāṃ sthāpayed hṛdi | 
tiṣṭha devi pare sthāne svasthāne parameśvari || 59 || 
visṛjyaivaṃ maheśānīṃ tataḥ pūrakavāyunā | 
saṃhāramudrayādāya samāghrāya gurūktayā || 60 || 
taccaitanyaṃ(sa?sva)mūlena mūla eva niveśayet | 
prāṇāyāmaistu saṃtarpya yajennirmālyadhāriṇīm || 61 || 
nirmālyaṃ nikṣipedbhūmau nītvā tāṃ citkalāṃ purā | 
asyā jaganmayī saiva sai cai(vāśo?va śe)ṣikā parā || 62 || 
tatparaṃ nahi va(vā ka pāṭhaḥ |)stve(ha?va)tattvajñānādahaṃ prabhuḥ | 
mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthaśṛṅgāṭodarasaṃsthitām || 63 || 
devīṃ parāṃ samālokya ātmānaṃ tu vicintayet | 
unmanyante śivo bhūtvā tiṣṭhedānandanirbharaḥ || 64 || 
śivenaikyaṃ samāsādya yāvadante (anta yāvatma ka pāṭhaḥ |) manolayaḥ | 
nivartitasamādhistu gurave mūrdhavāsine || 65 || 
ālalāṭaṃ namaskuryānnivedyārghyaṃ tadājñayā | 
aiśānyāṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā dvārapadmavivarjitam || 66 || 
śeṣikāṃ sundarīṃ tatra nirmālyena prapūjayet | 
lehyacoṣyā(ṣā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nnapānādi tāmbūlamanu(sragvile kha pāṭhaḥ |)lepanam || 67 || 
nairmālyaṃ bhojanaṃ tubhyaṃ dadāmi śrīśivājñayā | 
anena manunā devyā yajennirmālyadhāriṇīm || 68 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde vaṭukādibalividhinirūpaṇaṃ ekonaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 19 || 

<pṛ0 197> [viṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
devyuvāca 
kathaṃ sā parameśānī śeṣikā pū(ji?jya)te śiva | 
kīdṛśī sā mahādevī tadaśeṣaṃ vada prabho || 1 || 

īśvara uvāca 
śeṣikāṃ sundarīṃ vakṣye devīṃ guhyatamāṃ priye | 
ucchiṣṭapūrvikāṃ devīṃ mātaṅgīṃ sarvasiddhidām || 2 || 
sarvāpattāriṇīṃ vidyāṃ sarvadoṣavivarjitām | 
yayā vijñātayā devi kṣayaṃ gacchanti cāpadaḥ || 3 || 
sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ caiva kṛtrimaṃ cāṅgajaṃ tathā (viṣam kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
vidyeyaṃ nāśayed devi svaparāṅgasamāśritam || 4 || 
iyaṃ vidyā mahāvidyā sarvapāpāpahāriṇī | 
svargadā mokṣadā ceyaṃ rājyasaubhāgyadā tathā || 5 || 
iyaṃ devī mayā pūrvaṃ sādhitā devi nirjane | 
sakṛduccā(cca ka pāṭhaḥ |)ritā vidyā brahmahatyāvināśinī || 6 || 
ya ucchi(yadyu kha pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭamukho bhūtvā smared devīṃ kadācana | 
tadācānto bhaved devi vinaivācamane kṛte (aiśo'ya pāṭha ācamana vinetyartha, evamagrepi bodhyam |) || 7 || 
nirdhano dhanamāpnoti mūrkho vidyāmavāpnuyāt | 
mantraṃ śṛṇu mahādevyā yathāvat kathayāmi te || 8 || 

<pṛ0 198> ucchiṣṭaśabdamuccārya tathā caṇḍālinīti ca | 
sumukhīti tato devi mahāpiśācinīti ca || 9 || 
māyābījaṃ tataḥ paścāt ṭhakāradvitayaṃ tathā | 
savisargaṃ (ucchiṣṭacaṇḍālini sumukhi devi mahāpiśācini hrī ṭha ṭha iti |) mahādevi sarvasiddhipradāyakam || 10 || 
athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi mantraṃ paramadurlabham | 
vāṅmāyākamalābījaṃ namo bhagavatīti ca || 11 || 
mātaṅgeśvari sarvānte janavaśaṃkarīti ca | 
vahnijāyānvito mantraḥ (ai hrī śrī namo bhagavati mātaṅgeśvari sarvajanavaśakari svāhā | iti mantrāntaram |) sarvasiddhipradāyakaḥ || 12 || 
nāridoṣo'tra deveśi na vighno niyamastathā | 
aṅganyāsakaranyāsau nāṅgī caivāsya devatā || 13 || 
yasya tiṣṭhati mantro'yaṃ sa bhavet surapādapaḥ | 
dhyānamasyāḥ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadakhileśvari || 14 || 
śavopari samāsīnā raktāmbaraparicchadā | 
raktālaṃkārabhūṣāḍhyā guñjāhāravirājitā || 15 || 
navayauvanasaṃpannā pīnonnatapayodharā | 
kapālakartṛkāhastā paramajyotīrūpiṇī || 16 || 
vidhānaṃ cātra vakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi manoharam | 
bhojanānantaraṃ devi vinaivācamane kṛte || 17 || 
baliṃ kṛtvā prathamato mūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ | 
tato mantraṃ japed dhyātvā japedayutamānataḥ || 18 || 

<pṛ0 199> ucchiṣṭenaiva kartavyo japo'syāḥ siddhimicchatā | 
aparaṃ ca pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi phalapradam || 19 || 
homasaṃtarpaṇaṃ caiva sarvakāryārthasiddhaye | 
sthaṇḍile maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā caturasraṃ sabindukam || 20 || 
pūjayenmaṇḍalaṃ devyā mūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ | 
tatra devīṃ samāvāhya vahnirūpavyavasthitām || 21 || 
saṃpūjyaiva careddhomaṃ dadhisiddhārthataṇḍulaiḥ | 
sahasraikavidhānena rājā bhavati vaśyagaḥ || 22 || 
mārjārasya tu māṃsena devyai homaṃ samācaran | 
sa prāpnoti parāṃ vidyāṃ śastraśāstravaśīkṛtām || 23 || 
kuryācchāgasya māṃsena homaṃ madhughṛtānvitam | 
sahasraikapramāṇena bhavanti phalasiddhayaḥ || 24 || 
vidyākāmaścared homaṃ madhunā saha sarpiṣā | 
ayu(ktai?tai)kapramāṇena siddhiriṣṭā bhaved dhruvam || 25 || 
sadyo mārjāramāṃsena ghṛtena madhunā saha | 
cāṇḍālakeśayuktena bhavedākarṣaṇaṃ mahat || 26 || 
śaśakasya tu māṃsena madhunāloḍitena ca | 
kṛtvā homamavāpnoti vidyāvasuvarastriyaḥ || 27 || 
dhattū(dhūstū ka pāṭhaḥ |)rakāṣṭhayogena citāvahnau tu mantravit | 
kokilākākapakṣaiśca homaiḥ śatrūn vināśayet || 28 || 
uccāṭanāya śatrūṇāṃ homaṃ kuryācca mantravit | 

<pṛ0 200> pūrvoktena vidhānena citākāṣṭhahutāśane || 29 || 
ulūkakākapakṣābhyāṃ kṛtvā homaṃ nirantaram | 
dveṣayed dviṣṭamanyonyakalahākulasaṃkulam || 30 || 
ulūkapakṣahomena garbhapāto bhavet striyāḥ | 
bilvapatraiḥ su(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)madhvaktairmāsamekaṃ niranta(ra?)m || 31 || 
sahasraikapramāṇena kṛtvā homaṃ samāhitaḥ | 
api vandhyā labhet putraṃ cirajīvinamuttamam || 32 || 
bandhūkakusumaṃ hutvā raktaṃ madhusitānvitam | 
durbhagā caiva yā nārī subhagā sā na saṃśayaḥ || 33 || 
(iḍā?haṭhā)dāgatya kāmārtā balādāliṅgyanti tam | 
iyaṃ devī maheśānī vāmācāra(rā ka pāṭhaḥ |)phalapradā || 34 || 
dakṣiṇācārayogena na bhavet phaladāyinī | 
bhojanānantaraṃ cāsyā baliṃ dadyād dine dine || 35 || 
ucchiṣṭena japenmantraṃ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ śive | 
uṭaje (uñjaṭe ka pāṭhaḥ |) vā śmaśāne vā śūnyāgāre catu(ṣṭayaṃ?ṣpathe) || 36 || 
balipradānato devī pratyakṣā bhavati dhruvam | 
anayaivābhisaṃmantrya oṣadhyaḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ || 37 || 
candrī cakrī tathā vajrī triśūlā muddhayī tathā | 
dehasthā samare puṃsāṃ sarvāyudhavi(dhā?dā)riṇī || 38 || 
gṛhītaṃ puṣyanakṣatre apāmārgasya mūlakam | 
lepamātreṇa dhīrāṇāṃ sarvāyudhanivāraṇam || 39 || 

<pṛ0 201> arjunaṃ ca nārajaṃ ca campakonmattakaḥ kuhūḥ | 
lepamātrājjayī yuddhe vajradeho bhavennaraḥ || 40 || 
kharjūrī mukhamadhyasthā kaṭībaddhā ca ketakī | 
bhujadaṇḍasthitastālaḥ sarvāyudhanivāraṇaḥ || 41 || 
dakṣabāhusthitaścārko vāme tu hṛdaye'thavā | 
rudraḥ puṣpagato yuddhe vajradeho bhavennaraḥ || 42 || 
trilohaveṣṭitaṃ kṛtvā rasaṃ vajrābhasaṃyutam | 
raṇasthasya karasthaṃ ca sarvāyudhanivāraṇam || 43 || 
girikarṇīṃ śamīṃ dūrvāṃ guñjāṃ śvetāṃ samāharet | 
candanenānvitāḥ sarvāstilakādvijayī raṇe || 44 || 
adhaḥpuṣpā śikhī caiva śvetā ca girikarṇikā | 
gorocanāsamāyuktā tilakaṃ śatrumohanam || 45 || 
kanakārko(?)vahnirindradruḥ pañcamastathā | 
karoti tilakaṃ yastu paśyettaṃ pañcadhā ripuḥ || 46 || 
kṛṣṇasarpakarālaṃ tu rasaṃ mṛttikayānvitam | 
sitaguñjāṃ vapet tatra tasyā mūlaṃ samāharet || 47 || 
harītakyā samāyuktaṃ tilakaṃ śatrumohanam | 
kṛtatilakaṃ bhaṭaṃ dṛṣṭvā paśyet svaṃ śvāvṛtaṃ ripuḥ || 48 || 
śva(kha ka pāṭhaḥ |)gaṇairbha(kṣa?kṣya)māṇastu patatyeva tato bhuvi | 
chāyā yasya jale yāti saṃgrāhyaḥ kāsamarddakaḥ || 49 || 
anena tilakenāriḥ kūpavāpīṃ prapaśyati | 

<pṛ0 202> brahmadaṇḍī ca kaumārī īśvarī vaiṣṇavī tathā || 50 || 
vārāhī vajriṇī cāndrī mahālakṣmīstathaiva ca | 
etāścauṣadhayo divyāstathaitā mātaraḥ smṛtāḥ || 51 || 
kṛtatāḍī kare baddhā(ddhvā kha pāṭhaḥ |) sarvaśatrunivāriṇī | 
bahunā tu kimuktena saṃkṣepāt kathyate'dhunā || 52 || 
ṣaṭkarmaśālinī vidyā prayogāt sarvasiddhidā | 
mūlavidyāprayogena siddhihānirbhaved dhruvam || 53 || 
prayogecchā yadā devi tadaināṃ ca prayojayet | 
anayākhilakarmāṇi sādhayet sādhakottamaḥ || 54 || 
prasaṅgāt kathitaṃ devi gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ | 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śeṣikāvidyāprayogakramanirūpaṇaṃ viṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 20 || 

<pṛ0 203> [ekaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
tato vai mūlamantreṇa maheśānīṃ dhiyā smaran | 
aprāśya caiva nirmālyaṃ pādodakapuraḥsaram || 1 || 
śirasā dhārayedyastu bhūmau bindūṃstu pātayet (mau vā bindu pātayet kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
brahmahā sa tu vijñeyo yadbhaktyā cātmasā(dga?tkṛ)tam || 2 || 
śivaṃ gandhaṃ samādāya śaṃkhatoye vilokayet | 
savyahaste samādāya dakṣahastena mantravit || 3 || 
saptadhā mantritaṃ kṛtvā sarvatīrthamayaṃ smaret | 
prokṣayet tena cātmānaṃ mūladevīṃ hṛdi smaran || 4 || 
pādodakaṃ pived bhaktyā śeṣaṃ mūrdhani yojayet | 
sarvāṅgalepanaṃ kṛtvā yantralepādikaṃ ca yat || 5 || 
nirmañchet kāmabījena mūlamantreṇa cātmanaḥ | 
anāmikāgraparveṇa lalāṭamapi saṃspṛśet || 6 || 
nirmālyaṃ śirasā dhārya sarvāṅgeṣvanulepanam | 
mantreṇa bhāskarāyārghyamacchidrārthaṃ nivedayet || 7 || 
jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā paṭhitvā mantramīritam | 
ekāgramanasā vāgbhiracchidramavadhārayet || 8 || 
yajñacchidraṃ tapaśchidraṃ yacchidraṃ pūjane mama | 
sarvaṃ tadacchidramastu mārtaṇḍasya prasādataḥ || 9 || 

<pṛ0 204> mārtaṇḍabhairavaṃ paścāt praṇamya ca vilokayet | 
ādāvante ca devasya namaskāravilokane || 10 || 
kuryācca sarvadā bhaktyā dharmakāmārthasiddhaye | 
yajñādhikāritā cā(mā ka pāṭhaḥ |)dau paścāt saṃpūrṇatā vidheḥ || 11 ||
vidherviparyayāt tasya kṛtaṃ haranti rākṣasāḥ | 
tamudyantaṃ vilokyaiva yajedastamitaṃ tataḥ || 12 || 
ubhayorekatāṃ matvā tamudyantaṃ punastataḥ | 
sa evādau sa cāntasthaḥ so'nanto hyanta eva saḥ || 13 || 
ādyamantaṃ vidityaiva sarvakarmaphalaṃ labhet | 
tatastu puṣpanaivedyatoyapātrādikaṃ ca yat || 14 || 
māyābījena tatsarvaṃ punareva vilokayet | 
hastena cakṣuṣā vāpi yatra yaśca kṛtaḥ purā || 15 || 
pātranyāsastasya tasya visṛṣṭiramunā bhavet | 
toyairabhyukṣya tatsthānaṃ mārjayet tadanantaram || 16 || 
udake tarumūle vā nirmālyaṃ tatra saṃtyajet | 
naivedyādīni sarvāṇi gurave guruśaktaye || 17 || 
samarpyopāyanaṃ bhaktyā śivāya (śivayā ka pāṭhaḥ |) gururūpiṇe | 
jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā praṇamed daṇḍavat priye (meva ca ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 18 || 
ādāya guruṇā dattaṃ svīkuryāttu vidhānataḥ | 
tayorabhāvato dadyāt kumārībhyo yathāvidhi || 19 || 
amṛtaṃ bhakṣayed devo bhuktvā devatvamālabhet | 

<pṛ0 205> amṛtaṃ tadvijānīyādutsṛṣṭaṃ daivatena (ta tu ka pāṭhaḥ |) yat || 20 || 
paradaivatanairmālyaṃ vinānyat svīkṛtaṃ nahi | 
anivedya śivāyaiva yatkiṃcit svīkṛtaṃ priye || 21 || 
(sa?tat)ca paśurmṛtaṃ bhuṅkte lokadvayayutaṃ priye | 
purā sarve manuṣyādyā bhuktvā mṛtami(ye?daṃ) natu || 22 || 
devatvaṃ(nobhavet?cālabhan) yasmāttannaiva bhakṣayet kvacit (tu kvacit kvacit ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
divyabhāvaviśuddhātmā bhakṣayedamṛtaṃ yadi || 23 || 
nityamabhyāsayogena devagāmī bhavennaraḥ | 
amṛtopastaraṃ kṛtvā pidhānamapi tena vai || 24 || 
baliśeṣaṃ samādāya juhuyāccaiva pūrvavat | 
hutvāmṛtaṃ tato bhaktyā prāśayed bhāvaśuddhitaḥ || 25 || 
bhuktvāmṛtaṃ tadā devi hastaṃ mūrdhani vinyaset | 
tritattvena tridhācamya ṣaḍaṅgāni pravinyaset || 26 || 
śivo dātā ca (bha?bho)ktā ca śivaḥ sarvamidaṃ jagat | 
śivo jayati sarvatra yaḥ śivaḥ so'hameva ca || 27 || 
śaktīralaṃkṛtavaktrāḥ (tu kvacit kvacit ka pāṭhaḥ |) suveśāḥ sumanoharāḥ | 
paśyettu devatādṛṣṭyā tā eva devatā yataḥ || 28 || 
tathaiva brahmaṇān paśyedbhūdevāñ śuddhamānasān | 
bhaktyā natvā pramuditastataḥ svānavalokayet || 29 || 
anena vidhinā devi saṃpūjya parameśvarīm | 
tatkṛpālabdhavijñānapūrṇo'hamiva bhūtale (labdhirahita sahitasyāhameva vā ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 30 || 

<pṛ0 206> bhāvanāvaśasaṃpanno virahet tu tadicchayā || 30 || 

devyuvāca 
ka(sya?thaṃ) vā kriyate pūjā (na?nu)gṛhyeta niveditā (tāt kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kathaṃ vā pratyayaṃ cetastadupāyaṃ vada prabho || 31 || 

īśvara uvāca 
sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ tvayā bhadre smaraṇānmuktidāyakam | 
śiva(śa ka pāṭhaḥ |)rūpaṃ paraṃ brahma anuttarapadaṃ mahat || 32 || 
tadantaḥsthaṃ paraṃ brahma jyotīrūpaṃ sanātanam | 
svayaṃ prakāśate hyātmā meghāpāyeṃ'śumāniva || 33 || 
abhyased bahuśastatra śrutidarśitavartmanā | 
varṇarūpaṃ tu śabdasya tanmayyastatkriyāstathā || 34 || 
japtvā kṛtvā bhavet siddhi(ddhebho ka pāṭhaḥ |)rbhogamokṣamayī tataḥ (mayāstu ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
yāvanmano layaṃ yāti tasmin svātmani cinmaye || 35 || 
tāvadiṣṭamanuṃ mantrī japahomaiḥ samācaret | 
ataḥ paraṃ na kiṃcit tu kṛtyama(si?sti)tadātmanaḥ || 36 || 
vidite parame tattve samastairniyamairalam | 
tālavṛntena kiṃ kāryaṃ labdhe malayamārute || 37 || 
avaśyaṃ ca bhāvi phalaṃ tadāptau tatkaroti yaḥ | 
āstikaḥ sa tu vijñeyaḥ kramānmokṣe pratiṣṭhitaḥ || 38 || 
prāpya nyasettadā tasmin kṛtvā tadrahitaṃ nyaset | 
ubhayātmakaṃ tu vinyasya sa saṃnyāsī munirmataḥ || 39 || 

<pṛ0 207> yantraṃ śarīramatroktaṃ viditvā kamalekṣaṇe | 
kṛtvā cāhaṃmatiṃ tatra (kṛtvāvahamara tatra ka pāṭhaḥ |) yajedbhaktyā samāhitaḥ || 40 || 
yadrūpaṃ parameśānyā ni(ṣā?ṣka)laṃ saka(lārṇa?laṃ ca)vā | 
ātma(ā)bhedena saṃpūjya ātmānaṃ priyamīśvarīm || 41 || 
tadānandamayaṃ dhāma yāti paścānna saṃśayaḥ | 
evaṃ sā pañcamī proktā pañcadhā prathitavigrahā || 42 || 
pañcatattvātmake dehe pratyakṣīkriyate hi taiḥ | 
nānyatra vai bhaved vyaktā vinātmani vicintanam || 43 || 
anumānaṃ maheśānyā ātmanyeva naca kvacit | 
anumīya paraṃ caiva sarvamātmavadācaret || 44 || 
vastūnāṃ gandhamātreṇa saurūpyadarśanāt tathā | 
tuṣyanti devatāḥ śreṣṭhāḥ stutyā labhyāśca(bhyā ca ka pāṭhaḥ |) pārvati || 45 || 
bhūtapretapiśācāśca yakṣarākṣasapannagāḥ | 
upabhogena tuṣyanti manuṣyādyāśca jantavaḥ || 46 || 
guroḥ śarīramāsthāya kumārīṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ | 
brāhmaṇānāṃ gavāṃ caiva bhuñjate devatāḥ parāḥ || 47 || 
tasmāttāṃśca prayatnena bhojayet toṣayet sadā | 
tuṣṭeṣveṣu mahādevī parituṣṭā jaganmayī || 48 || 
brāhmaṇānāṃ śarīrasthā bhuñjate pitarastathā | 
anaṅgavyavadhānaṃ syādaṅgahīnaṃ tu yadbhavet || 49 || 
sāṅgaṃ bhavati tat sarvaṃ miṣṭānnairviprabhojanāt | 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde pūjāsaṃpūraṇādyupāyavidhinirūpaṇaṃ ekaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 21 || 

<pṛ0 208> [dvāviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
hṛdisthaṃ paramātmānaṃ vihāyānyat samīhate | 
aho mūḍho varārohe bahiryanmṛgyate'ndhavat || 1 || 
vijñāya hṛdayāntaḥsthaṃ paraṃ(ya?pra)kṛtigocaram | 
tanniṣṭhakarmaṇā cainamātmanyevaṃ pratīyate (daivādikasya īḍgatau ityasya dhāto kartari aya prayoga |) || 2 || 
tatpratītau bhavet siddho nānyathā khalu pārvati | 
ahaṃ viṣṇuḥ svayaṃbhūśca svāyaṃbhavā ime vayam || 3 || 
tadanubhūya dehe'smiṃstadeva samupāsmahe | 
tadantaḥsthaṃ samāhūya tadevaṃ tu yajāmahe || 4 || 
udvāsya ca tadātmānaṃ sthāpayitvā nije hṛdi | 
niveditaṃ tu tatprītyai tasminneva nivedayet || 5 || 
vināmṛtaṃ na cānyat tu kāṅkṣante devatāgaṇāḥ | 
amṛtenaiva tatpūjā amṛtaṃ tu nivedayet || 6 || 
amṛtatvaṃ labhedvīraḥ svīkṛtyātmaniveditam | 
iti te kathitaṃ devi śeṣikā(matṛ?mṛta)muttamam || 7 || 
sthūlasūkṣmavibhedena jñāyate kṛpayā guroḥ | 
nityaṃ naimittikaṃ(karma?kāmyaṃ)ceti teṣāṃ pṛthak pṛthak || 8 || 
trividhaṃ traipuraṃ karma kramatastat samācaret | 
yaduktaṃ tāmasaṃ tyaktvā tat sarva yatnataścaret || 9 || 

<pṛ0 209> dainandinamato nityaṃ pātakamavi(ka yadavi ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhānataḥ | 
māsikaṃ tithikṛtyaṃ ca vārṣikaṃ phaladāyakam || 10 || 
laṅghanānnirayo yasya nityaṃ śraddhāvi(dhāna?ghāta)taḥ | 
naimittikaṃ vijānīyācchraddhayā tatsamācaret || 11 || 
phalamātraśrutiryasya śrutismṛtipracoditā(tam kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kāmyaṃ tattu vijānīyāt pūjitaṃ tatra gocare || 12 || 
vidadhyāt tatprayatnena yat punarlokapūjitam | 
dharmamapi tyajet sādhu yat puna(rya ka pāṭhaḥ |)rlokagarhitam || 13 || 
nityaṃ sāttvikamevātra naimittikaṃ tu rājasam | 
tāmasaṃ kāmyamevātra kuryāt phalavitṛṣṇayā || 14 || 
tṛṣṇāṃ tāṃ dūratastyaktvā manaḥ pūrṇaṃ vicintayet | 
pūrṇe mana(si?sya)tṛṣṇe ca pūrṇaṃ sarvamidaṃ jagat || 15 || 
upānadgūḍhapādasya nanu carmāvṛtaiva bhūḥ | 
phalavirahitaṃ kāmyaṃ nityaṃ naimittikaṃ tathā || 16 || 
kriyate tripurāprītyai kṛtvā ta(smai?syai)nivedanam | 
sāttvikaṃ tadvijānīyād bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 17 || 
yasya yadvihitaṃ karma trividhaṃ tatra gocare | 
śrutismṛtyuditaṃ cāpi manasāpi na hārayet || 18 || 
karmalopādadhoyonau jāyate sādhakādhamaḥ | 
śivaśaktimayaṃ viśvaṃ viditvā sadguroḥ priye || 19 || 
sthūlasūkṣmavibhedena pitṛmātṛsvarūpataḥ | 

<pṛ0 210> karmabhistoṣayet tau tu tadbhāvamāśritaḥ sadā || 20 || 
ubhayātmā bhavet siddhyai naikātmā jñānavarjitaḥ | 
jñānacakṣustayoraikyaṃ viditvā śrīguroḥ kramāt || 21 || 
anubhūya tadānandaṃ tadātmā tatra saṃviśet | 
mātuḥ pituryathā bālo vyutpattiṃ labhate kramāt || 22 ||
tayoḥ samatvasaṃdhānād vyutpanno jñānamālabhet |
devatāḥ śaktirityāhuḥ pitaraḥ śiva eva ca || 23 || 
etāvubhau tāṃstu sarvān suhṛdaḥ pūrvasūcitān | 
balibhistarpayet tāṃstu suhṛdbhiśca hato'nyathā || 24 || 
teṣāṃ baliṃ puraskṛtya tāvubhau paritoṣayet | 
paścāt tebhyo nivedyaiva suhṛdbhirviharenmudā || 25 || 
svāhāntena ca devebhyo manuṣye hantakārataḥ (ṣyebhyo'nta eva ca ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
svadhāntena pitṛbhyastu tebhyo labhyantagena(?)tu || 26 || 
nirāśāḥ pitarastasya yāsyanti khalu pārvati | 
suhṛdo jñātayaścāpi vāṅmātreṇāpi nārcitāḥ || 27 || 
suhṛdo varṣma khādanti jñātayaḥ karma saṃcitam | 
aihikaṃ svapitā hanti svamātā pāralaukikam || 28 || 
lokadvayavihīnastu naiva siddhiṃ pravindate (prayacchati ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
ayaṣṭvā pitaraṃ yajñe yajenmātaramambikām || 29 || 
vidhiśatairapi yajñaṃ nānugṛhṇāti śāśvatī | 
ādāvante pitustasmāt kuryāt tarpaṇamādarāt || 30 || 

<pṛ0 211> adattaṃ nopatiṣṭheta dadyāt tasmādataḥ param | 
gobhūhiraṇyavastrādi bhakṣyabhojyāni yāni ca || 31 || 
vāsinībhyo dvijebhyaśca dīnāndhakṛpaṇāya ca | 
tyaktvā cāvaśyakaṃ karma laukikaṃ bhāvatatparaḥ || 32 || 
yogakṣeme hitaṃ yattu kuryāt tadanuśāsanāt | 
samartho(rtha kha pāṭhaḥ |) jīvayet snehāt svakīyānanujīvinaḥ || 33 || 
duṣṭobhyo duṣṭacitebhyo hiṃsra(hisrebhya ka pāṭhaḥ |)sāhasikāt tathā | 
balibhyo dhanamattebhyaḥ kāyasthebhyo viśeṣataḥ || 34 || 
rakṣayet pālayet sādhuḥ putrāniva (ni?pi)taurasān | 
lokāṃśca trividhānmatvā lālayet pālayet sadā || 35 || 
vadhyān vadhyāttathā daṇḍyān daṇḍayecchāstradarśanāt | 
avadhyasya vadhe yāvāṃstathādaṇḍyasya (daṇḍastasya tu ka pāṭhaḥ |) daṇḍane || 36 || 
daṇḍyasyādaṇḍane pāpastāvān vadhyasya rakṣaṇe | 
iti vijñāya yogātmā yogakṣemaṃ samācaret || 37 || 
vibhūtīrātmanaḥ paśyet tatprāptyā tannivedayet | 
vibhūtīrātmano yastu mahādevyai pradarśayet || 38 || 
tābhireva yuto bhūyādaṇimādivibhūtibhiḥ | 
muhūrttatrayamātraṃ tu kuryāt tanuvicinta(yeta?nam) || 39 || 
cintayet paramaṃ brahma madhyāhne samupāgate |
muhūrtatrayamātraṃ tu nidrayā samupāsayet || 40 || 
tato buddhvā(ddhyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) yathākāle tāmeva samupāsayet | 

<pṛ0 212> lalitāni ca nṛtyāni gītāni madhurāṇi ca || 41 || 
darśayecchrāvayed devyai bhāvātmā tadvilokayet | 
nṛtyeṣu gītaniyatā devyaḥ srakcandanārcitāḥ || 42 || 
bhūṣitāścārubhūṣābhirvi(duve?hare)t tābhireva ca | 
tato madhye svayaṃ devaḥ kāmeśvara ivāparaḥ || 43 || 
kāmeśvarī1yuto bhūtvā yajet kāmeśvarīṃ tataḥ | 
brahmacintāparāmodamudito rājyacintakaḥ || 44 || 
muhūrtatrayamātraṃ tu nidrayā samupāsayet | 
divā dadyāt pitṛbhyastu mātṛbhyo niśi tatparaḥ || 45 || 
mātā rātriḥ samākhyātā pitā divasa eva ca | 
ubhayorekatāṃ matvā siddho bhavati nānyathā || 46 || 
somaḥ śaktiḥ śivaḥ sūryo niśā śaktirdivā śivaḥ | 
yadā sa bhagavān devo mahātripurabhairavaḥ || 47 || 
parāparāyaṇo'nantaḥ paranānandanirbharaḥ | 
parāpararahasyākhyāṃ yoginīṃ brahmarūpiṇīm || 48 || 
śivānandānandamayīṃ mahātripurasundarīm | 
ākṛṣyordhvaṃ yadā tiṣṭhet tadahaḥ parikī(rta?rtya)te || 49 || 
śaktibhairavasaṃyogādānandānandanirbha(yā?rā)t | 
bhairavānanda(namrā?magrā)ntarlīlā sā paramā kalā || 50 || 
madhyāhnaṃ tadvijānīyānmuhūrtatrayalakṣitam | 
tau tadā samabhāgena tiṣṭhetāṃ śaktibhairavau || 51 || 
pūrvāparau tadā jñeyāvetaddviguṇalakṣitau | 

<pṛ0 213> parasparādvaitepsantau prāptadvaitau tu madhyataḥ || 52 || 
abhijinnāma jānīyāt tatkālaṃ suravandite | 
tattattejobhirākīrṇaṃ(rṇā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tayoraikyaṃ tadā bhavet || 53 || 
sūryakoṭipratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭyayutaprabham | 
tadā daśabhujo devaḥ pañcavaktrastrilocanaḥ || 54 || 
śuklāmbaradharaḥ śuklaḥ śuklamālyānulepanaḥ | 
tasyotsaṅge mahādevī candrakoṭyayutaprabhā || 55 || 
prahasantī viśālākṣī paramānandananditā | 
tadrūpatāmabhīpsantī tadrūpekṣaṇalālasā || 56 || 
śuklaveśaṃ vinā devi nānyat tatprītaye tadā | 
tatrānyadrūpamāpanne sādhake daivacodite || 57 || 
kruddhā bhagavatī tasya śāpaṃ dadyāt sudāruṇam | 
sarvaiḥ śuklamayairdravyaiḥ śuklaveśairyajet tadā || 58 || 
divi devī bhaved dṛśyā(śyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) śaraccandranibhānanā (nibhopamā ka pāṭhaḥ |) |
tatra pūjā sadā kāryā viśeṣeṇa varānane || 59 || 
peyaṃ co(ṣaṃ?ṣyaṃ) tathā lehyaṃ carvyaṃ bhakṣyaṃ (kṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca tarpaṇaiḥ | 
nivedayet sadā bhaktyā yatpunaḥ sumanoharam || 60 || 
upacārairyajet prātarmadhye rasyā(sā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nnapānakaiḥ | 
gītanṛtyādinā sākaṃ rātrau yāgapuraḥsaram || 61 || 
prāṅmukho hi yajet prātarmadhyāhne dakṣiṇāmukhaḥ | 
sāyaṃ pratyaṅmukho bhūtvā rā(hu?trā)vudaṅmukhaḥ sadā || 62 || 

<pṛ0 214> tatra śāṃbhavabhedena japedvidyāmananyadhīḥ || 62 || 
varjayecchaktibhedaṃ tu yadīcchedātmano hitam | 
aruṇakiraṇācchannaṃ yatpūrvaṃ bhairavodayāt || 63 || 
ardhanārīśvaraṃ jñeyaṃ tatra pūjā(ca?kri)yāḥ samāḥ | 
upacāraistadā kuryāt saparyāṃ (kāryā saparyā kha pāṭhaḥ |) vidhinā tathā || 64 || 
varivasyāṃ gṛhī samabhāgena saṃsthitau yadi | 
ānandapāramicchantau sadānandavivardhinau || 65 || 
pūrvāparau mahāpuṇyau yadā tau samarūpiṇau | 
cintayet satataṃ bhaktyā tau tatkālavidhānataḥ || 66 || 
śaktiśāṃbhavabhedena japedvidyāmananyadhīḥ | 
śuklāmbaro bhavet tatra śuklamālyānulepanaḥ || 67 || 
raktāmbaradharāḥ paśyed raktamālyānulepanāḥ | 
diśaśca vidiśaścaiva raktā dṛśyā manīṣibhiḥ | 
lākṣāruṇamayaṃ viśvaṃ svayaṃ ca tatra tadbhavet || 68 || 
padmarāgapratīkāśaḥ (surarājasamannibha ka pāṭhaḥ |) koṭisūryasamadyutiḥ | 
nāthaḥ kāmeśvarastatra hyekavaktraścaturbhujaḥ || 69 || 
raktapadmanibhā (bhā devī ka pāṭhaḥ |) devī bālārkakiraṇāruṇā(ṇām ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
icchaṃstadrūpatāṃ prāptuṃ tadrūpā taṃ (pā tā ka pāṭhaḥ |) viśantyataḥ || 70 || 
anubhūya tadābandhaṃ bhairavānandasaṃkulam | 
viparītamabhīpsantī tadākramaṇalālasā || 71 || 
tadā sa(ro?mo)bhavet kālaḥ sāyaṃsaṃdhyeti gīyate | 

<pṛ0 215> śoṇitaiśca samākrāntāṃ pratīcīmavalokayan || 72 || 
pūjayet sādhako bhaktyā copacārairyathāvidhi | 
yadā sā paramā śaktiḥ svecchayā viśvarūpiṇī || 73 || 
adhaḥ kṛtvā tu puruṣaṃ(varṇa?rantu)micchā bhavedyadā | 
tadākramya svayaṃ devī bhairavoparisaṃsthitā || 74 || 
sahajānandasaṃdohairnijānandapravardhinī | 
tadā naijaṃ bhavedviśvaṃ tatra pūjā mahodayā || 75 || 
tattaddṛ(ṣṭu?ṣṭi)mayairdīpai(rbhā?rbho)gaiśca vividhaiḥ sadā | 
lākṣāruṇamayaṃ sarvaṃ svayaṃ tāvattathā bhavet || 76 || 
śaktibhedātmikāṃ vidyāṃ haṃsabījapuṭīkṛtām | 
praṇavāntaritāṃ śuddhāṃ nādalīlāṃ tadātmikām || 77 || 
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntāṃ viṣatantutanīyasīm | 
adharā(dṛrāmbuva ka pāṭhaḥ |)mburuhahaṃsīṃ susthirāmiva cañcalām || 78 || 
saṃ(śna?sra)vantīṃ sudhādhārāṃ śuddhalākṣārasopamām | 
āvāhya pūjayitvā svaṃ kamalāṅkapurāntare || 79 || 
vinirji(ta?tye)ndriyamano japedānandarūpiṇīm | 
madhyaṃ mukhaṃ (sukha ka pāṭhaḥ |) vijānīyāt pūrvāparau stanadva(yau?yam) || 80 || 
ardhamātrāṃ (trā ka pāṭhaḥ |) paraṃ rūpaṃ niśāmadhyaṃ tayoradhaḥ | 
anantaphaladaṃ puṇyaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 81 || 
saṃdhyācatuṣṭayaṃ bhadre kathitaṃ bhuvi durlabham | 
caturbhujaṃ mahādevyā jñeyaṃ kālacatuṣṭayam || 82 || 
ātmā sā parameśānī parameśvara eva ca | 

<pṛ0 216> yadaṅgaṃ tu vihīyeta tadaṅgacchedanaṃ tayoḥ || 83 || 
tatra yat kriyate karma maṅgalyaṃ maṅgalaṃ param | 
dhyānaṃ pūjā japaścaiva homo nyāsaśca tarpaṇam || 84 || 
atra vai pūjitā devī pūrayet tanmanorathān | 
atra yat puṇyamanaghe bhaktiśraddhāsamanvite || 85 || 
vidhinā vihite yajñe paramānandasaṃkule | 
vaktrakoṭisahasraistu hyananto vaktumakṣamaḥ || 86 || 
amṛtāñjali(mapya kha pāṭhaḥ |)rapyatra (sudhābdhitulanopamaḥ(sudhāsāgaratulanām ka pāṭhaḥ |)) | 
atra yo nārcayed devīṃ jalenāpīha pārvati || 87 || 
na namedvā gurūn bhaktyā brahmahā sa nigadyate | 
atra nidrāparā yānti mahākālapuraṃ priye || 88 || 
dambhaṃ mohaṃ tathā nidrāmālasyaṃ bāhyacintanam | 
kāmaṃ krodhaṃ tathā lobhaṃ hiṃsāṃ mātsaryameva ca || 89 || 
varjayitvā prayatnena vidyāmeva samabhyaset | 
durvāsanāṃ parityajya koṭijanmasamadbhavām (vān kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 90 || 
ekena janmanā muktiṃ yāti bhogī na saṃśayaḥ | 
śaktermukhaṃ vinā nānyat paśyedvai karhicittadā || 91 || 
paśavo dūratastyājyāḥ puruṣāścānyapūjakāḥ | 
atrānyacintanādyānti mlechayoniṃ patantyadhaḥ || 92 || 
yānti cordhvaṃ paraṃ dhāma cintanād brahma śāśvatam | 
nāsti puraskriyā teṣāṃ kāyakleśapurassarā || 93 || 

<pṛ0 217> nityaṃ puraskriyāyuktāsta eva parikīrtitāḥ | 
taṃ tu devā namasyanti kiṃ punarna(va?ra)markaṭāḥ || 94 || 
devīkalā bhavettatra sarvalokavaśaṃkarī | 
amartyā a(rpi?pi)taṃ ma(nya?rtya)mīhante kulavallabham || 95 || 
dṛ(tadṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭvā yuvatayaḥ sarvāḥ kli(dyānmā?dyadyo)nyo mudānvitāḥ | 
śaradinduprabhaṃ devaṃ pūrṇendupratimānanam || 96 || 
nānāvaidagdhyacāturyasnigdhapīyūṣabhāṣiṇam | 
api cettatsamā nārī tatsamaḥ puruṣo'sti cet || 97 || 
narendraṃ naraśārdūlaṃ dṛṣṭvā kṣubdha(bdhaṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |)manā bhavet | 
pūrve yad dīyate vastu pare tasmāccaturguṇam || 98 || 
nānāvidhopahārāṇi mahādevyai nivedayet | 
rājopacāraṃ dattvānte stutvā nutvā visarjayet || 99 || 
kālatraye'pyaśaktaśceccaturthe sarvathā priye | 
anaśnan pūjayedrātrau bhayanidrāparāṅmukhaḥ || 100 || 
prātarhomaṃ prakurvīta tathā madhyandine'thavā | 
nidrākālaṃ pravakṣyāmi sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca || 101 || 
divāniśormahādevi nava muhūrtāstataḥ param | 
muhūrtatrayamānaṃ tu nidrā devyāḥ samīritā (tā kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 102 || 
atra nidrāparāṃ devīṃ nidrayā samupāsayet | 
nidrākāle japedyastu pūjayedvā vimohitaḥ || 103 || 
svāpakālaṃ vinā devi sva(pe?pyā)danyatra yo'budhaḥ | 

<pṛ0 218> catvāri tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo balam || 104 || 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena bodhakāle prabodhayet | 
darśanaṃ cāvalokaṃ ca saṃbhāṣaṃ cānyalokanam || 105 || 
svayamāveśanaṃ caiva mantrāṇāṃ pañcalakṣaṇam | 
viditvā prajapenmantraṃ sarvasiddhimupālabhet || 106 || 
vedasaṃdhyaṃ trisaṃdhyaṃ vā dvisaṃdhyaṃ vātha suvrate | 
yogātmā yogavijñānī yogamudrāsamanvitaḥ || 107 || 
abdamekaṃ japedyastu brahmacaryavrate sthitaḥ | 
sahasraṃ prajapedādāvante'pi ca sahasrakam || 108 || 
madhyayoḥ (madhye'pi kha pāṭhaḥ |) prajapedvidyāṃ śeṣaṃ ya(ccha?tsa)mabhāgataḥ | 
lakṣamekaṃ bhaved devi triṃśadabhyantare tathā || 109 || 
astabdhākuñcitaṃ kāryaṃ na drutaṃ na vilambitam | 
akṣarākṣarasaṃcāridhvanimātraṃ vibhāvayet || 110 || 
mayāpyetad vratasthena japyate'dyāpi sundari | 
trisaṃdhyaṃ japyate brahma tatpadaprāptisiddhaye || 111 || 
evaṃ kramādbhavet siddho bhogī bhogaparāyaṇaḥ | 
evaṃ māsamṛtuṃ caiva vatsaraṃ yugameva ca || 12 || 
gamayet parameśāni yadvā ma(nna?nva)ntarādikam | 
etadrahasyaṃ paramaṃ na prakāśyaṃ kadācana | 
samayācārasaṃketaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 113 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde samayācārasaṃketavarṇanaṃ dvāviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 22 || 

<pṛ0 219> [trayoviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
homādikaṃ tu viphalaṃ kumārīpūjanaṃ vinā | 
kumārī pūjitā yena trailokyaṃ tena pūjitam || 1 || 
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca ṛṣayo vā(va kha pāṭhaḥ |)savastathā | 
pitaraścaiva dikpālā gandharvāpsaraso'surāḥ || 2 || 
devapatnyastathā nāgā mātaraḥ siddhacāraṇāḥ | 
viśvedevāḥ sayakṣāśca rākṣasāścaiva devatāḥ || 3 || 
sthāvarā jaṅgamāścaiva sarvabhūtāni jantavaḥ | 
sarve te tṛptimāyānti kumāryo yatra pūjitāḥ || 4 || 
bahvīnāmapyalābhe tu ekaiva(kaika kha pāṭhaḥ |) varavarṇinī | 
pramadā yauvanonmattā sā bhavet sundarī parā || 5 || 
aṣṭābdāvadhi pañcābdāt pūjitavyā vidhānataḥ | 
kumāryai yajjalaṃ dattaṃ tajjalaṃ sāgaropamam || 6 || 
yadannaṃ dīyate tasyai kulācalasamaṃ priye | 
kumārīpūjanaṃ devi kumārīmanunā bhavet || 7 || 
yathā vā pūjyate devī pūjitavyāsta(vyāta kha pāṭhaḥ |)thā tathā | 
hetunā bhojitavyā(ṇijlopa aiśa |)stāḥ pāyasairmadhurānvitaiḥ || 8 || 

<pṛ0 220> bālapriyaiśca naivedyaistripurasundarīdhiyā | 
stutyā natvātha saṃtoṣya svābhīṣṭaṃ prārthayettataḥ || 9 || 
pūjitāyāśca tuṣṭāyā hastādbhaktiyuto naraḥ | 
śirasā pratigṛhṇīyādāśīrvādayutākṣatān || 10 || 
yadyadvadati saṃtuṣṭā tattadbhavati niścitam | 
iti te kathitaṃ devi rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam || 11 || 
vinā tena maheśāni na pūjāphalabhāgbhavet | 
nityārcāyāṃ ca dīkṣāyāṃ puraścaryādikeṣu ca || 12 || 
ādau pūrṇe ca madhye ca lakṣe pūrṇe viśeṣataḥ | 
kumāryaḥ pūjitavyāśca kumārīrnārcayedyadi || 13 || 
tasya pūjāphalaṃ sarvaṃ nīyate yakṣarākṣasaiḥ | 
na pūjayati cet kanyāstadā (tadvi ka pāṭhaḥ |) vighnaiḥ pra(pari ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhūyate || 14 || 
pūrvārjitaphalaṃ naśyet kā kathā parajanmani | 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena yadīcchedātmano hitam || 15 || 
pūjitavyā mahābhāgāḥ kumāryaḥ parameśvari | 
prātarutthāya pūjāyāṃ snānakāle'thavā punaḥ || 16 || 
saṃskṛtāsaṃskṛtā (te ka pāṭhaḥ |) vāpi hīnajātyudbhavāstathā | 
namasyāḥ sādhakendrāṇāṃ kulīnānāṃ parārcane || 17 || 
brahmaṇyarpitacittānāṃ nāstīha bhinnatā kvacit | 
kulapūjāṃ vinā devi kuladevī parāṅmukhī || 18 || 
parayoṣā yadā bhadre svayaṃ tāsāṃ gururbhavet | 

<pṛ0 221> brāhmaṇī kṣatriyā vaiśyā śūdrā ca kulabhūṣaṇā || 19 || 
veśyā nāpitakanyā ca rajakī (naṭakī kha pāṭhaḥ |) yoginī tathā | 
nānāvaidagdhyakuśalāḥ kalārūpaguṇānvitāḥ || 20 || 
tāsāṃ rūpaṃ ca bhāvaṃ ca vilokyāmarṣaceṣṭitam | 
brāhmaṇyādyaṣṭaśaktīnāṃ nāmabhiḥ kṛtaśabditāḥ (sajñakā kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 21 || 
āsanaṃ prathamaṃ tābhyaḥ svāgataṃ ca punaḥ punaḥ | 
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ ca pānīyaṃ madhuparkācamanīyakam || 22 || 
sna(snā kha pāṭhaḥ |)payed gandhapuṣpādbhiḥ keśasaṃskārameva ca | 
dhūpayitvā tathā keśān kauśeyaṃ(ṣeyaṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca nivedayet || 23 || 
tataḥ sthānāntare nītvā pīṭhamāstīrya bhaktitaḥ | 
saṃveśayedvidhānena pūrvādikramayogataḥ || 24 || 
nānālaṃkārabhūṣādyairbhūṣayitvānulepanaiḥ | 
gandhaṃ puṣpaṃ tathā dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ naivedyameva ca || 25 || 
dugdhaṃ dadhi ghṛtaṃ takraṃ navanītaṃ saśarkaram | 
nārikelaṃ kapitthaṃ ca nāgaraṅgakamuttamam || 26 || 
piṣṭakaṃ pāyasaṃ caiva nānārasasamanvitam | 
dattvā saṃpūjya vidhivat stutibhistoṣayettataḥ || 27 || 
mātardevi (ṅgeśvari ka pāṭhaḥ |) namastubhyaṃ brahmarūpadhare'naghe | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 28 || 
māheśi varade devi paramānandarūpiṇi (ṇī kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 

<pṛ0 222> kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 29 || 
kaumāri sarvavidyeśi kumārakrīḍane pare | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 30 || 
vaiṣṇavi viṣṇurūpāsi sarvavighnavināśinī (viṣṇurūpadhare devi vinatāsutavāhini kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 31 || 
vārāhi varade devi paramānandarūpiṇi (daṣṭedvṛtavasundhare kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 32 || 
indrāṇi varade devi gajaskandhasthitā hyasi (śakrarūpadhare devi śakrādisurapūjite kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 33 || 
cāmuṇḍe muṇḍamālāsrakcarcite bhayanāśini (vighnanāśini kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 34 || 
mahālakṣmi mahāmoha(mahotsāhe kha pāṭhaḥ |)kṣobhasaṃtānahāriṇi | 
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me || 35 || 
mi(i ka pāṭhaḥ |)timātṛmayi(ye ka pāṭhaḥ |) devi mi(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)timātṛbahi(s?ṣ)kṛte | 
eke bahutare devi viśvarūpe namo'stu te || 36 || 
etat stotraṃ paṭhedyastu karmārambheṣu saṃyataḥ | 
vidagdhāśca (gdhā vā kha pāṭhaḥ |) samālokya tasya vighnaṃ na jāyate || 37 || 
ācamya mukhavāsena tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet | 
tato dadyāt punarmālyaṃ gandhacandanapaṅkilama || 38 || 

<pṛ0 223> yadi krīḍāparāstāstu bhavanti bhāgyayogataḥ | 
krī(ḍāya?ḍaye)t krīḍanaiḥ sarvāḥ krīḍārasaparāyaṇaḥ || 39 || 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena rakṣitavyāḥ sadā priye | 
yathā tu namitāḥ prājñe bhaktibhāvaparāyaṇaiḥ || 40 || 
svecchāṛtumatī yā syādgṛhītvā raktamuttamam | 
rocanācandrakāśmīrakastūryagurusaṃyutam || 41 || 
svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ divyaṃ phalaṃ vā divyameva ca | 
gṛhītvā pūjayed devīṃ mahātripurasundarīm || 42 || 
kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ vāpi nānyatra kusumaṃ bhavet | 
madyaṃ māṃsaṃ mudrā śaktiḥ svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ tathā || 43 || 
ebhireva maheśāni pratyakṣīkriyate parā | 
dravyasaṃśodhanaṃ kṛtvā śaktiśodhanasaṃbhavaiḥ || 44 || 
saṃpūjya tripurāṃ devīmasādhyamapi sādhayet | 
anyā yadi na gacchanti nijakanyānujātmanaḥ (tmajā ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 45 || 
agrajā mātulānī tu mātā vā tatsapatnikā | 
vayasā jātito vāpi hīnā rakṣyāḥ svasā yathā || 46 || 
pūjyāḥ kulavaraiḥ sarvairnijāhaṃkāravarjitaiḥ | 
svayamakṣobhito bhūtvā mūlayoga na cācaret || 47 || 
mūlayogakṛtāmāyuḥsiddho'pi naśyati dhruvam | 
sarvābhāve hyekatarā pūjanīyā prayatnataḥ || 48 || 
saṃskṛtāsaṃskṛtā vāpi bandhakī vātha niṣpatiḥ | 

<pṛ0 224> pūrvāṃbhāve parā jñeyā tadaṃśā yoṣito yataḥ || 49 || 
ekā cet kulaśāstrajñā labhyā (bhyate ka pāṭhaḥ |) kulaviśāradaiḥ | 
pūjārhā sā ta(rā?dā)devi bhogamokṣaprasādhikā || 50 || 
ekā ca yuvatī yatra pūjitā cāvalokitā | 
tadā devyaśca sarvāśca pūjitaṃ sarvadaivatam || 51 || 
iti te kathitaṃ devi na prakāśyaṃ kadācana | 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde kumārīpūjanavidhānanirūpaṇaṃ trayoviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 23 || 

<pṛ0 225> [caturviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
evaṃ yaḥ kurute pūjāṃ nityaṃ bhaktiyuto budhaḥ | 
kandarpasadṛśaḥ strīṣu gaurīpatirivāparaḥ || 1 || 
sa eva sukṛtī loke sa eva kulabhūṣaṇam (ṇa kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
dhanyā ca jananī tasya dhanyastasya pitā khalu || 2 || 
daivī kalā bhavet tatra mama tulyo mahāmatiḥ | 
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhīśo jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 3 || 
vahniriva riporhantā induriva sukhapradaḥ | 
pitṛdevasamaḥ śāstā śucau śucisamaḥ khalu || 4 || 
bṛhaspatisamo vaktā dharaṇīsadṛśaḥ kṣamī | 
vaktre sarasvatī tasya lakṣmīstasya sadā gṛhe || 5 || 
tīrthāni tasya dehe vai naca tasya punarbhavaḥ | 
dhanena dhananāthaḥ syāt tejasā bhāskaropamaḥ || 6 || 
balena pavano hyeṣa dānena vāsavopamaḥ | 
gānena tumburuḥ sākṣānnityaṃ yena samarcitā || 7 || 
ekāhamapi deveśi mahātripurasundarīm | 
na pūjayettathā(nasyāt?tasmāt) prāyaścittaṃ samācaret || 8 || 
upoṣyaiva cādhivāsaṃ kṛtvā pūjāṃ pare'hani | 

<pṛ0 226> guruṃ saṃpūjya vidhivat tadā pūjāṃ samāpayet || 9 || 
kumāryai bhojanaṃ dattvā viprānapi ca bhojayet | 
ata ūrdhva punardīkṣāṃ lakṣajāpaṃ samācaret || 10 || 
mahātripurasundaryā yoginīnāṃ tathaiva ca | 
dvyahaṃ vātha tryahaṃ vāpi pūjāśūnyaṃ karoti yaḥ || 11 || 
siddhihānirbhavet tasya yoginīśāpamālabhet | 
catvāri tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo balam || 12 || 
tasya māṃsaṃ ca śukraṃ ca rūpaśoṇitameva ca | 
abhīṣṭānapi kāmāṃśca hiṃsanti yoginīgaṇāḥ || 13 || 
bandhubhiḥ kalaho ghoraḥ kalatraiśca viśeṣataḥ | 
sasyaśūnyā bhavedurvī vighnastasya pade pade || 14 || 
satyaṃ satyaṃ bhavedrogī daridraścopajāyate | 
ihaiva duḥkhamāpnoti trividhaṃ lomaharṣaṇam || 15 || 
pare svargāt paribhraṣṭaḥ kṣitau kṣitipa(lā?nā)yakaḥ | 
atulāṃ bhaktimāsādya kaivalyaṃ labhate tataḥ || 16 || 
brahmacintāpravṛtto yaḥ so'pahāya ca daivatam | 
vinā(la?na)yā pravarteta brahmaghātī sa eva tu || 17 || 
japadhyānaparo mantrī yogakṣemaparāyaṇaḥ | 
svayaṃ yadi bhavenmūḍho guruṃ tatra niyojayet || 18 || 
jñānakarmaparaḥ śuddhaḥ sarvadevamayaḥ prabhuḥ | 
siddhayaḥ sakalāstasya gururyasya hite rataḥ || 19 || 
māsato varṣato vāpi svayaṃ puṇyāhayogataḥ | 

<pṛ0 227> kuryādvai mahatīṃ pūjāṃ saṃpannāṅgavibhūṣitām || 20 || 
upahārairbahuvidhairalaṃkṛtasuvigrahām | 
nityamevārcanaṃ devyā nityameva samācaret || 21 || 
nityācāraparo mantrī naimittikavi(dhaṃ?dhiṃ) caret | 
nityanaimittikaparaḥ sādhuḥ kāmyaṃ vicintayet || 22 || 
kāmyānnaimittikaṃ nityaṃ nityaṃ naimittikāt param | 
nityācāravilopī yaḥ kāmyaṃ naimittikaṃ (kameva vā kha pāṭhaḥ |) ca vā || 23 || 
karoti sa ca durmedhā nāpnoti tasya tatphalam | 
nityācāramanādṛtya yadanyattu samīhate || 24 || 
niṣphalaṃ tasya tatkarma vandhyāstrīmaithunaṃ yathā | 
api puṣpaphalairvāpi pūjayeccakradevatāḥ || 25 || 
aṅgahīnaṃ tu puruṣo na samyagyājñiko bhavet | 
aṅgahīnā tathā pūjā na samyakphaladāyinī || 26 || 
dhyānaṃ pūjā japo homa iti hastacatuṣṭayam | 
śarīraṃ nyāsajālaṃ tu ātmā tajjñānameva ca || 27 || 
bhaktiḥ śiro'tra hṛcchraddhā kauśalaṃ netramīritam | 
evaṃ yajñaśarīraṃ tu matvā sādhakasattamaḥ || 28 || 
yajñaṃ samāpayennityaṃ sāṅmameva (sāṅgenaiva kha pāṭhaḥ |) khalu priye | 
aṅgahīne mahān doṣastato'ṅgaṃ nāvadhīrayet || 29 || 
sarvāṅgapūrṇapuruṣo yajñākhyaḥ (pūrṇayajñaḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarvasiddhidaḥ | 
tattadīhāparā śaktiḥ siddhiḥ saṃyogatastayoḥ || 30 || 

<pṛ0 228> śrīmattripurasundaryāḥ pūrṇe yajñaśarīrake | 
aṅgabādhe yathā doṣo nānyasya hi tathā bhavet || 31 || 
svavibhavā(nna?nu)rūpā vai pūjā kāryā vibhūtaye | 
vyatikramāt tu hīnaḥ syād brahmahatyāmavāpnuyāt || 32 || 
nādhikaṃ naiva ca nyūnamubhayaṃ pāpadāyakam | 
caturdaśyāmathāṣṭamyāṃ pūrṇāyāṃ māsamadhyataḥ || 33 || 
mahābhūtadine vāpi yajed vibhavavistaram | 
kṛṣṇayātha caturdaśyā yuktaṃ kujadinaṃ yadā || 34 || 
mahābhūtadinaṃ tattu sarvabhūtavaśaṃkaram | 
yadi puṣyo (ṣyā kha pāṭhaḥ |) bhavet tatra tadānantaphalapradam || 35 || 
mantraṃ yadi śmaśāne tu śavopari yathāvidhi | 
athavā prajaped devīṃ mātṛkāṃ nīlarūpiṇīm || 36 || 
kṛtvā japtvā tadā kuryād bhūtapretapiśācakān | 
tān vaśīkṛtya talloke tatheha taiḥ sahā(sa?ga)taḥ || 37 || 
vaśīkṛtya śriyā yukto modate putrapautrakaiḥ | 
yathā tathā gṛhe bāhye kṛtvā japtvā naro budhaḥ || 38 || 
rākṣasān kiṃnarān kṛtvā talloke ca tatheha ca | 
taiśca pramudito bhogī bhogān bhuṅkte yathecchayā || 39 || 
nijagṛhe sadā yastu pavitre sumanohare | 
kṛtvā japtvā naraḥ prājño yakṣān sarvān vaśaṃ nayet || 40 || 
bhuktvā ca mudito loke dhanī dhanaviśāradaḥ | 

<pṛ0 229> dhanaprāṇo dhanātmā ca sukhaṃ tadanucintanāt || 41 || 
anubhūya tadānandaṃ tadihāpi virājite | 
nadīnadasamīpe tu pitṛpīṭhe'thavā priye || 42 || 
kṛtvā japtvā ca talloke tatheha taiḥ pramoditaḥ | 
kāmātmā kāmarūpī ca kāmī kāmamanoharaḥ || 43 || 
kāmayitvākhilān kāmān kāmarāja ivāparaḥ | 
rājate satataṃ rājā rājabhiścaiva vājibhiḥ || 44 || 
puṇyakṣetre mahāpīṭhe puṇyavṛkṣasamīpake | 
kṛtvā japtvā naro mānī mānyo'yaṃ yamalokarāṭ || 45 || 
sarvadā(yuñjate?yaṃ jayī)loke rājate siddhi(ddha kha pāṭhaḥ |)bhūmiṣu | 
mānuṣatvaṃ vinā siddhiḥ punaḥ paramadurla(bhaṃ?bhā) || 46 || 
yasmāt tat sarvalokānāṃ bhogapratyakṣadāyakam | 
praphullakusumākīrṇe udyāne'timanohare || 47 || 
praphullakundasaṃmodaprapūritadigantare | 
vṛkṣamūle'thavā japtvā kṛtvā hastaṃ svamastake || 48 || 
gandharvarūpavān bhūtvā gītanṛtyaviśāradaḥ | 
gandharvān kiṃnarān kṛtvā talloke ca tatheha taiḥ || 49 || 
ānandaṃ paramaṃ labdhvā gītanṛtyādigocaram | 
tadānandamaye ramye modate tatprasādataḥ || 50 || 
nāgalokasaṃdhibhūmau vane giriguhāsu ca | 
kṛtvā japtvā sadā devīṃ nāgān sarvān vaśaṃ nayet || 51 || 

<pṛ0 230> taiḥ saha (tai sa pramu kha pāṭhaḥ |) muditaḥ prājñastalloke ca tatheha ca | 
bhuṅkte bahuvidhān bhogān nāgalokapratiṣṭhitān || 52 || 
parakīye yadā yatra paśyannacchavilokite(?) |
kṛtvā japtvā naro dharmādākṣaraṃ lokamāpnuyāt || 53 || 
tāneva vaśagān kṛtvā talloke ca tatheha ca | 
modate satataṃ vīraḥ surāsuraviceṣṭitaiḥ || 54 || 
yatra kutra mahāpīṭhe saure sūryavilokane | 
kṛtvā japtvā mahātejā bhavarogatamopahaḥ || 55 || 
udeti savitā sūryaḥ sūryaloke tatheha ca | 
vane sarvān vaśe kṛtvā vaśī vaśaṃ nayejjagat || 56 || 
puṇyanadyā (puṇyānadī kha pāṭhaḥ |) jalānte yastadanta(nte vā kha pāṭhaḥ |)rvā nirantaram | 
sadā puṇyaja(na?la)snāyī tatpāyī tadvihāravān || 57 || 
kṛtvā japtvā naraḥ prājño brahmarṣilokasaṃjñake | 
brahmarṣibhirmudā tatra tatheha ta(te pra kha pāṭhaḥ |)tprasādataḥ || 58 || 
bhogān bhuṅkte sa (bhakte savipra bhogān kha pāṭhaḥ |) viprarṣibrahma(brāhmayā kha pāṭhaḥ |)ghoṣapuraḥsarān | 
mahatyā ca(pri?śri)yā yukto brāhmyā caivātiśuddhayā || 59 || 
rājate satataṃ rājā (rā?vā)jirājavihāravān | 
devatāyatane (dha?pu)ṇye nityapūjāgṛhe tathā || 60 || 
devatāḥ pratigṛhṇanti devatāyatane kṛ(tāḥ?tām) | 
udyāne svasa(māṃ?mī)pasthe gṛhe cātimanohare || 61 || 

<pṛ0 231> nityamāvāhayet tatra madhuparkādibhiryajet | 
devāṃstatra vijānīyāt teṣāṃ sāṃnidhyayogataḥ || 62 || 
devatābhavanaistulye śobhite devaśobhayā | 
nirjane cātiśuddhe ca gandhadhūpotkare śubhe || 63 || 
dīpadarpaṇaghaṇṭādikusumotkarabhūṣite | 
devapīṭhe mahāpuṇye maha(du?tyu)ccagṛhe tathā || 64 || 
kṛtvā japtvā naro devi kārayedvaśagān sadā | 
bhāvanāvaśasaṃpanno naro di(vyo?vi)tatheha ca || 65 || 
dīvyate devavad devo devabhoga(gī ka pāṭhaḥ |)vihāravān | 
divyadarśī divyarūpī divyabhogavihāravān || 66 || 
devaiḥ saṃmānito mānī devavadviharet kṣitau | 
vimānagāmibhiryānairgajavājipuraḥsaraiḥ || 67 || 
śivālaye śivakṣetre śivaliṅgasamīpake | 
kṛtvā japtvā śivāmodī śivaloke tatheha ca || 68 || 
modate satataṃ yogī yuktaḥ śivadakiṃkaraiḥ | 
viṣṇukṣetre mahāpuṇye viṣṇugehe tadantike || 69 || 
vaiṣṇavaṃ bhāvamāśritya kṛtvā japtvātha sādhakaḥ | 
vaiṣṇavān vaśagān kṛtvā viṣṇuloke tatheha ca || 70 || 
modate satataṃ śuddhaṃ svayaṃ viṣṇurivāparaḥ | 
viṣṇupīṭhe parā siddhiḥ sadyo devatvadāyinī || 71 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde kumārīpūjāmahima-prayogādimāhātmyanirūpaṇaṃ caturviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 24 || 

<pṛ0 232> [pañcaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
puṇyakṣetrāṇi vakṣyante śṛṇu prādhānyato mama | 
puṇyakṣetraṃ nadītīraṃ guhāparvatamastakam || 1 || 
tīrthapradeśāḥ sindhūnāṃ saṃgamaḥ pāvanaṃ vanam | 
udyānāni viviktāni bilvamūlaṃ taṭaṃ gireḥ || 2 || 
tulasīkānanaṃ goṣṭhaṃ vṛṣaśūnyaṃ śivālayam | 
aśvatthāmalakīmūlaṃ gośālā jalamadhyataḥ || 3 || 
devatāyatanaṃ kūlaṃ samudrasya nijaṃ gṛham | 
gurūṇāṃ saṃnidhānaṃ ca cittaikāgrasthalaṃ tathā || 4 || 
sarveṣāmuttamaṃ proktaṃ nirjanaṃ paśuvarjitam | 
yatra tatra naraḥ pūjāṃ nirjane kurute tu yaḥ || 5 || 
tasyai datte śubhaṃ devi patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ jalam | 
śraddhābha(ktā?ktyo)śca bāhulyāt pūjādravyasya vistarāt || 6 || 
devyāḥ saṃnidhiratra syānnirjane pūjanāt tathā | 
vārāṇasyāṃ sadā pūjā saṃpūrṇaphaladāyinī || 7 || 
tatastu dviguṇā proktā puruṣottamasaṃnidhau | 
tato'pi dviguṇā proktā dvāravatyāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 8 || 
sarvakṣetreṣu pīṭheṣu pūjā dvāravatīsamā | 
vindhye śataguṇā proktā gaṅgāyāmapi tatsamā || 9 || 

<pṛ0 233> āryāvarte madhyadeśe brahmāvarte (hmadeśe ka pāṭhaḥ |) tathaiva ca | 
vindhyavat phaladā pūjā prayāge puṣkare tathā || 10 || 
tataścaturguṇā proktā karatoyānadījale | 
tasmāccaturguṇaphalā nandikuṇḍe ca pārvati || 11 || 
tataścaturguṇā proktā jalpī(lpe kha pāṭhaḥ |)śeśvarasaṃnidhau | 
tatra siddheśvarīyonau tato'pi dviguṇā matā || 12 || 
tataścaturguṇā proktā lauhityanadapāthasi | 
tatsamā kāmarūpe ca sarvatraiva jale sthale || 13 || 
sarvaśreṣṭho yathā viṣṇurlakṣmīḥ sarvottamā yathā | 
devīpūjā tathā śastā kāmarūpe surālaye || 14 || 
devīkṣetraṃ kāmarūpaṃ vidyate'nyanna tatsamam | 
anyatra viralā devī kāmarūpe gṛhe gṛhe || 15 || 
tataḥ śataguṇā proktā nīlakūṭasya mastake | 
tato'pi dviguṇā proktā hārake śivaliṅgake || 16 || 
tato'pi dviguṇā proktā dākṣāyaṇyāḥ svayoniṣu | 
tataḥ śataguṇā proktā (rṇa prekta kha pāṭhaḥ |) kāmākhyāyonimaṇḍale | 
kāmākhyāyāṃ mahādevīpūjāṃ yaḥ kṛtavān sakṛt || 17 || 
sa ceha labhate kāmān paratra śivarūpatā(m) | 
na tasya sadṛśo'nyo'sti ripustasya na vidyate || 18 || 
vāñchitaṃ samavāpnoti cirāyurabhijāyate | 
vāyoriva gatistasya bhavedanyairabādhitā || 19 || 

<pṛ0 234> saṃgrāme śāstravāde ca durjayaḥ sa hi jāyate | 
mūlamūrtirmahādevyā yonirūpā nigadyate || 20 || 
tatra saṃpūjya tāṃ devīṃ punarjanma na vidyate | 
puṇyakṣetramiti proktaṃ na prakāśyaṃ kadācana || 21 || 
devyuvāca 
saṃgrāme sūtake caiva rogabhītau tathāpadi | 
tadā kiṃ syānmahādeva tadiha kathayasva me || 22 || 
īśvara uvāca 
aśaucaṃ sādhakendrāṇāṃ nāsti rogabhayaṃ tathā | 
śucīnāṃ dharmacaryāṇāmāpadāmudbhavaḥ kutaḥ || 23 || 
yadi vighno bhaved devi pūrvakarmanibandhanāt | 
tadaivaṃ parameśāni vidhiṃ kuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ || 24 || 
gandhaṃ puṣpaṃ ca dhūpaṃ ca dīpaṃ naivedyameva ca | 
etairhīnā tu yā pūjā na sā kalyāṇadāyinī || 25 || 
puṣpāñjaliṃ vidhāyātha pūjayeccakradevatāḥ | 
aṣṭakoṇaṃ trikoṇaṃ vā baindavaṃ paripūjayet || 26 || 
evaṃ kṛtvā japedvidyāṃ samarpya ca visarjayet | 
kumāryai bhojanaṃ dattvā saṃpūrṇaphalabhāg bhavet || 27 || 
athavādvaitabhāvena ātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ smaret | 
advaitabhāvasaṃpannastripurīkṛtavigrahaḥ (he kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 28 || 
ātmanyeva yajed devīmupacārairyathāvidhi | 

<pṛ0 235> nijadehākhyayantraṃ tu sarvayantrāt paraṃ śivam || 29 || 
ānandahṛdayaṃ kṛtvā sa(donnā?dā nyā)sena mānavaḥ | 
gurūn nutvā vidhānena japedvidyāmananyadhīḥ || 30 || 
sugandhipuṣpamālābhiḥ svarṇālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ | 
snigdhaṃ sumadhuraṃ yantraṃ kāmarūpaṃ manoharam || 31 || 
kṛtvā sumaṅgalaṃ dehe mṛdubhāṣaṇasasmitam | 
ahiṃsāvṛttimāśritya sarvaprāṇihite rataḥ || 32 || 
nijabhāve sadā tiṣṭhed devavadviharet kṣitau | 
duḥkheṣvanudvignamanāḥ sukheṣu vigataspṛhaḥ || 33 || 
vītarāgabhayakrodho mano'haṃkāravarjitaḥ | 
yoṣidante puraścaryā kāryā rātrau nacānyathā || 34 || 
manastuṣṭau samutpā(nne?te) siṃhavyāghrasamākule | 
parasainyāgame vāpi kuryānmānasapūjanam || 35 || 
kārāgāranibandhe vā pūjādravyavihīnakaḥ | 
idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramamidaṃ svastyayanaṃ mahat || 36 || 
mantravedamayaṃ śuddhaṃ pūjākramamanuttamam | 
gopayed yatnato divyaṃ sarvasiddhipradāyakam || 37 || 
jñānadaṃ kāmadaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sadyaḥ pratyayakārakam | 
yasmai kasmai na dātavyaṃ nāstikāya kadācana || 38 || 
etajjñānāt paraṃ jñānī sadyo bhavati tatkṣaṇāt | 
devyuvāca 
kathaṃ tanmānuṣe loke lokānāṃ darśanaṃ bhavet || 39 || 

<pṛ0 236> tatkathaya mahādeva lokadeśavibhedataḥ | 
īśvara uvāca 
mānuṣe(ṣa kha pāṭhaḥ |) bhārataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ tatra ca puṇyadeśakam || 40 || 
lokāḥ puṇyaparāḥ śreṣṭhāsteṣāṃ jñānī viśiṣyate | 
jñānapuṇyavihīnāstu piśācā bhogatatparāḥ || 41 || 
paśuprāyajanā mlecchāḥ pretalokanivāsinaḥ | 
tadastīti pramāṇena jānāti (nanti kha pāṭhaḥ |) na samīhate || 42 || 
bhuṅkte bahuvidhān bhogān bhūtalokapramāṇakaḥ | 
bhakṣyābhakṣyaṃ na jānānti kāryākāryamathāpi vā || 43 || 
vartante'vidhinā yajñe bhogairmadhupuraskṛtaiḥ | 
te punariha deveśi niśācarapramāṇakāḥ || 44 || 
jīvanaṃ dhanamevātra dhanacintārāpayaṇaḥ(parāyaṇaḥ?) (ṇā kha pāṭhaḥ | ) | 
dhanasaṃcayakārī ca dānabhogabahiṣkṛtaḥ || 45 || 
śiśnodarasu(mu ka pāṭhaḥ |)khe yastu kevalaṃ vartate janaḥ | 
yakṣalokapramāṇī ca yakṣaloke mahīyate || 46 || 
sadācāramaye deśe sadācāravihāravān | 
arogo rūpavān bhogī pitṛloke mahīyate || 47 || 
madhyadeśe mahāpuṇye devanadīsamanvite | 
pūjyapūjakabhāvena yajñāyajñaviśāradaḥ || 48 || 
śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo vijño mānuṣa(ṣo kha pāṭhaḥ |)lokasūcakaḥ | 

<pṛ0 237> bhogamokṣaprade śuddhe kṛṣṇamṛgaviceṣṭite || 49 || 
kartavyamiti sarvāṇi śrutismṛtimayāni ca | 
kurute satataṃ bhogī dānabhogaparāyaṇaḥ || 50 || 
devavad viharelloke devalokapramāṇakaḥ | 
atha triguṇarūpiṇyāḥ pīṭhe traiguṇyahāriṇī (nistraiguṇyadāyake ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 51 || 
mahādevyā mahāpuṇye guhye vā prakaṭe'pi ca | 
nirānandairathā(thavā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nandairdakṣiṇottararūpakaiḥ || 52 || 
atadātmā tadātmā ca yogī vā bhogasaṃyutaḥ | 
nistraiguṇyo bhaved devi mahādevīprasādataḥ || 53 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde puṇyapīṭha-āpatkālapūjādividhinirūpaṇaṃ pañcaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 25 || 

<pṛ0 238> [ṣaḍviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
devyuvāca 
kīdṛśo vā bhavecchiṣyaḥ kīdṛśo vā bhavedguruḥ | 
kīdṛśī vā bhaved dīkṣā kathaṃ kuryādvada prabho || 1 || 
īśvara uvāca 
atha dīkṣāṃ pravakṣyāmi mantriṇāṃ hitakāmyayā | 
vinānayā na caiva syāt sarvamantraphalaṃ yataḥ || 2 || 
jñānaṃ divyaṃ yato dadyāt kuryāt pāpakṣayaṃ yataḥ | 
ato dīkṣeti sā proktā guruśiṣyau vadāmi te || 3 || 
ādau vidyāvatāro'yaṃ dakṣiṇāmūrtiravyayaḥ | 
gururbhūtvaiva bhagavān mahāvidyāṃ dadāti vai || 4 || 
divyo gururṛṣiḥ so'tha divyāṃ vidyāṃ prakāśya ca | 
divyaughān akarocchiṣyān vakṣye'tha śṛṇu pārvati | 
prakāśo'tha vimarṣo(rśo)'nyastvānando'para ityapi || 5 || 
nāmabhedādahaṃ loke'kalpayaṃ divyarūpataḥ | 
trayastebhyaḥ samutpannāḥ siddhāśca traya eva te || 6 || 
jñānaṃ satyaṃ pūrṇa iti śrīmukhāste samīritāḥ | 
divyā madantike nityaṃ siddhā bhūmāvihāpi ca || 7 || 
nivasanti tatastebhyaḥ samabhūvaṃstrayastathā | 
svabhāvaḥ pratibhastadva(sva ka pāṭhaḥ |)t subhagaśceti nāmataḥ || 8 || 

<pṛ0 239> te bhūmāveva satataṃ nivasanti madātmakāḥ | 
prasannavadanāḥ sarve varābhayakarānvitāḥ || 9 || 
dvinetrā dvibhujā ete lalitākārasaṃyutāḥ | 
māyālakṣmyādikāstadvadākhyā ānandanāthagāḥ || 10 || 
navānāṃ navanāmāni navārṇāni pṛthak pṛthak | 
tāni saptākṣarīyogāt pratyekaṃ ṣoḍaśākṣaram || 11 || 
nityāṣoḍaśarūpāṇi tāni jñeyānyanukramāt | 
vimalā jayinī madhye pūjyā evaṃ varānane || 12 || 
nāma paryāyataḥ prāptaṃ kālāvāptamiti dvayam | 
prasiddhaṃ bāhyato'nyacca trīṇi nāmāni sādhake || 13 || 
manuṣyarūpasaṃprāptaḥ sarvatantrārthatattvavit | 
mantratantrāvatā(votha?rāya)vicarāmyahameva saḥ || 14 || 
guruḥ śākto bhaved ṛddhyai tadanyo viparītadaḥ | 
guruḥ sarvaguṇopeto doṣairaspṛṣṭamānasaḥ || 15 || 
arogī nātivṛddhaśca(sa?su)vacā mi(sva?ṣṭa)bhāṣaṇaḥ | 
sundaraḥ sumukhaḥ svacchastvalobhī(sulabho kha pāṭhaḥ |) bahumantravit || 16 || 
asaṃśayaḥ saṃśayacchinnigrahānugrahe prabhuḥ | 
nirdvando nirahaṃkāraḥ satyavādī dṛḍhavrataḥ || 17 || 
āśramyāśramadharmajño mātsaryarahitaḥ śuciḥ | 
abahumantrado vāgmī japapūjāparāyaṇaḥ || 18 || 
sarvatantrārthavettā ca dayāvān naca hiṃsakaḥ | 

<pṛ0 240> yadṛcchālābhasaṃtuṣṭaḥ śānto niyamavānṛjuḥ || 19 || 
smerapūrvābhibhāṣitvaṃ svacchatā'ji(kṣa?hma)vṛttitā | 
saṃtoṣitvamagarvitvamalobhitvamaninditā || 20 || 
apakṣatva(nairapekṣya ka pāṭhaḥ |)mavittecchā gurutvaṃ hitavāditā | 
evaṃvidho gururjñeyastvitaraḥ śiṣyaduḥkhadaḥ || 21 || 
yathāyogyaguṇaiḥ pūrvairyuktaścātipriyaṃvadaḥ | 
viśuddhadehavadanaḥ śuddhāmbaradharaḥ śuciḥ || 22 || 
vimukhaḥ paranindāsu devatādarśaneṣu ca | 
parānnavanitābhūmipīḍāsu vigataspṛhaḥ || 23 || 
dayānvitaḥ sarvajane prekṣākārī jitendriyaḥ | 
āstiko gurubhaktaśca śuddhi(vā?mā)n susthirāśayaḥ || 24 || 
alubdhaḥ sthiramaitraśca guruvākyapramāṇakaḥ | 
sarvadā dṛḍhabhaktiśca gurau mantre sadaivate || 25 || 
evaṃvidho bhavecchiṣyastvitaro duḥkhakṛdguroḥ | 
dīkṣākālaṃ viniścitya muhūrte doṣavarjite || 26 || 
guruṃ samāśrayecchiṣyaḥ prasādāya samāhitaḥ | 
prasīda nātha deveti tatheti ca kṛtādaraḥ || 27 || 
praṇamyopaviśet pārśve tathā gacchedanujñayā | 
mukhāvalokī seveta kuryādādiṣṭamādarāt || 28 || 
asatyaṃ na vadedagre na bahu pralapedapi | 
kāmaṃ krodhaṃ tathā lobhaṃ mānaṃ prahasanaṃ stutim || 29 || 

<pṛ0 241> cāpalāni ca ji(kṣā?hmā)ni kāryāṇi paridevanam | 
ṛṇadānaṃ tathādānaṃ vastūnāṃ krayavikrayam || 30 || 
na kuryād guruṇā sārdhaṃ śiṣyo'pi ca kadācana | 
yato guruḥ śivaḥ sākṣāttaṃ stuvan praṇaman(tya?bha)jet || 31 || 
yathā deve tathā mantre yathā mantre tathā gurau | 
yathā gurau tathā cātmanyevaṃ bhaktikramaḥ priye || 32 || 
avamanya gurorvākyaṃ svabuddhyā kurute tu yaḥ | 
na kadācidbhavet siddhirmantrairdevaprapūjanaiḥ || 33 || 
mantreṇa tasya niyataṃ pūjāṃ kuryādyathoditam | 
āsanaṃ śayanaṃ vastraṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ pādukāṃ tathā || 34 || 
chāyā kalatramanyacca yad gurostat prapūjayet | 
gu(ru?roḥ)śayyāsanaṃ pīṭhamupānacchatrapādukām || 35 || 
snānodakaṃ tathā chāyāṃ laṅghayenna kadācana | 
guruṃ dṛṣṭvā bhaved hṛṣṭaḥ paramānandanirbharaḥ || 36 || 
bhītabhītaḥ padāmbhojaṃ paśyeccakitalocanaḥ | 
(uo?u)padīkṛtya sarvasvaṃ tadādiṣṭaṃ mudānvitaḥ || 37 || 
kuryāt sarvaprayatnena yathā tuṣṭo bhavet tu saḥ | 
sakṛt praṇamya daṇḍavadiṣṭadevadhiyā gurum || 38 || 
pulakāñcitasarvāṅgaḥ pūjākoṭiphalaṃ labhet | 
yadyat priyatamaṃ vastu bhaktyā tasmai nivedayet || 39 || 
adattvā gurave vastu yatkiṃcidiha bhūtale | 
ātmasāt kurute yastu sa bhavedyoginīpa(tiḥ?śuḥ) || 40 || 

<pṛ0 242> yade(dai ka pāṭhaḥ |)va labhyate vastu bhikṣayā vānyaceṣṭayā | 
tannivedya tadādiṣṭaṃ svayaṃ bhuñjīta sādaram || 41 || 
idameva hi sacchiṣyaiḥ kartavyaṃ guruniṣkṛtiḥ | 
yena viśuddhabhāvena sarvathātmārpaṇaṃ gurau || 42 || 
gurutā śiṣyatā caiva tayorvatsarakālataḥ | 
dāpayet svakṛtaṃ doṣaṃ patnī pāpaṃ svabhartari || 43 || 
tathā śiṣyārjitaṃ pāpaṃ gurumāpnoti niścitam | 
sadguruḥ svāśrame śiṣyaṃ varṣamekaṃ parīkṣya vai || 44 || 
dīkṣākālaṃ tataḥ prājño bhāvayet susamāhitaḥ | 
śaratkāle ca vaiśākhe dīkṣā śreṣṭhaphalapradā || 45 || 
phālgune mārgaśīrṣe ca jyaiṣṭhe dīkṣā ca madhyamā | 
āṣāḍho māghamāsaśca kaniṣṭhau sadbhirādṛtau || 46 || 
ninditaḥ śrāvaṇaścaitraḥ pauṣo bhādrapadastathā | 
ninditeṣvapi māseṣu dīkṣoktā grahaṇe śubhā || 47 || 
viṣuvāyanayordvandve āṣāḍhe madanotsave | 
grahaṇe'rkasya cendrorvā dinaṃ tatphaladaṃ bhavet || 48 || 
mantrārambhaṃ sudhīḥ kuryācchuklapakṣe śubhe'hani | 
ravau gurau site some kartavyaṃ budhavāsare || 49 || 
pūrṇimā pañcamī caiva dvitīyā saptamī tathā | 
trayodaśī ca daśamī praśastā sarvakāmadā || 50 || 
pañcāṅgaśuddhadivase svodaye rāśitārayoḥ | 

<pṛ0 243> guruśukrodaye śuddhe lagne dvādaśaśobhite || 51 || 
candratārānukūle ca sthire dīkṣā śubhā priye | 
trividhā sā bhaved dīkṣā māntrī śāktī ca śāṃbhavī || 52 || 
mantrārcanāsanasthānadhyānayogādibhiḥ kṛtā | 
māntrī dīkṣā ca sā proktā yathāśāstroktarūpiṇī || 53 || 
siddhaiḥ svaśaktimālokya tayā kevalayā śiśoḥ | 
nirupāyakṛtā dīkṣā śā(kteyo?ktīyaṃ)parikīrtitā || 54 || 
abhisaṃdhiṃ vinācāryaśiṣyayorubhayorapi | 
deśikānugraheṇaiva śivatāvyaktikāriṇī || 55 || 
śiṣṭā (śeṣaṃ ka pāṭhaḥ |) tu śāṃbhavī dīkṣā śivāveśanakāriṇī | 
ajñānād viśvavijñānaṃ trāṇaṃ saṃsārabandhanāt || 56 || 
yataḥ karoti saṃsiddhyai mantra ityucyate tadā | 
bhūme parigrahaṃ kuryādyathoktaṃ te mayā purā || 57 || 
śalyādiśodhanaṃ kuryāt yājñe (yājñī ka pāṭhaḥ |) vidhividhānataḥ | 
viprāśi(rā?ṣā) vedaghoṣairmaṅgalācārapūrvakam || 58 || 
vāstorbaliṃ prakurvīta maṇḍalaṃ racayet tathā | 
sarvamaṅgalasaṃpattyai vidadhyādaṅkurārpaṇam || 59 || 
guruḥ kālaṃ viniścitya prāgeva sapta vāsarān | 
śiṣyānukūlamantreṇa pūjayet paradevatām || 60 || 
praṇavādyairnamo'ntaiśca rātrau rātrīśanāmabhiḥ | 
pro(kta?ktān)balīṃstu teṣāṃ vai vitaredvidhinā guruḥ || 61 || 

<pṛ0 244> pūjāṃ rātrau prakurvīta dīkpālānapi pūjayet | 
tattad dhvajamadhiṣṭhāya tattadvarṇavirājitam || 62 || 
pāyasānnairbaliṃ tebhyo dattvā tān prārthayed guruḥ | 
dhārāyuktaṃ vāripātraṃ tattanmantrānumantritam || 63 || 
śirasyādhāya deveśi pradakṣiṇamanuvrajet | 
yajñaṃ saṃrakṣayed divyamādau gururananyadhīḥ || 64 || 
śakrādisahitā devāḥ pūjitāstarpitāstathā | 
ma(thaṃ?khaṃ)rakṣantu saṃtuṣṭā lokapālā namo'stu vaḥ || 65 || 
ma(the?kha)grahaṇapūrvedyuḥ sāyameva nivāsanam | 
gurvādisahito vāso rātrau niyamapūrvakam || 66 || 
vidhivanmaṇḍapaṃ cāruvedikāmadhyaśobhitam | 
patākādhvajasaṃkīrṇaṃ vitānādivibhūṣitam || 67 || 
nirdhūmaśāntasaṃbuddhadīpāvalibhirañcitam | 
puṣpākṣataphalaiḥ kumbhairlājairarcirbhira(ravi kha pāṭhaḥ |)rcitam || 68 || 
tarupallavamālābhiḥ sarvataḥ samalaṃkṛtam | 
saṃvṛtaṃ (ntai kha pāṭhaḥ |) kadalīstambhaiḥ pūgopetai(pātrai kha pāṭhaḥ |)ralaṃkṛtam || 69 || 
pañcagavyena tadgehaṃ cakrarājaṃ śiśuṃ tathā | 
śodhayenmūlamantreṇa mantritena varānane || 70 || 
samānaṃ pañcagavyānāṃ kṛtvā bhāgaṃ viśodhayet | 
mūlamantreṇa saṃmantrya kuśāgreṇaiva śodhayet || 71 || 
tena sarvaviśuddhiḥ syāt sarvapāpanikṛntanam | 

<pṛ0 245> mahāpātakajātāni kṛtvā gavyaṃ pibedyadi || 72 || 
nāśayet pānamātreṇa ityāhurvedave(vā ka pāṭhaḥ |)dinaḥ | 
susnātaṃ śuddhaveśaṃ ca śiṣyaṃ susthiramānasam || 73 || 
ārāt (stho'yaṃ?saṃsthāpya)vidhivad yajedanudinaṃ guruḥ | 
homayet saṃskṛte vahnau pāyasairmadhurāplutaiḥ || 74 || 
ācāryaḥ kuṇḍe vidhivat saṃpūjya paradevatām | 
mūlenaiva śikhāṃ baddhvā tataḥ śayyāgataṃ śiśum || 75 || 
svapnamānavamāśritya (svāda?svāpa)yet pūrvamastakam | 
tāro hilidvayaṃ śūlapāṇaye dvi(ja?ṭha) īritaḥ || 76 || 
svapnamānavamantro'yaṃ śayane parikīrtitaḥ | 
namo'jāya trinetrāya piṅgalāya mahātmane || 77 || 
rāmāya viśvarūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ | 
svapne kathaya me tathyaṃ sarvakāryeṣvaśeṣataḥ || 78 || 
kriyāsiddhiṃ vidhāsyāmi tvatprasādānmaheśvara | 
mantreṇa svāpa(svapi kha pāṭhaḥ |)kāle tu devaṃ prārthya tataḥ svapet || 79 || 
svapne śubhāśubhaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ pṛcchet prātaḥ śiśuṃ guruḥ | 
guruṇā vārcanaṃ kṛtvā upavāsī jitendriyaḥ || 80 || 
darbhaśayyāgato rātrau dṛṣṭvā svapnaṃ nivedayet | 
kanyāṃ chatraṃ rathaṃ dīpaṃ prāsādaṃ (maṅga?kama)laṃ nadīm || 81 || 
ku(kumaṃkṛṣayaṃ?ñjaraṃ vṛṣabhaṃ)mālyaṃ svarṇaṃ ca phalinaṃ drumam | 
parvataṃ ca hayaṃ medhyamāmamāṃsaṃ surāsavam || 82 || 

<pṛ0 246> evamādīni sarvāṇi (spṛ?dṛ)ṣṭvā siddhimavāpnuyāt | 
cāṇḍālaṃ gardabhaṃ kākaṃ gartaṃ śūnyamamaṅgalam || 83 || 
tailābhyaktaṃ naraṃ nagnaṃ śuṣkavṛkṣaṃ sakaṇṭhakam | 
prāsādama(ṅga?ta)laṃ dṛṣṭvā naro rogamavāpnuyāt || 84 || 
dṛṣṭvā duḥsvapnakaṃ caiva homāt siddhimavāpnuyāt | 
śubhe śubhaṃ vadet tasya juhuyādaśubhe(śubha?śatam) | 
astreṇeti kramāt prokto vidhiḥ śiṣyā(śayyā ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhivāsa(ra?ne) || 85 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde gurvādilakṣaṇadīkṣānirūpaṇaṃ ṣaḍviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 26 || 

<pṛ0 247> [saptaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
atha pūrvānusāreṇa nityaṃ prātaḥ samāpya ca | 
devān pitṝn samabhyarcya vastrālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ || 1 || 
ācāryaṃ vṛṇuyād bhaktyā brāhmaṇānapi to(bhū ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣayet | 
śiṣyaḥ (sā?sva)laṃkṛto maunī puṣpacandanabhūṣitaḥ || 2 || 
nānāmaṅgalavādyaiśca brahmaghoṣapuraḥsaram | 
nārīṇāṃ maṅgalāśīrbhirbrāhmaṇānāṃ tathaiva ca || 33 || 
jayaśabdānvitaiḥ stotraiḥ saṃtuṣṭaḥ śuddhamānasaḥ | 
dīpamālāvalīramyaṃ nānādhūpapradhūpitam || 4 || 
maṇḍapaṃ vidhivad devi pūrvavat praviśed guruḥ | 
pūrvavadaparaṃ kṛtvāsane samupaviśya ca || 5 || 
tathāparaṃ ca nirvartya kuṅkumena varānane | 
vedikāyāṃ varārohe sindūrarajasāthavā || 6 || 
cakrarāje (ja ka pāṭhaḥ |) tu likhite (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) tanmadhye darbhavistṛte | 
sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tāmraṃ maṇikaṃ (mārtika ka pāṭhaḥ |) ca sulakṣaṇam || 7 || 
dvātriṃśadaṅgulaṃ kumbhaṃ vistāronnatiśālinam | 
kṣālayitvāstra(taṃ?ma)ntreṇa kumbhaṃ samyak sureśvari || 8 || 
candanāgurukarpūrarocanākuṅkumairapi | 

<pṛ0 248> divyairdravyaistu saṃpūrṇaṃ vāsoyugmena veṣṭitam || 9 || 
nūtanaṃ netraramyaṃ ca puṣpamālādyalaṃkṛtam | 
dadhicandanasaṃliptaṃ kṣi(ptā?ptvā)ntarnavaratnakam || 10 || 
madayantīṃ sahadevīṃ dūrvāṃ bhasma tathaiva ca | 
mṛtikāḥ sapta vinyastaṃ pallavaiḥ pañcabhiryutam || 11 || 
parito veṣṭitaṃ sūtrai raktaiścātimanoharaiḥ | 
yavānāstīrya puṣpāṇi(sa?su)radrumadhiyā guruḥ || 12 || 
mūlamantreṇa saṃsthāpya yajedādhārapūrvakam | 
vahnimaṇḍalarūpaṃ taṃ kalābhiḥ saha pūjayet || 13 || 
tathā sūryamayaṃ kumbhaṃ kalābhistatra pūjayet | 
jalaṃ somamayaṃ tadvat kalābhiśca samarcayet || 14 || 
tejastrayamidaṃ proktaṃ jvalattadātmakaṃ smṛtam | 
puṣpaira(ñjāla?ñjali)māpūrya tasminneva pradāpayet || 15 || 
paścimottatarudrendre puṣpapātaḥ śubho'śubhe | 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ śāntyai juhuyādastramantrataḥ || 16 || 
atha prāguktavidhinā yathākramamanuttamam | 
kṛtvā saṃpūjya vidhivadiṣṭvā devadhiyā guruḥ || 17 || 
aṅgāvṛtīḥ samabhyarcya śrapayitvā caruṃ tataḥ | 
bhāgamekaṃ mahādevyai śeṣamagnau hunettataḥ || 18 || 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ sājyaṃ madhuratritayānvitam | 
samiddhe'gnau mahādevīṃ dhyātvā samyak pradhānataḥ || 19 || 
yo'narciṣi juhotyagnāvasamiddhe ca mānavaḥ | 

<pṛ0 249> sa mandāgniḥ sāmayo vā alpāyuścopajāyate || 20 || 
tasmāt samiddhe hotavyaṃ nāsamiddhe kathaṃcana | 
ārogyamicchatāyuśca śriyamātyantikīṃ tathā || 21 || 
tathābudhaḥ sadhūme ca juhuyādyo hutāśane | 
yajamāno bhavedandhaḥ saputraśca vinaśyati || 22 || 
a(tha?pra)dīpte na hotavyaṃ madhyame nāpyanedhite | 
pradīpte lelihāne'gnau hotavyaṃ karmasiddhaye || 23 || 
hutvā sā(jñā?ṅgāṃ) maheśānīṃ samāpya tadanantaram | 
karma pūrvoktamā(cā?ca)ryya taruṇollāsavān guruḥ || 24 || 
śiṣyamāhūya yatnena vāsasācchādya tanmukham | 
viśe(ṣyā?ṣā)rghyodakenaiva tamavo(ve ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṣya vidhānataḥ || 25 || 
kāruṇyā(vinaye?mbunidhe)devi sarvasaṃpattisaṃśraye | 
śaraṇye vatsa(lo?le)mātaḥ kṛpāmasmiñ śiśau kuru || 26 || 
(aśi?āṇa)vapramukhaiḥ pāśaiḥ pāśitasya sureśvari | 
dīnasyāsya dayādhāre kuru kāruṇyamīśvari || 27 || 
aihikāmuṣmikairbhaugairabhisaṃ(bu?ba)ddhyatāmasau | 
svabhaktiḥ sakalā cāsmai dīyatāṃ niṣkalāśraye || 28 || 
evaṃ prārthya mahādevīmu(drā?dvā)sya hṛdayāmbuje | 
śiṣyāya śrāvayed divyaḥ śivo'hamiti bhāvayan || 29 || 
antastamopahaṃ divyaṃ siddhāntaṃ śrāvayed guruḥ | 
(yat?ṣaṭ)triṃśattattvabha(vi?ri)taṃ viśvaṃ sthāvarajaṅgamam || 30 || 

<pṛ0 250> śarīraṃ cāpi ta(tro?ttvo)tthaṃ tasminneva dvidhā śivaḥ | 
kañcukitaḥ śivo jīvo niṣkañcukaḥ paraḥ śivaḥ || 31 || 
ātmajñānamātmavidbhiḥ puruṣārthaḥ samīritaḥ | 
varṇātmakaṃ maheśāni nityāḥ śabdāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 32 || 
acintyastviha mantrāṇāṃ prabhāvaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ | 
saṃpradāyaparijñānaṃ gurūṇāṃ siddhidāyakam || 33 || 
viśvāsādguruvākyānāṃ sarvasiddhiritīritā | 
prāmāṇyaṃ cātra svaniṣṭhaṃ viśvāsaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ || 34 || 
gurūṇāṃ caiva mantrāṇāṃ devānāmapi pārvati | 
manaḥpavanayoścaivamekatvena vibhāvanāt || 35 || 
antarātmaparijñānamiti jānīhi pārvati | 
ānandaṃ brahmaṇo rūpaṃ tacca dehe(ha ka pāṭhaḥ |) vibhāvayet || 36 || 
tasyābhivyañjakāḥ pañca makārādyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ | 
taireva yajanaṃ tasya guptyā siddhirnacānyathā || 37 || 
prākaṭyācca(prakṭā ca ka pāṭhaḥ |)(va?bha)yaṃ yasmād gopayenmātṛjāravat | 
abhedabhāvanādārḍhyādājñāsiddhiḥ samīritā || 38 || 
na ninded dakṣiṇaṃ vāmaṃ na ninded darśanāni ca | 
nindādrohādikartṝṇāṃ gaṇanāṃ naiva kārayet || 39 || 
rahasyakathanaṃ devi sacchiṣya(ṣyāyai kha pāṭhaḥ |) eva nāpare | 
sadā vidyānusaṃdhānaṃ śivabhāvena tatparaḥ || 40 || 
kāmaṃ krodhaṃ tathā lobhaṃ madamohau tathaiva ca | 

<pṛ0 251> hiṃsāṃ steyaṃ ca mātsaryaṃ yallokeṣu vigarhitam || 41 || 
strīvidveṣādikaṃ caiva varjayenmatimān sadā | 
eka eva gururdevastasyaivopāsanaṃ sadā || 42 || 
asaṃśayastu sarvatra niṣparigrahatā matā | 
phalavirahitaṃ karma tyajedanityameva tat || 43 || 
pañcānāmapyalābhe tu nityaṃ kramavima(rṣa?rśa)nam |
nirbhayatvaṃ ca sarvasmājjñeyaṃ sarva ha(ri?viḥ)priye || 44 || 
svayameva hi hotātra ātmā śi(śa ka pāṭhaḥ |)vastu pāvakaḥ | 
ātmalābhātparaṃ nāsti phalaṃ kvāpi ca suvrate || 45 || 
saiṣājñā paramā śaivī kathitā tava pārvati | 
vedādisakalā vidyā veśyā iva prakāśitāḥ || 46 || 
sarveṣu darśaneṣveva vidyeyaṃ khalu gopitā | 
dhīmāstatraiva dīkṣeta sarvathātmavibhūtaye || 47 || 
atha śiṣyaśirodeśe (varu?cara)ṇaṃ raktaśuklayoḥ | 
bhāvayitvā vapustasya kṣālitaṃ māṃ(mā kha pāṭhaḥ |)sabṛhitam || 48 || 
tadamṛtaiḥ(śra?sra)vadbhiśca kuryād gururudāradhīḥ | 
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ jvalantīṃ jvalanacchavim || 49 || 
pratīśaṣaharīṃ(?)koṭisūryaprakāśinīṃ parām | 
candrakoṭiprabhāṃ śuddhāmajñānendhanadāhikām || 50 || 
tattadraśmibhirevāsya pāpapāśāṃstu saṃdahet | 
śivo'hamiti niścitya vīkṣet karuṇayā dṛśā (ttaṃ karuṇadravā kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 51 || 

<pṛ0 252> sarvapāpavinirmuktaṃ sarvadoṣavivarjitam | 
punaḥ svayaṃ śivo bhūtvā asaṃdigdhamanā guruḥ || 52 || 
śivahastena śiṣyasya mantraṃ śirasi saṃspṛśet | 
japoktakramato yogī śiṣyadehaṃ praviśya tu || 53 || 
gṛhītvā tasya cātmānamātmanā yojayed guruḥ | 
svayaṃ mantratanurbhūtvā saṃkrāmenmana(sā)darāt || 54 || 
hsauḥvarṇakarṇike śi(kṣya?ṣyaṃ)svaradvandvāṣṭakesare | 
digaṣṭakasthitavaṃṭhaṃvargāṣṭayuktadigdale || 55 || 
caturasrāsane śuddhe mātṛkāyantrarājake (kā ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
niveśya sādaraṃ devi kalaśāmṛtadhārayā || 56 || 
sna(snā ka pāṭhaḥ |)payenmūlavidyābhistri(bhaṅgo?raṅgaiḥ) deśikottamaḥ | 
paridhāpya dukūle ca candanādyairvilepayet || 57 || 
alaṃkṛtya yathālābhaṃ samānaṃ śiṣyaputrakam | 
prasannaṃ śāntacittaṃ ca pārśve niveśya deśikaḥ || 58 || 
tadaṅge mātṛkāṃ nyasya vidyāṅganyāsamācaret | 
vimuktamukhavastrasya haste tasya guruḥ svayam || 59 || 
yathādhikāramālocya dravyabhedān prakāśayet | 
anyathā sarvahāniḥ syādayogyeṣu prakāśanāt || 60 || 
bhojanaṃ tattvamantraistu kārayed grā(ma?sa)mudrayā | 
atha guruḥ prasannātmā pūrvoktāmātmanaḥ parām || 61 || 
bālānvitāṃ vidhāyādau pādukāṃ vinivedayet | 

<pṛ0 253> dakṣakarṇe diśedbālāṃ paścādiṣṭaṃ nivedayet || 62 || 
svakīyacaraṇaṃ mūrdhni śiśornikṣipya pārvati | 
sarvān mantrān sakṛdvāpi krameṇaiva yathāvidhi || 63 || 
yathādhikāramāvartya svāṅgeṣu ca śiśoḥ karam | 
sparśayitvā kimapyaṅgaṃ tadaṅgamātṛkādikam || 64 || 
dvyakṣaraṃ tryakṣaraṃ vāpi caturakṣarameva vā | 
ānandanāthaśabdāntaṃ nāma kuryādguruḥ pitā || 65 || 
ācārānanuśiṣyātha (nvaśiṣyartha ka pāṭhaḥ |) hṛccaitanyaṃ parāmṛ(ṣa?śe)t | 
tribhiḥ kūṭaistadaṅgaṃ ca triḥ (vipra ka pāṭhaḥ |) pramṛjya guruḥ svayam || 66 || 
parirabhya tathā mūrdhni samupā(grā?ghrā)ya sādaram | 
ātmarūpaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śiṣyaṃ (ṣya pūṇī ka pāṭhaḥ |) pūrṇaṃ vibhāvayet || 67 || 
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ svaśaktihānyanavāptaye | 
prasannātmā japedvidyā tato gururudāradhīḥ || 68 || 
kṛtārthaḥ kṛtakṛtyastu yathāvibhavavistaraiḥ | 
vittaśāṭhyaṃ parityajya dambhamohau ca ji(mbha?hma)tām || 69 || 
hastyaśvarathayānādyairdāsadāsībhireva ca | 
gobhūhiraṇyavastrādyaistoṣayed gurumātmanaḥ || 70 || 
kumbhādikarṇe yad dravyaṃ sarvamaṇḍapa eva ca | 
arthaṃ prāṇāñ śarīraṃ ca sarvaṃ tasmai nivedya ca || 71 || 
patitvā pādayormūle daṇḍavad bhuvi mānavaḥ | 
namaste bhagavannātha śivāya gururūpiṇe || 72 || 

<pṛ0 254> prasīda karuṇādhāma(n)mayi dīnatvatāpite | 
kāyena manasā vācā tvatto nānyā gatirmama || 73 || 
prasannāstu parā devī bhogamokṣavidhā(pradā kha pāṭhaḥ |)yinī | 
tanmanā bhava he putra (tvā?tā)meva tvaṃ sadā smara || 74 || 
dvaitabhāva ca te māstu pūrṇānandamayo bhava | 
(vaktraiḥ?uktvo)ttiṣṭheti pīyūṣavacobhirabhi(va?na)ndyatam || 75 || 
hastābhyāṃ ca tamutthāpya prasanno'haṃ sadā priya(ye kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
siddhayaḥ sakalāstūrṇaṃ santu te matprasādataḥ || 76 || 
prasannātmā tathā śiṣyo viditākhilavedyakaḥ | 
bhaktiśraddhāsamāyukto bhojayed vai (ddhamāvi?kumāri)kāḥ || 77 || 
brāhmaṇān paritoṣyātha dīnāndhakṛpaṇānapi | 
pakvānnairatimiṣṭaiśca jñātīnapi ca bhojayet || 78 || 
gandhairnānāvidhaiḥ puṣpairmālyairapi ca toṣayet | 
tebhya āśiṣa ādāya samarthīyā (yān ka pāṭhaḥ |) jayāvahāḥ (ha ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 79 || 
sadgurorāhitadīkṣo mahāvidyādharo mahān | 
sarvamantrādhikārī syāt sarvajño bhuvi jāyate || 80 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde dīkṣāvidhānanirūpaṇaṃ saptaviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 27 || 

<pṛ0 255> [aṣṭāviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
devyuvāca 
puraścaryāvidhiṃ brūhi vidyāsiddhirbhavedyathā | 
īśvara uvāca 
atha vakṣye vidhānāni pauraścaraṇake vidhau || 1 || 
vinā yena na siddhaḥ syānmantro varṣaśatairapi | 
yathāvidhi gurordīkṣāṃ gṛhītvā sādhakottamaḥ || 2 || 
tathaiva tu yajed devīṃ nityaṃ prātarananyadhīḥ | 
ātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ smṛtvā bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ || 3 || 
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vā lakṣārdhaṃ yāvadeva hi | 
tāvadeva manuṃ japtvā puraścaryāṃ samācaret || 4 || 
nyūnātiriktadoṣāṇāṃ śāntāvaṣṭādhikaṃ japet | 
gurorājñāṃ samādāya śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo naraḥ || 5 || 
yatnāt puraskriyāṃ kuryāt svavidyāsiddhikāṅkṣayā | 
sarveṣāmeva mantrāṇāṃ vidyānāṃ caiva pārvati || 6 || 
gurorājñaiva mūlaṃ syāt siddhiryasmāt tadājñayā | 
aśraddhā caiva nāstikyaṃ pūrvajanmakṛtā(tā kha pāṭhaḥ |)śubham || 7 || 

<pṛ0 256> pratibandhatrayaṃ devi mantrasiddhau nigadyate | 
yatnāt puraścarenmantrī pratibandhavināśane || 8 || 
lakṣmīmadādanādṛtya mantraṃ tathā naiva puraskriyām || 9 || 
sa mantrasya ṛṇī jñeyo bha(ya kha pāṭhaḥ |)janaṃ tasya śāntaye | 
jīvahīno yathā dehaḥ(ho ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarvakarmasu na kṣamaḥ || 10 || 
puraścaraṇahīno'pi tathā mantraḥ prakīrtitaḥ | 
tat kuryāt sarvathā mantrī guruṃ vā kārayedbudhaḥ || 11 || 
gurorabhāve vipro'sya sarvaprāṇihite rataḥ | 
śuddhāntaḥkaraṇaḥ snigdho vāsobhiśca viśeṣataḥ || 12 || 
kulajñaḥ kulaśāstrajñaḥ punarguruḥ puraskriyām | 
kārayitvā punarvidyāṃ labdhvā tu (ti ka pāṭhaḥ |) viniyojayet || 13 || 
ādau puraskriyāṃ kartuṃ puṇyakṣetraṃ samāśrayet | 
caturdaśyāmathāṣṭamyāmamāvasyāmuhūrtake || 14 || 
devyāḥ puraskriyārambhaḥ kartavyaḥ sādhakottamaiḥ (maḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
atha pūrvamupoṣyātha kṛtanityakriyaḥ śuciḥ || 15 || 
dvijān devān gurūn bhaktyā saṃpūjya parameśvari | 
gaṇeśaṃ mātṛkā(kā cai ka pāṭhaḥ |)ścaiva pitṝṃścaiva prapūjayet || 16 || 
grāme vā nagare deśe pure vā pattane tathā | 
kṣetrādhipasya nāmnā tu dīpasthānaṃ vicārayet || 17 || 

<pṛ0 257> śaktikṣetre śivakṣetre dīpasthānaṃ vicintayet | 
vartulaṃ racayed devi kūrmākṛti sulocane || 18 || 
tanmadhye nava koṣṭhāni kṛtvā  varṇān samālikhet | 
svarān yugmakrameṇaiva dikṣu cāṣṭadaleṣu ca || 19 ||
avargaḥ kathito devi kavargādikasaptakam | 
pūrvādikramato devi kuberāntaṃ likhettataḥ || 20 || 
ḻakṣavarṇa śaṃbhukoṇe vilikhet kūrmasaṃjñake | 
yasmin koṣṭhe kṣetranāma tanmukhaṃ viddhi pārvati || 21 || 
aṅgeṣu pārśvayoḥ pāṇiyugmaṃ jānīhi sundari | 
tataḥ pārśvadvayaṃ devi kukṣisthānaṃ nigadyate || 22 || 
tataḥ pādadvayaṃ devi cānte pucchaṃ prakīrtitam | 
mukhe kāryāṇi sidhyanti manorathaśatāni ca || 23 || 
kaṇṭhasthāne maheśāni sarvakāryavināśakṛt | 
udare duḥkhadāridryaṃ pādayorhānirucyate || 24 || 
pucche tu dhanahāniḥ syādityevaṃ kathitaṃ mayā | 
dīpasthānaṃ samāśritya japapūjāṃ samācaret || 25 || 
pūrvoktavidhisaṃpannaṃ guruṃ natvā vidhānataḥ | 
akṣamālāṃ samāśritya mātṛkāṃ varṇarūpiṇīm || 26 || 
mantrasiddhipradāṃ śuddhāṃ sarvapāpaughanāśinīm | 
praṇavo mātṛkā devī māyā caivāmṛtatrayam || 27 || 
amṛtatrayasaṃyogād duṣṭamantro'pi sidhyati | 

<pṛ0 258> atha muktāphalamayī vāṅmokṣaphaladāyinī || 28 || 
sarvasiddhipradā nityaṃ sarvalokavaśaṃkarī | 
yathā muktāphalamayī sphāṭikī ca tathā bhavet || 29 || 
rudrākṣamālikā bhogamokṣānantaphalapradā | 
pravālamālā vaśye tu sarvakāryārthasādhikā || 30 || 
(malinā?māṇikya)racitā mālā sāmrājyaphaladāyinī | 
putrajīvodbhavā mālā putrapautrapradāyinī || 31 || 
padmākṣamālayā lakṣmīrjāyate mahatī yaśaḥ | 
raktacandanamālā tu vaśye sarvasamṛddhidā || 32 || 
mahāśaṅkhamayī mālā māraṇoccāṭanādiṣu | 
vīrāṇāṃ śasyate sā hi śeṣayorna śubhapradā || 33 || 
pañcāśadbhiḥ śataiḥ kuryādaṣṭāviṃśati (reva?bhiśca) vā | 
na nyūnairnādhikaiḥ kāryā bījādyairna vibhūtaye || 34 || 
eko merustatra deyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ sthūlasaṃbhavaḥ | 
ādyaṃ sthūlaṃ tato (tatastasmāt kha pāṭhaḥ |) nyūnaṃ nyūnaṃ nyūnataraṃ tataḥ || 35 || 
vinyaset kramatastasmāt sarpākārā (vi?pya(ca sā yata ka pāṭhaḥ |))nāyatā | 
brahmagranthiyutaṃ kuryāt pratibījaṃ tathāsthitam || 36 || 
anyathā viphalā mālā saṃskṛtā japakarmaṇi | 
rudrākṣairyadi japyeta indrākṣaiḥ sphāṭikaistathā || 37 || 
nānyanmadhye prayoktavyaṃ putrajīvādikaṃ tu yat | 

<pṛ0 259> yadā(1)nyattu prayuñjīta mālāyāṃ japakarmaṇi || 38 || 
miśrībhāvaṃ tadā yāti caṇḍālaiḥ pāpakarmabhiḥ | 
ekajātīyabījena yaḥ kuryānmālikāṃ sadā || 39 || 
janmāntare jāyate sa vedavedāṅgapāragaḥ | 
pūrvoktena vidhānena gṛhītvā divyamālikām || 40 || 
japaṃ samārabhet paścāt proktayogasamanvitaḥ | 
tatra sthitvā japedvidyāṃ lakṣamātraṃ sadā śuciḥ || 41 || 
dadhi kṣīraṃ ghṛtaṃ gavyamaikṣavaṃ guḍavarjitam | 
tilāścaiva sitā mudgāḥ kandaḥ kemukavarjitaḥ || 42 || 
nārikelaphalaṃ caiva kadalī lava(ṇī?lī) tathā | 
āmramāmalakaṃ caiva panasaṃ ca harītakī || 43 || 
vratāntarapraśastaṃ ca haviṣyaṃ manyate budhaiḥ | 
avaiṣṇavamalabhyaṃ ca yadaśastaṃ vratāntare || 44 || 
tyājyameva tu tat sarvaṃ yadīcchet siddhimātmanaḥ | 
kṣāraṃ ca lavaṇaṃ māṃsaṃ gṛñjanaṃ kāṃsya(2)bhojanam || 45 || 
māṣāḍhakīmasūrāṃśca kodravāṃścaṇakānapi | 
tāmbūlaṃ ca dvibhaktaṃ ca duḥsaṃvādaṃ pramattatām || 46 || 
śrutismṛtiviruddhaṃ ca japaṃ rātrau vivarjayet | 
bhūśayyā brahmacāritvaṃ maunaṃ cāpyanasūyatā || 47 || 
nityaṃ triṣavaṇasnānaṃ kṣudrakarmavivarjanam | 
nityapūjā nityadānaṃ deva(3)tāstutikīrtanam || 48 || 

<pṛ0 260> naimittikārcanaṃ caiva viśvāso gurudevayoḥ | 
japaniṣṭhā dvādaśaite dharmāḥ syurmantrasiddhidāḥ || 49 || 
strīśūdrapatitavrātya(patito?nāstiko)cchiṣṭabhāṣaṇam | 
asatyabhāṣaṇaṃ ji(kṣa?hma)bhāṣaṇaṃ parivarjayet || 50 || 
sa(tyai?bhyai)rapi na bhāṣeta japahomārcanādiṣu | 
anyathānuṣṭhitaṃ sarvaṃ bhavatyeva nirarthakam || 51 || 
vāṅmanaḥkarmabhirnityaṃ niḥspṛhāvān bhavet sadā | 
varjayed gīta(nṛtyā?vādyā)diśravaṇaṃ nṛtyadarśanam || 52 || 
mālyaṃ ca gandhalepaṃ ca puṣpadhāraṇameva ca | 
maithunaṃ tatkathālāpaṃ tadgoṣṭhīṃ parivarjayet || 53 || 
kauṭilyaṃ kṣauramabhyaṅgamaniveditabhojanam | 
prāṇihiṃsāṃ na kurvīta puraścaraṇakṛnnaraḥ || 54 || 
asnātāṃśca dvijāñ śūdrān striyo naiva spṛśettathā |
asaṃkalpitakṛtyaṃ ca varjayenmardanādikam || 55 || 
tyajeduṣṇodakasnānaṃ sugandhāmalakādikam | 
śivāṅgaṃ pañjagavyena kṣālayed bahirantaram || 56 || 
snāyācca pañcagavyena kevalāmalakena vā | 
apavitrakaro (apavrakaralagno vā śi ka pāṭhaḥ |) nagnaḥ śirasi prāvṛto'pivā || 57 || 
nirāsanaḥ śayāno vā gacchannutthita eva vā | 
rathyāyāmaśiva(māśaba ka pāṭhaḥ |)sthāne na japet timirālaye || 58 || 

<pṛ0 261> pralapan vā japed yāvat tāvanniṣphalamucyate | 
sukṛduccārite śabde praṇavaṃ samudīrayet || 59 || 
prokte pāmaraśabde tu prāṇāyāmaṃ sakṛccaret | 
bahupralāpe cācamya nyasyāṅgāni tato japet || 60 || 
patitānāmantyajānāṃ darśane bhāṣaṇe śrute | 
kṣute'dhovāyugamane jṛmbhaṇe japamutsṛjet || 61 || 
kṛtvācamya japeccheṣaṃ yadvā sūryādidarśanam | 
śayīta kuśaśayyāyāṃ śucivastradharaḥ sadā || 62 || 
pratyahaṃ kṣālayecchayyāmekākī nirbhayaḥ svapet | 
evamādīṃśca niyamān puraścaraṇakṛccaret || 63 || 
evamuktavidhānena vilambatvaritaṃ vinā | 
uktasaṃkhyājapaṃ kuryāt puraścaraṇasiddhaye || 64 || 
devatāgurumantrāṇāmaikyaṃ saṃbhāvayan dhiyā | 
japedekamanāḥ prātaḥkālānmadhyaṃdināvadhi || 65 || 
yatsaṃ(khyāmā?khyayā)samārabdhaṃ tacca kuryyāddine dine | 
yadi nyūnādhikaṃ kuryād vratabhraṣṭo bhavennaraḥ || 66 || 
nairantaryavidhiḥ prokto na dinaṃ vyatilaṅghayet | 
divasātikramāt (teṣāṃ?puṃsaḥ) siddhihāniḥ prajāyate || 67 || 
mantraṃ japtvāmbu pānīyaiḥ sulocanamabhojanam (?) | 
kuryādyathoktavidhinā trisaṃdhyaṃ devamarcayet || 68 || 
ekasaṃdhyaṃ dvisaṃdhyaṃ vā na mantraṃ kevalaṃ japet | 

<pṛ0 262> ekagrāme sthito gatvā vandeta kevalaṃ gurum || 69 || 
praṇāmo'ṣṭāṅga evātra devatāvandanaṃ tathā | 
nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kuryāt saṅgaṃ ca sādhubhiḥ saha || 70 || 
śaktau triṣavaṇasnānaṃ dve sakṛdvā tathā caret | 
parakīyatare toye snānaṃ pūrvaṃ samācaret || 71 || 
saṃkhyāpūrtau nijairdravyairjapasaṃkhyādaśāṃśataḥ | 
yathoktavihite kuṇḍe juhuyāt saṃskṛte'nale || 72 || 
athavā pratyahaṃ japtvā juhuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
tathā homadaśāṃśaṃ tu jale saṃpūjya devatām || 73 || 
tarpayāmīti mantrānte proktādbhirmūrdhni tarpayet | 
japo homastarpaṇaṃ ca (pū?mṛ)jā brāhmaṇabhojanam || 74 || 
pūrvapūrvadaśāṃśena kuryāt pañcāṅgasaṃyutam | 
svābhiṣekāghamarṣau ca sūryārghyaṃ jalapānakam || 75 || 
prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pūrvapūrvadaśāṃśataḥ | 
daśāṅgopāsanaṃ bhaktyā puraścaraṇamucyate || 76 || 
tatpuraścaraṇaṃ nāma mantrasiddhyarthamātmanaḥ | 
yathoktaṃ niyamaṃ kṛtvā svakalpoktajapasya hi || 77 || 
karaṇaṃ vijayāntaṃ tatproktaṃ deśikasattamaiḥ | 
tadante mahatīṃ pūjāṃ kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam || 78 || 
guruṃ saṃtoṣayedevaṃ mantrāḥ sidhyanti mantriṇaḥ | 

<pṛ0 263> homakarmaṇyaśa(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)ktānāṃ viprāṇāṃ dviguṇo japaḥ || 79 || 
itareṣāṃ tu varṇānāṃ triguṇādiḥ samīritaḥ | 
ekamaṅgaṃ vihīyeta tato neṣṭamavāpnuyāt || 80 || 
aṅgahīnaṃ bhavedyadyat tattanne(nna ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭārthasādhanam | 
sarvathā bhojayedviprān kṛtasāṅgatvasiddhaye || 81 || 
viprārādhanamātreṇa vyaṅgaṃ sāṅgaṃ bhavedyataḥ | 
nyūnātiriktakarmāṇi na phalanti manorathān || 82 || 
tānyevaṃ pūrṇatāṃ yānti samastāni bhavanti cet | 
ato yatnena viduṣo bhojayet sarvakarmasu || 83 || 
niyatānyapi karmāṇi hīnāni dvijabhojanaiḥ | 
nirarthakāni tāni syurbījānyūṣaragāṇi ca || 84 || 
athavānyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate | 
grahaṇe'rkasya cendorvā śuciḥ pūrvamupoṣitaḥ || 85 || 
nadyāṃ samudragāminyāṃ nābhimātrodake (ka kha pāṭhaḥ |) sthitaḥ | 
grahaṇādivimokṣāntaṃ japenmantraṃ samāhitaḥ || 86 || 
anantaraṃ daśāṃśena kramāddhomādikaṃ caret | 
homasya tu daśāṃśena tarpaṇa samupācaret || 87 || 
abhiṣekadaśāṃśena kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam | 
tadante mahatīṃ pūjāṃ kuryāt sādhakasattamaḥ || 88 || 
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyādbhaktyā viprān pratarpayet | 

<pṛ0 264> tataśca mantrasiddhiḥ syād devatā ca prasīdati || 89 || 
tatastu mantrasiddhyarthaṃ guruṃ saṃpūjya toṣayet | 
athavā devatārūpaṃ guruṃ bhaktyā pratoṣayet || 90 || 
puraścaraṇahīno'pi mantrasiddhirasaṃśayaḥ | 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde puraścaryāvidhinirūpaṇaṃ aṣṭāviṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 28 || 

<pṛ0 265> [ekonatriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
pūrvoktavidhinā devi lakṣārdhaṃ prajapet tathā | 
rātrau tāmbūlapūrṇā(rāsya kha pāṭhaḥ |)syastathaivoktavidhānataḥ || 1 || 
kāmarūpaṃ vapuḥ kṛtvā kāminyeva(nī kha pāṭhaḥ |) mahāniśi | 
kulayukto japellakṣaṃ niśāyā madhyabhāgataḥ || 2 || 
atra yat kriyate karma tadanantaphalapradam | 
mūlādhāre mahādevi liṅgaṃ svayaṃbhūvācakam || 3 || 
jyotīrūpaṃ tu yonisthaṃ tatraiva manasā japet | 
dhyāyet kuṇḍalinīṃ devi tadvidyākṣararūpiṇīm || 4 || 
hṛdi trikoṇamadhye ca bāṇaliṅge ca tejasi | 
tatra saṃcintya manasā japellakṣa samāhitaḥ || 5 || 
mūrdhni trikoṇamadhye tu itaraṃ paścimāmukham | 
tatra sthitvā japellakṣaṃ yatra kutra samāhitaḥ || 6 || 
evaṃ lakṣatraye siddhe yadbhāvastūpajāyate | 
tamupāśritya bhāvena yathā devastathā (rave?bhavet) || 7 || 
navalakṣaṃ japedvidyāmiha bhogasamṛddhaye | 
na dhyāna naca vinyāso na pūjā na puraskriyā || 8 || 

<pṛ0 266> kevalaṃ japamātreṇa siddhayaḥ siddhikāṅkṣiṇām | 
koṭijāpe tu saṃpūrṇe mano mantrātmakaṃ bhavet || 9 || 
yāvattāvaddhi japtavyaṃ manasaiva nacānyathā | 
mantramātrasvarūpe ca siddhe manasi pārvati || 10 || 
dhyānamātraṃ manaḥ kṛtvā dhyānaṃ brahmaṇi cārpayet | 
vidite brahmaṇaḥ kṣetre viditaḥ sarvavit prabhuḥ || 11 || 
nava sthānāni kathyante śṛṇu sāvahitā priye | 
jyotīrūpaṃ tadādhāre meḍhrasthāne śikhāprabham || 12 || 
nābhisthaṃ sūryabimbābhaṃ taruṇādityavarccasam | 
hṛdi jyotiḥśikhākāraṃ kaṇṭhe dīpaśikhāprabham || 13 || 
bhrūmadhye ratnasaṅkāśaṃ tadūrdhve bhāskaraprabham | 
lambike candrabimbābhaṃ tato vaidūryasaṃnibham || 14 || 
navame viśvatejā hi ghaṇṭāvaidūryyasaṃnibhaḥ | 
liṅgarūpī hyahaṃ devi nava niṅgāni yāni ca || 15 || 
nava sthānāni mantreṇa kramāt saṃbhidya kuṇḍalīm | 
visaṃjñāmamṛtaṃ pītvā punarādhāramānayet || 16 || 
mūlasthānagataṃ mantraṃ  smaredevaṃ krameṇa tu | 
navalakṣapramāṇaṃ tu japtvā tripurasundarīm || 17 || 

<pṛ0 267> vidhivajjāyate devi rudramūrttirivāparaḥ | 
mantrāṇāṃ nava lakṣāṇi kṛtvā liṅgani vai nava || 18 || 
navaiva parijapyātha navalakṣaphalaṃ labhet | 
jātasūtakamādau syād vṛtte ca mṛtasūtakam1 || 19 || 
sūtakadvayasaṃyukto yo mantraḥ sa na sidhyati | 
svayaṃ tadrahitaṃ kṛtvā mantraṃ yāvajjapeddhiyā || 20 || 
sūtakadvayanirmuktaḥ sa mantraḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ | 
satkulasthānajātīnāṃ śucīnāṃ śrīmatāṃ satām || 21 || 
niyatamagnihotṝṇāṃ bhikṣāśino(śanā) grajanmanām | 
eṣāṃ madhye tu yaḥ kaścidgururvā śiṣya eva vā || 22 || 
mantrārthaṃ2 mantracaitanyaṃ yonimudrāṃ na vetti ca | 
kathitaṃ sūtakaṃ tasya japāt siddhirna jāyate || 23 || 
guptabī(jā?ryā)śca ye mantrā na dāsyanti phalaṃ priye | 
mantrāścaitanyasaṃyuktāḥ sarvasiddhikarāḥ smṛtāḥ || 24 || 
caitanyarahitā mantrāḥ proktā varṇāstu kevalam | 
phalaṃ naiva prayacchanti lakṣakoṭijapādapi || 25 || 
mantroccāre kṛte yādṛk svarūpaṃ prathamaṃ bhavet | 
śate sahasre lakṣe vā koṭijāpe na tatphalam || 26 || 

<pṛ0 268> hṛdaye granthibhedaśca sarvāvayavavardhanaḥ | 
mantrārthaḥ(rdha kha pāṭhaḥ |) kathyate devi śṛṇu tatprathamaṃ priye || 27 || 
bhāvārthaḥ saṃpradāyārtho niga(rvā?rbhā)khyaśca kaulikaḥ | 
tathā sarvarahasyārtho mahātattvārtha eva ca || 28 || 
a(tyantā?kṣarā)rtho hi bhāvārthaḥ kevalaṃ parameśvari | 
śivaśaktisamāyogājjanito mantrarājakaḥ || 29 || 
tanmayīṃ paramānandananditāṃ mantrarūpiṇīm | 
ni(saṃjña?sarga) sundarīṃ devī jñātvā svairamupāsate || 30 || 
śivaśaktyātmasaṃ(yantra?ghaṭṭa)rūpiṇī brahmarūpiṇī | 
tatprathāprasarāśleṣabhuvi tvindropalakṣite || 31 || 
jñāturjñānamayākārakaraṇānmantrarūpiṇī | 
madhyabinduvi(sargāntaḥ)samā(masthā kha pāṭhaḥ |)sthānamaye pare || 32 || 
kuṭilārūpake tasyāḥ pratirūpe(bimba ka pāṭhaḥ |) viyatkale | 
madhyaprāṇaprathārūpaspandavyomni sthitā punaḥ || 33 || 
madhyame mantrapiṇḍe tu tṛtīye piṇḍake punaḥ | 
(bāhya?rāhu)kūṭadvayasphūrjacca(rūdbhā?lattā)saṃsthitasya tu || 34 || 
dharmādharmasya vācyasya (vīrā?viṣā)mṛtamayasya ca | 
vācakākṣarasaṃyukteḥ prathitā (tā ka pāṭhaḥ |) viśvarūpiṇī (ṇīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 35 || 

<pṛ0 369> teṣāṃ samastarūpeṇa parāśaktistu mātṛkā | 
kūṭatrayātmikā devī (kā devī ka pāṭhaḥ |) samaṣṭivyaṣṭirūpiṇī (ṇīm ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 36 || 
kūṭatraye tu hrīṃkāraṃ devyā netratrayaṃ śubham | 
hakārastvagnirū(ḍha?pa)tvāt saṃharedbhedasaṃtatim || 37 || 
rephaḥ kālāgnirū(ḍha?pa)tvāt pāpaughakṣayakārakaḥ | 
tayorvimarśa īkāro bindunā triguṇātmanā || 38 || 
amṛtatvaṃ karotīnduḥ kāmaḥ kāmānaśeṣataḥ | 
sampradāyo mahābodharūpo gurumukhe sthitaḥ || 39 || 
viśvākāraprathāyāstu mahattvaṃ ca (sa?ya)dāśrayam | 
śivaśaktyādyayā (tmanā ka pāṭhaḥ |) mūlavidyayā parameśvari || 40 || 
jagatkṛtsnaṃ tayā vyāptaṃ śṛṇuṣvāvahitā priye | 
pañcabhūtamayaṃ viśvaṃ tanmayī sā sanātanī || 41 || 
tanmayī mūlavidyā ca tathāpi kathayāmi te | 
hakārādvyoma saṃbhūtaṃ (ha?ka)kārāttu prabhañjanaḥ || 42 || 
rephādagniḥ sakārācca jalatattvasya sambhavaḥ | 
lakārāt pṛthivī jātā tasmādviśvamayī ca sā || 43 || 
guṇāḥ pañcadaśa proktā bhūtānāṃ tanmayī śubhā | 
yasya yasya padārthasya yā yā śaktirudīritā || 44 || 

<pṛ0 270> saiva sarveśvarī devī sa ca sarvo maheśvaraḥ | 
vyāptyā pañcadaśārṇaiḥ sā pañcabhūta(stṛ?gu)ṇātmikā (kām ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 45 || 
pañcabhiśca tathā ṣaḍbhiścaturbhirapi cākṣaraiḥ | 
svaravyañjanabhedena saptatriṃśatprabhedinī (prathamabīje'kāracatuṣṭayamīkāraśceti pañca svarā vyañjanapaṭaka ceti evamekādaśa dvitīyabīje'kārapañcakamīkāraśceti ṣaṭ svarā sapta vyañjanāni eva trayodaśa | tṛtīyabīje'kāratrayamīkāraśceti catvāra svarā pañca vyañjanāni eva nava | evaṃ vibhajane trayastriṃśat | bījatrayānte bindavasraya iti ṣaṭtriṃśat | etatsamaṣṭirekā | eva saptatriṃśatprabhedinī vidyeti |) || 46 || 
saptatriṃśatprabhedena ṣaṭtriṃśattattvarūpiṇī | 
tattvātītasvabhāvā ca vidyeyaṃ bhāvyate sadā || 47 || 
pṛthivyādiṣu bhūteṣu vyāpakaṃ cottarottaram | 
bhūtaṃ(laṃ sastalaṃ?tvadhastanaṃ)vyāpyaṃ tadguṇā vyāpakāśrayāḥ || 48 || 
vyāpyeṣvavasthitā devi sthūlasūkṣmavibhedataḥ | 
tasmādvyomaguṇaḥ śabdo vāyvādīn vyāpya saṃsthitaḥ || 49 || 
vyomabījaistu vidyā(dyai?sthai)rlakṣaye(tu ca?cchabda) pañcakam | 
teṣā kāraṇarūpeṇa sthitaṃ vyomamaya (dhvanimaya kha pāṭhaḥ |) param || 50 || 
bhave(jjvalu?dguṇa)vatāṃ bījaṃ guṇānāmapi vācakam | 
kāryakāraṇabhāvena tayoraikyavivakṣayā || 51 || 

<pṛ0 271> mahāmāyātrayeṇāpi kāraṇena ca bindunā | 
vāyvagnijalabhūmīnāṃ sparśānāṃ ca catuṣṭayam || 52 || 
utpannaṃ bhāvayed devi sthūlasūkṣmavibhedataḥ | 
rūpāṇāṃ tritayaṃ ta(ttvaṃ?dvat)tribhī rephairvibhāvitam || 53 || 
pradhānaṃ tejaso rūpaṃ tadbījena hi janyate | 
vidyāsthaiścandrabījaistu sthūlaḥ sūkṣmo rasaḥ smṛtaḥ || 54 || 
sambandho vidito loke rasasyāpyamṛtasya ca | 
vasundharāguṇo gandhasta(dviddhi?llipiḥ)gandhavācikā || 55 || 
bhuvanatrayasaṃ(buddhyā?bandhāt) tridhātvaṃ tu maheśvari | 
aśuddha(stattva?śuddha) miśrāṇāṃ pramātṝṇāṃ paraṃ vapuḥ || 56 || 
krodhīśatritayenātha vidyāsthena prakāśyate | 
śrīka(śca?ṇṭha) daśakaṃ tadvadavyaktasya hi(1) vācakam || 57 || 
prāṇarūpasthito devi ta (ttvame?dvade)kādaśaḥ (punaḥ?paraḥ) | 
ekaḥ sanneva puruṣo bahudhā jāyate hi saḥ || 58 || 
rudreśvarasadeśākhyā devatā mita(2)vigrahāḥ | 
bindu(krame?traye)ṇa kathitā amitāmita(3)vigrahāḥ || 59 || 
śāntiḥ śaktiśca śaṃbhuśca nādatritayabodhanāḥ(4) | 
vā(gbhavo?gurā) mūlavalaye sūtrādyāḥ kavalīkṛtāḥ || 60 || 

<pṛ0 272> tathā mantrāḥ samastāśca vidyāyā(ya?ma)tra saṃsthitāḥ | 
gurukrameṇa saṃprāptaḥ saṃpradāyārtha īritaḥ || 61 || 
niga(rvo?rbho)'pi ca deveśi śivagurvā(tha?tma) gocaraḥ (gaurava ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tatprakāraṃ ca deveśi diṅmātreṇa vadāmi te || 62 || 
śivagurvātmanāmaikyānusaṃdhānāt tadātmakam | 
niṣkalatvaṃ śive buddhvā tadrūpatvaṃ gurorapi | 
tannirīkṣaṇasāmarthyādātmanaśca śivātmatām || 63 || 
bhāvayedbhaktinamrastu śaṅkonmeṣākalaṅkitaḥ | 
kaulikaṃ kathayiṣyāmi cakra(me?de)vatayorapi || 46 || 
vidyāgurvātmanāmaikyaṃ tatprakāraḥ pradarśyate (dṛśyate ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
tathā mantrātmakaṃ cakraṃ devatāyāḥ paraṃ vapuḥ || 65 || 
ekādaśādhikaśata(ta ka pāṭhaḥ |)devatātmatayā sthitam | 
lakāraiścaturasrāṇi vṛttatritayasaṃyutam || 66 || 
saroruhadvayaṃ (śakto?śāktai)ragnī(so?ṣo)mātmakaṃ priye | 
hṛllekhātrayasambhū(tyai?tai)rakṣarairnavasaṃkhyakaiḥ || 67 || 
bindutrayayutairjātaṃ navayonyātmakaṃ priye | 
maṇḍalatrayasaṃyuktaṃ cakraṃ śaktyanalātmakam || 68 || 
vyomabījatrayeṇāpi pramātṛtritayātmakam | 
icchā(dinā?jñāna)kriyārūpamādanatrayasaṃyutam || 69 || 

<pṛ0 273> sarvavarṇātmakaṃ binducakraṃ sadyaḥ śivātmakam | 
gaṇeśatvaṃ mahādevyāḥ sasomaravipāvakaiḥ || 70 || 
icchājñānakriyābhiśca guṇatrayayutaiḥ punaḥ | 
graharūpā parā devī jñānakarmendriyairapi || 71 || 
ta(dutthai?darthai)reva deveśi karaṇairāntaraiḥ punaḥ | 
prakṛtyā ca guṇenāpi puṃstvabandhena cātmanā || 72 || 
nakṣatravigrahā jātā yoginīnāmathocyate | 
tvagādidhātunāthābhirḍākinyādibhirapyasau || 73 || 
vargāṣṭakaniviṣṭābhiryoginī(bhya?bhi)stu saṃyutā | 
yoginīrūpamāsthāya krīḍate viśvarūpiṇī || 74 || 
prāṇo'pānaḥ samānaśca vyānodānau tathā punaḥ | 
nāgaḥ kūrmo'tha kṛkaro devadatto dhanañjayaḥ || 75 || 
jīvātmā paramātmā ca taireva (bali?rāśi)rūpiṇī | 
akathāditripaṃktyātmatārtīyādikrameṇa(1) sā || 76 || 
(jananā?gaṇeśo')bhūnmahāvidyā parāvāgādivāṅmayī | 
bījabindudhvanīnāṃ ca trikūṭeṣu grahātmikā || 77 || 
hṛllekhātrayasambhūtaistithisaṃkhyairathākṣaraiḥ | 
anyairdvādāśabhi(rvyaktai?rvarṇai)reṣā nakṣatrarūpiṇī || 78 || 

