<pṛ0 191> [dvātriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
devyuvāca 
vahnīndvarkamayī mudrā pratiṣṭhā ca kathaṃ bhavet | 
īśvara uvāca 
somasūryāgnirūpāḥ syurvarṇā lo(ka?ha)trayaṃ tathā || 1 || 
svarāḥ ṣoḍaśa saumyāste saurāḥ syuḥ kādayo'pare | 
āgneyāste samuddiṣṭā yādayo daśa cāpare || 2 || 
raupyamindustathā hema sūryastāmraṃ hutāśanaḥ | 
lohabhāgāḥ samuddiṣṭā svarādyakṣarasaṃkhyayā || 3 || 
tairlohaiḥ kārayenmudrāmasaṃkalitasaṃga(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)tām | 
pañcāmṛtaiḥ pañcagavyaiḥ kṣālayitvā śubhe'hani || 4 || 
bhānuvāre śubhe lagne pūrvoktamātṛkāmbuje | 
madhyādi sthāpayetteṣu patreṣu kalaśānapi || 5 || 
tantubhirveṣṭitāñ śuddhān bahiścandanacarcitān | 
sudhūpavāsitāndevi dūrvākṣatasamanvitān || 6 || 
kvāthena pūrayeddevi yathāvadakṣarauṣadhaiḥ | 
rocanācandrakāśmīralaghukastūrīkāyutaiḥ || 7 || 

<pṛ0 292> āpūrya gandhatoyaistānveṣṭayedaṃśukaiḥ śubhaiḥ | 
muktāmāṇikyavaidūryagomedavajravidrumān || 8 || 
puṣparāgaṃ marakataṃ nīlaṃ ceti yathākramam | 
vinyasetteṣu kumbheṣu ratnāṅkitaphalāni ca || 9 || 
sthāpayet kumbhavaktreṣu komalāṃścūtapallavān | 
madhyakumbhe ca mudrāṃ tāṃ vinyasya bahumaṅgalaiḥ || 10 || 
bījatrayaṃ tridhā kṛtvā mātṛkāṃ ca tridhā tathā | 
vibhajya pūjayeddevi somasūryahutāśanān || 11 || 
tatrāvāhya yajeddevīṃ saṃmohanīṃ parāṃ tataḥ | 
prāṇānāyamya vidhivat pūrvavanmātṛkāṃ nyaset || 12 || 
(vi?tri)netrāṃ taruṇendvābhāṃ bālārkakiraṇāruṇām | 
akṣamālāṅkuśaśarā(dharā ka pāṭhaḥ |)n pāśaṃ padmadvayaṃ tathā || 13 || 
ābibhratīṃ karāmbhojaiḥ puṇḍrekṣucāpapustakam(kān ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
māyāśrīkāmabījādyāṃ nityāṃ varṇamayīṃ bhajet || 14 || 
nānāvidhaistu kusumairdhūpairdīpairmanoharaiḥ | 
uccāvacairupahāraiḥ pūjayitvā yathāvidhi || 15 || 
śarkarāghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ pāyasaṃ ca nivedayet | 
pūjayeddikṣu kumbheṣu vyāpinyādīnyathākramam || 16 || 
vyāpinī pālinī paścāt plāvinī kledinī tathā | 
dhariṇī mālinī caiva harṣiṇī śāntinī tathā || 17 || 
vyāpinyaścāṣṭasaṃkhyā vai etāḥ parvatanandini(nī ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
sāgraṃ sahasraṃ saṃjapya spṛṣṭvā tāṃ mudrikāṃ tataḥ || 18 || 

<pṛ0 293> homayetsaṃskṛte vahnau sahasraṃ haviṣā tathā | 
tasyāṃ saṃpātayeddevi vidhināhutiśeṣakam || 19 || 
samohanīṃ samuddiśya gṛhītvājyaṃ sruveṇa tu | 
bījatrayayutāṃ devi mātṛkāṃ bindusaṃyutām || 20 || 
vahnibhāryānvitāṃ paścāt kṛtvā vai homayettataḥ | 
maṇḍale mātṛkādevyāḥ śiṣyaṃ niveśya sādaram || 21 || 
surāstvāmiti mantraistu navabhiḥ kalaśaiḥ śubhaiḥ | 
abhiṣicya vinītāya dadyāttāṃ mudrikāṃ guruḥ || 22 || 
iyaṃ rakṣākarī mudrā viṣarogavināśinī | 
vyālacauramṛgādibhyo rakṣāṃ kuryādviśeṣataḥ || 23 || 
sarvavaśyakarī śuddhā śuddhidāśuddhihāriṇī | 
tarjanyāṃ dhārayedenāṃ vidhinā manujeśvaraḥ || 24 || 
yuddhe vijayamāpnoti śriyā paramayā yutaḥ | 
vibhajenmātṛkāṃ devi navavargāṃstathoditān || 25 || 
navavargasamutpannā navaratneśvarā grahāḥ | 
arkenduvakrajñagurubhṛgumandāhiketavaḥ || 26 || 
navaratnairmaheśāni mudrāṃ kuryādyathecchayā | 
tadratneṣu (teṣu ratneṣu ka pāṭhaḥ |) grahānsarvān pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ || 27 || 
āvāhya pūjayeddevīṃ saṃmohanīṃ parāṃ tathā | 
japahomādikaṃ sarvaṃ kuryātpūrvoktavartmanā || 28 || 
yo mudrāṃ dhārayedenāṃ tasya syurvaśagā grahāḥ | 
vardhate tasya saubhāgyaṃ lakṣmīravyāhatā bhavet || 29 || 

