<pṛ0 326> saṃsāranigaḍairbaddhaḥ pumān vimucyate tayā | 
tasyāstoṣaṃ vinā devi vimuktirnaiva vidyate || 41 || 
tannigṛhītacittānāṃ puṃsāṃ puruṣapūjite | 
atastāṃ ca prayatnena puruṣā muktilipsavaḥ || 42 || 
samāśrayanti yogādyairnityānandasvarūpiṇīm | 
brahmā viṣṇustathā cāhamātmavatsamupāsmahe || 43 || 
tapaḥkleśaiśca tāṃ devi paśubhāve sthito vidhiḥ | 
saṃtoṣya parayā bhaktyā sāvitrīṃ vedamātaram || 44 || 
icchāśaktiṃ ca vāgīśīṃ labdhvā sṛṣṭimacīkarat | 
tanayāṃ jagṛhe mohādbrahmā paśurudāradhīḥ || 45 || 
tajjugupsitamanyāyyamadyāpi na nivartate | 
paraśaktiṃ paśustasmānmanasāpi na saṃsmaret || 46 || 
tadbhāvamāśritā viprāstāmeva samupāsate | 
mitrāṇāṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ teṣāṃ madyaṃ ghṛtaṃ payaḥ || 47 || 
apūpaṃ piṣṭakaṃ māṃsaṃ gṛhṇīyuḥ śaktidāpitam | 
apivā saṃvidāsaktā bhaveyuḥ śaktimāśritāḥ || 48 || 
divyabhāvasthito viṣṇurjagatpālanarūpiṇīm | 
madhumaireyabhogādyaiḥ saṃtoṣyānandarūpiṇīm || 49 || 
jñānaśaktimayīṃ lakṣmīṃ jagadādhārarūpiṇīm | 
labdhvā tu jagataḥ so'yaṃ pālako'bhūnnirākulaḥ || 50 || 
tadbhāvamāśritā bhūpāstathaiva tāmupāsate | 
atha devāśca daityāśca munayo mānuṣāḥ pare || 51 || 

<pṛ0 327> viṣṇumeva hi satataṃ bhajante bhāvasiddhaye | 
sa ca bhāvaviśuddhātmā tadbhāvaṃ tu jugopa ha || 52 || 
ye(ni?na)ndanti ca tadbhāvaṃ gopayanti ca sarvadā | 
te vai priyatamāḥ sarve śaṅkhacakragadābhṛtaḥ || 53 || 
tadbhāvādvimukhān kartuṃ lokāṃllokeśvaro hariḥ | 
idamādiṣṭavān devi māmeva jagadīśvaraḥ || 54 || 
bhagavānuvāca 
sarve divyā bhaviṣyanti madbhāve hi prakāśite | 
paśubhāvaṃ puraskurvan madbhāvaṃ ca vinindakaḥ || 55 || 
āgamaiḥ kalpitairdeva madbhāvādvimukhān kuru | 
īśvara uvāca 
tadājñāṃ śirasi dhṛtvā viṣṇoramitatejasaḥ || 56 || 
tathaivāhaṃ maheśāni kṛtavāṃstantravistaram | 
gopayandivyabhāvaṃ ca puraskurvan paśormatam || 57 || 
ata eva maheśāni vaiṣṇave darśane khalu | 
pūjitaḥ paśubhāvaśca śaktinindā ca vi(smṛ?stṛ)tā || 58 || 
yā śaktiḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ dvidhā bhavati sā punaḥ | 
stūlarūpā ca sā devī sūkṣmarūpā ca pārvati || 59 || 
sthūlarūpeṇa sā devī sarvametajjagattrayam | 
mohayitvā janānsarvān bahurūpā(pān ka pāṭhaḥ |) sukhecchayā || 60 || 
saṃsthitā parameśāni līlākalitavigrahā | 
svabhāvato na jānanti tanmāyāmohitā janāḥ || 61 || 

<pṛ0 328> kecittāṃ tu prahārādyaiḥ kaṭūktibhāṣaṇaistathā | 
tāḍayanti ca vai mū(ca sumūḍhā ka pāṭhaḥ |)ḍhā janā nirayagāminaḥ || 62 || 
kecittāṃ bhūṣaṇācchādaiḥ saṃbhogairapi sevayā | 
pūjayanti hi te dhīrāścaturvargaprasādhakāḥ || 63 || 
teṣāṃ vipriyakartāraḥ patiṣyanti suniścitam | 
sūkṣmarūpāṃ ca tāṃ viddhi sarveṣā(ntamada?manta)rasthitām || 64 || 
trailokyajananīṃ devīṃ mukhyena brahmavartmanā | 
yojayitvā parānande(nda kha pāṭhaḥ |) paramānandarūpiṇīm || 65 || 
tayoryogādyadamṛtaṃ tarpayettena yoginīm | 
prāṇadhāraṇayā devi śuddhanāḍīmanāḥ(na ka pāṭhaḥ |) sudhīḥ || 66 || 
prāṇānpraveśayennāḍyā tanmukhe caiva tān hunet | 
tadvaktre vāyunā bhinne yāti cordhvaṃ pareśvarī || 67 || 
tasmādākṛṣya tadvāyuṃ kumbhayitvā tu saṃcayet | 
saṃcitairvāyubhistāṃ ca kulavartmavihāriṇīm || 68 || 
sahasrāre mahāpadme sitadīdhitimaṇḍale | 
samunnīya pare haṃse tayoraikyaṃ(kyadhi ka pāṭhaḥ |) dhiyā smaret || 69 || 
homādyaṃ vihitaṃ tatra candrasūryātmakaṃ tayoḥ | 
srukasruvau ca samādāya juhuyādavyayaṃ haviḥ || 70 || 
mūlādhāre pare cakre śaktiryā kuṇḍalī śubhā | 
tadbhramāvartato'yaṃ ca bahiryāti dine dine || 71 || 
dineśāṅgulimānena tadardhaṃ copavāsataḥ | 
dviguṇaṃ ratikāle syāt triguṇaṃ bhojanādbahiḥ || 72 || 

<pṛ0 329> ata ūrdhvaṃ vaheddevi tridinaṃ yadi mārutaḥ | 
nyūnaṃ vā tadadhaḥ prāṇaḥ śarīraṃ parimuñcati || 73 || 
yāvatkālaṃ vahedetadvāyuśca jagadīśvaraḥ | 
tāvaccalati deho'yaṃ tadvinā cācalaḥ smṛtaḥ || 74 || 
niścalaṃ pavanaṃ kṛtvā yogī bhavati sādhakaḥ | 
vāyunā nīyate bāhye manastu prāṇināṃ(nā ka pāṭhaḥ |) śive || 75 || 
vāyau ca susthirībhūte mano'pi sthiratāṃ vahet | 
tayoradvaitabhā(vena ka pāṭhaḥ |)ve tu niścalatvaṃ (tvagatestayo ka pāṭhaḥ |) gate dvayoḥ || 76 || 
dehaṃ nirāmaya viddhi saṃtyajya ca kalevaram || 77 || 
advaitabhāvamāpanno na sa punarihāvrajet | 
prasaṅgāt kathitā devi dehasiddhiranuttamā || 78 || 
yena (anenaiva kha pāṭhaḥ |) tena vidhānena parituṣṭā maheśvarī | 
saṃsāranigaḍairbaddhaḥ pumānvimucyate tayā || 79 || 
tasyāstoṣaṃ vinā devi vimuktirnaiva vidyate |
ani(tanni ka pāṭhaḥ |)gṛhītacittasya puruṣasya maheśvari || 80 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śaktimāhātmya-dehasiddhivarṇanaṃ nāma saptastriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 37 || 

<pṛ0 330> [aṣṭātriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
īśvara uvāca 
bahukālaṃ(lapūjitaistu ka pāṭhaḥ |) pūjitā tu tuṣṭā syātsūkṣmarūpiṇī | 
yathā tuṣyati bhogena tapoyogaiśca na tathā || 1 || 
ato bhogena tāṃ toṣya tayā mukto bhavetsukhī | 
mayā cāpi purā devi sevitā yogavartmanā || 2 || 
parituṣṭā na me devī sūkṣmarūpāntarasthitā | 
śaktihīnaṃ ca māṃ vīkṣya vinatāvimukhaṃ tathā || 3 || 
viṣaṇavadano brahmā hṛdayena vidūyatā | 
cintāvaśamupā(pavi ka pāṭhaḥ |)viṣṭo brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ || 4 || 
māmāsādya tathā viṣṇuṃ yayau kṣīrapayonidhim | 
kṣīrodasyottare tīre ratnadvīpe suśobhite || 5 || 
tatra sthitvāvayormadhye brahmā dhyānaparo'bhavat | 
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhyasthe devīpādasaroruhe || 6 || 
mano nidhāya yogātmā devīsūktaṃ paraṃ jagau | 
vyatīte bahukāle'tha devī tribhuvaneśvarī || 7 || 

<pṛ0 331> śūlapāśadharā devī kirīṭādivimaṇḍitā | 
caturbhujā trinetrā ca bālārkakiraṇāruṇā || 8 || 
darśayāmāsa svaṃ rūpaṃ tasya tuṣṭā tadā śive | 
prasannāṃ tāṃ samālokya sraṣṭā sarvajagadguruḥ || 9 || 
bhaktyā vinamravadanastuṣṭāva ca nanāma ca | 
brahmovāca 
tvaṃ sāvitrī ca vāgdevī tvaṃ śrīḥ sarvajagatprasūḥ || 10 || 
svāhā tvaṃ devayajñeṣu pitṛyajñeṣu ca svadhā | 
su(sva ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhā tvaṃ devalokeṣu havistvaṃ khalu mānuṣe || 11 || 
tvaṃ vidyāścaiva mantrāśca vedāstvaṃ hi (su?sva)rātmikā | 
ardhamātrātmikā tvaṃ vai yānuccāryā viśeṣataḥ || 12 || 
tvameva paramā śaktirjagatkāraṇarūpiṇī | 
vicāryāṣṭāṅgayogena lakṣaṇādyairmuhurmuhuḥ || 13 || 
yat sthirīkriyate devi tatte rūpaṃ sanātanam | 
yadavyaktamanirdeśyaṃ niṣkalaṃ paramātmanaḥ || 14 || 
rūpaṃ tavaiva tat sūkṣmaṃ sakalaṃ ca jaganmaya(yi kha pāṭhaḥ |)m | 
yā sṛṣṭiśaktirasmākaṃ sthitiśaktistathā hareḥ || 15 || 
antaśaktistatheśasya sā tvaṃ śaktiḥ sanātanī | 
tvaṃ jātavedogatā śaktirugrā 
tvaṃ dāhikā sūryakarasya śaktiḥ 
āhlādikā tvaṃ bahu candrikāyā-
stāṃ tvāmahaṃ naumi namāmi cāmbikām || 16 || 

<pṛ0 332> yoṣā yoṣitpriyāṇāṃ tvaṃ vidyā tvaṃ cordhvaretasām | 
vāñchā tvaṃ sarvajagatāṃ māyā ca tvaṃ tathā hareḥ || 17 || 
yayā prakāśyate brahma sā tvaṃ nityā prasīda me | 
viśvādistvamanādistvaṃ viśvayonirayonijā || 18 || 
anantātsarvajagatastvamevaikāntarūpiṇī | 
ekā tvaṃ trividhā bhūtvā(tā kha pāṭhaḥ |) mo(kṣa?ha)saṃhārakāriṇī || 19 || 
saṃsārasāgarottārataraṇiḥ sukhamokṣade | 
tvaṃ nityā tvamanityā ca tvaṃ carācaramohinī || 20 || 
namaste jagatāṃ mātaḥ sṛṣṭirūpe sanātani | 
sthitirūpe namastubhyaṃ namaḥ saṃhārarūpiṇi || 21 ||  
evaṃ saṃstūyamānā sā yoganidrā viriñcinā | 
āvirbabhūva pratyakṣaṃ brahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 22 || 
devyuvāca 
parituṣṭāsmi lokeśa stotreṇānena te vibho | 
varaṃ vṛṇīṣva bhadraṃ me yatte manasi vartate || 23 || 
īśvara uvāca 
māṃ samīkṣya varaṃ vrave jagatsaṃhārakārakam | 
sṛṣṭiśaktiṃ mayi tvaṃ ca viṣṇau pālanarūpiṇīm || 24 || 
saṃhāraśaktimīśāne dehi mātarnamo'stu te | 
ekaścarati bhūteśo na dvitīyāṃ samīhate || 25 || 
tathā mohaya sarveśaṃ dārān(rā ka pāṭhaḥ |) svayaṃ jighṛkṣa(kṣya ka pāṭhaḥ |)ti | 
devyuvāca 
yaduktaṃ bhavatā brahmaṃstacca(tsa ka pāṭhaḥ |) satyaṃ nacānyathā || 26 || 

<pṛ0 333> mohayitvāhamīśānaṃ satīrūpeṇa śaṃkaram | 
saṃhariṣyāmi lokeśa jagadetaccarācaram || 27 || 
tatrāpi tāṃ tanuṃ tyaktvā saṃbhaviṣyāmi pārvati | 
iti tasmai samābhāṣya brahmaṇe parameśvarī || 28 || 
vīkṣyamāṇā jagatsraṣṭrā tatraivāntaradhīyata | 
tasyāmantarhitāyāṃ ca brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ || 29 || 
kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā viṣṇumāha prajāpatiḥ | 
saṃhārakaraṇe yogyaṃ vīrabhāvaṃ ca yadbhavet || 30 || 
tannideśaya mahādeve viṣṇo lokeṣu durlabham | 
iti tadvacanaṃ śrutvā bhagavān harirīśvaraḥ || 31 || 
ādiṣṭavān mayi bhadre vīrabhāvaṃ sudurlabham | 
vīrabhāve sthitaḥ so'haṃ mātastvāṃ (tistva ka pāṭhaḥ |) samupāsmahe || 32 || 
adyāpi parameśāni mātastubhyaṃ namo namaḥ | 
prakṛtiḥ (tistva ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarvabhūtānāṃ tvaṃ hi sarvajagatprasūḥ || 33 || 
yā (muktiḥ?mūrtiḥ) mama deveśi kṣitirūpā tu gīyate | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satya namo namaḥ || 34 || 
yā me mūrtirdvitīyā ca jalamayīti kathyate | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 35 || 
āgneyī yā tṛtīyā me jagatkṣobhaṇakāriṇī | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 36 || 
caturthī vāyavī mūrtiḥ sṛṣṭisaṃhārakāriṇī | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 37 || 

<pṛ0 334> pañcamī yā ca sarveṣāṃ pariṇāmasvarūpiṇī | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 38 || 
ṣaṣṭhī yā sarvadevānāmāpyāyanīti gīyate | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 39 || 
saptamī mama mūrtiryā jagadāhlādakāriṇī | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 40 || 
aṣṭamī mama mūrtiryā sthitisaṃhārakāriṇī | 
sā tvameva na me nāhaṃ mātaḥ satyaṃ namo namaḥ || 41 || 
nacaivāhaṃ na me kiṃcidyadiha jagatītale | 
tvayaivedaṃ jagadvyāptaṃ jagat sarvaṃ tvameva hi || 42 || 
devyuvāca 
mayā sarvaṃ jagadvyāptaṃ vatsa satyaṃ prabhāṣase | 
mamaivaite'vatārāśca matsyakūrmādayo'pare || 43 || 
tvamevāhaṃ nacānyo'si brahmāhaṃ viṣṇurapyaham | 
ahameva jagat sarvaṃ nāsti kiṃcit mayā vinā || 44 || 
yattu paśyasi he vatsa yat kiṃcijjagatītale | 
brahmādistambaparyantamahameva na saṃśayaḥ || 45 || 
ihaikasthaṃ jagatkṛtsnaṃ paśyādya sacarācaram | 
ityuktvā darśayāmāsa śaṃbhave jagadīśvarī || 46 || 
svaśarīre jagatkṛtsnaṃ saṃpraviṣṭamanekadhā | 
dṛṣṭvā jaganmayīṃ (jaganmayīṃ tato dṛṣṭvā ka pāṭhaḥ |) prāha śaṃbhurmāyāvimohitaḥ | 
māmuddhara jaganmātarmohasāgaramadhyataḥ || 47 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śivasya śaktiprāptinirūpaṇaṃ nāma aṣṭātriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 38 || 

<pṛ0 335> [ūnacatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
jaganmayyuvāca 
mā viṣīda mahādeva sarvathā tvaṃ sthiro bhava | 
kulajñānī kathaṃ tvaṃ hi bhāvajñānī kathaṃ punaḥ || 1 || 
ityevaṃ tvaṃ mayā pṛṣṭastvamātmānaṃ na vismara | 
tadānandamayaṃ dhāma svavidyābhedasaṃgatam || 2 || 
puruṣaḥ prakṛtiścaiva nityau dvau samupasthitau | 
saguṇādhibalā devī nirguṇo nirbalaḥ pumān || 3 || 
avidyānādyarūpā sā madaṃśā bhedarūpiṇī | 
sisṛkṣayāpi nīcāsya savidhe samupasthitā || 4 || 
sisṛkṣayā mayā pūrvaṃ prārthitaḥ puruṣaḥ khalu | 
māmānandaya sānandamityuktvā dharṣitaḥ prabhuḥ || 5 || 
mayā dharṣitamātro'sau babhūva saguṇo vibhuḥ | 
tattadānandasaṃdohai(rā?ḥ sā)nandāhaṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 6 || 
jaḍatvādubhayordeva śūnyabhāvamupāgatam | 
athānandātmanorjātā śaktirādyā sanātanī || 7 || 

<pṛ0 336> guṇatrayamayī sā tu bindutrayasvarūpiṇī | 
adhaḥ kṛtvā tu puruṣaṃ hakārārdhasvarūpiṇī || 8 || 
viparītena ramate vahnīndvarkasvarūpiṇī | 
aśiraskahakārāntya(ntyame ka pāṭhaḥ |)maśeṣākārasaṃsthitam || 9 || 
antaścaramajasraṃ taṃ svamātmānamupāsmahe | 
bindutraye mahādeva sargametat pratiṣṭhitam || 10 || 
brahmādistambaparyantaṃ jagat sthāvarajaṅgamam | 
pañcabhūtamayaṃ viddhi cāsatyaṃ satyavadbhramaḥ || 11 || 
pṛthivīyaṃ mahādeva prā(pra ka pāṭhaḥ |)kṛtī natu (kasturī?vāstavī) | 
brāhmaṇī naiva cāṇḍālī naiva daivī na mānuṣī || 12 || 
rasamātraṃ jalaṃ viddhi na dvijaṃ naca pukka(śam ka pāṭhaḥ |)sam | 
rūpamātraṃ tu yattejastatra kiṃ jātikalpanā || 13 || 
sparśamātraṃ tu yadvāyurnottamo nādhamaḥ khalu | 
śabdamātraṃ yadākāśaṃ vibhostasya mahātmanaḥ || 14 || 
nīcatāṃ kalpate devi mūḍho'jñānavijṛmbhitaḥ | 
ebhiḥ pañcabhirārabdhaṃ dehaṃ sthāvarajaṅgamam || 15 || 
pañcānāṃ saṃnipātaṃ yat na brāhmaṇaṃ na pukkasa(śa ka pāṭhaḥ |)m | 
tadasatyaṃ vijānīyāt satyaṃ brahma na tanna tat || 16 || 
dehādbhinnaḥ śivo dehī paramānandarūpavān | 
tadbrahmeti ca yo vidyāt sa eva brāhmaṇo mataḥ || 17 || 
yadidaṃ lakṣyate(kṣase ka pāṭhaḥ |) deva pañcabhūtātmavigrahe | 
vāyubhirindriyagrāme prerite pañcabhiḥ śivam || 18 || 

<pṛ0 337> kartṛtvamātmano deva tadavidyābhramo mahān | 
vyāpṛteṣvindriyeṣvātmā vyāpārī(vivekī cā ka pāṭhaḥ |)vāvivekinām || 19 || 
dṛśyate'bhreṣu dhāvatsu dhāvanniva yathā śaśī | 
ātmacaitanyamāśritya dehendriyamanodhiyaḥ || 20 || 
svakīyārtheṣu vartante sūryālokaṃ yathā janāḥ | 
dehendriyaguṇān karmāṇyamale saccidātmani || 21 || 
adhyāsyātmā(tmavi ka pāṭhaḥ |)vivekena gagane nīlatāmiva(vat ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
ajñānānmānasopādheḥ kartṛtvādīni cātmani || 22 || 
kalpyante'mbugate candre calanādiryathāmbhasaḥ | 
rāgecchāsukhaduḥkhādi(vṛ?bu)ddhau satyāṃ (satyā kha pāṭhaḥ |) pravartate || 23 || 
suṣuptau nāsti tannāśe tasmād buddhestu nātmanaḥ | 
prakāśo'rkasya toyasya śaityamagneryathoṣṇatā || 24 || 
svabhāvaḥ(vasa ka pāṭhaḥ |) saccidānandanityanirmalatātmanaḥ | 
ātmanaḥ saccidaṃśaśca buddhervṛ(ddhi?tti)riti dvayam || 25 || 
saṃyojya cāvivekena jānāmīti pravartate | 
ātmano vikriyā nāsti buddherbodho na jātviti || 26 || 
jīvaḥ (jīva savamaya jñātvā jñātvā dṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarvamalaṃ jñātvā kartā draṣṭeti muhyati | 
rajjusarpavadātmānaṃ jñātvā jīvo bhayaṃ vahet || 27 || 
nāhaṃ jīvaḥ parātmeti jñātaśca (ścenni ka pāṭhaḥ |) nirbhayo bhavet | 
ātmāvabhāsayatyeko buddyādīnīndriyāṇi hi || 28 || 
dīpo ghaṭādivat svātmajātaistairnāvabhāsyate | 
svabodhe nānyabodhecchā (dhaśca ka pāṭhaḥ |) bodharūpasya (rpastathā ka pāṭhaḥ |) cātmanaḥ || 29 || 

<pṛ0 338> na dīpasya (patayā ka pāṭhaḥ | syānya kha pāṭhaḥ |) tu dīpecchā yathā svātmaprakāśane | 
niṣidhya nikhilopādhiṃ neti netīti vākyataḥ || 30 || 
vidyādaikyaṃ mahāvākyairjīvātmaparamātmanoḥ | 
āvidyakaṃ śarīrādi dṛśyaṃ budbudavat kṣaṇam || 31 || 
etadvilakṣaṇaṃ vidyādahaṃ brahmeti nirmalam | 
dehā(dehātyatvānna me janmajarākārśyalayādayaḥ kha pāṭhaḥ |)nmama vibhinnatvānna me janmajarādayaḥ || 32 || 
śabdādiviṣayaiḥ saṅgo nirindriyatayā naca | 
amanastvānna me duḥkharāgadveṣabhayādayaḥ || 33 || 
aprāṇo hyamanāḥ śuddha(bhra kha pāṭhaḥ |) ityādiśrutiśāsanāt | 
nirguṇo niṣkriyo nityo nirvikalpo nirañjanaḥ || 34 || 
nirvikāro nirākāro nityamukto'smi nirmalaḥ | 
nityaśuddhavimuktaikamakhaṇḍānandamadvayam || 35 || 
satyaṃ jñānamayaṃ yattat paraṃ brahmāhameva tat | 
evaṃ nirantaraṃ(rābhyastā kha pāṭhaḥ |) kṛtvā brahmaivāsmīti vāsanā || 
haratyavidyāvikṣepān rogāniva rasāyanam || 36 || 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
dehādbhinnaḥ kathaṃ hyātmā kīdṛśaḥ kutra saṃsthitaḥ | 
kathaṃ vā jñāyate brahma tanme vada jaganmami || 37 || 
jaganmayyuvāca 
avacchinna ivājñānāt tannāśe sati kevalaḥ | 
svayaṃ prakāśate hyātmā meghāpāyeṃ'śumāniva || 38 || 
ajñānakaluṣaṃ jīvaṃ jñānābhyāsādvinirmalam | 
kṛtvājñānaṃ svayaṃ naśyejjalaṃ katakareṇuvat || 39 || 

<pṛ0 339> saṃsāraḥ svapnatulyo hi rāgadveṣādisaṃgataḥ (sakula kha pāṭhaḥ |) | 
a(svakāle kha pāṭhaḥ |)bodhe satyavadbhāti su(pra kha pāṭhaḥ |)bodhe'satyavadbhavet || 40 || 
tāvat satyaṃ jagadbhāti śuktikārajataṃ yathā | 
yāvanna jñāyate brahma sarvādhiṣṭhānamadvayam || 41 || 
saccidātmanyanusyūtā nitye viṣṇau prakalpitāḥ | 
vyaktayo vividhāḥ sarvā hāṭake kaṭakādivat || 42 || 
yathākāśo hṛṣīkeśo nānopādhigato vibhuḥ | 
tadbhedādbhinnavadbhāti tannāśe tve(sati kevala kha pāṭhaḥ |)kavadbhavet || 43 || 
nānopādhivaśādeva jātivarṇāśramādayaḥ | 
ātmanyāropitāstoye rasavarṇa(rṇādi kha pāṭhaḥ |)vibhedavat || 44 || 
pañcīkṛtamahābhūtasaṃbhavaṃ karmasaṃcitam | 
śarīraṃ sukhaduḥkhānāṃ bhogāyatanamucyate || 45 || 
pañcaprāṇamanobuddhidaśendriyasamanvitam | 
apañcīkṛtabhūtotthaṃ sūkṣmāṅgaṃ bhogasādhanam || 46 || 
anādyavidyānirvācyā kāraṇopādhirucyate | 
upādhitritayādanyadā(mā kha pāṭhaḥ |)tmānamavadhāraya(yet kha pāṭhaḥ |) || 47 || 
sarvabhūtasthamātmānamahameva tathātmani | 
sarvabhūtāni saṃcintya cintayasvaikameva hi || 48 || 
utpattipralayābhyāṃ ca na sadidaṃ niśāmaya | 
manaḥ karoti pāpāni manaḥ pāpena lipyate | 
manasyunmananībhūte na dharmo naca pātakam || 49 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śivasya devīkṛtajñānopadeśavarṇanaṃ nāmonacatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 39 || 

<pṛ0 340> [catvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
kathyatāṃ devadeveśi vyaktībhūtāvubhau katham | 
śivaśaktimayaṃ jñānaṃ kathaṃ vā jāyate tathā || 1 || 
jaganmayyuvāca 
puṃbhāvaḥ śiva i(mi ka pāṭhaḥ |)tyāhuḥ strībhāvaḥ prakṛtiḥ parā | 
śivo jñānamayo dehe śaktirbuddhimayī parā || 2 || 
śukraṃ śivo mahāmedaḥ śaktiḥ kuṇḍalinī tviti | 
liṅgaṃ śiva(va ka pāṭhaḥ |)stathā śaktiryonirjagati dṛśyate || 3 || 
ityevaṃ tripurā śaktirityevaṃ tripuraḥ śivaḥ | 
nānayorvidyate bhedo yā śaktiḥ sa śivo dhruvam || 4 || 
na śivena vinā śaktirna śakti(ktyāvā ka pāṭhaḥ |)rahitaḥ śivaḥ | 
na tadbhūtastayorbhedaścandracandrikayoriva || 5 || 
evaṃ tau sarvabhūteṣu dvidhābhūtau vyavasthitau | 
tasmānnāsti tayorbhinnaṃ jagadetaccarācaram || 6 || 
pitā mātā sutaśceti bhāvo'yaṃ vividho (mu?mṛ)ṣā | 
svā(sva ka pāṭhaḥ |)vidyāsudṛḍhābhyāsād dṛḍhībhūto hṛdi sthitaḥ || 7 || 

<pṛ0 341> guruvākyena taṃ vidyād dṛḍhābhyāsena mānavaḥ | 
jīvanmuktaḥ sarvabhūtamayo bhavati vai dhruvam || 8 || 
śarīraṃ vividhāṅgaṃ me kathyate śṛṇu sādaram | 
brahmaivāhaṃ nacānyo'smi śarīrametadeva hi || 9 || 
caitanyaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ śabdabrahmasvarūpakam | 
varṇarūpeṇa tadvyaktaṃ mantravidyādibhedataḥ || 10 || 
kuṅkumāgurukastūryā rocanācandanendubhiḥ | 
prakāśya tava pīṭhe tu śaktyantaḥsthaṃ yathā bhavet || 11 || 
tatra pūjā sadā kāryā tattadvartmavidhānataḥ | 
sarveṣāmeva devānāṃ mantramādyaṃ śarīrakam || 12 || 
pūjayettad guru(rurmantrī ka pāṭhaḥ |)mantradevatātmasvarūpataḥ | 
dvitīyaṃ kathyate deva yatpunardhyānagocaram || 13 || 
kṛtvā ratnamayaṃ rūpaṃ śuddhakāñcananirmitam | 
pratyahaṃ pūjayeddevamamutra māsi māsi ca || 14 || 
vārṣikaṃ tvatha vā kuryānmahotsavamanuttamam | 
vimukho dambhamāśritya dravyanāśa(doṣo nāśya ka pāṭhaḥ |)vaśāduta || 15 || 
mahotsavavidhau yo me (sva?sa)syādbhagnamanorathaḥ | 
vimukhāstasya durbuddheḥ pitaraḥ sāmarā (samarā ka pāṭhaḥ |) gaṇāḥ || 16 || 
tasmātparadine(na kha pāṭhaḥ |) prāpte bodhayitvā vidhānataḥ | 
pratyahaṃ pūjayedbhaktyā pūrṇaṃ (pūrṇānta syānma ka pāṭhaḥ |) tasyā mahotsavam || 17 || 
tṛtīyaṃ kathyate yantraṃ rā(ra kha pāṭhaḥ |)tnaṃ vā hemanirmitam | 
madātmarūpamātraṃ tu viditvā sadgurorbudhaḥ || 18 || 

<pṛ0 342> pūjayedgandhapuṣpādyairmadātmā madabhedataḥ | 
candanāgurukastūryā rocanācandrakuṅkumaiḥ || 19 || 
kulapuṣpaiśca saṃlikhya tvaduktāvidhinā yajet | 
vārāhaskandhajaidarbhairanulepaṃ vigharṣayet || 20 || 
vārāhadehajairdarbhaiḥ kuryānmalavigharṣaṇam | 
prītirme jāyate tatra pūrṇā dvādaśavārṣikī || 21 || 
sugandhisparśasukhadaiḥ kusumairaruṇairapi | 
aśūnyaṃ sarvadā kuryācchūnye vighnādyanekaśaḥ || 22 || 
atyantasukhadairvastrairācchādya bhavanāntare | 
tvalliṅgenātiśuddhena śuklena cittahāriṇā || 23 || 
sthāpayetpūjayetsārdhaṃ yato nāhaṃ tvayā vinā | 
naiva tvamapi he deva prabhurdevo mayā vinā || 24 || 
tasmādāvāṃ sadaivātra sthāpayetsiddhimicchukaḥ | 
vidrumamauktikābhyāṃ vā yo japenmantramuttamam || 25 || 
samayācārayogena tvayoktenaiva śaṃkara | 
pūjāṃ yaḥ kurute nityaṃ bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ || 26 || 
caturdhā kālarūpaiśca hastairāliṅgya taṃ śivam | 
māmakyā kalayā yuktaṃ karomi puranāyakam || 27 || 
turīyaṃ me paraṃ rūpaṃ guptaṃ yajjagatītale | 
tatra pūjā sadā kāryā kulayāgavidhānataḥ || 28 || 
sarvāpāyeṣu sarvatra kaulo dharmaḥ paro mahān | 
su(svā ka pāṭhaḥ |)gamā nigamāḥ sarve kaulo dharmastu durgamaḥ || 29 || 

<pṛ0 343> nisargadurgamaḥ kaulaḥ sugama iva bhātyasau | 
brahmaviṣṇuśivādīnāṃ prabhavo(va ka pāṭhaḥ |) yatra kīrtitaḥ (tam ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 30 || 
tadrūpaṃ me paraṃ dhāma brahmaṇo vyaktajanmanaḥ | 
sadguroḥ kṛpayā labdhā(bdhvā ka pāṭhaḥ |) tatra pūjā mahodayā || 31 || 
brahmaprakāśakaṃ tattu tanniṣṭhaṃ brahma cocyate | 
svayaṃ prakāśate brahma yasya darśanataḥ śivaḥ || 32 || 
sparśanātpūjaye(nā kha pāṭhaḥ |)dyasya brahmaṇyeva nimajjati | 
ānandābdhau nimajjyeva bhavābdhiṃ sa na paśyati || 33 || 
kaulo dharmastvayā proktastamāsādya kulaṃ yajet | 
madrūpā paramā śaktirliṅgarūpī bhavān prabhuḥ || 34 || 
śukraṃ śivo rajaḥ śaktiriti jānīhi śaṃkara | 
tvayā mayā jagadidaṃ paripūrṇaṃ maheśvara || 35 || 
ekaivāhaṃ paraṃ brahma śivaśaktīti bhedataḥ | 
saṃprabhinnaṃ jagadidaṃ bhrama evātra kāraṇam || 36 || 
tvamahaṃ ceti yatproktaṃ tadavidyā(śra?bhra)mo mahān | 
tattvamasi sa evāhaṃ na tvaṃ nāhaṃ tadeva yat || 37 || 
āvayornahi bhedo'sti yuktyā budhyasva śaṃkara | 
madantastvayi saṃlīne tva(tvā ka pāṭhaḥ |)mevāhaṃ bhavān prabhuḥ || 38 || 
āvayoḥ saralākāramabhūnmilitayoḥ śiva | 
tanmahāmokṣamāpnoti bhogenaiva maheśvara || 49 || 
kalpakoṭisahasrāṇi kalpakoṭiśatāni ca | 
pūjanānnahi me prītiryadihānyaprakārataḥ || 40 || 

<pṛ0 344> māṃsabhārairna me prītirna tathā madyasāgaraiḥ | 
yathā me jāyate prītirbhagaliṅgāmṛtaiḥ śiva || 41 || 
ahameva mahādeva striyaḥ sarvā jagatsviha | 
iti matvā bhajante māṃ budhā bhāvasamanvitāḥ (ta ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 42 || 
ye devā madgataprāṇā madvāsā madvibhūṣaṇāḥ | 
svadharmānaparityajya māmeva śaraṇaṃ gatāḥ || 43 || 
te punarbhogino muktā jīvanto(vato ka pāṭhaḥ |)'pi mahītale | 
madaṅgasparśamātreṇa cātmānaṃ jñātumarhasi || 44 || 
mayi praviśa viśveśa māṃ bhajasva sanātanīm | 
jahi śaṅkāṃ mahādeva tvamātmānaṃ na vismara || 45 || 
viṣṇuḥ pibatyasau vāmaṃ brahmā me dakṣiṇaṃ stanam | 
tvaṃ pibasva mahādeva mamādhara(śru?sru)tāmṛtam || 46 || 
striyaṃ gacchan spṛśanpaśyaṃstābhireva vihāravān | 
dhyānaṃ pūjāṃ japaṃ caiva kuryānme sādhakottamaḥ || 47 || 
śaktyāyuktaḥ sadā mantrī na tayā rahito bhavet | 
tayā virahito devaḥ sarvakarmasu na kṣamaḥ || 48 || 
patihīnā yathā nārī sarvakarmavivarjitā | 
śaktihīnastathā mantrī tasmācchaktiyuto bhava || 49 || 
ekā cedvaśagā sādhvī tasyāḥ kṛ(syākṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṣṭirbhavāya ca | 
duṣṭabhāryā (kulā?karā)kṛṣṭirvināśāyaiva kevalam || 50 || 
kulabhedī(di ka pāṭhaḥ |) nadītīre koṣāgāraṃ yathā śiva | 
bhagaliṅgasamāyogādyadānandaḥ prajāyate || 51 || 

<pṛ0 345> brahmaiva tadvijānīyādanantaṃ mokṣasādhanam | 
gurupūjā karākṛṣṭirvighnotsāraṇakarmakṛt || 52 || 
rahasyākhyānakaṃ karṇe hyāsanaṃ gaṇḍacumbanam | 
bhūtaśuddhiḥ parīrambhaḥ saṃtoṣendriyanigrahaḥ || 53 || 
prāṇāyāmaḥ stanākṛṣṭirnyāsamatra samīritam | 
nakhadantakṣatādīni dhūpadīpapradāpanam || 54 || 
cāṭukāni ratānte ca supuṣpāṇyaṅgasaṃgamam | 
darśanaṃ sparśanaṃ yonervikārālliṅgagharṣaṇam || 55 || 
adharāmṛtapānaṃ ca svayamāveśanaṃ tathā | 
vikṣepotkṣepaṇaṃ caiva patanotpatanaṃ tathā || 56 || 
tarpaṇādyupacāraṃ tu mathanaṃ havanaṃ tathā | 
sītkāro mantrajapanaṃ brahmārpaṇaikacittatā || 57 || 
kūjanaṃ gāyanaṃ stotraṃ(stutya kha pāṭhaḥ |) retaḥpāto visarjanam | 
itthameva mahādeva pūjanaṃ me samīritam || 58 || 
ekasyā(kāyā ka pāṭhaḥ |) bahurūpiṇyāḥ(ṇya ka pāṭhaḥ |) pratyahaṃ yaḥ samācaret | 
jīvanmuktaḥ svayaṃ devo'pyasādhyamapi sādhayet || 59 || 
bhogaiśca madhuparkādyairvāmābhāve sthito yajet | 
śrutismṛtyuditaṃ karma tyajan vātha samāśrayan || 60 || 
tattatkarmaparityāgād (dhyānaṃ?hīnaṃ) jātiṣu jāyate | 
tato bahu sukhaṃ bhuktvā pareṣāṃ ca sudurlabham || 61 || 
vidyābhyāsaprasādena bhogena mokṣamāpnuyāt | 
evaṃ bahuvidhān bhogī bhogānvai sumanoharān || 62 || 

<pṛ0 346> samāsādya ca tāṃstāṃstu vairāgye vana(na ā ka pāṭhaḥ |)māviśet | 
asārāṃśca tathā sārānniḥsārāṃśca tathā parān || 63 || 
nānāvidhairvivekādyairvivicya sādhakastathā | 
sārabhūte pare tattve mana ādhāya yogavit || 64 || 
niḥsāramasadādyantaṃ jagadetaccarācaram | 
satyaṃ kimapi tatraiva vastu sākṣānnirakṣaram || 65 || 
tadānandamayaṃ brahma viditvātmani sādhakaḥ | 
ekāntavijane ramye mṛḍa(du kha pāṭhaḥ |)komala āsane || 66 || 
āsīnaścintayedbrahma paramānandanirbharaḥ | 
brahmacintāparāmodī(dabho ka pāṭhaḥ |) bhogeṣu vigataspṛhaḥ || 67 || 
ekāṃ bhāryāṃ samādāya yoginīṃ sahacāriṇīm | 
asādhyaṃ sādhayedyogī yoginyeva sahāyinī || 68 || 
yathā tvaṃ mayakā nātha pārvatyā parameśvara | 
mohayitvā punardevī śaṃkaraṃ prāha pārvatī || 69 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde śivaśaktimayajñāna-kulayāgavarṇanaṃ nāma catvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 40 || 

<pṛ0 347> [ekacatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] | 
atulaikarasānandaṃ kaivalyāyatanaṃ śivam | 
natvā śiṣyeva sānandā tamuvāca parā śivā || 1 || 
pārvatyuvāca 
prasīda paramānandamaya saṃśāntavigraha (saśaktivigraha ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
yadyadeva paraṃ tattvaṃ tattvato viditaṃ mayā || 2 || 
tvayā deva samākhyātāḥ sarve mantrāḥ kriyāḥ parāḥ | 
yogāḥ samādhayo jñānaṃ tathā cānye madīpsitāḥ || 3 || 
teṣāṃ hi kāraṇaṃ tattvaṃ yadīśa parataḥ param | 
vaktumarhasi tattvena śāṃbhavaṃ cāpyanuttaram || 4 || 
vācyasvarūpavyāptitvaṃ jñātumicchāmi tattvataḥ | 
prakāśo vimarśādhīna iti satyaṃ yadi prabho || 5 || 
mamādhīnastvamevā(va syāt ka pāṭhaḥ |)si yathoktaṃ vada śaṃkara | 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
atiguhyatamaṃ sūkṣmamavāṅmanasagocaram || 6 || 
mayā yatnena guptaṃ tanna tatkasyāpi kathyate | 
ahameva tvamapyasmi (pyasya ka pāṭhaḥ |) khalūkteti ca me matiḥ || 7 || 

<pṛ0 348> tvamapyevaṃ smarasyasmāt tvayāpi viditaṃ priye | 
saccitsaṃyogasaṃsiddhi(ddhimama vaśyā mavasāyata ka pāṭhaḥ |)stvadvaśyā mama sā yataḥ || 8 || 
tadeva cottaraṃ prāhuḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ mayoditam | 
tadeva citsadādyantāvaikyena saṃsthitaṃ yadā || 9 || 
tadā śāṃbhavamityāhurmunayastattvavittamāḥ | 
tadevāhamidaṃbhāvapūrṇānando yadā bhavet || 10 || 
tadaiva śaṃbhubhāvaḥ syāduktametatpadatrayam | 
śakra(kratri ka pāṭhaḥ |)striśūlī sargo'ntaṃ tairevālaṃkṛtā yadi || 11 || 
saiva hi śrīparetyuccairmunibhiḥ parikīrtitā | 
prakāśānandasaṃdohakaivalyamahamā(dā ka pāṭhaḥ |)śrayā || 12 || 
matparatvānmahāsiddhyai sā pareti ca kathyate | 
ye mantrāḥ parameśāni tenādāvapi saṃyutāḥ || 13 || 
te jīvanti ca mantrebhyo hyanyonyamiti me matiḥ | 
saptaṣaṣṭiprakṛtyarṇā jagatsṛṣṭyādikartṛkāḥ || 14 || 
eteṣāṃ jīvabhūtatvādanuttaramidaṃ jagat | 
pārvatyuvāca 
sakalā niṣkalāścaiva muktimārgaprabodhakāḥ || 15 || 
mantrāstu bahavaḥ santi vada teṣāmanuttaram | 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
keṣāṃcidasmaduktānāmete'pyanarthadarṇavā (?) || 16 || 
āvayordevadeveśi manūnāṃ kāraṇaṃ manoḥ | 
sarveṣāmeva mantrāṇāṃ prāpyāvāvāṃ maheśvari || 17 || 
āvayorapi tatprāpyamanuttaramiti smṛtam | 
apyetadakṣarāvṛttergamyāgamyatayā sthitam || 18 || 

<pṛ0 349> agamyakāraṇatvācca gamyāvāvā(vā prati ka pāṭhaḥ |)miti priye | 
idantayāhantayā vā sarveṣāmantarātmani || 19 || 
pratīyamānastvartho yastadeva śivanirṇayam | 
pūrṇāhantāsvabhāvena kṛtrimāhantayā vinā || 20 || 
bahirantāradaṃ viśvaṃ yaḥ paśyati sa paśyati | 
ahantāyāṃ mahādevi tvameva prāṇināṃ priyā || 21 || 
ajñānāma(da ka pāṭhaḥ |)pi cātmā tvaṃ (tmāna ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarve te'nuttarapriyāḥ | 
pārvatyuvāca 
tvayā pūrvopadiṣṭaṃ yattattvaṃ śrīmatparāmayam || 22 || 
tadeva nirvāṇapadamiti proktaṃ tayā mayā | 
idānīmatiguhyānāṃ tadevādya(dyā ka pāṭhaḥ |)manuttaram || 23 || 
praśaṃsase parānandavimarśāviṣṭavigraha | 
etasminneva kaivalye cetaḥśleṣo(ṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |) na me vibho || 24 || 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
satyameva tvayākhyātamubhayaṃ tava sundari | 
parayā tvapi tatprāpyaṃ pūrvoditamanuttamam || 25 || 
yat saṃmataṃ tathāpyetat tayorapyantaraṃ mahat | 
parā tu saptaviṃśatyā antarbāhyakriyāguṇaiḥ || 26 || 
pūjyā cāsmatkalāṃśeti keṣāṃcidyoginīmatam | 
mānarūpakriyopādhivihīnatvānmaheśvari || 27 || 
parāyā api tatprāpyaṃ pūrvoditamanuttaram | 
pārvatyuvāca 
asya māhātmyamevoktaṃ tvayā me bahudhā vibho || 28 || 

<pṛ0 350> upāyenāmunā paśye ya(śye dyukta naiva tu ka pāṭhaḥ |)duktaṃ naiva jātucit | 
yadiṣṭaṃ sarvamākhyātaṃ yadapyuktamanuttaram || 19 || 
naiva śaknomi nirṇetuṃ tattvataḥ kathayasva me | 
śaṃbhuruvāca 
atyantābhāvato bhedādāvayoḥ paramārthataḥ || 30 || 
idamīdṛśamityuktaṃ purevāhamupā(ditam ka pāṭhaḥ |)dhitaḥ | 
saṃprāptā svaradevatā naiva kāryā vicāraṇā || 31 || 
yadyanyabhāvasthairyeṇa prāptavyaṃ guṇakāryataḥ | 
tarhi bhūyo'pi vakṣyāmi mayoktārthasya nirṇayam || 32 || 
manovāgviṣayātītaṃ pūrvoktaṃ yadanuttaram | 
tattridhā bhedamāyāti bindunādākhyabījataḥ || 33 || 
tānyeva saccidānandabhedena vai(vi ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhavāni tu | 
matsvarūpo hi yo (yad ka pāṭhaḥ |) bindustasmānnādastu bhāmi(vini ka pāṭhaḥ |)ni || 34 || 
dvayoḥ samarasī(sābhāva mukha bījā ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhāvāduktaṃ bījākhyamāvayoḥ | 
aikyajñānapathe caināṃ devi śāṃbhavavācake || 35 || 
varṇakrameṇa saṃbhāvya kuryānmi(matha ka pāṭhaḥ |)thunabhāvanām | 
evaṃ krame maheśāni tāmanuttaratāṃ vrajet || 36 || 
vahnivat kāṣṭhasaṃbaddhe samunnaddho'vaniṃ taret (ra ka pāṭhaḥ |) |
vyañjane (vārjane ka pāṭhaḥ |) mathanodbhūte tāṃ tu śaktipadātmikām || 67 || 
vratahomena saṃbhāvya (vye ka pāṭhaḥ |) svabhāvaṃ svayamācaret | 
prakāśānta(nta ka pāṭhaḥ |)rvimarśāntastasmādevaprakāśakam || 38 || 

<pṛ0 351> uttarottaramekaikaṃ nayāmi tat kramotkramāt | 
saṃkocaḥ savikāsaśca svarūpau sūryasaṃgatau || 39 || 
tattu yāgatayā syātāṃ prakāśānandamandirau | 
saccinmayau kriyāsārāvadhūtātmakriyāparau || 40 || 
etayorāvayoryattatkāraṇaṃ syādanuttaram | 
hṛdayānala(nabhāryāntā ka pāṭhaḥ |)bhāryāntaṃ śivadaṇḍīvilaṃ pha(lambitam kha pāṭhaḥ |)lam || 41 || 
antaḥ pratīyamānaṃ tadameyaṃ sarvatomukham | 
ādimadhyāntanirmuktaṃ nistaraṅgābdhisaṃnibham || 42 || 
sanmātraṃ caiva cinmātraṃ tayoraikyarasāvṛtam | 
tamaḥprakāśahīnaṃ yadaṇorbahutaraṃ param || 43 || 
mahatāṃ ca mahattvācca brahmasaṃjñamanuttaram | 
tadevāvahitena tvaṃ svāntena paribhāvaya || 44 || 
anena bhāvavānāśu mantrastanmayatāṃ vrajet | 
yadā tanmayasiddhyādi viśvaṃ tvayi vibhāvayet || 45 || 
tena viśrāntabhāvena tadaikyā(daikā ka pāṭhaḥ |)nandamāpsyati(tha ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
ākāśe nirmale yadya(dva kha pāṭhaḥ |)tsahasā ghanasaṃkulam || 46 || 
utpatya līyate tadvajjagadātmanyanuttare | 
ityevaṃ pratyabhijñānasiddhiḥ syāttava suvrate || 47 || 
svasaṃvedyaṃ sukhaṃ paścānnaiva śaknomi veditum | 
parā tvaṃ paramarddhiḥ syānnatvasya vihitaṃ yataḥ || 48 || 
itaḥ paraṃ na jānāmi tvayāhaṃ bahudhā śape | 
etacchrutvā mahādevyā hyetadarthavima(rṣaṇam ka pāṭhaḥ |)rśanam || 49 || 

<pṛ0 352> prakāśitaṃ tadevāśu vismayāviṣṭacetasā | 
mahadāścaryametanme saṃpūrṇo'yaṃ yadāsthitaḥ || 50 || 
iti saṃcintya devasya pādamāśliṣya sundarī | 
ta(va?dā)cānyonyamathanātsāndrānandābhinanditā || 51 || 
yatprakāśātmakaṃ sarvaṃ tattvaṃ kevalatāṃ gatam | 
vimarśā(mṛśyā kha pāṭhaḥ |)vani(rṣamavani ṣā ka pāṭhaḥ |)saṃprāptamityeṣā tāttvikī sthitiḥ || 52 || 
avadhānaikabhāvānāṃ matiḥ sā sākṣirūpiṇī | 
tatpramāṇaiḥ varākaiḥ (kaistaiścidevā pramāṇakaḥ ka pāṭhaḥ |) kiṃ taiścidevāpramāṇakā || 53 || 
nahi vaikartanaṃ jyotirdīpālokamapekṣate | 
ādarśe vimalābhoge yathā sarvaṃ prakāśate || 54 || 
itthaṃ cidātmakaṃ viśvaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvabhedanam | 
ādau śuddhātmakaṃ tattvaṃ pañcadhā tamasaḥ param || 55 || 
śivaḥ śaktiśca sādākhya īśo vidyeti bhidyate | 
hakṣādiśāntavarṇātmā niramāyi yadā śive || 56 || 
kalāvidyā rāgakālau niyatirvarma(rbandha kha pāṭhaḥ |) ucyate | 
māyāpūrvo vakārādiyakārāntākṣarātmakam || 57 || 
pradhānaṃ (pramāṇaṃ ca mano ka pāṭhaḥ |) puṃmano buddhirahaṃkṛ(hahṛ ka pāṭhaḥ |)nmādipañcakam | 
śrotrādipañcakaṃ tādi (lādivādi ka pāṭhaḥ |) ṭādi vāgādipañcakam || 58 || 
tanmātrapañcakaṃ cādi (mādi yādi ka pāṭhaḥ |) bhūmyādi kādipañcakam | 
sisṛkṣoḥ prathamaḥ spandaḥ śivatattvaṃ prabhoḥ smṛtam || 59 ||
icchaivāsyā(sya ka pāṭhaḥ |)parimlānā śaktitattva(tvaṃ mada ka pāṭhaḥ |)mudaṅkuśam | 
svecchayā sūcitaṃ viśvamācchādyāhanta(tva ka pāṭhaḥ |)yā sthitaḥ || 60 || 

(12 śva mada ka pāṭha |??????)

<pṛ0 353> sa eva tattvaṃ sādākhyaṃ sarvānugrahaṇonmukham | 
sa evaiśvaratattvaṃ syāt paśyan viśva(habheda ka pāṭhāḥ |)midantayā || 61 || 
ahantedantayoraikyaṃ(kyama ka pāṭhaḥ |) sā vidyeti nigadyate | 
svāṅgabhūteṣu bhāveṣu māyātattvaṃ vibhedadhīḥ (tvavibhedinī ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 62 || 
māyāgṛhītasaṃkocaḥ śivaḥ puṃstattvamuṃcyate | 
ayameva hi saṃsārī jīvo bhokteti dṛśyate || 63 || 
jñatva(jñatā ka pāṭhaḥ |)kartṛtvapūrṇatvanityatvādyāśca śaktayaḥ | 
tatsaṃkocā(ccha ka pāṭhaḥ |)tsaṃkucitāḥ kalāvidyādinā(dyātmanayā sthitā ka pāṭhaḥ |) sthitāḥ || 64 || 
māyātmanaḥ kalā nāma kiṃcitkartṛtvalakṣaṇam | 
vidyā kiṃcijjñatāhetū rāgo'bhiṣva(bhiyoga ka pāṭhaḥ |)ṅgakāraṇam || 65 || 
kālaḥ paricchedako vā niyatiścedameva me | 
kartavyaṃ nānyadityeṣā vyavasthāyantraṇākṛtiḥ || 66 || 
prakṛtirguṇasāmyaṃ syādahaṃkārādijanmabhūḥ | 
ahaṃ(ahisā madami ka pāṭhaḥ |)mamedamityetadbuddhiheturahaṃkṛtiḥ || 67 || 
buddhiradhyavasāyasya kāraṇaṃ niścayātmanaḥ (niyatātmana ka pāṭhaḥ |) | 
saṃkalpasya vikalpasya bījaṃ mana udīryate || 68 || 
vacanādeśca śabdādervāgādi śravaṇādikam | 
karaṇaṃ śravaṇādīnāṃ grāhyaṃ tanmātrapañcakam || 69 || 
ākāśādyavakāśā(dyavasānādi ka pāṭhaḥ |)dikāraṇaṃ bhūtapañcakam | 
parāparāśaktimaye śuddhe vidyādipañcakam || 70 || 

<pṛ0 354> tadanyadaparāśaktirvidyā(riti kha pāṭhaḥ |)tattvamudīritam | 
atha(iya kha pāṭhaḥ |) devī parāśaktiḥ śuddhāśuddhādhva(rddhahāriṇī ka pāṭhaḥ | garbhiṇī kha pāṭhaḥ |)rūpiṇī || 71 || 
pṛthivyādīni tattvāni ya(sa ka pāṭhaḥ |)dā līnāni kāraṇe | 
tadā kāraṇamātrāṇi śaktirudvama(dra ka pāṭhaḥ |)te bahiḥ || 72 || 
anuttarecche unmeṣa ānandeśanamūnatā | 
kriyecchājñānaśaktīnāṃ svarāṇāṃ mūlatā ca ṣaṭ || 73 || 
iccheśanāṃ tato rūḍhā sphuṭāsphuṭajaganmayī | 
catvāraḥ ṣaṇḍavarṇāḥ (parato varṇā ṣaṇḍā kha pāṭhaḥ |) syuḥ śuddhātmānaḥ pracoditāḥ || 74 || 
anuttarānandaśaktī icchāśaktau niyojite | 
trikoṇamatha ṣaṭkoṇamicchāyāṃ rūḍhimāgate || 75 || 
anuttarānandaśaktī trikoṇadvayayogataḥ | 
tathaivonmeṣayogena kriyāśakteḥ sphuṭaṃ vapuḥ || 76 || 
uktatriśaktisaṃghaṭṭāt triśūlaṃ dvaitaghasmaram | 
parasparāvirodhena kāryeṣu pravirohati || 77 || 
na kathaṃcidupādheyamāsāṃ rūpamidaṃ bhavet | 
bindurvedyasya saṃskāro vimarśaḥ(ṣa ka pāṭhaḥ |) sarga ityasau || 78 || 
kalāṣoḍaśakākārā śakti(kte ka pāṭhaḥ |)rbījāyate parā | 
tithayaḥ pratipatpūrvāḥ pañcadaśyantimā yathā || 79 || 
sūryācandramasau svāntaścarantau sthitihetave | 
tathā vimarśavapuṣaḥ sargasyādyāḥ kalāḥ smṛtāḥ || 80 || 
dvidheyaṃ mātṛkā devī bījayonyātmanā sthitā | 
nityapravṛ(bhudīptavapurviśvasya caiva ka pāṭhaḥ |)ttaśṛṅgāṭavapurviśvasya janmabhūḥ || 81 || 

<pṛ0 355> hṛdayaṃ bījametasyāḥ saṃvido (veda ka pāṭhaḥ |) yatparaṃ mahaḥ | 
vaṭabīje yathā vṛkṣastadvat saṃnihitaṃ jagat || 82 || 
vicāryamāṇo yo naiva kāraṇādatiricyate | 
mṛdādeḥ kalaśādīnāṃ tattvaṃ nānyannirūpaṇe || 83 || 
ityāhustattvavādinyaḥ śrutīnāmantimā giraḥ | 
idaṃ sarvaṃ sadevā(vāha nāsīt ka vānyannāsīt kha pāṭhaḥ |)sīdagra iti viniścayāt || 84 || 
sattāvācini bīje'smin kṣmādimāyāntimaṃ jagat | 
viluptapratyayākārametat sa pariśiṣyate || 85 || 
tato jñānakriyāsārā vidyeśvarasadāśivāḥ | 
śaktau (śaktitriśūlini ka linyāma kha pāṭhaḥ |) triśūle līyante caturdaśakalātmani || 86 || 
ūrdhvādhaḥ sṛṣṭivapuṣi sarvaṃ līnamataḥ param | 
itthaṃ parasyāṃ saṃvittau sā (sarvasakucita ka pāṭhaḥ |) visargacitiḥ kramāt || 87 || 
atha vāṅmanasātīte yatra kvāpi nirañjane | 
ṣaṭtriṃśattattvalaharīka(phala ka pāṭhaḥ |)lahātītagocare || 88 || 
viśvātmani mahāmantre svabhāve sā vilīyate | 
kutaścinmathite dhāmni dīpte kenāpi hetunā || 89 || 
sarva haviridaṃ juhvanna dāridryeṇa pīḍyate | 
pañcapañcātmakaṃ devi pañcaspandavijṛmbhitam || 90 || 
saṃkocayan parāmarśī sāmānyaspandakevalam | 
ahami pralayaṃ kurvannidamaḥ (damapra ka pāṭhaḥ |)pratiyoginaḥ | 
parākramaparo bhuṅkte svabhāvamaśivāpaham || 91 || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde'nuttarajñānaprakriyānirūpaṇaṃ nāmaikacatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 41 || 

<pṛ0 356> [dvicatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 
śrīpārvatyuvāca | 
kathamutpadyate vāṇī kathaṃ vā sā vilīyate | 
vāco vinirṇayaṃ brūhi paścāttattvamudīraya || 1 || 
īśvara uvāca 
avyaktātprāṇa utpannaḥ prāṇādutpadyate manaḥ | 
manasa utpadyate vāgvāṅmanasi vilīyate || 2 || 
devyuvāca 
āhāraṃ kāṅkṣate ko'sau bhuṅkte ca (cāpivatīśa ka pāṭhaḥ |) pibate ca kaḥ | 
jāgarti supyate (svapa ka pāṭhaḥ |) ko'sau suptaḥ ko'sau prabudhyate(ddhate ka pāṭhaḥ |) || 3 || 
īśvara uvāca 
āhāraṃ kāṅkṣate prāṇo bhuṅkte caiva hutāśanaḥ | 
jāgarti supyate vāyuḥ supte tejaḥ prabodhayet || 4 || 
devyuvāca 
ko vā karoti pāpāni ko vā pāpena lipyate | 
ko vā baddho vimuktaḥ kaḥ ko vā pāpaiḥ pramucyate || 5 || 
īśvara uvāca 
manaḥ karoti pāpāni manaḥ pāpena lipyate | 
manasyunmananībhūte na dharmo nāpi pātakaḥ || 6 || 

<pṛ0 357> devyuvāca 
yadidaṃ śakta(śakti ka pāṭhaḥ |)mākāśaṃ dehasthaṃ dehavarjitam | 
tat sthitaṃ tu kathaṃ dehe(ha ka pāṭhaḥ |) dehidehavivarjitam || 7 || 
kathaṃ jīvaḥ sthito dehe ko vā jīvaḥ prakīrtitaḥ | 
kena paśyatyasau jīvaḥ kena mārgeṇa saṃcaret || 8 || 
sakala(saphala ka pāṭhaḥ |)stu kathaṃ jīvo niṣkalastu kathaṃ bhavet | 
kena jīvatyasau jīvaḥ kiṃvā jīvasya bhojanam || 9 || 
kuto vā līyate jīvo jāyate kuta eva hi | 
ko vā jīvaḥ kathaṃ prāṇaḥ kena jīvaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 10 || 
etatsarva yathātattvaṃ tattvaṃ me brūhi śaṃkara | 
saṃsārārṇavamagnā hi yena mucyāmyahaṃ prabho || 11 || 
īśvara uvāca 
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yattvayā samudāhṛtam | 
kathayāmi na saṃdehaḥ sārātsārataraṃ śubham || 12 || 
vāyustejastathākāśaṃ tṛtīyaṃ jīvasaṃjñakam | 
sa jīvaḥ prāṇa ityukto bālāgra(rka ka pāṭhaḥ |)śatakalpitaḥ || 13 || 
jīvaḥ śukraṃ ca vijñeyaṃ yāvat sattvena saṃsthitam | 
rajasā ca samāyukto vāyurjīvaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 14 || 
tamasā ca samāyuktastadā hṛṣṭo bhaved dhruvam | 
sattvena ca samāyukto dharmajñānapravartakaḥ || 15 || 
rajasā ca samāyukto bhuṅkte ca viṣayān prabhuḥ | 
tamasā ca samāyuktastadā pāpena lipyate || 16 || 
nāsāgraṃ caiva nābhiṃ ca hṛdayaṃ ca tṛtīyakam | 
sthānānyetāni jīvasya kalpitāni śivena tu || 17 || 

<pṛ0 358> hṛtkamalaṃ śiraścaiva sattve yāvadvyavasthitam | 
dehasaṃsthi(tyakta ka pāṭhaḥ |)ta ityuktaḥ śivena paramātmanā || 18 || 
yāvanna calate jīvastāvanniścalatāṃ gataḥ | 
nābhistho niṣkalaṃ jñātvā mucyate janmabandhanāt || 19 || 
nābhisthaḥ sarvakāleṣu hṛdi tiṣṭhati sarvagaḥ | 
vaktranāsāpuṭāntaḥstho bhuṅkte ca viṣayān prabhuḥ || 20 || 
jīvaḥ paśyati dehastho jīva(vi ka pāṭhaḥ |)te ca maheśvaraḥ | 
bhuṅkte bhogaṃ śubhaṃ jīvo dehī(hi ka pāṭhaḥ |) dehe vyavasthitaḥ || 21 || 
dehaṃ tyaktvā yadā jīvo bahirākāśamāśritaḥ | 
tadātmaviṣayo jīvo jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 22 || 
tadidaṃ niṣkalaṃ brahma dhyāyediti sadāśivam | 
dhyātvā śivaṃ ca sahajaṃ mucyate bhavabandhanāt || 23 || 
sarvagaḥ sarvadehastho nāsāgre ca pratiṣṭhitaḥ | 
pratyakṣaḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ dṛśyate naca lakṣyate || 24 || 
nābhimadhye sthitaṃ jīvaṃ śuddhatattvaṃ tu nirmalam | 
ādityamiva dīptaṃ tu raśmibhirjvalitaṃ śubham || 25 || 
hakārārdhanibhaṃ jīvaṃ jīvo dehe ca saṃsthitaḥ | 
nābhirandhra(ndhracita ka pāṭhaḥ |)sthitaṃ khyātaṃ viṣayānprāpya saṃsthitam || 26 || 
tenedamakhilaṃ vyāptaṃ kṣīraṃ ca sarpiṣā yathā | 
kāraṇaṃ nātmanaścaiva prāṇāpānaistu pañcabhiḥ || 27 || 
śvāsaniḥśvāsayogena adhūrdhvaṃ pravartate | 
śuṣkapatraṃ tu vātena nīyate gaganaṃ yathā || 28 || 

<pṛ0 359> tathā bhramati jīvākhyaṃ prāṇāpānaistu pañcabhiḥ | 
catuṣkalāsamāyukto bhrāmyate hṛdaye sthitaḥ || 29 || 
golaka(ka ka pāṭhaḥ |)stu yathā devi svena daṇḍena tāḍitaḥ | 
utpatya patate(tatastu patane ka pāṭhaḥ |) śīghramaviśrāntaḥ punaḥ punaḥ || 30 || 
pārvatyuvāca 
yadidaṃ sakalaṃ brahma vyomātītaṃ nirañjanam | 
niṣkalaṃ nirmalaṃ śāntaṃ niṣprapañcamalakṣaṇam || 31 || 
apratyakṣamavijñeyaṃ vināśotpattivivarjitam | 
kaivalyaṃ kevalaṃ śāntaṃ śuddhasphaṭikasaṃnibham || 32 || 
karaṇayoganirmuktaṃ hetusādhanavarjitam | 
tatkṣaṇānmucyate yena tajjñānaṃ brūhi śaṃkara || 33 || 
īśvara uvāca 
etadeva mahābhāge kumāro brahmaṇaḥ sutaḥ | 
parisametya yo(geyatato ka pāṭhaḥ |)gīśaṃ viṣṇuṃ viśvaikakāraṇam || 34 || 
uvāca parayā bhaktyā brahmavidyāṃ vada prabho | 
yayācirāt sarvapāpaṃ vyapohya parātparaṃ puruṣaṃ yāti vidvān || 35 || 
tasmai sa hovāca jagatprabhuśca 
śraddhābhaktidhyānayogādavehi | 
na karmaṇā na prajayā dhanena 
tyāgenaikenāmṛtatvamānaśuḥ || 36 || 
pareṇa nākaṃ nihitaṃ guhāyāṃ 
vibhrājate yadyatayo viśanti | 
vedāntavijñānaviniścitārthāḥ 
saṃnyāsayogād (gi ka pāṭhaḥ |) yatayo viśuddhāḥ || 37 || 

<pṛ0 360> te brahmalokeṣu parāntakāle 
parāmṛtāt parimucyanti sarve | 
viviktadeśe ca sukhāsanasthaḥ 
śuciḥ samagrīvaśiraḥśarīraḥ || 38 || 
svasvāśramasthaḥ sakalendriyāṇi 
nirudhya bhaktyā svaguruṃ praṇamya | 
hṛtpuṇḍarīke virujaṃ viśuddhaṃ 
vicintya madhye viśadaṃ viśokam || 39 || 
acintyamavyaktamanantarūpaṃ 
śivaṃ śāntamamṛtaṃ brahma yonim | 
athādimadhyāntavihīnamekaṃ 
vidhiṃ(bhu ka pāṭhaḥ |) cidānandamarūpamadbhutam || 40 || 
umāsahāyaṃ parameśva(śa ka pāṭhaḥ |)raṃ prabhuṃ 
trilocanaṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ praśāntam | 
dhyātvā munirgacchati bhūtayoniṃ 
samastasākṣiṃ tamasaḥ parastāt || 41 || 
sa brahmā śivaḥ sa indraḥ so'kṣaraḥ paramaḥ svarāṭ | 
sa (sa viṣṇu ka pāṭhaḥ |) eva viṣṇuḥ sa prāṇaḥ sa kālo'gniḥ sa candramāḥ || 42 || 
sa (sa sa ka pāṭhaḥ |) eva sarvaṃ yadbhūtaṃ yacca bhavyaṃ sanātanam | 
jñātvā taṃ mṛtyumatyeti nānyaḥ panthā vimuktaye || 43 || 
sarvabhūtasthamātmānaṃ sarvabhūtāni cātmani | 
saṃpaśyan paramaṃ brahma yāti nānyena hetunā || 44 || 

<pṛ0 361> ātmānamaraṇiṃ kṛtvā praṇavaṃ cottarāraṇim | 
jñā(dhyā kha pāṭhaḥ |)nanirmathanābhyāsāt pāpaṃ dahati paṇḍitaḥ || 45 || 
sa eva māyāparimohitātmā 
śarīramāsthāya karoti sarvam | 
strīsvannapānādivicitrabhogaiḥ 
sa eva jāgratparitṛptimeti || 46 || 
svapne ca jīvaḥ sukhaduḥkhabhoktā 
svamāyayā kalpita(to ka pāṭhaḥ |)viśvaloke | 
suṣuptikāle sakale vilīne 
tamobhibhūtaḥ sukharūpameti || 47 || 
punaśca janmāntarakarmayogāt 
sa eva jīvaḥ svapiti prabuddhaḥ | 
puratraye krīḍati yaśca jīva-
statastu jātaṃ sakalaṃ vicitram || 48 || 
ādhāramānandamakhaṇḍabodhaṃ 
yasmiṃllayaṃ yāti puratrayaṃ ca | 
etasmājjāyate prāṇo manaḥ sarvendriyāṇi ca | 
khaṃ vāyurjyotirāpaśca pṛthivī viśvadhāriṇī || 49 || 
yatpunarbrahma sarvātmā sarvasyāyatanaṃ mahat | 
sūkṣmāt sūkṣmataraṃ nityaṃ tattvameva tvameva tat || 50 || 
jāgratsvapnasuṣuptyādi prapañcaṃ yatprakāśate | 
tadbrahmāhamiti jñātvā sarvabandhaiḥ pramucyate || 51 || 

<pṛ0 362> triṣu dhāmasu yadbhogyaṃ bhoktā bhogaśca yadbhavet | 
tebhyo vilakṣaṇaḥ so'haṃ (sākṣī ka pāṭhaḥ |) cinmātro'haṃ sadāśivaḥ || 52 || 
mayyeva sakalaṃ jātaṃ mayi sarvaṃ pratiṣṭhitam | 
mayi sarvaṃ layaṃ yāti tadbrahmādva(hvayo ka pāṭhaḥ |)yamasmyaham || 53 || 
aṇoraṇīyānahameva tadva-
nmahānahaṃ viśvamahaṃ vicitram | 
purātano'haṃ puruṣo'hamīśo 
hiraṇmayo'haṃ śivarūpamasmi || 54 || 
apāṇipādo'hamacintyaśaktiḥ 
paśyāmyacakṣuḥ sa śṛṇomyakarṇaḥ | 
ahaṃ vijānāmi viviktarūpo 
na cāsti vettā mama citsadāham || 55 || 
vedairanekairahameva vedyo 
vedāntakṛdvedavideva cāham | 
na puṇyapāpe mama nāsti nāśo 
na janma dehendriyabuddhirasti || 56 || 
na bhūmirāpo mama nāsti vahni-
rna cānilo me'sti nacāmbaraṃ ca | 
evaṃ viditvā paramātmarūpaṃ 
guhāśayaṃ niṣkalamadvitīyam || 57 || 
samastasākṣiṃ sadasadvihīnaṃ 
prayāti śuddhaṃ paramātmarūpam || 58 || 

<pṛ0 363> ya etattantraṃ samadhīte so'gnipūto bhavati surāpānātpūto | 
bhavati kṛtyākṛtyātpūto bhavatyagamyagamanātpūto bhavati || 

[iti śrīgandharvatantre pārvatīśvarasaṃvāde tattvajñānopadeśanaṃ nāma dvācatvāriṃśaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 42 || 

[samāptamidam śrīśivārpaṇaṃ bhūyāt] || 


